�脢id�fead2f987798�body���化石是远古动植物留下的遗体或痕迹，常见于沉积岩中。当生物被泥沙迅速掩埋、隔绝空气后，矿物质慢慢替换其硬体，便保存为石头般的印记。��A fossil is the preserved remains or trace of an ancient organism, usually found in sedimentary rock. When a creature is quickly buried by mud or sand and sealed off from air, minerals slowly replace its hard parts, turning it into a stone-like record.�ans��src��9Plummer 等《物理地质学》第16版（McGraw-Hill）�WPlummer, C.C., Carlson, D.H. & Hammersley, L., Physical Geology (16th ed., McGraw-Hill)��id�01d7e57d1756�body��`石头由不同材料在火山、河流或海底慢慢变成，所以颜色样子都不一样。�{Rocks are made from different materials that form in volcanoes, rivers, or the sea, so they come in many colors and shapes.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�03562d29461a�body�ٟ化石是保存在岩石中的古代生物遗体、遗迹或印痕，如贝壳、骨骼和脚印。它帮助科学家重建远古环境和生命演化历程。��A fossil is the preserved remains, traces, or impressions of ancient organisms in rock, such as shells, bones, and footprints. Fossils help scientists reconstruct past environments and the history of life.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�0ba9455a799d�body�ٜ夏天陆地比大海热得快，空气上升形成低气压，潮湿的海风就吹过来，遇热上升变成云和雨，所以季风季总是湿漉漉。ٱIn summer the land heats faster than the sea, air rises and makes low pressure, so moist sea breezes blow in and rise into clouds and rain—that's why monsoon season is so wet.�ans��src��*王斌《亚洲季风》，Springer，2006�+Wang, B., The Asian Monsoon, Springer, 2006��id�0bf81da9bae8�body��l板块每年大约移动几厘米，和人的指甲生长速度差不多，慢得平时根本感觉不到。�pPlates move only a few centimeters per year—about the rate your fingernails grow—so slowly we never feel it.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�0f1399c33e85�body�٫在海底很多地方，泥沙每年只落下薄薄一层，积一厘米可能要几十年到上百年，所以海底的泥是一层层慢慢写成的“地球日记”。٫In many seafloor areas sediment settles only a thin film each year; a centimeter can take decades to centuries, so seabed mud is Earth's diary written layer by slow layer.�ans��src��cRachel Carson,《The Sea Around Us》Oxford University Press,1951;中译《环绕我们的海洋》�HR. Carson, The Sea Around Us, Oxford University Press, 1951; Chinese ed.��id�193241bc8f4d�body�ٖ常和“极地涡旋”有关。平时绕北极转的冷空气圈被扰动后，裂开的一团寒流就会南下，带来刺骨严寒和暴风雪。٪It's often linked to the polar vortex. When the swirl of cold air around the Arctic is disturbed, a lobe breaks off and plunges south, bringing bitter cold and blizzards.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�1af0b7370bd6�body��i大树又高又湿，容易被雷电击中，电流还会顺着地面传到附近的人，非常危险。نA tall, wet tree is easily struck by lightning, and the current can spread along the ground to nearby people, which is very dangerous.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�1b69b1e64bb5�body��f靠近地面的空气变冷，水汽凝结成许多小水珠，密密麻麻飘在近处，就是雾。�When air near the ground cools, its water vapor turns into countless tiny drops that float close to the earth, and that is fog.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�1e738d7f9b1e�body���日落时阳光穿过更厚的大气层，波长较短的蓝紫光被散射掉，剩下波长较长的红橙光直达眼睛。瑞利散射使白天天空呈现蓝色，而更长的光程让暖色占据主导。�At sunset sunlight travels through a thicker slice of atmosphere, so shorter-wavelength blue and violet light is scattered away while longer-wavelength red and orange light reaches the eye. Rayleigh scattering gives the blue daytime sky, and the long path makes warm colors dominate.�ans��src��D卢特根斯、塔巴克《大气：科学导论》，Pearson，2011�\Lutgens, F.K. & Tarbuck, E.J., The Atmosphere: An Introduction to Meteorology, Pearson, 2011��id�21aa67124d8a�body��W阳光里蓝光照得最远，被空气散开布满天空，所以我们看到蓝天。�`Blue light in sunlight spreads farthest through the air and fills the sky, so we see a blue sky.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�2fff76a67c03�body�٢靠近地面的空气先被太阳晒热。热空气往上升的时候会慢慢膨胀,温度一点点降下来,升到山顶时已经凉快了,所以越高越冷。١The sun warms the air near the ground. As that warm air rises it spreads out and cools a little all the way up, so the mountain top is much colder than the base.�ans��src��D卢特根斯、塔巴克《大气：科学导论》，Pearson，2011�\Lutgens, F.K. & Tarbuck, E.J., The Atmosphere: An Introduction to Meteorology, Pearson, 2011��id�377959c23d90�body���太阳热量到达地球后被地面吸收，再以红外线的形式向外辐射，大气中的二氧化碳和水汽像被子一样把部分热量留住，使地球温暖宜居。若没有它，地球会冷得多。��Sunlight warms the ground, which then radiates heat back as infrared light; gases like carbon dioxide and water vapor act like a blanket, trapping some of that heat and keeping Earth warm enough for life. Without it the planet would be far colder.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�39fc10f1690b�body�٢矿物得是天然形成的、无机的、有固定化学成分、而且原子排成规则的晶体；像冰在自然里也算矿物，而玻璃和塑料不算。٬A mineral must be naturally formed, inorganic, with a definite composition, and with atoms arranged in an ordered crystal; natural ice counts, but glass and plastic do not.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�3cb0aa45d872�body�ٙ从顶上往下长、像冰溜子的是钟乳石；从地上往上长的是石笋。记住：钟乳石“石”在顶上垂，石笋在地下“笋”。�hThe one hanging from the ceiling is the stalactite; the one growing up from the floor is the stalagmite.�ans��src��B福特、威廉姆斯《岩溶水文与地貌学》，Wiley，2007�NFord, D.C. & Williams, P.W., Karst Hydrogeology and Geomorphology, Wiley, 2007��id�3ed055c41a29�body��Z傍晚太阳斜着照，蓝光被挡住，剩下红橙光铺满天空，就变成橘色。�fAt sunset the Sun is low, blue light is blocked, and the leftover red and orange light paints the sky.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�523e77ee61fc�body��W沙漠地方雨下得很少，太阳又毒，水分很快被晒干，所以特别干。�`Deserts get very little rain and strong sun, so water dries up fast and the land stays very dry.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�564202b82db1�body��{黄土里有很多细小的矿物质养分，而且疏松透气，存得住水和肥，所以很适合种小米和麦子。�qLoess is rich in fine minerals, loose and airy, and holds water and nutrients well, so it suits millet and wheat.�ans��src��=刘东生《黄土与环境》，中国海洋出版社，1985�ALiu Tungsheng, Loess and the Environment, China Ocean Press, 1985��id�5804586aab22�body��l不一定。泉水可能带细菌、寄生虫，或天然含过多矿物质，最好烧开再喝才安全。�~Not always. Spring water can carry bacteria, parasites or too much natural mineral, so it is safer to boil it before drinking.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�5e549845bfa4�body�ٍ先看到光。因为光跑得比声音快得多，闪电和打雷其实同时发生，但光瞬间到达，声音要过一会儿才传来。٘We see light first. Light travels far faster than sound; the flash and the boom happen together, but light arrives instantly while sound takes a moment.�ans��src��D卢特根斯、塔巴克《大气：科学导论》，Pearson，2011�\Lutgens, F.K. & Tarbuck, E.J., The Atmosphere: An Introduction to Meteorology, Pearson, 2011��id�602385a99720�body�٫地球绕太阳的轨道会发生很慢的变化（偏心率、地轴倾斜、岁差），改变了各地接收到的阳光，于是冰川就周期性地扩张和退缩。٢Earth's orbit changes very slowly—eccentricity, axial tilt, and precession—altering the sunlight each region gets, so ice sheets expand and retreat in cycles.�ans��src��8Wicander & Monroe,《Historical Geology》Cengage 多版�TR. Wicander and J. S. Monroe, Historical Geology, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�66e101b73dea�body��{地下岩石受力太大会突然错动、断裂，把能量猛地释放出来，地面就跟着摇晃，这就是地震。�uUnderground rock stressed too far suddenly slips and breaks, releasing energy that shakes the ground—an earthquake.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�6a5b8d429f23�body�ل地幔厚得多。地壳像蛋壳一样薄，地幔占了地球体积的大部分，是夹在地壳和地核之间很厚的一层。َThe mantle is far thicker. The crust is thin like an eggshell, while the mantle makes up most of Earth's volume, lying between crust and core.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�723fb1a1bfe2�body��c强风把小冰粒反复吹到高空结冰，一层层裹大，太重了就掉下来变成冰雹。�Strong winds toss small ice bits up into freezing air again and again, adding layers until they are too heavy and fall as hail.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�72a18e4f2bb3�body�ٖ它像一层隐形的护盾，把太阳风里有害的带电粒子挡开，保护大气和地面上的生命，还帮候鸟和指南针辨别方向。ٹIt acts like an invisible shield that deflects harmful charged particles from the solar wind, protecting the atmosphere and life, and helps migrating birds and compasses find direction.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�735cd025b1d5�body�٨普通火山多长在板块边界，热点火山却长在板块中间，由地底一股固定的热柱顶出来，所以常常孤零零地在海洋里冒出一座岛。٬Most volcanoes sit on plate boundaries, but hotspot volcanoes rise in the middle of plates from a fixed hot column below, so they often poke up lonely islands in the ocean.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�756e67f67972�body�ه细小的泥沙从大陆边慢慢飘落、铺在海底，把原来的坑坑洼洼都盖平了，就成了又平又广的深海平原。�{Tiny mud and silt drift from the continents and blanket the seafloor, smoothing over bumps into broad, flat abyssal plains.�ans��src��cRachel Carson,《The Sea Around Us》Oxford University Press,1951;中译《环绕我们的海洋》�HR. Carson, The Sea Around Us, Oxford University Press, 1951; Chinese ed.��id�776af7f20e22�body���当地面被太阳晒得又热又湿，暖湿空气就会像气球一样往上飘，在高空遇冷变成小水滴和冰晶，聚成乌云。云里的水滴越积越多、相互碰撞，最后变成雨落下来，还会伴随闪电和打雷。��When the ground gets hot and humid, warm moist air rises like a balloon and cools high up, turning into tiny water drops and ice crystals that build a dark cloud. The drops grow and bump together until they fall as rain, often with lightning and thunder.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�7d2fbb80d4dc�body�ى最深的叫马里亚纳海沟，最深处大约有 1.1 万米深，比珠穆朗玛峰还高的一大截如果放进去也露不出头。مThe deepest is the Mariana Trench, about 11,000 meters down—so deep that Mount Everest would be completely submerged if dropped in.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�7dcfc0640088�body���地震多发生在板块边界，地壳中的岩层长期受力变形，当应力超过岩石强度时突然断裂错动，释放的能量以地震波传向四周。地下核爆或水库蓄水也能诱发地震。��Most earthquakes occur at plate boundaries, where rocks strained by long-term forces suddenly fracture and slip, releasing energy that travels outward as seismic waves. Underground nuclear tests or reservoir filling can also trigger them.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�802b315f15ac�body��T地壳挤在一起把地面拱高，再被风和雨水慢慢刻出尖尖的形状。�tThe Earth's crust pushes up and folds the land into heights, and wind and rain slowly carve them into pointy shapes.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�86baf35b385a�body�ه水一受热就会胀大，占的地方变多，虽然每滴只胀一点点，但整片大洋加起来，海平面就慢慢升高了。نWater expands when heated, taking up more space; each drop swells a little, but across the whole ocean it adds up and lifts sea level.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�893122b38117�body��T地核温度大约 5000 到 6000 摄氏度，和太阳表面的温度差不多热。�KThe core is about 5000–6000°C, roughly as hot as the surface of the Sun.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�8966c51d8472�body��u地下通道里的水被岩浆烤热，底部的水变成蒸汽撑不住时，便把上边的水猛地喷向天空。ٔWater in underground channels is heated by magma; when the steam at the bottom builds up enough pressure, it blasts the water above up into the air.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�897102ead65c�body�ه祖母绿是绿柱石家族的一员，原本接近无色，因为晶体里混进了一点点铬或钒，就染出了鲜艳的绿色。قEmerald is a member of the beryl family, nearly colorless on its own; a tiny bit of chromium or vanadium tints it the vivid green.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�8b264e878b34�body��~意思是：立刻蹲下，躲到结实的桌子下护住头颈，抓紧桌腿直到摇晃停止。这样能挡住掉落物。٠It means: drop to the floor, take cover under a sturdy desk protecting head and neck, and hold the leg until shaking stops—shielding you from falling objects.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�937b7cca5e9b�body�٥有的矿物在岩浆慢慢冷却时结晶，有的从热的水溶液里沉淀，还有的在岩石受高温高压变质时重新组合，于是长成各种晶体。ٮSome crystallize as magma cools slowly, some precipitate from hot watery solutions, and some re-form when rocks are squeezed by heat and pressure—producing varied crystals.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�94f4a79ec4ff�body���按形态和高度，云主要分为积云（蓬松团状）、层云（均匀层状）和卷云（高空纤细），以及它们的组合如积雨云。不同云类对应不同的天气征兆。ٹBy shape and height, clouds are mainly cumulus (puffy), stratus (layered), and cirrus (wispy, high), plus combinations like cumulonimbus. Different cloud types signal different weather.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�955c2f826f16�body��r太阳风吹来的带电粒子被地球磁场引到两极，撞上高空空气使它发光，就形成了极光。هCharged particles from the solar wind are steered by Earth's magnetic field to the poles, where they light up the upper air as auroras.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�992d288366e5�body��`泥土里藏着养分和水分，植物靠它长大，我们吃的许多食物都从土里来。�dSoil holds nutrients and water that plants need to grow, and much of our food comes from the ground.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�9e2309f49841�body��f能！火山喷出的“浮石”里满是小气泡，像海绵一样轻，丢进水里会浮起来。�[Yes! Volcanic pumice is full of tiny bubbles like a sponge, so it is light enough to float.�ans��src��=普雷斯、西弗尔《理解地球》，W.H. Freeman，2001�?Press, F. & Siever, R., Understanding Earth, W.H. Freeman, 2001��id�9e64c9d77397�body�ِ人体靠出汗蒸发来降温，空气太湿时汗蒸发不出去，热量散不掉，所以又热又闷比干晒更难受，也容易中暑。ٗWe cool off by sweating, but in humid air the sweat won't evaporate, so heat can't escape; that makes muggy heat more miserable and risky than dry sun.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�a29ac17ab9b9�body�ٽ大多数东西冷了会缩小，但水在结成冰时分子排成疏松的六角结构，占据更大空间，于是冰比水轻、能浮在水面。这保护了水下生物安全过冬。��Most things shrink when cold, but when water freezes its molecules arrange into an open hexagonal pattern that takes up more space, so ice is lighter than water and floats. This protects the life below from freezing solid in winter.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�a53e9753f8c6�body��u会。酸度升高让许多小生物的外壳变软、长不好，依赖它们为食的鱼虾也会跟着受影响。قYes. Higher acidity softens and stunts the shells of many small creatures, and the fish and shrimp that eat them are affected too.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�a9a1c08fdb1d�body��p因为它平均海拔超过4000米，是世界上海拔最高的大高原，就像盖在地球上的大屋顶。�gIts average elevation exceeds 4,000 m, the highest plateau on Earth, like a giant roof over the planet.�ans��src��=普雷斯、西弗尔《理解地球》，W.H. Freeman，2001�?Press, F. & Siever, R., Understanding Earth, W.H. Freeman, 2001��id�b0e0f279ee06�body��`秋天天气变冷，树叶里的绿颜色退去，黄红颜色露出来，叶子就变了色。�eIn autumn it gets cold, the green color in leaves fades away, and yellow and red colors show through.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�b74bd07042fb�body���太阳把江河湖海里的水晒成水蒸气升上天空，遇冷凝结成云，再以雨或雪落回地面。落下的水有的流进河流、有的渗进泥土成为地下水，最后又回到大海，周而复始地循环。�The Sun turns water in rivers, lakes, and oceans into vapor that rises into the sky, cools into clouds, and falls back as rain or snow. The water then flows into rivers or soaks into the ground as groundwater before returning to the sea, cycling over and over.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�b9fe0f928cd6�body��o因为它流经黄土高原，带走了大量黄色泥沙，河水看起来黄澄澄的，所以得名黄河。�zIt flows through the Loess Plateau and carries huge amounts of yellow silt, making the water look yellow—hence the name.�ans��src��W米尔曼、米德《全球河流输沙入海》，《地质学杂志》第91卷，1983�pMilliman, J.D. & Meade, R.H. (1983), World-wide delivery of river sediment to the oceans, Journal of Geology, 91��id�ba474e3b9a20�body��i雨后空气里飘着很多小水珠，阳光穿过水珠被分开成七种颜色，就出现了彩虹。�dAfter rain, tiny water drops hang in the air and split sunlight into seven colors, making a rainbow.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�c59a03d55bd1�body��]月亮用引力轻轻拉海水，海水就跟着月亮涨上来又退下去，成了潮水。�qThe Moon's gravity gently pulls the ocean, so the water rises and falls as it follows the Moon; that is the tide.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�cd51a5272565�body�٥山脉是相对于周围明显高耸的地形，通常由构造抬升或火山活动形成。它们以较大的高度、陡坡和局部气候差异区别于丘陵。��A mountain is a landform that rises prominently above its surroundings, usually built by tectonic uplift or volcanism. Its height, steep slopes, and distinct local climate set it apart from hills.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�ce0496374fed�body��l死海盐特别多，水比普通海水重得多，浮力大，人躺上去自然漂着，很难沉下去。�jThe Dead Sea is extremely salty, so dense water gives huge buoyancy—people float easily and rarely sink.�ans��src��)加里森《海洋学》，Cengage，2015�JGarrison, T., Oceanography: An Invitation to Marine Science, Cengage, 2015��id�cfdfe8d94c15�body��f云是无数小水滴和小冰晶聚在一起，它们很轻，被上升的空气托着飘在天上。�yClouds are made of countless tiny water drops and ice crystals that are so light the rising air holds them up in the sky.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�ddb6e8967b66�body�ٱ煤不是严格意义上的矿物，因为矿物必须是无机形成的固体，而煤来自古代植物的遗体。不过煤常被归为可燃有机岩，是重要的能源。��Coal is not strictly a mineral because minerals must form inorganically, while coal comes from the remains of ancient plants. Still, it is classed as a combustible organic rock and is an important energy source.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�e273d50e1f86�body�ٽ火山是地壳的薄弱开口，岩浆、气体和碎屑由此从地球内部上升到地表。喷发时会形成熔岩、火山灰和气体，既能塑造地貌，也可能带来灾害。��A volcano is an opening in the crust through which magma, gas, and fragments reach the surface from Earth's interior. Eruptions produce lava, ash, and gases that both build landscapes and pose hazards.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�e3e84bdd3577�body�ٍ龙卷风是把空气拧成的高速旋转柱子，中心气压很低，能把屋顶掀飞、把树拔起，虽然范围小但风力极强。ٗA tornado is a fast-spinning column of air with very low central pressure that can rip off roofs and uproot trees; small in size but extremely violent.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�e72b9df88de9�body��r很久以前动植物死后被泥沙盖住，经过很长很长时间变成了石头里的印子，就是化石。نLong ago, plants and animals were buried by mud and sand and slowly turned into stone prints over a very long time; those are fossils.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�e9c9b6669fc3�body��N水从高处往低处流，小溪汇成大河，就一直不停地向前跑。�iWater always flows from high places to low places, and streams join into rivers that keep moving forward.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�earth_25_001�body���云朵是无数比灰尘还小的小水滴集合成的,每一颗都轻得像空气。它们被上升的暖风托着,像羽毛飘在空中。等水滴抱在一起变得又大又重,托不住了,就变成雨点落下来——那是云在下雨呢。��Clouds are crowds of droplets tinier than dust, each light as air. Warm rising winds hold them aloft like floating feathers. When droplets hug together growing heavy, they fall as raindrops — the cloud is raining.�ans��src��H《十万个为什么》第六版地球分册,少年儿童出版社,2013�VTen Thousand Whys: Earth volume, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�earth_25_002�body���石头是地球写日记的方式:有的来自喷火的火山,岩浆冷却变硬;有的是泥沙在大海里一层层压了千万年变成的,花纹就是当年的泥沙层。捡一块鹅卵石,你手里就握着一个古老的故事。��Rocks are how Earth keeps diaries: some froze from fiery volcano lava; others pressed from seafloor mud over millions of years — those stripes are old sand layers. Hold a pebble and you hold an ancient story.�ans��src��H《十万个为什么》第六版地球分册,少年儿童出版社,2013�VTen Thousand Whys: Earth volume, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�earth_25_003�body���雨点开始了一场大旅行:有的钻进泥土给树根喝水,有的汇进小溪流向大河奔向大海,有的被太阳晒热变回看不见的水蒸气飞上天,攒够了再变成新的雨点落下来。这场旅行永远不停站!ٸRaindrops start a grand trip: some sink to give tree roots drinks, some join streams racing rivers to the sea, some evaporate skyward to become new rain later. The journey never stops!�ans��src��H《十万个为什么》第六版地球分册,少年儿童出版社,2013�VTen Thousand Whys: Earth volume, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�earth_25_005�body���雪花是小冰晶排队伍,水分子天生喜欢六边形队形,所以每片都长六个瓣。可下落途中温度湿度千变万化,长出的花纹各不相同——找两片完全一样的雪花,比找两片一样的树叶还难!�Snowflakes are tiny ice crystals, and water molecules love lining up in six-sided teams, so every flake grows six arms. Each falls through different temperatures and humidity, growing unique patterns — finding two identical flakes is harder than finding two identical leaves.�ans��src��H《十万个为什么》第六版地球分册,少年儿童出版社,2013�VTen Thousand Whys: Earth volume, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�ef793b10cc08�body��N大石头被风、水和冰块一点点磨碎，最后变成细细的沙粒。�_Big rocks are slowly ground down by wind, water, and ice until they become tiny grains of sand.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�f8759225fd78�body�ِ雨水冲刷陆地，把岩石里的盐分带进河流，最终汇入大海；水会蒸发变淡，盐却留下来越积越多，海就咸了。فRain washes salts from rocks into rivers and then the sea; water evaporates but salt stays and builds up, making the ocean salty.�ans��src��)加里森《海洋学》，Cengage，2015�JGarrison, T., Oceanography: An Invitation to Marine Science, Cengage, 2015��id�fdf509e942b4�body�ٟ台风中心是下沉气流，空气从高空轻轻落下，所以风小、云少、甚至能见到蓝天，但四周的“眼墙”却是最凶的风雨区。٠The center has sinking air that gently descends, so it's calm, clear, and sometimes blue-skied, while the surrounding eyewall packs the fiercest winds and rain.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�ff1b30b28d86�body��i太阳把地面晒得不一样热，热空气往上跑、冷空气补过来，空气流动就成了风。�}The Sun heats the ground unevenly, so warm air rises and cooler air rushes in to fill the space, and that moving air is wind.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�00b26b5b8bb0�body��当巨型地幔柱头部上涌至岩石圈底部，可造成大规模溢流玄武岩喷发，形成大火成岩省（LIP），面积可达百万平方公里，如印度的德干高原与西伯利亚暗色岩。这类事件常伴随快速的气候与生物灭绝事件。�6When a giant mantle-plume head reaches the base of the lithosphere it can drive massive flood-basalt eruptions forming large igneous provinces (LIPs) up to about a million square kilometers, such as the Deccan Traps and Siberian Traps. Such events are often linked to rapid climate shifts and mass extinctions.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�0245d7611a5a�body���在降水丰富、碳酸盐岩广布的地区，含CO2的水溶蚀岩石形成溶沟、溶洞与地下河，地表塌陷则成天坑与峰林。中国南方喀斯特是世界典型的湿润区岩溶地貌。��In rainy regions underlain by carbonate rock, CO2-rich water dissolves the stone to create furrows, caves, and underground rivers, while surface collapse forms sinkholes and tower karst. South China karst is a classic example of humid-zone karst.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�02a7ae37410f�body��
台风在温暖的热带海面上形成，需要海温高于约26摄氏度的充足水汽和能量。地转偏向力使气流旋转，中心形成低压眼区，周围出现强烈上升运动和狂风暴雨。它在不同大洋有不同名称，如飓风、气旋。�lTyphoons form over warm tropical oceans, needing sea surface temperatures above about 26 degrees Celsius to supply ample moisture and energy. The Coriolis force makes the airflow rotate, a low-pressure eye develops at the center, and intense upward motion produces violent winds and rain. The same phenomenon is called a hurricane or cyclone in other ocean basins.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�03ff27f7ef97�body�ٍ冰川湖每年夏季沉积浅色粗粒、冬季沉积深色细粒，形成一对纹泥，数层数就能读出逐年气候与冰川活动。ٖGlacial lakes lay down a light coarse summer layer and dark fine winter layer each year; counting varve pairs reveals annual climate and ice activity.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�045eb1939c41�body�ٍ断层有时在数天到数月里无声地缓缓错动释放能量，叫慢滑移，虽不震却会改变周边应力、影响大震风险。ُFaults can slip silently over days to months, releasing energy as slow slip; it does not shake but shifts stress and can affect big-quake risk.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�04f604c0f301�body�ِ三峡把长江巨大的水量和高落差的势能装进大坝，水流推动水轮机发电，是世界上最大的水力发电工程之一。�xThe dam captures the Yangtze's huge volume and head, spinning turbines—one of the world's largest hydropower projects.�ans��src��1国际水电协会《2019年水电现状报告》�EInternational Hydropower Association (2019), Hydropower Status Report��id�05465e6bf4bf�body���NASA 与德国航太中心的 GRACE 及后继 GRACE-FO 卫星通过探测地球重力场变化估算冰盖质量盈亏；NASA 的 ICESat 与 ICESat-2 激光测高则直接测量冰面高程变化，两者互补。��NASA and DLR's GRACE and successor GRACE-FO satellites infer ice-sheet mass change from Earth's gravity field, while NASA's ICESat and ICESat-2 laser altimetry directly measure surface elevation—the two approaches complement each other.�ans��src�٭Velicogna,《Increasing rates of ice mass loss from the Greenland and Antarctic ice sheets revealed by GRACE》,Geophysical Research Letters,2009 (DOI: 10.1029/2009gl040222)٫Velicogna, 'Increasing rates of ice mass loss from the Greenland and Antarctic ice sheets revealed by GRACE', Geophysical Research Letters, 2009, DOI: 10.1029/2009gl040222��id�05e643368288�body���暖流从低纬带来温暖海水，使沿岸地区冬季较温和；寒流则带来冷水，使沿岸更凉爽甚至干旱。例如北大西洋暖流让西欧冬季比同纬度其他地区温暖得多。�Warm currents carry warm water from low latitudes, making coastal winters milder, while cold currents bring cool water that can make coasts cooler or even drier. For instance, the North Atlantic Drift keeps Western Europe much warmer in winter than other places at the same latitude.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�05f4ee29ce91�body�ق在大洋板块俯冲到陆侧的边界，闭锁的断层突然错动数十米，释放巨大能量，如2011年东日本地震。�At a subduction boundary a locked fault suddenly slips tens of meters, releasing huge energy, as in the 2011 Tohoku earthquake.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�06791e200cc3�body���上升流把深海富含营养盐的冷水带到表层，促进浮游植物大量繁殖。浮游植物是食物链基础，因此上升流区往往形成高产渔场。秘鲁沿岸和本格拉寒流区都是典型的上升流渔场。�3Upwelling brings cold, nutrient-rich deep water to the surface, fueling large blooms of phytoplankton. Because phytoplankton form the base of the food chain, upwelling regions often become highly productive fishing grounds. The Peruvian coast and the Benguela Current region are classic upwelling fisheries.�ans��src��cRachel Carson,《The Sea Around Us》Oxford University Press,1951;中译《环绕我们的海洋》�HR. Carson, The Sea Around Us, Oxford University Press, 1951; Chinese ed.��id�070edebd242a�body�ِ会。日晒冻融让岩石胀缩开裂，水和二氧化碳溶蚀矿物，树根也能撑裂石缝，物理和化学风化终把大山削平。ُYes. Heating-freezing, dissolution by water and CO2, and plant roots all crack rock; physical and chemical weathering slowly flatten mountains.�ans��src��=普雷斯、西弗尔《理解地球》，W.H. Freeman，2001�?Press, F. & Siever, R., Understanding Earth, W.H. Freeman, 2001��id�071c42e2f78e�body��地震震动使斜坡岩土体瞬间失稳，尤其在陡坡、松散堆积和降雨条件下大量滑坡集中发生，堵塞河道形成堰塞湖，后续溃决又引发洪水。这种地震—滑坡—堰塞湖—溃决的链条放大了单一灾害损失。�!Ground shaking destabilizes slope materials instantly, triggering clustered landslides on steep, loose, or rain-saturated terrain; they can dam rivers into landslide lakes whose later breach causes floods. This earthquake-landslide-dam-breach chain amplifies the loss from a single hazard.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�07999668359a�body���火山灰是细小的玻璃和矿物碎屑，会损害呼吸道、污染水源并压垮屋顶。它还能使发动机熄火、瘫痪航空交通，1991年皮纳图博火山喷发就造成了全球性影响。��Volcanic ash is fine glassy and mineral debris that can damage lungs, contaminate water, and collapse roofs. It can also stall engines and paralyze air traffic; the 1991 Pinatubo eruption had global effects.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�0a8eb272d92a�body���海平面上升来自两大来源：海水受热膨胀和陆地冰融化。气候变暖让表层到深层海水体积增大，而格陵兰与南极冰盖、山地冰川融化把淡水注入海洋。卫星测高显示近几十年来全球海平面平均每年上升约3毫米以上，且速度在加快。沿海城市、低洼岛屿和三角洲因此面临更频繁的风暴潮与淹没风险。��Sea level rise has two main sources: thermal expansion of seawater and melting of land ice. A warming climate enlarges the volume of ocean water, while ice sheets in Greenland and Antarctica plus mountain glaciers pour fresh water into the sea. Satellite altimetry shows global mean sea level rising more than about 3 mm per year in recent decades, and accelerating. Coastal cities, low islands, and deltas therefore face more frequent storm surge and inundation.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�0be32041e8fa�body�ِ这里的砂砾岩里含铁，岩石被氧化后呈红褐色；经流水切割，露出层层红崖，于是有了“色如渥丹”的奇观。�vIron in the sandstones oxidizes to red-brown; erosion by water exposes red cliffs, giving the red-as-cinnabar scenery.�ans��src��=普雷斯、西弗尔《理解地球》，W.H. Freeman，2001�?Press, F. & Siever, R., Understanding Earth, W.H. Freeman, 2001��id�0c7b5ebe1b4d�body�ٜ最先遭殃的是低洼海岸、河流三角洲（如长江、珠江口）、岛国（如马尔代夫、图瓦卢）和孟加拉国这样的平坦低地。ٗFirst hit are low coasts, river deltas (e.g. Yangtze and Pearl River mouths), island nations (e.g. Maldives, Tuvalu) and flat lowlands like Bangladesh.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�10747d973eb5�body�ه高楼设计成有一定柔韧性，风一吹会小幅摆动来卸掉风力，像芦苇弯腰。只要在限度内，反而更安全。٘Tall buildings are designed to be flexible; they sway a little to shed wind force, like reeds bending. Within limits this makes them safer, not riskier.�ans��src��Q《十万个为什么》第六版建筑与交通分册,少年儿童出版社,2013�pTen Thousand Whys: Architecture and Transportation volume, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�107a943647b7�body���干旱区蒸发强烈，灌溉水带入的盐分在表层累积而难以淋洗，加之排水不畅使地下水位抬升、盐分随毛管水上升至根层。治理依赖改良排水、洗盐与耐盐作物。�In arid regions strong evaporation accumulates salts brought by irrigation at the surface with little leaching, and poor drainage raises the water table so salts rise into the root zone by capillary action. Management relies on improved drainage, leaching, and salt-tolerant crops.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�1097c7da2ce9�body��O泥炭地常年积水、缺氧且偏酸，微生物分解极慢，植物残体以泥炭形式逐年积累，使其成为全球最大的陆地有机碳库之一。排水后土壤通气，好氧微生物迅速分解积累的有机质，持续数十至上百年释放大量CO₂；因此保护和恢复泥炭地是重要的气候行动。��Peatlands are waterlogged, anoxic, and acidic, so microbial decomposition is extremely slow and plant residues accumulate year by year as peat, making them among the largest terrestrial organic carbon stores. Drainage aerates the soil, aerobic microbes rapidly decompose the accumulated organic matter, releasing large amounts of CO₂ for decades to a century; protecting and restoring peatlands is therefore a key climate action.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�13312e2f5216�body�ٽ统计上地震在一天中的发生时间基本随机，与昼夜无关。人们觉得多在夜间，常因夜间安静更易察觉、记忆更深刻，属认知偏差而非真实规律。��Statistically, earthquakes occur roughly randomly through the day, unrelated to day or night. The impression they strike at night comes from quieter nights making them more noticeable and memorable, a cognitive bias rather than a real pattern.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�1336a7e3a53e�body���高温多雨使矿物强烈风化，可溶性盐类和硅被淋失，相对富集的铁铝氧化物呈红色，形成红壤。它常酸性强、养分易流失，需要科学管理才能耕作。��High heat and heavy rain drive intense weathering that leaches soluble salts and silica, leaving iron-aluminum oxides that give a red color, forming red soils. They are often acidic with easily lost nutrients and need careful management for farming.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�14abdbc6e297�body�ٖ变暖使大气含水更多而更强保温，云量变化可增温或降温，冰雪融化降低反照率又加速吸热，都放大或调节变暖。ٞWarming holds more water vapor that traps heat; clouds can warm or cool; melting ice lowers albedo and absorbs more sun—each amplifies or moderates warming.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�14b4d5cf3e40�body���甲烷的温室效应约为 CO₂ 的 80 余倍（20 年尺度）。北极与高纬永冻土中封存大量有机碳，升温融化后微生物分解释放 CH₄ 与 CO₂，进一步增温，形成正反馈，可能加速气候变化。�Methane's greenhouse effect is over 80 times that of CO₂ on a 20-year basis. Arctic permafrost holds vast organic carbon; warming thaws it, and microbial decay releases CH₄ and CO₂, warming further—a positive feedback that could accelerate climate change.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�14db1ea3a7f0�body���我们正处在被称为“第四纪冰期”的一个温暖间歇（间冰期）里：两极仍有大冰盖，但相比冰盛期算是比较暖的阶段，这个间冰期已持续约一万年。٧We are in a warm interglacial within the ongoing Quaternary ice age: polar ice sheets still exist, but it's a relatively warm phase that has lasted about 10,000 years.�ans��src��8Wicander & Monroe,《Historical Geology》Cengage 多版�TR. Wicander and J. S. Monroe, Historical Geology, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�15f676043279�body���洋面温度异常指某海域海温相对于多年平均值的偏离，偏高或偏低都属异常。它是监测厄尔尼诺、拉尼娜和海洋热浪的关键指标。异常的持续时间和范围会影响大气环流与极端天气。�/A sea surface temperature anomaly is the departure of a region's sea temperature from its long-term average, whether warmer or cooler. It is a key indicator for monitoring El Nino, La Nina, and marine heatwaves. The duration and extent of anomalies influence atmospheric circulation and extreme weather.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�1674dc2b73fc�body���积雨云是垂直发展极旺盛的云，顶部常伸展到平流层附近形成砧状。其内部强烈的上升和下沉气流带来雷电、暴雨甚至冰雹。它是几乎所有强对流天气的载体。�	A cumulonimbus is a vigorously developing vertical cloud whose top often spreads into an anvil near the stratosphere. Its strong updrafts and downdrafts produce lightning, heavy rain, and sometimes hail. It is the engine behind nearly all severe convective weather.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�178e4e4f22e3�body���一是海水受热膨胀（热膨胀），二是陆地冰（山岳冰川、格陵兰与南极冰盖）融化汇入海洋。IPCC AR6 指出二者贡献相当，20 世纪以来全球平均海平面已上升约 20 厘米。�One is thermal expansion of warming seawater, the other is land ice—mountain glaciers and the Greenland and Antarctic ice sheets—melting into the ocean. IPCC AR6 notes both contribute comparably, with global mean sea level already up about 20 cm since 1900.�ans��src��8Wicander & Monroe,《Historical Geology》Cengage 多版�TR. Wicander and J. S. Monroe, Historical Geology, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�17c7d0d71d44�body���矿物是具有确定化学成分和晶体结构的天然无机固体，例如石英和长石。岩石则是由一种或多种矿物聚合而成的固体集合体，比如花岗岩由石英、长石和云母组成。��A mineral is a natural inorganic solid with a definite chemical composition and crystal structure, such as quartz or feldspar. A rock is an aggregate of one or more minerals, for example granite is made of quartz, feldspar, and mica.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�18b7a1b655e4�body��~石油能炼出汽油、柴油、塑料、化肥和药品等，几乎现代生活处处用到，所以像血液一样重要。ًFrom petroleum we make gasoline, diesel, plastics, fertilizers and medicines; it touches almost all modern life, so it is vital like blood.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�19b00f7c8b35�body�ٴ环太平洋地震带是围绕太平洋边缘、地震和火山极其密集的地带，俗称火环。它位于多个板块俯冲交汇处，全球约80%的强震发生在这里。��The circum-Pacific seismic belt, nicknamed the Ring of Fire, is a zone around the Pacific rim with extremely dense earthquakes and volcanoes. Sitting where several plates subduct, it hosts about 80% of the world's major earthquakes.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�1a27290fd7b3�body�ف海水吸收二氧化碳后碳酸根减少、饱和度下降，珊瑚和贝类更难形成碳酸钙外壳，幼体尤其脆弱。ٔAbsorbed CO2 lowers carbonate ions and saturation, making it harder for corals and shellfish to build calcium-carbonate shells, harming larvae most.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�1c0efb565c09�body���气溶胶是悬浮在大气中的固态或液态微粒。按来源分为自然与人为两类，沙尘属于自然源矿物气溶胶，由风蚀地表松散沉积物扬起，是质量最大的自然气溶胶成分之一。��An aerosol is a suspension of solid or liquid particles in the air. By source they split into natural and anthropogenic; dust is a natural mineral aerosol lifted by wind erosion of loose sediment, among the most massive natural aerosol components.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�1c1d4440e0c4�body���地下水补给是地表水通过下渗进入含水层、补充地下水储量的过程。降水、河流渗漏和人工回灌都是重要补给来源。补给速率决定了地下水能否可持续利用。�
Groundwater recharge is the process by which surface water infiltrates into aquifers and replenishes stored groundwater. Rainfall, river leakage, and artificial recharge are important sources. The recharge rate determines whether groundwater can be used sustainably.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�1d98cb4c968f�body�ف午后地面被晒得最热，湿热空气猛烈上升，到高空遇冷凝结成积雨云，于是电闪雷鸣、暴雨倾盆。فAfternoon ground is hottest, so humid air rises violently, condenses into cumulonimbus aloft, triggering lightning and downpours.�ans��src��D卢特根斯、塔巴克《大气：科学导论》，Pearson，2011�\Lutgens, F.K. & Tarbuck, E.J., The Atmosphere: An Introduction to Meteorology, Pearson, 2011��id�1e8bcd7d4d6a�body���休眠火山指历史上喷发过、目前安静但未来可能再喷发的火山；死火山则被认为已失去岩浆供应、长期不会再活动。这种划分有时模糊，因为「死」火山也可能复活。��A dormant volcano has erupted in the past, is quiet now but may erupt again; an extinct volcano is thought to have lost its magma supply and will not reawaken. The distinction is sometimes blurry because 'extinct' volcanoes can still revive.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�1f350684f47b�body���经典土壤学以气候、生物、地形、母岩和时间「五大因子」解释土壤差异，后来补充人为活动因子。不同组合造就从热带砖红壤到寒带灰化土的全球多样性。��Classic soil science explains soil differences through five factors: climate, organisms, topography, parent material, and time, later supplemented by human activity. Their combinations produce global diversity from tropical oxisols to boreal podzols.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�200e63be1344�body�ٖ在海底热泉和冷泉附近，细菌靠化学物质（如硫化氢）制造能量，这种“化能合成”支撑起不依赖阳光的食物链。ٛNear hydrothermal vents and seeps, bacteria make energy from chemicals like hydrogen sulfide—chemosynthesis—supporting food webs that need no sunlight.�ans��src�ٽVon Damm, K. L.：《海底热液活动：黑烟囱化学与烟囱体》，《地球与行星科学年鉴》（Annual Review of Earth and Planetary Sciences），1990年，18卷173–204页١Von Damm, K. L., 'Seafloor hydrothermal activity: black smoker chemistry and chimneys', Annual Review of Earth and Planetary Sciences, 1990, vol. 18, pp. 173-204��id�20c93b0096c2�body�ٺ泉水是地下水自然涌出地表的地方。当含水层被隔水层切断或地形切穿含水层时，承压水便沿裂隙流出，形成泉。温泉则多因深处地热加热。��A spring is where groundwater naturally surfaces. When an aquifer is cut off by an aquitard or exposed by terrain, confined water flows out along fractures, forming a spring. Hot springs are usually heated by deep geothermal energy.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�216ef837dbb7�body��u梅雨期空气又暖又湿，连续阴雨、日照少，衣服上的水很难蒸发，所以晾很久还是潮的。٘During the Meiyu season the air is warm and very humid with continuous rain and little sun, so moisture on clothes hardly evaporates and they stay damp.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�2279357d6ffb�body�ف它从热带到高山气候齐全，地形起伏大，给成千上万种植物留出各自的小环境，所以物种特别多。�wFrom tropics to alpine climates across rugged terrain, Yunnan offers countless micro-habitats, so plant species abound.�ans��src��K联合国教科文组织世界遗产中心《云南三江并流保护区》�MUNESCO World Heritage Centre, Three Parallel Rivers of Yunnan Protected Areas��id�229e90bd4ceb�body���信风在西侧、西风带在东侧持续推动表层海水，加上科里奥利效应使水流在北半球右偏、南半球左偏，海水就在各大洋绕出巨大的顺时针或逆时针漩涡，叫大洋环流。环流把热量从低纬送到高纬，调节全球气候，例如西边界流（湾流、黑潮）流速最快、最暖。环流圈还收集漂浮物，形成大洋"垃圾带"。��Steady trade winds push surface water westward while the westerlies push it eastward, and the Coriolis effect deflects flow right in the Northern Hemisphere and left in the Southern, so water swirls into giant clockwise or counterclockwise loops called gyres. Gyres carry heat from low to high latitudes and regulate climate; the warm, fast western boundary currents such as the Gulf Stream and Kuroshio are their most striking parts. Gyres also concentrate floating debris into ocean garbage patches.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�24257dfa4d6e�body���大陆漂移学说由德国气象学家阿尔弗雷德·魏格纳于1912年提出，他认为所有大陆曾经连成一块名为泛大陆的超大陆。虽然当时证据不足，这一思想后来发展为板块构造学说。�The theory of continental drift was proposed by German meteorologist Alfred Wegener in 1912, who argued that all continents were once joined in a supercontinent called Pangaea. Though poorly supported at the time, the idea later developed into plate tectonics.�ans��src��$魏格纳《海陆的起源》(1915)�6Wegener's 'The Origin of Continents and Oceans' (1915)��id�244551879f9f�body���板块移动速度大致和指甲生长差不多，每年约2到10厘米，但持续几百万年就能累积成数千公里的位移。科学家用全球卫星定位系统（GPS）在固定于板块上的站点连续记录坐标，年复一年的微小变化就显示出板块的走向和速率，卫星测距与海底磁条带也相互印证。GPS测量让现代的大陆漂移从理论变成了可直接观察的现实。��Plates move at roughly the speed fingernails grow, about 2-10 cm per year, yet over millions of years that adds up to thousands of kilometers of displacement. Scientists use the Global Positioning System (GPS) to record coordinates at stations fixed on plates year after year; the tiny annual shifts reveal each plate's direction and speed, corroborated by satellite ranging and magnetic stripes on the seafloor. GPS measurements have turned continental drift from a theory into directly observable reality.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�2514eb48ba74�body���海沟是板块俯冲时一块板块下插、在海底刻出的狭长深谷，是海洋的最深处。马里亚纳海沟位于太平洋板块俯冲到菲律宾海板块之下，最深处超过1.1万米。��An ocean trench is a long, narrow, deepest part of the sea carved where one plate dives beneath another during subduction. The Mariana Trench formed where the Pacific plate subducts under the Philippine Sea plate and reaches over 11,000 meters deep.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�26f2ee1cbaec�body���水井是钻入含水层以抽取地下水的竖井，靠水泵把水提到地面。适度取水可由补给维持平衡，但超采会造成地面沉降和水质恶化。许多城市依赖井水作为饮用水源。�A well is a shaft drilled into an aquifer to draw groundwater, using a pump to lift water to the surface. Moderate withdrawal is balanced by recharge, but over-extraction causes land subsidence and worsening water quality. Many cities rely on well water for drinking.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�272a990af001�body�ه水流过岩石土壤时会溶进钙、镁、钾、钠等。适量的钙镁让水有“硬度”，也是人体需要的微量元素。٣As water passes rock and soil it dissolves calcium, magnesium, potassium and sodium. Moderate calcium and magnesium give hardness and supply useful trace elements.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�276926e19011�body���海洋环流把低纬度的热量向高纬度输送，并重新分配热量与盐分。它减缓了赤道与两极之间的温差，使沿海地区的气候更温和。环流变化还会引发区域性的旱涝异常。�Ocean circulation transports heat from low latitudes toward high latitudes and redistributes both heat and salt. It reduces the temperature contrast between the equator and the poles, keeping coastal climates milder. Changes in circulation can also trigger regional droughts and floods.�ans��src��cRachel Carson,《The Sea Around Us》Oxford University Press,1951;中译《环绕我们的海洋》�HR. Carson, The Sea Around Us, Oxford University Press, 1951; Chinese ed.��id�2a982ff26cae�body�ل中国辽西等地发现的带羽恐龙证明羽毛先用于保温或展示，后来才用于飞行，鸟类由恐龙演化而来。مFeathered dinosaurs from Liaoning show feathers first served warmth or display, then flight, confirming birds evolved from dinosaurs.�ans��src��8Wicander & Monroe,《Historical Geology》Cengage 多版�TR. Wicander and J. S. Monroe, Historical Geology, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�2b7a6aedb43a�body���海面与大气接触时，二氧化碳按分压差溶入表层海水，再被海洋生物利用或下沉输送到深层。这一过程是地球碳循环的重要汇，使海洋成为最大的活跃碳储库。但过量吸收也导致海洋酸化。�=At the sea surface, carbon dioxide dissolves into surface water according to the pressure difference and is then used by marine life or transported to depth. This process is a major sink in the carbon cycle, making the ocean the largest active carbon reservoir. But absorbing too much also causes ocean acidification.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�2b8060749b02�body��~流星体高速闯进大气层，和空气剧烈摩擦生热燃烧，拖出亮亮的光尾，没烧完落地的就叫陨石。َA meteoroid plunges into the atmosphere at high speed, friction heats and burns it into a glowing trail; what survives to land is a meteorite.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�2b9483e0911f�body��~采矿把地下黄铁矿暴露给空气和水，氧化后生成硫酸并溶出重金属，污染河流使水体变酸发黑。قMining exposes pyrite to air and water; oxidation makes sulfuric acid and leaches heavy metals, acidifying and blackening streams.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�2bbc25081045�body��{它描述大洋从裂谷张开、扩宽、俯冲收缩到最终闭合的全过程，伴随大陆聚合与分裂的循环。نIt describes an ocean's full life: rifting open, widening, subducting shut and finally closing, cycling continents together and apart.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�2e6fe6949f70�body���物理风化只把岩石打碎而不改变成分，如冻融胀裂、盐结晶；化学风化则通过水、氧气和酸使矿物发生溶解或转化，如长石风化成黏土。二者常同时进行。�Physical weathering only breaks rock without changing composition, like freeze-thaw cracking or salt crystallization; chemical weathering dissolves or transforms minerals via water, oxygen and acids, such as feldspar turning to clay. They often act together.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�2e894a7ccc3d�body�ِ它是甲烷分子被低温高压下的冰晶包裹成的白色固体，藏在深海沉积和冻土中，受热或减压会释放大量气体。َMethane trapped in ice-like cages under cold high pressure, found in deep sediments and permafrost, it releases gas if warmed or decompressed.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�2e96401d6153�body���湿润气流爬升山脉时冷却凝结、在迎风坡降水，过山后空气下沉增温、水汽难以凝结，于是在背风坡形成少雨干燥的雨影区。美国大盆地与喜马拉雅北坡都是典型例子。�Moist air rises and cools on the windward slope, condensing and dropping precipitation; after crossing the crest the air descends, warms, and holds its moisture, creating a dry leeward rain shadow. The Great Basin of the U.S. and the north side of the Himalaya are classic examples.�ans��src��D卢特根斯、塔巴克《大气：科学导论》，Pearson，2011�\Lutgens, F.K. & Tarbuck, E.J., The Atmosphere: An Introduction to Meteorology, Pearson, 2011��id�31106b25c13b�body���大冰期指两极和高山冰盖大幅扩张、全球变冷的时期。过去数百万年，地球在冰期和间冰期之间来回摆动，最近一次冰期约在2万年前达到顶峰，当时海平面比现在低约120米。轨道变化、大气成分、洋流与板块位置共同调控这些冷暖循环。所谓"间冰期"就是两次冰期之间相对温暖的时期，我们现在就生活在一个间冰期里。��An ice age is a period when polar and mountain ice sheets expand greatly and the planet cools. Over the past few million years Earth has swung between glacial and interglacial periods; the last glacial maximum peaked about 20,000 years ago, when sea level stood roughly 120 meters lower. Orbital changes, greenhouse gas levels, ocean currents, and plate geography together control these cold-warm cycles. An interglacial is the relatively warm stretch between glacials—the one we live in now.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�322b2326007b�body�ف北方人口和工农业用水太大，本地河湖水远远不够，黄河水量也有限，必须从南方“借”水补充。ٙNorthern demand from people, industry and farms far exceeds local supply, and the Yellow River alone can't cover it, so water is borrowed from the south.�ans��src��'中国水利部《南水北调工程》�OChina Ministry of Water Resources (MWR), South-to-North Water Diversion Project��id�33559bb25dbb�body�ف浮游植物光合固碳，死亡后碎屑下沉，被食物链传递并最终埋入海底沉积，把碳从表层运往深处。ّPhytoplankton fix carbon, die and sink as particles eaten along the food chain and buried in sediment, transporting carbon from surface to depth.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�33b7e7a10783�body��当河流入海或入湖时，流速骤减，携带的泥沙大量沉积，在河口堆积成扇形或鸟足状地貌即三角洲。泥沙供应充足、波浪和潮汐较弱时三角洲更易发育。著名的如长江三角洲和密西西比河三角洲。�+Where a river meets the sea or a lake, its speed drops sharply and the sediment it carries is deposited, building a fan- or bird-foot-shaped landform called a delta. Deltas develop best where sediment supply is ample and waves and tides are weak. Examples include the Yangtze and Mississippi deltas.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�3411d8a895a8�body�ٍ这里大片石灰岩被雨水溶蚀，地下掏空、地面塌陷成峰林和洼地，洼地积水就成了漓江和星罗棋布的碧水。ٟLimestone here was dissolved by rainwater; the ground collapsed into towers and depressions that filled with water, creating the famous peaks-and-rivers scene.�ans��src��B福特、威廉姆斯《岩溶水文与地貌学》，Wiley，2007�NFord, D.C. & Williams, P.W., Karst Hydrogeology and Geomorphology, Wiley, 2007��id�341bb613f843�body���海水中存在¹⁸O和¹⁶O两种稳定氧同位素，蒸发时水汽优先带走较轻的¹⁶O。冰期时大量¹⁶O被封锁在冰盖中，使海水¹⁸O/¹⁶O比值升高，并被有孔虫的碳酸钙壳体记录，因此壳体δ¹⁸O增大代表冰盖扩张（气候变冷）。底栖有孔虫生活在海底，受表层水温变化影响小，其δ¹⁸O更能代表全球冰量信号。��Seawater contains two stable oxygen isotopes, ¹⁸O and ¹⁶O; evaporation preferentially removes lighter ¹⁶O. During glacial periods much ¹⁶O is locked in ice sheets, raising the ¹⁸O/¹⁶O ratio of seawater, which foraminifera record in their calcite shells—so higher shell δ¹⁸O indicates ice-sheet growth and colder climate. Because benthic foraminifera live on the seafloor, far from surface-temperature swings, their δ¹⁸O is the classic global ice-volume proxy.�ans��src�� 《普通地质学》(舒良树)�General Geology (Shu Liangshu)��id�344913db349b�body��V驱动力来自地幔内部的热：放射性元素衰变产热和地核向地幔底部的传热，使物质受热上升、冷却变密下沉。岩石圈板块正是对流圈顶部的冷边界层，在洋脊处新生、在俯冲处沉回地幔；现代观点认为俯冲板片的负浮力（板片拖拽）是板块运动的主要驱动力。��Convection is driven by internal heat—radiogenic decay and heat from the core—so material rises when hot and sinks when cooled and denser. Lithospheric plates are the cold boundary layer atop the convection cell, created at ridges and sinking back into the mantle at subduction zones; the modern view holds that the negative buoyancy of subducting slabs (slab pull) is the main driving force of plate motion.�ans��src�� 《普通地质学》(舒良树)�General Geology (Shu Liangshu)��id�34d5c497f7b2�body���天然的温室效应是好事，它让地球比没有大气时温暖约 33 度，适合生命；问题出在人类排放过多温室气体，让这个“被子”太厚，导致全球变暖。ٹThe natural greenhouse effect is good—it warms Earth by about 33 degrees, making life possible. The problem is human emissions making that 'blanket' too thick, causing global warming.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�361ee1bd6af1�body���河流阶地是昔日河床或泛滥平原被抬升或基准面下降后留下的阶梯状地貌。多级阶地反映区域地壳抬升、气候变化或海平面变动的序列，是恢复古环境与构造活动的重要证据。�A river terrace is a step-like landform left when a former channel or floodplain is raised by uplift or lowered base level. Multiple terrace levels record sequences of crustal uplift, climate change, or sea-level shifts, key evidence for reconstructing paleoenvironments and tectonics.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�36b05831abbb�body���沙尘暴发生在干燥裸露的地表，强风把大量沙尘卷入空中并随风输送。它常出现在干旱和半干旱地区，春季冷空气活动频繁时更易发。沙尘暴会降低能见度并影响空气质量和健康。�)Dust storms occur over dry, bare ground where strong winds lift large amounts of dust into the air and carry it along. They are common in arid and semi-arid regions and are more frequent in spring when cold-air outbreaks are active. Dust storms reduce visibility and affect air quality and health.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�36d42cad9965�body���健康叶片强烈吸收红光用于光合作用、反射近红外光，NDVI利用这两种波段之差归一化，数值越高代表植被越茂密健康。它被广泛用于监测农作物长势、森林覆盖与荒漠化。�Healthy leaves strongly absorb red light for photosynthesis and reflect near-infrared; NDVI normalizes the difference between these bands, with higher values indicating denser, healthier vegetation. It is widely used to monitor crops, forest cover, and desertification.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�3927eed2a468�body�ٺ当河流入海或入湖速度变缓，携带的泥沙沉积下来，在河口堆出扇形或三角形的堆积体即三角洲。它土地肥沃、水网密布，常是人口稠密区。��Where a river slows at the sea or lake, its carried sediment drops and builds a fan- or triangle-shaped deposit at the mouth, a delta. Fertile and laced with channels, deltas are often densely populated.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�3ab1f5e88800�body���径流是降水形成、未蒸发也未下渗而沿地表或地下流走的水流，最终汇入河流湖泊和海洋。它可分为地表径流和地下径流。径流的多少决定一个地区的水资源丰歉和洪水风险。� Runoff is the portion of precipitation that neither evaporates nor infiltrates but flows away over or under the ground, eventually reaching rivers, lakes, and the ocean. It is divided into surface runoff and subsurface runoff. Its volume determines a region's water wealth and flood risk.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�3b4857bd8c14�body���该假说认为约7亿到6亿年前，地球曾几乎完全被冰盖包裹，连赤道海洋也结冰。冰盖反射阳光加剧寒冷，后来火山释放的二氧化碳温室效应打破冰封，开启新生命演化。�The hypothesis holds that roughly 700–600 million years ago Earth was nearly entirely ice-covered, even equatorial oceans frozen. Ice reflected sunlight and deepened cold until volcanic CO2 greenhouse warming broke the freeze, enabling new life evolution.�ans��src�٘Hoffman 等《Snowball Earth》（1998，Science）；Kirschvink《Late Proterozoic low-latitude glaciation》（1992，Geological Society of America）�pHoffman et al., Snowball Earth (1998, Science); Kirschvink, Late Proterozoic low-latitude glaciation (1992, GSA)��id�3ba7507d3c5b�body��~那是强冷空气卷着地面积雪漫天飞舞，视线里白茫茫一片，又叫“风吹雪”，又冷又看不清路。�sIt is strong cold air whipping surface snow into the air—blowing snow—a whiteout that is freezing and blinding.�ans��src��9美国国家气象局（NWS）《冬季天气：吹雪》�?US National Weather Service (NWS), Winter Weather: Blowing Snow��id�3bfcf3fab00b�body���当河流流速减慢或负载超过搬运能力时，携带的泥沙便会沉积下来。沉积在河口形成三角洲，在弯曲河道凸岸形成点坝。沉积塑造了冲积平原，也埋藏了宝贵的地下水资源。��When a river slows down or its load exceeds transport capacity, the sediment it carries is deposited. Deposition builds deltas at the mouth and point bars on the inside of bends. It shapes alluvial plains and also buries valuable groundwater resources.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�3cf54b7f9a6f�body��)这符合鲍温反应序列：岩浆冷却时，镁铁质矿物按橄榄石→辉石→角闪石→黑云母的不连续序列结晶，长石则由钙长石向钠长石连续演化。玄武岩保存了早期高温结晶的镁铁质组合，花岗岩保存了晚期低温结晶的长英质组合。�UThis follows Bowen's reaction series: as magma cools, mafic minerals crystallize in a discontinuous sequence (olivine→pyroxene→amphibole→biotite) while feldspars evolve continuously from anorthite toward albite. Basalt preserves the early high-temperature mafic assemblage; granite preserves the late low-temperature felsic assemblage.�ans��src�� 《普通地质学》(舒良树)�General Geology (Shu Liangshu)��id�3cf97436a980�body��	这是化石层序律（生物层序律）：生物演化不可逆且在全球同步推进，相同的化石组合代表相同地质年代。19世纪初威廉·史密斯据此编制了英格兰地层柱，证明了用标准化石进行全球性对比的可行性。�9This is the principle of faunal succession: because evolution is irreversible and globally synchronous, identical fossil assemblages mark identical geologic ages. In the early 19th century William Smith used it to build the first stratigraphic column of England, demonstrating global correlation by index fossils.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�3d60e7efa12c�body��e石灰岩主要成分是碳酸钙，雨水溶解空气中的二氧化碳后形成弱酸性水，沿裂隙不断溶蚀碳酸钙，把岩石掏成溶洞、地下河和竖井。溶洞塌陷扩大就成了天坑，残余的岩柱被水流雕刻成峰林石林。这类地貌统称喀斯特，我国广西、贵州、云南是世界著名的喀斯特集中区。��Limestone is mainly calcium carbonate, and rainwater that has absorbed CO2 from the air becomes weakly acidic, slowly dissolving the rock along cracks into caves, underground rivers, and shafts. Collapsing cavern roofs produce sinkholes, while leftover rock pillars are sculpted into stone forests. Such landscapes, called karst, are spectacularly developed in Guangxi, Guizhou, and Yunnan, among the most famous karst regions on Earth.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�3d92c4d88cdf�body�ف大坝把河水拦高，高处的水冲下来推动水轮机，带动发电机发电，相当于把“水的落差”变成电。قThe dam raises the river; falling water spins turbines that drive generators, turning the water's drop in height into electricity.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�3dc8b9ab4153�body���季风是随季节反转的大范围风向变化，主要由海陆热力差异驱动。亚洲拥有世界最大陆地（欧亚大陆）和最大海洋（太平洋），夏季陆地升温快形成低压吸引海洋湿润气流，故季风特别强盛。�)A monsoon is a large-scale seasonal reversal of wind direction, mainly driven by land-sea thermal contrasts. Asia sits between the huge Eurasian landmass and the Pacific Ocean; in summer the land heats fast, forming low pressure that draws in moist ocean air, making its monsoon especially strong.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�3f486d0e4cfc�body��{冰的微小晶体按六方结构排列，水分子以固定角度结合，所以长成的雪花基本都是六角对称。هIce crystals grow in a hexagonal lattice, with water molecules bonding at fixed angles, so snowflakes are basically six-fold symmetric.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�3fd891b11bed�body�٢闪电有几公里长，离你近的一头和远的一头声音传到耳朵的时间不同，再加上山和云的反射，听上去就变成连绵的隆隆声。٣A lightning channel is kilometers long, so sound from its near and far ends arrives at different times, and echoes off hills and clouds turn it into a long rumble.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�40a4e49f216a�body���尼罗河的水源主要来自上游埃塞俄比亚高原的夏季降雨，雨水汇入青尼罗河使水位在汛期暴涨。周期性泛滥带来肥沃淤泥，孕育了古埃及农业文明。现代水库修建后这种自然泛滥已被控制。�,The Nile's water comes mainly from summer rainfall on the Ethiopian highlands upstream, which swells the Blue Nile and raises the level during flood season. The regular floods deposited fertile silt that sustained ancient Egyptian agriculture. Modern dams have since controlled this natural flooding.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�40bc2b733e97�body��{工业和农业排放的氮化物随雨雪落到陆地海洋，过量会酸化土壤水体、扰乱植被并污染水体。ـNitrogen compounds from industry and farming fall with rain and snow; excess acidifies soils and waters and disrupts ecosystems.�ans��src��E雅各布《大气化学导论》，Princeton University Press，1999�UJacob, D.J. (1999), Introduction to Atmospheric Chemistry, Princeton University Press��id�40c82f5fac2d�body�َ冻雨是过冷雨滴，落到0℃左右的物体上立刻结成透明冰（雨凇）。冰越裹越厚，重量会把电线、树枝压断。ّFreezing rain is supercooled; it freezes into clear glaze ice on objects near 0°C. The thickening ice gets so heavy it snaps wires and branches.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�42370d3236be�body��CFC在对流层稳定，进入平流层后被紫外线分解释放出活性氯原子，氯催化分解臭氧分子并可在数月至数年内反复作用，导致臭氧层变薄甚至出现臭氧洞。蒙特利尔议定书限制其生产后臭氧已开始恢复。�@CFCs are stable in the troposphere but, once in the stratosphere, ultraviolet light releases reactive chlorine atoms that catalytically destroy ozone molecules and act repeatedly over months to years, thinning the layer and opening ozone holes. After the Montreal Protocol limited production, ozone has begun to recover.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�426085fca15c�body�ٺ板块边界处地壳较薄或开裂，地幔物质更易上涌形成岩浆。俯冲带让含水岩石熔融，洋中脊则直接让地幔减压熔融，因此这些地方火山密集。��At plate boundaries the crust is thinner or cracked, letting mantle material rise more easily into magma. Subduction zones cause water-bearing rock to melt, and ridges allow direct decompression melting, so volcanoes cluster there.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�435237d9012c�body��白天城乡都受强太阳辐射，温差被掩盖；夜间郊区因植被与土壤快速辐射降温，而城市建筑路面白天储存的热量缓慢释放、且天空视野受限阻碍散热，使城区维持较高温度，热岛强度因此夜间最大。�By day both city and country receive strong solar heating, masking the difference; at night suburbs cool rapidly by radiation, while urban fabric slowly releases stored heat and limited sky view hampers cooling, keeping the city warm. The heat-island intensity thus peaks at night.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�4414928a0ec9�body�ي铁是远洋浮游植物稀缺的养分，少量补铁可促其大量繁殖、吸收二氧化碳，但也会改变生态并存在争议。ّIron is a scarce nutrient for open-ocean phytoplankton; adding a little can spur blooms that absorb CO2, but it alters ecosystems and is debated.�ans��src��'Nature（海洋铁施肥试验研究）�-Nature (ocean iron fertilization experiments)��id�45045552ba72�body��x远古植物死后沉在积水沼泽里，缺氧不易腐烂，被泥沙层层掩埋、经高温高压慢慢变成煤。ْAncient plants fell into waterlogged swamps where lack of oxygen slowed decay; buried by sediment, heat and pressure slowly turned them into coal.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�45b3c86bcd6e�body�ل这时南方暖湿气流和北方冷空气在长江中下游“僵持”，谁也赶不走谁，雨带停留形成连绵的梅雨。ٜWarm moist air from the south meets cold air from the north and stalls over the middle-lower Yangtze, leaving a stationary rain band—the plum-rain season.�ans��src��-丁一汇《中国季风》，Springer，1994�-Ding, Y., Monsoons over China, Springer, 1994��id�46ba00021e9f�body�ٖ城市热岛让空气上升更猛，高楼和粗糙表面扰乱气流，加上污染微粒当凝结核，容易在城区及下风方向多下阵雨。ٛThe urban heat island boosts rising air, buildings roughen the flow, and pollution particles act as nuclei, so cities and downwind areas get extra showers.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�4705e7909830�body�لGPS测出火山膨胀隆起，气体传感器追踪二氧化硫和二氧化碳排放，二者异常往往预示岩浆正在上涌。�rGPS detects swelling of the edifice and gas sensors track SO2 and CO2; anomalies often mean magma is rising below.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�472cf9bf5205�body��WAMOC把表层暖咸水向北输送，在高纬冷却下沉后以深层水向南回流，是“全球海洋传送带”的关键环节。它向北大西洋和欧洲输送热量，调节海洋储碳并为深层水供氧。IPCC评估它在21世纪很可能减弱，极端情景下甚至可能在百年尺度上崩溃，深刻改变区域气候。��AMOC carries warm salty surface water northward, which cools and sinks at high latitudes and returns south as deep water—a key link in the global ocean conveyor belt. It delivers heat to the North Atlantic and Europe, regulates ocean carbon storage, and oxygenates the deep ocean. IPCC assesses it will very likely weaken this century, and in extreme scenarios could collapse on centennial timescales, profoundly altering regional climate.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�493159e2801a�body��r早晚阳光斜着穿过更厚的大气，蓝光被散射掉很多，剩下红光为主，所以太阳显得红。مAt those times sunlight passes obliquely through thicker air; blue light is scattered away, leaving mostly red, so the Sun looks red.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�4ce0487928c5�body�ل陆地靠植物光合作用和土壤储存碳，海洋靠溶解吸收与生物泵运碳，二者共同吸收约一半人为排放。٘Land stores carbon via photosynthesis and soils, the ocean via dissolution and the biological pump; together they take up about half of human emissions.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�4e518f59221b�body�ٷ盐碱土是地表积累过多可溶性盐或碱性物质的土壤，多出现在干旱区排水不良处。蒸发强使地下盐分随水上升到表层积聚，影响作物生长。��Saline-alkali soil accumulates excess soluble salts or alkaline substances, common in arid poorly drained areas. Strong evaporation draws groundwater salts to the surface where they accumulate, harming crops.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�4f0867f62c4e�body�ف约几千万年前，印度板块向北挤撞欧亚板块，把这里的地壳狠狠叠厚抬升，慢慢堆成了世界屋脊。�xTens of millions of years ago the Indian Plate collided with Eurasia, stacking and uplifting the crust into the plateau.�ans��src�ل尹安、哈里森《喜马拉雅—青藏高原造山带的地质演化》，《地球与行星科学年度评论》第28卷，2000وYin, A. & Harrison, T.M. (2000), Geologic evolution of the Himalayan–Tibetan orogen, Annual Review of Earth and Planetary Sciences, 28��id�4f446d3a60d3�body���PM2.5指空气动力学直径不大于2.5微米的细颗粒物，可深入肺泡甚至进入血液，携带硫酸盐、重金属与有机污染物。长期暴露与心肺疾病、卒中风险上升相关，是城市空气质量的核心指标。�1PM2.5 denotes fine particles with aerodynamic diameter no larger than 2.5 micrometers; they penetrate deep into alveoli and even the bloodstream, carrying sulfates, heavy metals, and organics. Long-term exposure raises risks of heart and lung disease and stroke, making it a core urban air-quality metric.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�502fe14e7672�body�ٍ卫星两次经过同一地点拍摄雷达，对比相位差就能测出毫米级的抬升或下沉，用于监测火山、断层和沉降。ٕA satellite images the same spot twice; comparing radar phase reveals millimeter uplift or subsidence, monitoring volcanoes, faults and sinking land.�ans��src��Massonnet 与 Feigl 1998 年发表于 Reviews of Geophysics 的综述:雷达干涉测量及其在地表变化探测中的应用لMassonnet, D. & Feigl, K.L., Reviews of Geophysics, 1998: Radar interferometry and its application to changes in the Earth's surface��id�51caaafaf778�body��~黄石是活着的破火山口，过去有过超大规模喷发，如今以间歇泉和地表隆起显示岩浆仍在活动。�}Yellowstone is a living caldera with past supereruptions; today geysers and ground uplift show magma is still active beneath.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�52f3b72929c9�body�ٷ过度抽取地下水会使含水层孔隙水压下降、颗粒被压密，导致地表缓慢下沉。沿海城市如上海、墨西哥城都曾因超采地下水发生明显沉降。��Over-pumping groundwater lowers pore pressure and compacts aquifer grains, slowly sinking the surface. Coastal cities like Shanghai and Mexico City have seen notable subsidence from excessive extraction.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�5310cdde398c�body��>云滴需要云凝结核（CCN）才能凝结。在洁净空气中，水汽即使达到过饱和也难以自发成滴；气溶胶粒子（海盐、硫酸盐、尘埃、人为污染物）提供了凝结表面，使水汽在很低的过饱和度下即可成云。气溶胶数量还影响云滴大小与云的反射率。�UCloud droplets require cloud condensation nuclei (CCN) to condense. In clean air, vapor rarely nucleates droplets even when supersaturated; aerosol particles (sea salt, sulfate, dust, anthropogenic pollutants) provide surfaces for condensation at very low supersaturation. Aerosol abundance also controls droplet size and cloud reflectivity.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�54295ee0fd1f�body�م湾流是北大西洋的暖流，AMOC是它连同深层冷水回流组成的传送带，把热量送往高纬、调节欧洲气候。ٝThe Gulf Stream is a North Atlantic warm current; AMOC is the conveyor with deep return flow that carries heat to high latitudes and shapes Europe's climate.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�54837c892a43�body���科罗拉多大峡谷主要是科罗拉多河在数百万年间向下切割、并辅以风化剥蚀而雕刻出的。它暴露出层层水平岩层，像是记录地球历史的巨型书本。��The Grand Canyon was mainly carved by the Colorado River cutting downward over millions of years, aided by weathering and erosion. It exposes layer upon layer of horizontal rock, like a giant book recording Earth's history.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�555584c09c7d�body�ل它是唯一连通三大洋、环绕南极的洋流，隔离了南极的寒冷、驱动深层水形成，深刻影响全球环流。ْThe only current linking three oceans around Antarctica, it isolates its cold, drives deep-water formation and strongly shapes global circulation.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�55a5872bf271�body���臭氧层吸收太阳紫外辐射中能量最强的UV-B和大部分UV-C，只让少量紫外线到达地面。没有这层保护，紫外线会灼伤皮肤、诱发皮肤癌和白内障，并伤害农作物与浮游生物。20世纪80年代发现的南极臭氧洞说明氯氟烃（CFC）会破坏臭氧，1987年《蒙特利尔议定书》禁止这类物质后，臭氧层正在缓慢恢复。��The ozone layer absorbs the most energetic ultraviolet bands, UV-B and most UV-C, letting only a small fraction reach the surface. Without it, UV radiation would burn skin, raise rates of skin cancer and cataracts, and damage crops and plankton. The Antarctic ozone hole found in the 1980s showed that chlorofluorocarbons (CFCs) destroy ozone; since the 1987 Montreal Protocol banned them, the layer has been slowly recovering.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�567d8ccd8848�body��~它直接利用黄土的隔热保温，冬天不用烧太多煤、夏天不用空调也舒服，几乎不消耗额外能源。�sIt uses loess's natural insulation, needing little heating in winter or cooling in summer—almost no extra energy.�ans��src��=刘东生《黄土与环境》，中国海洋出版社，1985�ALiu Tungsheng, Loess and the Environment, China Ocean Press, 1985��id�56ad52177522�body�ٷ自然金常以细小颗粒或块状散布在石英脉或河流砂砾（砂金）中。因为金化学性质稳定、不易与其他元素结合，所以多以单质形式被开采。��Native gold often occurs as tiny grains or nuggets dispersed in quartz veins or in river gravel as placer gold. Because gold is chemically stable and rarely bonds with other elements, it is mostly mined in its pure metallic form.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�58dcd015ee95�body�ه测高卫星向海面发射微波并接收回波，精确算出卫星到海面的距离，长期记录就能看出海面是升是降。ًAltimetry satellites bounce microwaves off the sea and time the return, giving precise height; long records show whether seas rise or fall.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�592654738a4e�body���拉尼娜是厄尔尼诺的反相，表现为赤道中东太平洋海温异常偏低。它会增强信风和赤道上升流，使西太平洋更暖、东太平洋更冷。拉尼娜年常导致西太平洋台风活动偏多、北美南部更干旱。��La Nina is the opposite phase of El Nino, marked by abnormally cool sea surface temperatures in the central and eastern equatorial Pacific. It strengthens the trade winds and equatorial upwelling, making the western Pacific warmer and the eastern Pacific cooler. During La Nina years the western Pacific often sees more typhoon activity and the southern United States tends to be drier.�ans��src�ُTimmermann, A. 等，《El Niño–Southern Oscillation complexity》，Nature 第559卷535–545页，2018年，DOI: 10.1038/s41586-018-0252-6وTimmermann, A. et al., El Niño–Southern Oscillation complexity, Nature, vol. 559, pp. 535–545, 2018, DOI: 10.1038/s41586-018-0252-6��id�5ad08081da9d�body���补给是地表水渗入并补充含水层的过程。主要途径包括降水入渗、河流与湖泊渗漏、灌溉回渗以及山区基岩出露区的侧向补给。补给速率受气候、植被、岩性与人类活动共同控制。�6Recharge is the process by which surface water infiltrates and replenishes an aquifer. Main pathways are precipitation infiltration, river and lake leakage, irrigation return flow, and lateral inflow where bedrock outcrops in mountains. Rate is controlled by climate, vegetation, lithology, and human activity.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�5b73422d901c�body�ل当地为避病害改挖深井，却打穿含砷的冲积层，微生物把沉积物里的砷释放进水，导致大规模中毒。ْTo avoid surface disease people drilled deep wells into arsenic-rich sediments; microbes mobilized the arsenic into water, causing mass poisoning.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�5c29d88eb191�body���钻石是碳在高温高压下结晶而成的矿物，通常形成于地下150公里以上的地幔深处。它们随火山喷发被带到地表，藏在一种叫金伯利岩的特殊岩石中。��Diamonds are minerals of carbon crystallized under high temperature and pressure, usually deep in the mantle more than 150 km down. They are brought to the surface by volcanic eruptions and hosted in a special rock called kimberlite.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�5fe6df897b64�body��可以。海浪能是海洋表面起伏所蕴含的机械能，可通过振荡水柱、点吸收浮标或越浪式装置转换为电力。它资源稳定、能量密度较高，但装置需承受腐蚀和强风暴的考验。目前已在部分沿海国家开展示范应用。�zYes. Wave energy is the mechanical energy contained in the up-and-down motion of the sea surface, which can be converted to electricity by oscillating water columns, point-absorber buoys, or overtopping devices. It is steady and relatively energy-dense, but devices must withstand corrosion and severe storms. Demonstration projects already operate in several coastal countries.�ans��src��lNREL 美国国家可再生能源实验室；Twidell & Weir《可再生能源资源》；IAEA 核安全标准�nNREL (National Renewable Energy Laboratory); Twidell & Weir, Renewable Energy Resources; IAEA Safety Standards��id�5ff2589f0d34�body��_磁场由液态外核中导电流体的运动（发电机效应）产生，流动模式并不稳定，偶极场会衰减重建，使南北磁极偶尔互换。火山岩冷却时会把当时的磁场方向记录在磁性矿物中，沉积物逐层沉积也记录磁场方向，地质学家据此建立磁性地层年表并用于地层对比与定年。��The field is generated by the motion of electrically conducting fluid in the liquid outer core (the geodynamo); the flow pattern is unstable, so the dipole field decays and rebuilds, occasionally swapping magnetic poles. Cooling lavas lock in the field direction in magnetic minerals, and sediments record it layer by layer, letting geologists build the geomagnetic polarity time scale for correlation and dating.�ans��src�� 《普通地质学》(舒良树)�General Geology (Shu Liangshu)��id�600c61f8e37d�body��~火山灰是喷发时岩浆被炸碎成的微小玻璃碎屑和岩石颗粒，细如粉尘却含尖锐的玻璃棱角。吸进肺里会损伤呼吸系统，落满屋顶可能压塌建筑，磨蚀机械和发动机，卷入飞机发动机可导致空中停车。2010年冰岛埃亚菲亚德拉火山喷发让欧洲空域关闭多天，显示火山灰对现代社会的巨大影响。��Volcanic ash is made of tiny glass shards and rock fragments blasted apart during an eruption—fine like dust but with sharp glassy edges. Inhaled, it damages the lungs; piled on roofs it can collapse buildings; it abrades machinery and engines; and sucked into jet engines it can cause them to fail midair. The 2010 Eyjafjallajokull eruption in Iceland closed European airspace for days, showing how disruptive ash can be.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�63559aee9a49�body�ٽ桌山顶部覆盖一层坚硬耐风化的岩石，保护下方较软岩层不被侵蚀，使山体保持平坦顶。周围软岩被剥蚀后退，留下孤立平顶山，如南非桌山。��A table mountain has a cap of hard erosion-resistant rock protecting softer layers below, keeping a flat top. Surrounding soft rock is stripped back, leaving an isolated flat-topped hill, as with Table Mountain in South Africa.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�674d055e4b45�body��主要是SO₂和NOx：SO₂主要来自燃煤电厂与冶炼厂，NOx主要来自机动车尾气和电厂燃烧。它们在大气中被氧化为硫酸和硝酸，随降水或干沉降到达地面，使湖泊酸化、森林受损，并腐蚀建筑与文物。�=Mainly SO₂ and NOx—SO₂ chiefly from coal-fired power plants and smelters, NOx from vehicle exhaust and power-plant combustion. Oxidized in the atmosphere to sulfuric and nitric acid, they reach the ground as wet or dry deposition, acidifying lakes, damaging forests, and corroding buildings and cultural relics.�ans��src��*中国气象局（酸雨监测与成因）�EChina Meteorological Administration (acid rain monitoring and causes)��id�68126d2fd20f�body��~它是我国最大沙漠，极度干旱、沙丘移动、寸草难生，古代商队迷路其中九死一生，因而得名。قChina's largest desert is hyper-arid with shifting dunes and almost no life; lost caravans rarely survived, earning the grim name.�ans��src��}吴正《风沙地貌学》,科学出版社,1987 ; 另见: Bagnold, The Physics of Blown Sand and Desert Dunes, Methuen, 1941�Bagnold, The Physics of Blown Sand and Desert Dunes, Methuen, 1941 ; see also: 吴正《风沙地貌学》,科学出版社,1987��id�694fbaa12e52�body�ي丹霞是红色砂砾岩经风化、流水切割形成的赤壁丹崖。岩石里的铁被氧化成红色，看起来像火烧的一样。َDanxia forms when red sandstone and conglomerate are cut by weathering and rivers. Iron in the rock oxidizes red, leaving glowing cliff walls.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�6a4b9b3d449e�body��r地核外核液态铁镍流动改变，使磁极从加拿大向北西伯利亚漂移，近年速度明显加快。�Changes in the swirling iron-nickel outer core are shifting the pole from Canada toward Siberia, and recently at a faster pace.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�6a62501884e9�body��多年冻土中封存着大量冻结的有机碳，约占全球土壤碳的三分之一。融化后有机质被微生物分解，释放CO₂和温室效应更强的CH₄，形成正反馈；同时融冰沉陷（热喀斯特）改变水文与生态系统，进一步放大碳释放。�;Permafrost locks up vast amounts of frozen organic carbon—about a third of global soil carbon. When it thaws, microbes decompose the organic matter, releasing CO₂ and the more potent greenhouse gas CH₄ in a positive feedback; thaw settlement (thermokarst) and hydrologic change further amplify carbon release.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�6a640296d629�body���厄尔尼诺是指赤道中东太平洋海面温度异常升高，会改变大气环流和降水分布。它常使南美洲西岸暴雨增多、西太平洋和印度洋一些地区干旱。厄尔尼诺还会影响台风路径和全球粮食产量。�rEl Nino refers to an abnormal warming of sea surface temperatures in the central and eastern equatorial Pacific, which alters atmospheric circulation and rainfall patterns. It often brings heavier rains to the west coast of South America and drought to parts of the western Pacific and Indian Ocean. El Nino also shifts typhoon tracks and affects global food production.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�6b4aec3e6d42�body��o月球引力把正对月球一侧的海水拉成一个高潮鼓包，同时地球与月球绕共同质心转动产生的离心力，在背对月球一侧也托起另一个鼓包。地球自转一圈，一个地点先后经过这两个鼓包，于是大约每隔12小时25分钟涨落一次，一天两次。大陆形状和海底地形会改变本地潮汐的细节。�rThe Moon's gravity pulls the water facing it into one high-tide bulge, while the centrifugal force of the Earth-Moon system raises a second bulge on the far side. As Earth rotates, any coastline passes beneath both bulges in turn, so high tide returns about every 12 hours 25 minutes—twice a day. Coastline shapes and seafloor relief modify the details of local tides.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�6bfa87be2b2b�body��r清明时气温回升、雨水增多、地温合适，正是春播好时机，种下的瓜豆容易发芽生长。�rBy Qingming the soil has warmed and rains increased—ideal for spring sowing, so melons and beans germinate well.�ans��src��$中国气象局《农业气象历》�FChina Meteorological Administration (CMA), Agrometeorological Calendar��id�6c780721e349�body���两国都位于环太平洋俯冲带，太平洋板块在此俯冲到大陆板块之下，边界摩擦积累巨大应力并频繁释放。日本处于欧亚与太平洋板块交界，智利处于纳斯卡板块俯冲南美板块处。�Both lie on the Pacific Ring of Fire's subduction zones, where the Pacific plate dives beneath continental plates, accumulating and frequently releasing huge stress. Japan sits where the Pacific meets the Eurasian plate, while Chile is where the Nazca plate subducts under South America.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�6d8559697702�body�ٙ台风靠温暖海面“吃饭”，登陆后断了水汽和热量来源，又受地形摩擦，旋转力量迅速减小，最后散架成普通雨带。ـTyphoons feed on warm seas; on land they lose heat and moisture and meet friction, so they spin down into an ordinary rain band.�ans��src��W伊曼纽尔《热带气旋》，《地球与行星科学年度评论》第31卷，2003�ZEmanuel, K.A. (2003), Tropical cyclones, Annual Review of Earth and Planetary Sciences, 31��id�6ed35ef85d35�body���通风廊道是利用城市中的河流、绿地、道路等线性开敞空间，引导盛行风穿过建成区，带走热量与污染物。合理规划廊道可增强空气交换、降低峰值气温，是许多城市气候规划的核心手段。�Ventilation corridors use linear open spaces—rivers, green belts, roads—to channel prevailing winds through built-up areas, carrying away heat and pollutants. Well-planned corridors enhance air exchange and lower peak temperatures, a core tool in urban climate planning.�ans��src��hBritter 与 Hanna,《Flow and dispersion in urban areas»,Annual Review of Fluid Mechanics 第35卷,2003�lR. E. Britter and S. R. Hanna, Flow and dispersion in urban areas, Annual Review of Fluid Mechanics 35, 2003��id�708223273f6f�body���永久冻土是常年保持在0摄氏度以下、含冰的土壤和岩层。气候变暖使高纬度冻土解冻，释放其中封存的二氧化碳和甲烷。冻土消融还会造成地表塌陷，影响道路和建筑。�Permafrost is ground, including soil and rock, that stays below 0 degrees Celsius year-round and contains ice. Warming thaws high-latitude permafrost, releasing the carbon dioxide and methane locked inside. Thawing also causes surface collapse that damages roads and buildings.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�71c71f855dbe�body�ٻ在格陵兰和澳大利亚的古老岩石中发现了约35亿到38亿年前的微生物迹象（如叠层石和碳同位素异常）。说明生命在地球形成后不久就已出现。��Ancient rocks in Greenland and Australia preserve microbial signs (like stromatolites and carbon-isotope anomalies) about 3.5–3.8 billion years old, suggesting life arose not long after Earth formed.�ans��src��8Wicander & Monroe,《Historical Geology》Cengage 多版�TR. Wicander and J. S. Monroe, Historical Geology, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�71ea064dfa3d�body���主要源区为蒙古高原南部、中国西北的戈壁与塔克拉玛干等干旱半干旱区。春季强冷空气大风将表层粉砂吹起，沿西风带向东传输，可影响华北、朝鲜半岛与日本，甚至越洋至北美。�The main sources are the southern Mongolian Plateau and arid Gobi and Taklamakan regions of northwest China. Spring cold-front gales lift silt that travels eastward along the westerlies, affecting North China, the Korean Peninsula, Japan, and occasionally crossing to North America.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�722ba24f1e07�body��风暴潮是热带气旋或强温带气旋经过时，强风和低气压把海水推向海岸造成的海平面异常升高。它常与天文大潮叠加，淹没低洼沿海地带。风暴潮是台风造成人员伤亡和财产损失的主要原因之一。�QA storm surge is an abnormal rise of sea level when a tropical or intense extratropical cyclone pushes seawater toward the coast with strong winds and low pressure. It often coincides with astronomical spring tides and floods low-lying coastal areas. Storm surge is one of the main causes of casualties and property loss during typhoons.�ans��src��cRachel Carson,《The Sea Around Us》Oxford University Press,1951;中译《环绕我们的海洋》�HR. Carson, The Sea Around Us, Oxford University Press, 1951; Chinese ed.��id�7595e6b25b5f�body���对流层是最接近地面的一层，集中了大部分天气现象，气温随高度降低。平流层在其上方，含有臭氧层，气温随高度升高而上升，空气较稳定、少有对流。飞机常在平流层底部飞行以避开颠簸。�;The troposphere is the lowest layer, where most weather occurs and temperature falls with height. The stratosphere lies above it, contains the ozone layer, and temperature rises with height, making the air stable with little convection. Aircraft often cruise near the bottom of the stratosphere to avoid turbulence.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�76e01005b9ea�body��u地球内部很热：地下水沿地壳薄弱带被加热上涌形成温泉，岩浆被挤到地表则形成火山。ٯEarth's interior is very hot: where groundwater is heated and rises along weak crustal zones it forms hot springs, and where magma is pushed to the surface it forms volcanoes.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�796cf54ba007�body���LiDAR向地面发射激光脉冲并精确测量往返时间，计算出密集的三维点位，能穿透林冠获取地表与植被结构。它被广泛用于绘制数字高程模型、洪水淹没范围与考古地貌。�
LiDAR fires laser pulses at the ground and measures round-trip time precisely to compute dense 3-D points, penetrating forest canopy to capture both surface and vegetation structure. It is used for digital elevation models, flood mapping, and archaeological terrain.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�7a6e8673b919�body���海拔越高，上方空气柱越短、空气越稀薄，气压就越低。大约每升高5500米，气压约减半。正因为如此，高山上氧气分压较低，容易出现高原反应。�The higher the altitude, the shorter the column of air above and the thinner the air, so pressure drops. Roughly every 5500 meters of ascent halves the pressure. That is why the partial pressure of oxygen is lower on high mountains and altitude sickness can occur.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�7c432f7f956d�body�ِ是风。干旱区强风夹着沙粒，不断打磨软硬不一的岩层，把山丘雕成城墙、怪兽等奇特形状，称为风蚀地貌。ّThe wind. In arid regions, sand-laden winds abrade rock layers of varying hardness into castle- and monster-like shapes—wind-erosion landforms.�ans��src��?派伊、措阿尔《风成沙与沙丘》，Unwin Hyman，1990�CPye, K. & Tsoar, H., Aeolian Sand and Sand Dunes, Unwin Hyman, 1990��id�7c80a7e9b506�body���长期集中开采地下水使井周围水位下降，在平面上形成以开采中心为凹点的漏斗状水面。开采量持续超过补给量时，漏斗范围扩大、中心深度加深，是超采的典型标志。��Sustained intensive pumping lowers the water table around wells, forming a funnel-shaped surface with the extraction center as the low point. When withdrawal persistently exceeds recharge, the cone expands and deepens—a hallmark of over-exploitation.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�7df5768e7de3�body�ه地下河长期溶蚀石灰岩，把顶部掏空，当岩层撑不住时就整块塌陷，形成一个朝天的深坑，就是天坑。�uUnderground rivers dissolve limestone until the roof can't hold, then it collapses into a deep open pit—a sinkhole.�ans��src��B福特、威廉姆斯《岩溶水文与地貌学》，Wiley，2007�NFord, D.C. & Williams, P.W., Karst Hydrogeology and Geomorphology, Wiley, 2007��id�7e875235b7af�body��{我国南方水多、北方水少，工程把长江流域的水调到缺水的华北和西北，缓解北方用水紧张。ٛSouthern China has surplus water while the north is short, so the project moves water from the Yangtze basin to water-scarce north China to ease shortages.�ans��src��'中国水利部《南水北调工程》�OChina Ministry of Water Resources (MWR), South-to-North Water Diversion Project��id�7f6b33f7e559�body���可以通过硬度、颜色、光泽、解理（破裂方式）、密度等性质来识别矿物。例如方解石遇稀盐酸会冒泡，磁铁能吸起含铁矿物，这些特征帮助快速区分。��Minerals can be identified by properties such as hardness, color, luster, cleavage (how they break), and density. For example, calcite fizzes in dilute acid and a magnet picks up iron-bearing minerals, helping quick distinction.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�7ffe80243c93�body��按成因降水可分为对流雨、地形雨、锋面雨和台风雨。对流雨由空气强烈受热上升形成，常见于夏季午后；地形雨是气流遇山抬升成云致雨；锋面雨发生在冷暖空气交界面。不同类型决定了降雨的时空分布。�IBy cause, precipitation is divided into convective, orographic, frontal, and typhoon rain. Convective rain forms from strongly heated rising air, common on summer afternoons; orographic rain comes as air is lifted by mountains; frontal rain occurs at the boundary of warm and cold air. The type governs when and where rain falls.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�821edaf2af2d�body��气候系统由大气、海洋、陆地、冰雪圈和生物圈五大圈层组成，它们通过能量和物质交换相互影响。太阳辐射是其主要能量来源，而温室气体决定能量收支。任何圈层的变化都会通过反馈波及整个系统。�:The climate system consists of five spheres: atmosphere, ocean, land, cryosphere, and biosphere, which interact through exchanges of energy and matter. Solar radiation is its main energy source, while greenhouse gases set the energy budget. A change in any sphere propagates through the whole system via feedbacks.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�84075768cf30�body�ف海底压力计侦测到海啸波引起的微弱水压变化，经浮标传回卫星，系统便能推算波高和到达时间。ٍSeafloor pressure gauges detect the slight wave signal, relay via buoys to satellites, and the system estimates wave height and arrival time.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�84490f52b58d�body���南大洋吸收了约一半人为 CO₂ 的海洋吸收量，靠下沉的冷水将碳带入深海长期封存。但南极绕极流与冰架融化带来的淡水分层减弱了这种下沉，若效率下降，更多 CO₂ 将滞留大气，加剧变暖。�=The Southern Ocean takes up roughly half of all anthropogenic CO₂ absorbed by the oceans, sending carbon to the deep via sinking cold water. But freshwater from ice-shelf melt and the Antarctic Circumpolar Current weaken this sinking; if efficiency drops, more CO₂ stays in the atmosphere and warming accelerates.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�845d30fefa1c�body���阳光加热表层海水，风浪混合使上层温度均匀，往下温度骤降的界面叫温跃层。密度随温度和盐度变化，冷水、咸水更重，于是形成稳定分层：表层的混合层、中间的温跃层和深层的冷水。这种分层阻挡上下物质交换，深层水的氧和营养主要靠洋流和下沉补充。海洋还按深度划分为透光层、弱光层和无光层等生态带。��Sunlight warms the surface, and wind mixes the upper layer to a uniform temperature, below which a sharp drop called the thermocline occurs. Density depends on temperature and salinity—cold, salty water is heavier—so the ocean stabilizes into a mixed surface layer, the thermocline, and deep cold water. The layering blocks vertical exchange, so oxygen and nutrients in deep water arrive mainly through currents and sinking. Ecologically, the ocean is also zoned into sunlit, twilight, and midnight layers.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�84cca16fd23b�body�ي那不是鬼怪，是夜晚冷空气灌进雅丹的缝隙和孔洞，风穿过时像吹笛子一样发出呼啸声，听起来很吓人。لNo ghosts—cool night air rushes through cracks and holes in the rock, and wind whistles through them like a flute, sounding eerie.�ans��src��?派伊、措阿尔《风成沙与沙丘》，Unwin Hyman，1990�CPye, K. & Tsoar, H., Aeolian Sand and Sand Dunes, Unwin Hyman, 1990��id�855da1250832�body��x约2.1万年前地球最冷，冰盖扩张到中纬度，海平面比今天低约120米，许多大陆架曾是陆地。ًAbout 21,000 years ago Earth was coldest, ice sheets reached mid-latitudes and sea level was roughly 120 m lower, exposing shelves as land.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�8699e7d2bc45�body���典型系统包括实时监测网络（地震台、气象雷达、水位站）、数据传输与模型预测、以及面向公众的发布与响应机制。缩短「预警到行动」的时间差是降低伤亡的关键。�A typical system includes real-time monitoring networks (seismic stations, weather radar, water-level gauges), data transmission and model forecasting, and public alerting and response protocols. Shortening the warning-to-action gap is key to reducing casualties.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�86ba7ad077ce�body���流域是汇集降水并汇入同一条河流及其支流的陆面区域，以分水岭为界。流域内所有的径流最终都流向同一个出口。流域的大小和形状影响洪水过程和人类用水。�A drainage basin is the land area where precipitation collects and flows into a single river and its tributaries, bounded by a divide. All runoff within it eventually reaches the same outlet. The basin's size and shape affect flood behavior and human water use.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�8880d4b32f72�body���冰川融水补给指河流的水量部分来自高山冰川和积雪的季节性消融。夏季气温升高时融水增多，使河流出现夏汛。这类河流对气候变暖敏感，长期可能面临水量减少。�Glacier meltwater feeding means part of a river's flow comes from the seasonal melting of mountain glaciers and snow. As temperatures rise in summer, meltwater increases and the river peaks. Such rivers are sensitive to warming and may see reduced flow in the long term.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�8a3dce2a1e62�body���急流是高空狭窄而强劲的风带，风速常超过每小时100公里。它由南北温差造成的气压梯度驱动，主要出现在对流层顶附近。急流引导着天气系统移动，影响航班时间和区域天气。�7A jet stream is a narrow, fast-flowing ribbon of wind high in the atmosphere, often exceeding 100 kilometers per hour. It is driven by the pressure gradient created by north-south temperature contrasts and sits near the tropopause. Jet streams steer weather systems and affect flight times and regional weather.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�8ea74ef44f6b�body��岩浆房是地壳或上地幔中聚集熔融岩石的空腔或裂隙网络。多数浅成岩浆房位于地下约 5 至 15 公里处，深成岩浆房可下延至 30 公里以上。它们并非巨大的单一空腔，而是由充满岩浆的裂隙和孔隙组成的储集系统。�BA magma chamber is a reservoir of molten rock accumulated in cavities or fracture networks within the crust or upper mantle. Most shallow chambers sit roughly 5 to 15 km below the surface, while deeper ones extend beyond 30 km. Rather than a single giant void, they are storage systems of magma-filled fractures and pores.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�8eb4dd2e4e59�body�ل海绵城市用透水铺装、下沉绿地和蓄水池，让雨水能渗、能蓄、能慢排，减少暴雨时马路积水成灾。١A sponge city uses permeable pavements, sunken green spaces and storage ponds so rain can soak in, be stored and drain slowly, cutting street flooding in storms.�ans��src��C住房和城乡建设部《海绵城市建设技术指南》，2014�hMinistry of Housing and Urban-Rural Development (MOHURD), Sponge City Construction Technical Guide, 2014��id�918bf76a7810�body���赤道洋流主要由稳定的信风持续吹拂海面、通过摩擦带动海水运动而形成。在科里奥利力作用下，北赤道和南赤道洋流分别向西流动。它们与西边界的强流（如黑潮、湾流）共同组成大洋环流。�5Equatorial currents are mainly formed by the steady trade winds dragging the sea surface through friction. Under the Coriolis force the North and South Equatorial Currents both flow westward. Together with strong western boundary currents such as the Kuroshio and the Gulf Stream they make up the ocean gyres.�ans��src��cRachel Carson,《The Sea Around Us》Oxford University Press,1951;中译《环绕我们的海洋》�HR. Carson, The Sea Around Us, Oxford University Press, 1951; Chinese ed.��id�920e34382f7b�body���断层是岩层发生相对错动的破裂面。走滑断层中两盘沿水平方向相对滑动，如圣安德烈亚斯断层；逆冲断层中上盘相对向上逆冲，常见于板块碰撞带，易产生强烈地震。�A fault is a fracture surface along which rock masses slip. In strike-slip faults the blocks move horizontally past each other, like the San Andreas Fault; in thrust faults the hanging wall moves up and over, common at collision zones and prone to strong quakes.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�93fb6c30ff75�body�٫当急流蜿蜒成深槽和高压脊，冷暖空气被拉得很南北分明，槽前易暴雨、脊下易热浪干旱，若系统停滞就会让某地连着极端天气。��When the jet meanders into deep troughs and ridges, cold and warm air separate sharply; troughs bring storms, ridges bring heat and drought, and if the pattern stalls, extremes persist in one place.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�94ba7cc54b23�body���海底扩张指新的洋壳在洋中脊处由地幔物质上涌冷却生成，并不断向两侧推开的过程。它解释了海洋地壳为何较年轻，也为大陆漂移提供了动力机制。��Seafloor spreading is the process where new oceanic crust forms at mid-ocean ridges from upwelling mantle material and is pushed outward on both sides. It explains why ocean crust is relatively young and provides a mechanism for continental drift.�ans��src��%海底扩张学说（赫斯, 1960s）� Seafloor spreading (Hess, 1960s)��id�94f4b524945a�body���山谷冰川像巨型锉刀，凭借底部裹挟的岩屑对谷壁和谷底进行磨蚀与刨蚀，把原本的V型河流谷拓宽加深为平直的U型谷，并留下冰斗、刃脊等遗迹。这是第四纪冰期最直观的地貌证据。�Valley glaciers act like giant files, abrading walls and floors with debris they carry, widening and deepening former V-shaped river valleys into straight U-shapes and leaving cirques and aretes. These are the most visible landforms of Quaternary glaciation.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�958cc9890335�body�ل那多是“水华”：水温高、养分（氮磷）多时，藻类大量繁殖铺满水面，会耗氧、发臭，影响鱼虾。٠That is usually an algal bloom: warm water rich in nutrients (nitrogen, phosphorus) lets algae multiply and cover the surface, using up oxygen and harming fish.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�96315aa423f5�body���河流入海（湖）时流速骤减，泥沙在河口堆积形成三角洲。大量三角洲因上游水库拦截泥沙、地下水与油气超采导致地面沉降，加之海平面上升，正面临淹没与侵蚀加剧的风险。��Where a river meets the sea or lake, its velocity drops and sediment accumulates to build a delta. Many deltas now subside because upstream dams trap sediment and groundwater or hydrocarbon extraction causes land subsidence, compounded by sea-level rise.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�97aaf08cd9c6�body�ٜ不是恐龙会走，而是它们生活的年代各大陆还连在一起（泛大陆）。后来大陆漂移分开，恐龙化石也就散落到了各地。٤The dinosaurs didn't migrate; they lived when the continents were joined (Pangaea). After the land split and drifted, their fossils ended up on separate continents.�ans��src��8Wicander & Monroe,《Historical Geology》Cengage 多版�TR. Wicander and J. S. Monroe, Historical Geology, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�98889cbd1c45�body�ه海洋板块携带含水矿物下沉，深处受热脱水，水汽上升降低熔点触发火山，水就这样在地球内部循环。١A sinking plate carries water-rich minerals; deep heat drives it off, the vapor rises, lowers melting point and fuels volcanoes, cycling water through the Earth.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�99422c279cf8�body���冰芯定年结合年度层计数（浅层可见季节纹层）、火山灰层等已知事件标志，以及基于冰流模型的年龄—深度尺度。深层常用气体与冰的「年龄差」校正，因气泡封闭滞后于降雪堆积。�Ice-core dating combines annual layer counting (visible seasonal bands in shallow ice), markers such as volcanic ash horizons, and ice-flow-model age-depth scales. In deep ice, a gas-age versus ice-age offset is corrected because bubbles close off after snow accumulates.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�9cc8ffb94023�body��~不是。地下水靠雨水慢慢下渗补充，开采速度常快过补给，过量抽取会让水位下降、甚至井干。ٍNo. Groundwater is slowly refilled by rain seepage; pumping often outpaces recharge, so over-use lowers the water table and can dry up wells.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�9cdbcb036034�body��x喷发柱里岩屑与冰晶剧烈摩擦起电，电荷分离后在烟尘中放出闪电，常伴大规模喷发出现。وAsh, rock and ice in the eruption column rub and charge up, and the separated electricity flashes inside the plume during big eruptions.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�9e40f0d9bd09�body���它们中的硫酸盐和粉尘会散射阳光、给云增白而短期降温，但其中的黑碳吸光又会加热大气；总体上污染气溶胶掩盖了一部分温室增暖，却带来健康与污染问题。��Sulfates and dust scatter sunlight and brighten clouds, cooling short-term, while black carbon absorbs light and warms the air; pollution aerosols mask some greenhouse warming but cause health and pollution harm.�ans��src��>盛裴轩 等,《大气物理学》,北京大学出版社,2003�HSheng Peixuan et al., Atmospheric Physics, Peking University Press, 2003��id�9f42bd277a77�body�ٽ里氏震级由查尔斯·里克特于1935年提出，用地震仪记录的地震波振幅来量化地震大小。它是一个对数标度，震级每增1级，释放能量约增30多倍。��The Richter scale, introduced by Charles Richter in 1935, quantifies earthquake size from the amplitude of seismic waves recorded by seismographs. It is a logarithmic scale: each whole number increase means roughly 30 times more released energy.�ans��src��地震学（里克特, 1935）�Seismology (Richter, 1935)��id�9f4f273949f4�body�ٺ河流侵蚀指水流及携带的砂石磨蚀河床和河岸，使其下切和拓宽。下切形成峡谷，侧蚀使河道摆弯。侵蚀强度取决于流量、坡度和泥沙含量。�River erosion is the wearing away of the bed and banks by flowing water and the sediment it carries, cutting down and widening the channel. Downcutting forms canyons, while lateral erosion bends the course. Erosion intensity depends on discharge, slope, and sediment load.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�a06cb2a16f41�body�ٖ桌山是顶部盖着一层坚硬水平岩石、下方软岩被侵蚀掉后留下的平顶山，像一张桌子。南非的开普敦桌山最著名。٭A table mountain keeps a flat top because a hard horizontal rock layer resists erosion while softer rock below is worn away—like a tabletop. Cape Town's is the famous one.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�a0764941f0de�body���大洋中脊是板块张裂、地幔物质上涌并新生大洋地壳的地方，属于离散型边界。地幔熔融补给使两侧板块不断分离，中脊因此成为全球最长的火山山脉系统，也是海底扩张的中心。�Mid-ocean ridges are where plates diverge and upwelling mantle creates new oceanic crust—divergent boundaries. Continuous mantle melting feeds the separating plates, making ridges the planet's longest volcanic mountain system and the hub of seafloor spreading.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�a1907607caac�body���破火山口是岩浆大规模喷发后，地下空腔排空、上方地表塌陷形成的近圆形洼地。喷发量可达数十至上百立方公里，塌陷直径常达数公里至数十公里，如黄石和托巴破火山口。�:A caldera is a roughly circular depression formed when the ground above a magma reservoir collapses after a massive eruption empties the chamber. Eruptions can eject tens to over a hundred cubic kilometers of material, and collapse diameters range from a few to tens of kilometers, as seen at Yellowstone and Toba.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�a19615803c3b�body��&海啸由海底地震、滑坡或火山活动引发，波长极长、传播极快，在深海不易察觉但近岸可造成巨浪。风暴潮则是强风与低气压把海水推挤到岸边造成的海平面异常抬升，与台风等天气系统有关。两者成因和预警方式都不同。��A tsunami is triggered by undersea earthquakes, landslides, or volcanic activity; it has a very long wavelength and travels extremely fast, being barely noticeable in deep water but forming huge waves near shore. A storm surge is an abnormal rise of sea level caused by strong winds and low pressure pushing water toward the coast, linked to weather systems like typhoons. Their causes and warning methods differ.�ans��src��cRachel Carson,《The Sea Around Us》Oxford University Press,1951;中译《环绕我们的海洋》�HR. Carson, The Sea Around Us, Oxford University Press, 1951; Chinese ed.��id�a20897eaee31�body���黑潮是西北太平洋的一条强暖流，沿日本东岸向北流动。它源自北赤道洋流，携带高温高盐水，影响东亚沿海的气候与渔场。黑潮的强弱变化与区域天气和渔业密切相关。�LThe Kuroshio is a strong warm current in the northwestern Pacific that flows northward along the east coast of Japan. Originating from the North Equatorial Current, it carries warm, saline water and influences the climate and fishing grounds of East Asia. Its strength varies and is closely linked to regional weather and fisheries.�ans��src��cRachel Carson,《The Sea Around Us》Oxford University Press,1951;中译《环绕我们的海洋》�HR. Carson, The Sea Around Us, Oxford University Press, 1951; Chinese ed.��id�a22354b963fa�body���台风的强风和低压使海面异常抬升，叠加天文大潮时海水倒灌淹没低洼海岸，是最具破坏力的致灾因素之一。预警依赖风暴路径、气压与海底地形耦合的潮位模型。�A typhoon's strong winds and low pressure raise the sea surface anomalously; combined with astronomical high tide, seawater floods low-lying coasts and becomes one of the most destructive factors. Warning relies on tide models coupling storm track, pressure, and bathymetry.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�a26aa2d552ea�body�ي氟氯碳化物等人类化学品升入平流层，在极地寒冬的冰晶上释放氯，春季阳光照射时猛烈破坏臭氧分子。ًMan-made CFCs rise to the stratosphere; on polar ice crystals they release chlorine that destroys ozone rapidly each spring under sunlight.�ans��src��>盛裴轩 等,《大气物理学》,北京大学出版社,2003�HSheng Peixuan et al., Atmospheric Physics, Peking University Press, 2003��id�a2ca2233b302�body���拉尼娜是厄尔尼诺的反相：信风异常增强，把更多暖水堆到西太平洋，东太平洋海温比常年更冷。它通常让东南亚、澳大利亚和南亚降水偏多、易发洪涝，而南美西部和美国西南部偏干，全球平均气温往往被拉低一些。厄尔尼诺与拉尼娜交替出现，构成了厄尔尼诺-南方涛动（ENSO）这个自然摆动。��La Nina is the opposite phase of El Nino: trade winds strengthen unusually, piling extra warm water in the western Pacific and leaving the eastern Pacific cooler than normal. It typically brings heavier rain and floods to Southeast Asia, Australia, and South Asia while drying western South America and the US Southwest, and it slightly lowers the global average temperature. The alternation of El Nino and La Nina forms the natural oscillation called ENSO.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�a3d3abf17f00�body�ٍ它不用大坝硬堵，而是用“鱼嘴”分水、“飞沙堰”排沙、“宝瓶口”控流，顺水势而为，所以历久弥新。ٍInstead of a dam, it uses a levee to split flow, a spillway to dump silt and a channel to control it—working with the river, so it endures.�ans��src��E联合国教科文组织世界遗产中心《青城山—都江堰》�NUNESCO World Heritage Centre, Mount Qingcheng and Dujiangyan Irrigation System��id�a45bc3dc8db4�body��r深海中海啸波长可达数百公里、时速约700公里却只有一米高，近岸变短变高才成巨浪。ٍIn deep ocean a tsunami has a wavelength of hundreds of km and speed near 700 km/h but only about a meter high, growing tall only near shore.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�a6a4c62744c2�body�٨断层是岩层受力破裂并发生相对位移的破裂面，是地震最常见的发生地。按运动方向可分为正断层、逆断层和走滑断层等类型。��A fault is a fracture where rock has broken and moved relative to the other side, and it is the most common site of earthquakes. By movement direction they are classified as normal, reverse, and strike-slip faults.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�a6dec79627bd�body���冰期干冷多风时，西北干旱区的细粉砂被强劲西风与冬季风搬运至黄土高原堆积，间冰期风化成壤，形成数十至数百米厚的黄土-古土壤序列。它是东亚季风与沙漠演化的天然档案。�SDuring cold, dry, windy glacials, fine silt from arid northwestern sources was carried by strong westerlies and winter monsoons to the Loess Plateau and deposited; interglacials weathered it into soils, building tens to hundreds of meters of loess-paleosol sequences. It is a natural archive of the East Asian monsoon and desert evolution.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�a7eaa9f5a811�body���俯冲带中一端板块插入另一端之下，界面处因摩擦闭锁积累巨大弹性应变，一旦突然错动便释放巨大能量，形成矩震级 9 级左右的特大地震，并常伴生海啸，如 2011 年东日本大地震。�In subduction zones one plate thrusts beneath another, and friction locks the interface, accumulating huge elastic strain that is suddenly released in a giant rupture—producing magnitude-9 megathrust quakes often followed by tsunamis, as in the 2011 Tohoku earthquake.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�aa8a7ab3beb6�body�ٺ震源是地下岩体最先破裂、释放能量的点；震中是震源垂直投影到地面的位置。破坏通常离震中越近越严重，但震源深度也会影响影响范围。��The focus is the point underground where the rock first breaks and releases energy; the epicenter is the point on the surface directly above it. Damage is usually worst near the epicenter, though focal depth also shapes how widely the shaking spreads.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�ab7be618cee1�body�ٮ两种都有：云把阳光反射回太空会降温，但云也会像毯子一样拦住地面红外辐射而升温；低厚云多半净降温，高空薄云多半净升温。٭Both: clouds reflect sunlight (cooling) but also trap outgoing infrared like a blanket (warming). Low thick clouds usually net-cool, while high thin clouds usually net-warm.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�ac9c925de14e�body�ٮ末次盛冰期约在2.1万年前，是最近一次冰期冰川规模最大的时期。当时全球气温低、海平面比现在低约120米，大片陆地被冰盖覆盖。��The Last Glacial Maximum around 21,000 years ago was the peak of the most recent ice age's glaciation. Global temperatures were lower and sea level about 120 m below today, with vast ice sheets covering land.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�ad2911052196�body��更多气溶胶作为云凝结核使云滴更细小密集，云对阳光的反射增强（Twomey效应），冷却地表；但若云滴过小抑制降水，云寿命延长也会改变水循环。这一间接效应是气候模拟中不确定性的主要来源之一。�UMore aerosols as cloud condensation nuclei make cloud droplets smaller and more numerous, increasing the cloud's reflection of sunlight (the Twomey effect) and cooling the surface; if droplets are too small to rain, longer cloud lifetime also alters the water cycle. This indirect effect is a leading source of uncertainty in climate models.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�ad325bb2ff20�body���这是角度不整合：下伏岩层先沉积、褶皱抬升，经长期侵蚀夷平，之后海侵或沉降使新沉积物覆盖其上。它记录了该地区曾发生的构造运动、抬升剥蚀与再次沉降，代表一段缺失的地质时间。�'This is an angular unconformity: the underlying strata were deposited, folded and uplifted, then beveled by long-term erosion before renewed subsidence or transgression buried them. It records a cycle of tectonism, uplift and erosion, and renewed deposition, representing a gap in geologic time.�ans��src�� 《普通地质学》(舒良树)�General Geology (Shu Liangshu)��id�adf15030f00d�body�ٱ砂岩由砂粒经水流或风搬运后压实胶结而成，颗粒较粗；页岩由极细的黏土颗粒在静水环境缓慢沉积、压实而成，层理薄且易裂成片。��Sandstone forms when sand grains transported by water or wind are compacted and cemented, with coarser particles. Shale forms from very fine clay particles slowly deposited and compacted in quiet water, with thin layering that splits easily.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�ae9458b9222d�body��2农业径流和污水带来过量氮磷，浮游植物爆发性增殖形成赤潮。危害包括：藻类夜间呼吸及衰亡后分解大量耗氧，形成缺氧“死区”；部分藻类产生毒素，毒杀鱼类贝类并威胁食品安全；浓密藻华遮蔽阳光，破坏海草床等底栖生境。��Agricultural runoff and sewage deliver excess nitrogen and phosphorus, causing explosive phytoplankton growth. Harm comes from oxygen depletion—nighttime respiration and post-bloom decomposition create hypoxic “dead zones”—while some species produce toxins that kill fish and shellfish and threaten food safety; dense blooms also shade out seagrass beds and other benthic habitats.�ans��src��TPaerl 等,《Mitigating harmful cyanobacterial blooms»,Water Research 第45卷,2011�UH. W. Paerl et al., Mitigating harmful cyanobacterial blooms, Water Research 45, 2011��id�b14d2f9d30a5�body���大量淡水注入北大西洋会削弱海水下沉，可能减缓AMOC；南极融水则影响绕极流与底层水形成。这些变化会改变区域气候与海平面分布，是未来气候情景的重要不确定源。�Large freshwater input to the North Atlantic can weaken sinking and slow the AMOC; Antarctic melt affects the Antarctic Circumpolar Current and bottom-water formation. Such changes would reshape regional climate and sea-level patterns and are a major uncertainty in future scenarios.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�b297917b3461�body���河流搬运指水流把侵蚀下来的泥沙以悬移、推移或溶解等方式向下游输送。搬运能力随流速增大而增强，洪水期能携带大量粗粒物质。搬运和沉积共同塑造了平原与三角洲。�River transportation is the downstream movement of eroded sediment by suspension, bed load, or dissolution. Transport capacity grows with flow velocity, so floods can carry large amounts of coarse material. Together with deposition it shapes plains and deltas.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�b2dacac46923�body��+多种因素叠加：太阳活动减弱（如蒙德极小期太阳黑子极少）、一系列大型火山喷发（如1815年坦博拉火山）向平流层注入硫酸盐气溶胶遮蔽阳光，以及北大西洋海冰扩张与环流变化的正反馈。当时全球气温比现代低约0.5–1°C。�eA combination of factors: weakened solar activity (the Maunder Minimum's near-absence of sunspots), a cluster of large eruptions such as Tambora in 1815 injecting sunlight-blocking stratospheric sulfate aerosols, and positive feedbacks involving expanded North Atlantic sea ice and circulation shifts. Temperatures were about 0.5–1°C below modern values.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�b316a4712f6a�body��r闪电的高温高压把氮气和氧气合成氮氧化物，随雨水进入土壤成为植物可吸收的养分。قLightning's heat and pressure combine nitrogen and oxygen into nitrogen oxides that fall in rain as soil nutrients plants can use.�ans��src��>盛裴轩 等,《大气物理学》,北京大学出版社,2003�HSheng Peixuan et al., Atmospheric Physics, Peking University Press, 2003��id�b47a6a43d719�body��w分水岭是相邻流域之间的高地形边界，如分水岭山脊，落到两侧的降水会进入不同的河流系统。整个被分水岭围住、河水都汇入同一干流的区域叫流域或集水区，例如长江流域面积约180万平方公里。流域边界也决定污染物去向、洪水风险与水资源管理范围，所以治水必须先看懂流域。��A divide is the high terrain, like a ridge line, separating neighboring drainage basins; precipitation falling on its two flanks enters different river systems. The whole region drained into one main river is its watershed or drainage basin—the Yangtze drains about 1.8 million square kilometers. Basin boundaries determine where pollutants go, flood risk, and how water is managed, which is why water governance begins with reading the watershed.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�b47c19a079cb�body���地下水储存在土壤和岩石的空隙中，能大量蓄水的透水层叫含水层，如砂砾层和砂岩；黏土等几乎不透水的叫隔水层。地下水位是饱水带的顶面，受降雨补给和抽水影响，旱季或大量抽水时会下降。地下水不断向河流和泉补给，是许多地区饮用水与农业的主要来源，过度抽取会造成水位持续下降和地面沉降。��Groundwater fills pores and cracks in soil and rock; layers that store and transmit it freely, like gravel beds and sandstone, are aquifers, while clay and other nearly impermeable layers are aquitards. The water table is the top of the saturated zone; it falls in droughts or under heavy pumping and rises with recharge. Groundwater continuously feeds rivers and springs, supplies much of the world's drinking and irrigation water, and over-pumping causes long-term declines and land subsidence.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�b604ef574e33�body�ٴ曲流是平原河流因侧蚀作用形成的蜿蜒弯道。凹岸受冲刷、凸岸堆积，使弯道不断加宽并可能自然截弯取直。废弃的弯道常留下牛轭湖。��A meander is a sinuous bend formed by lateral erosion on a plain river. The outer bank is scoured while the inner bank builds up, widening the loop until it may be cut off naturally. The abandoned loop often leaves an oxbow lake.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�b6c33e0cff44�body�ٓ会。板块挤压、火山喷发能把地壳抬升，山就慢慢长高；当然风化和侵蚀也在不断把它削低，两者一直在比赛。نYes. Plate collision and volcanism uplift crust, raising mountains; meanwhile weathering and erosion wear them down—a constant race.�ans��src��=普雷斯、西弗尔《理解地球》，W.H. Freeman，2001�?Press, F. & Siever, R., Understanding Earth, W.H. Freeman, 2001��id�b7dc1683d959�body���石英成分为二氧化硅，化学性质稳定、耐高温和风化，广泛存在于花岗岩等火成岩及沉积岩中。它在地壳中形成温度范围宽，因此成为分布最广的造岩矿物之一。��Quartz is silicon dioxide, chemically stable and resistant to heat and weathering, and is widespread in igneous rocks like granite and in sediments. It forms across a wide temperature range, making it one of the most abundant rock-forming minerals.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�b7fb3d563a68�body��,浮游植物是能光合作用的微藻和蓝细菌，是海洋的初级生产者；浮游动物是摄食浮游植物的微小动物（如桡足类、磷虾）。浮游植物每年固定的碳约占全球光合固碳总量的一半，支撑着整个渔业食物网，因此被称为海洋的草地。�7Phytoplankton are photosynthetic microalgae and cyanobacteria—the ocean's primary producers; zooplankton (copepods, krill) are tiny animals that graze on them. Phytoplankton fix roughly half of global photosynthetic carbon each year and underpin the entire fishery food web, hence the "grasslands of the sea."�ans��src��cRachel Carson,《The Sea Around Us》Oxford University Press,1951;中译《环绕我们的海洋》�HR. Carson, The Sea Around Us, Oxford University Press, 1951; Chinese ed.��id�b81b1fe9c3b6�body���公元79年维苏威火山喷发，火山灰和火山碎屑流迅速掩埋了庞贝等城镇，使建筑和居民瞬间定格。这次事件成为研究古罗马生活和火山灾害的珍贵现场。��In 79 AD, Mount Vesuvius erupted and buried Pompeii and nearby towns under ash and pyroclastic flows, freezing buildings and residents in an instant. The site is a precious record of Roman life and volcanic hazard.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�b92002ce0458�body��它们如同固体水库，夏季融化补给河流，维持旱季与炎热季节的水量。退缩的近期效应是融水增加、冰湖溃决风险上升；长远看融水将逐渐减少，威胁下游数亿人的灌溉、饮水和发电用水，并加剧夏季干旱。�mThey act as solid reservoirs, releasing meltwater in summer and sustaining river flow through dry and hot seasons. In the near term retreat raises melt runoff and the risk of glacial-lake outburst floods; over the long term meltwater declines, threatening irrigation, drinking water, and hydropower for hundreds of millions downstream and worsening summer droughts.�ans��src��0中国科学院（冰冻圈与亚洲水资源）�BChinese Academy of Sciences (cryosphere and Asian water resources)��id�b9415d51272a�body�ٓ它高耸的冰川和积雪融化后，汇成长江、黄河、雅鲁藏布江、湄公河等大江大河的源头，哺育了亚洲几十亿人。وIts glaciers and snowmelt feed the headwaters of the Yangtze, Yellow, Yarlung Tsangpo, Mekong and more, sustaining billions across Asia.�ans��src��T姚檀栋等《第三极环境与变化》，《中国科学通报》第57卷，2012�[Yao, T. et al. (2012), Third Pole environment and its changes, Chinese Science Bulletin, 57��id�ba16ec97850d�body�ٖ白天陆地升温快、空气上升，海上的冷空气补过来形成海风；夜里陆地降温快、海上相对暖，风又从陆地吹向海。١By day land heats fast and air rises, drawing cool sea air inland (sea breeze); at night land cools fast and air flows from land to the warmer sea (land breeze).�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�bab20b06a90b�body��?云中水滴变大变重，空气托不住就落下来成雨。�<Cloud droplets grow heavy and fall when air can't hold them.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�bb5ef5b835d6�body��陆地冰川和冰盖融化是海平面上升的另一大来源，目前与海洋热膨胀的贡献大致相当。格陵兰和南极冰盖的加速消融尤其受到关注。卫星观测显示，两者共同导致近几十年海平面每年上升数毫米。�aMelting of land glaciers and ice sheets is the other major source of sea level rise and currently contributes roughly as much as thermal expansion. The accelerating loss from the Greenland and Antarctic ice sheets is especially concerning. Satellite observations show that together they raise sea level by several millimeters per year in recent decades.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�bb921e312293�body���沙漠空气干燥、植被稀少，水汽和云都很少，白天地面吸收大量太阳辐射而迅速升温。夜间缺乏云层保温，地面热量快速向天空散失，温度骤降。因此沙漠常出现白天酷热、夜晚寒凉的现象。�KDeserts are dry with little vegetation, so there is little water vapor and few clouds; the ground absorbs abundant solar radiation and heats rapidly by day. At night, with no cloud blanket to retain heat, the ground quickly radiates energy to the sky and cools sharply. That is why deserts are scorching by day and chilly at night.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�bdc01b8cb566�body�٫大理石主要成分碳酸钙会与酸反应溶解，酸雨中的硫酸、硝酸长期作用使表面粉化、字迹模糊。许多古老石雕因此面临风化威胁。��Marble's main component, calcium carbonate, dissolves in acid; long exposure to sulfuric and nitric acids in acid rain powders the surface and blurs inscriptions. Many ancient stone carvings face this weathering threat.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�be0237a1492a�body��x大河提供饮用和灌溉水、方便乘船运粮运货，还能界河防御。有水有路，城市才容易长大。٘Big rivers gave drinking and irrigation water, easy boat transport of grain and goods, and a defensive border. With water and routes, cities could grow.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�bfba2cb9fa05�body�ٮ蚯蚓吞食有机物和土壤，排泄富含养分的蚓粪，并打通孔隙改善透气透水。它们的活动促进团粒结构形成，被称为「土壤工程师」。��Earthworms eat organic matter and soil, excreting nutrient-rich castings and opening pores that improve air and water flow. Their activity builds aggregate structure, earning them the name 'soil engineers'.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�c02d392d47d7�body���火山带是火山集中分布的地带，最典型的是环太平洋火山带。板块边界地壳较薄且活动强烈，地幔物质容易上涌，因此全球大多数活火山都位于板块张裂或俯冲的边界附近。�A volcanic belt is a zone where volcanoes cluster, the most famous being the Ring of Fire around the Pacific. Plate boundaries have thin, active crust where mantle material can rise easily, so most of the world's active volcanoes lie near spreading or subducting boundaries.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�c0b46ca09881�body�ٟ穿衣指数是综合气温、风、湿度和日照等，给出“该穿多少”的建议。冷风大或湿度高时，体感更冷，建议就穿得更厚。٩The clothing index combines temperature, wind, humidity and sun to advise how to dress. Strong wind or high humidity makes it feel colder, so it suggests warmer clothes.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�c1f1844b2180�body���圣安德烈斯断层是美国加州的一条大型转换断层，属于板块的走滑边界。太平洋板块与北美板块在此水平错动，因此该区域地震频繁但不易发生俯冲型火山活动。��The San Andreas Fault is a major transform fault in California, a strike-slip plate boundary. The Pacific and North American plates slide past each other horizontally there, causing frequent earthquakes but little subduction-related volcanism.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�c203a41ccf03�body�ف珊瑚骨骼中锶钙比、氧同位素随水温变化，按年轮取样就能得到数十年到百年尺度的古海温序列。ِSr/Ca ratios and oxygen isotopes in coral skeletons track water temperature; sampled by annual bands they give decades to centuries of past SST.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�c3da37460fc3�body���海底地震发生后，岸上地震台网先锁定震源并判断是否可能引发海啸；深海的浮标压力计（海啸监测站）测到海啸波经过时的水位变化，再把数据实时传给预警中心。计算机模型结合震级与波传播路径，估算各海岸的到达时间和浪高，通过广播、短信发布警报。2004年印度洋大海啸前缺乏预警系统，教训促使各国建立起覆盖全球的预警网络。��After an undersea earthquake, land seismic networks first locate the source and judge tsunami potential; deep-ocean buoys with pressure sensors detect the tsunami wave passing overhead and transmit data in real time to warning centers. Computer models combine magnitude and wave paths to estimate arrival times and heights for each coast, and alerts go out by broadcast and text. The 2004 Indian Ocean disaster struck before any system existed, prompting the global warning network in place today.�ans��src��RLevin, B.W. 与 Nosov, M.A.《海啸物理学》（第2版），Springer，2016年�GLevin, B.W. & Nosov, M.A., Physics of Tsunamis, 2nd ed., Springer, 2016��id�c499af50e41f�body�ٽ裂谷是地壳受拉张而下沉、断裂形成的狭长凹陷地带，常是大陆开始分裂的地方。东非大裂谷就是典型的例子，未来可能逐渐演化成新的海洋。��A rift valley is a long, narrow depression formed where the crust is pulled apart and subsides along faults, often marking where a continent begins to split. The East African Rift is a classic example and may eventually become a new ocean.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�c66062a1d08e�body�ٍ藻类大量死亡后被细菌分解，会耗光水中的氧气；缺氧加上残留毒素，就会造成鱼类和其他生物成片死亡。١When the algae die and bacteria decompose them, they consume the water's oxygen; the resulting hypoxia plus lingering toxins kill fish and other life in patches.�ans��src��cRachel Carson,《The Sea Around Us》Oxford University Press,1951;中译《环绕我们的海洋》�HR. Carson, The Sea Around Us, Oxford University Press, 1951; Chinese ed.��id�c797fc2894f3�body�ف不同岩石的稀土元素配分模式像指纹，比较沉积物或尘埃的稀土特征就能判断它们来自哪片母岩。ـRare-earth patterns act like fingerprints of rocks; matching sediments or dust to them reveals which parent rock they came from.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�c7fad869210b�body��r风浪长期啃食岸线，台风带来的风暴潮叠加天文大潮猛灌内陆，加剧淹没与房屋倒塌。مWaves steadily eat the shoreline while a typhoon's storm surge stacked on high tide floods inland, worsening inundation and collapse.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�c96d7a43c3de�body�ٓ暖湿气流爬山脉时被抬升、变冷、下雨（迎风坡多雨），翻过去后空气变干，背风坡就少雨，形成“雨影区”。ّMoist air is lifted by the range, cools and rains on the windward side; past the crest the air is dry, leaving the lee side arid—a rain shadow.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�cac40c985ca1�body�� 主要通过结晶分异：早期结晶的橄榄石和辉石比重大，沉入岩浆房底部，使残余岩浆中的SiO₂、Al₂O₃和碱质相对富集；地壳物质的同化混染也能推动岩浆向酸性演化。反复的分离结晶使残余岩浆逐渐接近花岗岩成分。�TMainly through fractional crystallization: early-crystallized olivine and pyroxene are dense and sink to the chamber floor, enriching the remaining melt in SiO₂, Al₂O₃, and alkalis; assimilation of crustal material also drives the melt toward felsic composition. Repeated separation of crystals gradually produces near-granitic magma.�ans��src�� 《普通地质学》(舒良树)�General Geology (Shu Liangshu)��id�cc0f28f54b1d�body���气旋是中心气压低、空气向内辐合并上升的天气系统，北半球逆时针旋转，常带来阴雨。反气旋中心气压高、空气向外辐散下沉，北半球顺时针旋转，多晴朗干燥天气。�$A cyclone is a low-pressure system where air converges inward and rises, rotating counterclockwise in the Northern Hemisphere and often bringing clouds and rain. An anticyclone is a high-pressure system with diverging sinking air, rotating clockwise northward and bringing clear, dry weather.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�cc1f7a22428b�body��;夏威夷位于太平洋板块缓慢移动经过地幔柱（热点）之上，炽热地幔物质在此上涌形成火山；随着板块持续西北向移动，新的火山在热点处生成、旧的被带离，于是排成西北—东南向的火山链。这是板块运动叠加深部固定热点的典型证据。�^Hawaii sits where the Pacific Plate slowly moves over a relatively fixed upwelling of hot mantle called a mantle plume; volcanism builds a volcano above the plume, and as the plate drifts northwest, new volcanoes form while old ones are carried away, producing a chain. The pattern is classic evidence of plate motion over a deep, stationary hotspot.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�cc231bc5b422�body�ً已知有哥伦比亚、罗迪尼亚、潘诺蒂亚和约3亿年前的泛大陆等，它们聚了又散，塑造了气候与生物分布。َExamples include Columbia, Rodinia, Pannotia and Pangaea about 300 million years ago; they assembled and broke up, reshaping climate and life.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�cc56a9529a15�body�ٓ城市矿产指从废手机、电脑等电子产品里回收金属。手机电路板镀有少量金、银、铜，集中回收比挖矿更省料。٤Urban mining recovers metals from discarded phones and electronics. Phone boards are plated with a little gold, silver and copper, and recycling them saves raw ore.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�cca346059b7e�body���海啸多由海底地震使海底突然抬升或下沉、推动上方巨量海水而形成。海底火山喷发和山体滑坡也能引发海啸，其波速在深海中可达每小时数百公里。��Tsunamis are usually caused by undersea earthquakes that abruptly lift or drop the seafloor, displacing huge volumes of water above. Submarine eruptions and landslides can also trigger them, and their waves can travel hundreds of km/h in deep ocean.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�cd053f62481b�body�ل台风需要又暖又湿的洋面提供能量，夏秋西北太平洋海温最高，水蒸气充足，最容易“生”出台风。قTyphoons need warm, moist ocean energy; in late summer-autumn the NW Pacific is warmest with plenty of vapor, ideal for formation.�ans��src��W伊曼纽尔《热带气旋》，《地球与行星科学年度评论》第31卷，2003�ZEmanuel, K.A. (2003), Tropical cyclones, Annual Review of Earth and Planetary Sciences, 31��id�cd40696145f4�body��大型喷发将二氧化硫注入平流层，转化为硫酸盐气溶胶，反射阳光并使全球地表在数月到数年内降温。1991 年皮纳图博火山喷发使全球平均气温暂时下降约 0.5℃。火山灰本身则很快沉降，对气候影响有限。�:Major eruptions inject sulfur dioxide into the stratosphere, where it becomes sulfate aerosols that reflect sunlight and cool the global surface for months to a few years. The 1991 Pinatubo eruption lowered global mean temperature by about 0.5℃ temporarily. Ash falls out quickly and has limited climatic effect.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�cf99417167f0�body�ْ阳光射进空气中的小水滴，经过折射和反射再射出，方向大约偏转42度，所以彩虹总在背对太阳那一侧的天空。ِSunlight enters raindrops, is refracted and reflected, and leaves at about a 42° angle, so the rainbow always sits in the sky opposite the Sun.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�d0e3c0773bb9�body��N水分子在某个库里的平均停留时间叫驻留时间，各库差别极大。大气约9天，河流约数周，土壤约数月到两年，地下水从数年到上万年，冰盖可达数十万年，海洋里最久约三千年。理解这些时间尺度，才能解释为什么污染物会在地下水或冰川里滞留很久。��The average time a water molecule spends in a reservoir is its residence time, and it varies enormously. In the atmosphere it is about 9 days; in rivers, weeks; in soil, months to a couple of years; in groundwater, years to tens of thousands of years; and in ice sheets, up to hundreds of thousands of years. The ocean holds water for roughly 3,000 years. These time scales explain why pollutants linger so long in groundwater and ice.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�d1e30e770436�body�ي双星测量地球重力场的微小变化，水多水少会改变重力，从而反推出区域地下水、冰川和土壤水的盈亏。ٖTwin satellites track tiny gravity-field changes; more or less water shifts gravity, revealing gains and losses in groundwater, ice and soil moisture.�ans��src���Frappart, Ramillien,《Monitoring Groundwater Storage Changes Using the Gravity Recovery and Climate Experiment (GRACE) Satellite Mission: A Review》,Remote Sensing,2018 (DOI: 10.3390/rs10060829)��Frappart, Ramillien, 'Monitoring Groundwater Storage Changes Using the Gravity Recovery and Climate Experiment (GRACE) Satellite Mission: A Review', Remote Sensing, 2018, DOI: 10.3390/rs10060829��id�d270e55a0d32�body��~河流分多条岔道（汊流）把泥沙送到海里，每条岔道像一根脚趾，泥沙堆积成鸟足状的三角洲。ٙThe river splits into several distributary channels that carry sediment to the sea; each builds a toe of land, together forming a bird-foot-shaped delta.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�d2ada7343697�body���龙卷风通常在强雷暴中、当风随高度剧烈变化产生旋转气流时形成。旋转的空气柱被上升气流拉伸并收窄，转速骤增，从云底伸向地面。它尺度小但破坏力极强。�*Tornadoes usually form in severe thunderstorms when winds change sharply with height and create a rotating column of air. The rotating column is stretched and narrowed by the updraft, spinning faster, and extends from the cloud base to the ground. They are small in scale but extremely destructive.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�d363dcf25a73�body���降雪压实成冰时封存了当时的大气气泡，钻取冰芯后可在洁净实验室中释放气泡并测定其气体成分，从而直接得到过去80万年的大气CO2记录。南极冰芯显示冰期CO2约180 ppm、间冰期约280 ppm。�FAs snow compacts into ice it traps tiny bubbles of the contemporaneous atmosphere; ice cores are drilled and their gases extracted in clean labs to measure composition, giving a direct record of atmospheric CO2 over the past 800,000 years. Antarctic cores show roughly 180 ppm during glacials and 280 ppm during interglacials.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�d5545a1fa59f�body��u寒冷湿润处植物残体分解慢，碳在泥炭层里积累千年，全球泥炭地储存的碳比森林还多。ٌIn cool wet places plant matter decays slowly and carbon builds up in peat for millennia; peatlands hold more carbon than forests worldwide.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�d72f57efc639�body�ٽ土壤侵蚀是表土被水、风等剥蚀搬运的过程。毁林开荒、过度放牧和不合理耕作会破坏植被与结构，使侵蚀速度远超自然形成，导致土地退化。��Soil erosion is the stripping and transport of topsoil by water and wind. Deforestation, overgrazing and poor tillage destroy vegetation and structure, making erosion far exceed natural formation and degrading land.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�d796e76f2802�body���常见类型有盾状火山、成层火山（复式火山）和火山渣锥。盾状火山坡度平缓、熔岩流动性强，如夏威夷火山；成层火山陡峭、爆炸性强，如富士山。��Common types are shield volcanoes, composite (stratovolcanoes), and cinder cones. Shield volcanoes have gentle slopes and fluid lava, like those in Hawaii; composite volcanoes are steep and explosive, like Mount Fuji.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�d7bc78811518�body�ٝ会。地磁极在过去曾多次倒转，最近一次大规模倒转约发生在 78 万年前；倒转并不规律，间隔从几万到几百万年都有。ټYes. The geomagnetic poles have reversed many times; the last major reversal was about 780,000 years ago. Reversals are irregular, spaced from tens of thousands to millions of years apart.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�d82ff934cd5f�body���河流通过下切、侧蚀和搬运泥沙来改造地形，上游多下切形成峡谷，下游则侧蚀和堆积形成曲流与平原。长期的河流作用塑造了大部分陆地表面的形态。��Rivers reshape terrain by downcutting, lateral erosion, and transporting sediment: upstream they cut canyons, downstream they meander and build plains. Over time, river action shapes much of the Earth's land surface.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�d91cb78afdd6�body���三角洲在河流入湖海处因流速骤减堆积而成，多呈尖朝陆的扇形；冲积扇在山口因坡度突然变缓堆积而成，位于山区与平原交界。二者都是堆积地貌但位置和形态不同。��A delta forms where a river meets a lake or sea and suddenly slows, a fan with the point inland; an alluvial fan forms at a mountain mouth where slope drops abruptly, at the mountain-plain boundary. Both are depositional but differ in location and shape.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�d953cef4ea1d�body��{稀土矿常伴生放射性元素和酸性废液，提取需大量酸与水和尾矿，处理不当会长期污染水土。ُRare-earth ores often carry radioactive elements and need much acid, water and tailings; mishandling pollutes soil and water for the long term.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�da0b07841bc4�body�ف地下温度变化很慢、常年接近当地年均温。冬天地面冷、井水显得暖；夏天地面热、井水显得凉。ْUnderground temperature changes slowly and stays near the yearly average, so in cold winters the well feels warm and in hot summers it feels cool.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�da4a1539855e�body���太古宙（约40亿到25亿年前）是最早、生命稀少的时期；元古宙延续到约5.4亿年前，出现藻类和早期多细胞生物；显生宙从寒武纪至今，以丰富可见生命为特征。��The Archean (~4.0–2.5 billion years ago) is the earliest, life-sparse eon; the Proterozoic ran to about 540 million years ago with algae and early multicellular life; the Phanerozoic from the Cambrian to now is marked by abundant visible life.�ans��src��8Wicander & Monroe,《Historical Geology》Cengage 多版�TR. Wicander and J. S. Monroe, Historical Geology, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�da6ad0628827�body�٠冰川搬运磨蚀形成U形谷、冰斗和刃脊，后退时堆积出终碛垄、鼓丘和冰碛平原。这些痕迹是识别古冰川活动的重要证据。ٺGlaciers carve U-shaped valleys, cirques and arêtes by erosion, and deposit terminal moraines, drumlins and till plains as they retreat. Such traces are key evidence of past glaciation.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�dae36f8045fe�body�ه在板块上布设连续观测站，精确记录点位毫米级位移，长期积累就能算出板块每年移动的速度和方向。كPermanent GPS stations record millimeter-level position changes; over years they reveal each plate's speed and direction of motion.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�db9f3695fe7e�body�ه地幔柱是从核幔边界上升的热物质柱，在岩石圈底部加热形成固定的热点，板块漂移时留下一串火山。ٗA mantle plume is a hot upwelling from deep mantle that heats a fixed hotspot at the base of the lithosphere, leaving a volcanic chain as plates drift.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�dbfcdd7140af�body��e不是。震级衡量地震释放的能量，用仪器测得，一次地震只有一个震级；烈度描述地表和建筑受破坏的程度，随距离震中的远近而不同。烈度还受震源深度和当地地质条件影响，同一地震在不同地方烈度差别很大。我国采用十二级烈度表，而震级常用里氏或矩震级表示。��No. Magnitude measures the energy released, is determined from instruments, and a single earthquake has just one magnitude. Intensity describes the shaking and damage at the surface and varies with distance from the epicenter; it also depends on focal depth and local geology, so the same quake can produce very different intensities in different places. China uses a 12-grade intensity scale, while magnitude is commonly given as local (Richter) or moment magnitude.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�dcea95104f7e�body��海洋热膨胀指海水温度升高时体积增大、密度减小的现象。由于海洋吸收了大部分多余的地球热量，热膨胀已成为海平面上升的主要贡献者之一。它使相同质量的水占据更大体积，从而抬高海平面。�KOcean thermal expansion is the increase in seawater volume and decrease in density as its temperature rises. Because the ocean has absorbed most of the excess heat on Earth, thermal expansion has become one of the main contributors to sea level rise. It lets the same mass of water occupy a larger volume and thus raises sea level.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�ddc0ae99c680�body���蓝碳指红树林、盐沼和海草床等沿海生态系统捕获并长期埋藏的碳，单位面积固碳速率常高于陆地森林。它们通过植物光合固定的有机碳在沉积物中可保存千年，对减缓气候变化有独特价值。�LBlue carbon is the carbon captured and buried long-term by coastal ecosystems such as mangroves, salt marshes, and seagrass meadows, whose per-area sequestration rates often exceed those of terrestrial forests. Photosynthetically fixed organic carbon can persist in sediments for millennia, offering unique climate mitigation value.�ans��src�ًAlongi,《Current status and emerging perspectives of coastal blue carbon ecosystems》, Carbon Footprints, 2023 (DOI: 10.20517/cf.2023.04)هAlongi, 'Current status and emerging perspectives of coastal blue carbon ecosystems', Carbon Footprints, 2023, DOI: 10.20517/cf.2023.04��id�de321bde99db�body���岩浆冷却成火成岩；火成岩或变质岩经风化、搬运、沉积，被压实胶结成沉积岩；任何岩石被埋入高温高压环境都会重结晶成变质岩；变质岩或沉积岩在深部熔化又能变回岩浆。这条循环线路靠板块运动提供能量，但并不是单向流水线——每类岩石都可以在多个环节跳转，循环时间从千年到数亿年不等。��Magma cools into igneous rock; igneous or metamorphic rock is weathered, transported, and buried to become sedimentary rock through compaction and cementation; any rock reheated and squeezed deep underground recrystallizes into metamorphic rock; and rocks can melt back into magma. Plate tectonics supplies the energy for the loop, but it is no one-way assembly line—each rock type can jump between several stages, and a full cycle takes anywhere from thousands to hundreds of millions of years.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�de3fb7e0e989�body�ي有。山能挡住寒冷的北风，水提供饮用和灌溉，缓坡不易被淹又好排水，所以背山面水是宜居的好选址。ْYes. Hills block cold north winds, water supplies drinking and irrigation, and gentle slopes drain well and avoid floods—a sensible site choice.�ans��src��=普雷斯、西弗尔《理解地球》，W.H. Freeman，2001�?Press, F. & Siever, R., Understanding Earth, W.H. Freeman, 2001��id�e1a5690f90b3�body���煤来自数亿年前沼泽中堆积的植物残体，被泥沙掩埋后在高压高温下经泥炭、褐煤、烟煤到无烟煤逐步碳化。石油和天然气主要来自海洋浮游生物，它们死亡沉入海底，在缺氧的沉积物里被埋藏、加热，有机质成熟生成烃类，再运移到孔隙岩层中聚集。因为它们都是古代生物遗体转化而来，所以叫化石燃料，形成需要数百万年而消耗极快。� Coal comes from plant remains piled in swamps hundreds of millions of years ago; buried and squeezed, they pass through peat, lignite, bituminous, and anthracite stages as carbon concentrates. Oil and natural gas come mainly from marine plankton that sank to the seafloor, were buried in oxygen-poor sediment, and were cooked so their organic matter matured into hydrocarbons that migrated into porous reservoir rock. Because all derive from ancient life, they are called fossil fuels—forming over millions of years but consumed in centuries.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�e1e60c35d0a0�body�ٓ有。不同温度、盐度的水团密度不同，会在深海形成流动清晰的“密度流”，像海底的河一样搬运水体和营养。ٚYes. Water masses of different temperature and salinity form distinct density currents in the deep sea, like underwater rivers moving water and nutrients.�ans��src��)加里森《海洋学》，Cengage，2015�JGarrison, T., Oceanography: An Invitation to Marine Science, Cengage, 2015��id�e2d7568b05c1�body��x这里河网密布、湖泊众多，水田连片、热量雨水充足，既产稻米又盛鱼虾，物产格外丰富。�`Dense rivers and lakes, vast paddies and ample heat and rain make it rich in both rice and fish.�ans��src��B中国科学院南京地理与湖泊研究所《长江三角洲》�bChinese Academy of Sciences, Nanjing Institute of Geography and Limnology, The Yangtze River Delta��id�e30f565ca599�body��G滑坡是土石沿斜坡快速下滑，触发条件常是雨水渗入增加孔隙水压、地震震动或人类开挖坡脚。陡坡、松散土石和缺少植被的坡面更脆弱，连续强降雨是最常见的诱因。滑坡速度可以快得惊人，能埋没道路、村镇并阻断河流，山区雨后应特别警惕。��A landslide is rock and soil rapidly sliding down a slope; common triggers are rainwater seeping in and raising pore pressure, earthquake shaking, or humans undercutting the toe of the slope. Steep slopes, loose debris, and sparse vegetation are more vulnerable, and prolonged heavy rain is the most frequent cause. Slides can be astonishingly fast, burying roads and villages and damming rivers, so hillsides warrant caution after storms.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�e4268ac40837�body���这体现了矿物内部晶体结构对破裂方式的控制。解理是矿物沿原子结合力最弱的方向裂开的性质，具有方向性；断口是矿物受外力后产生的不规则破裂面，没有方向性。�It illustrates how internal crystal structure controls breakage. Cleavage is the tendency to split along planes of weakest atomic bonding and is directional; fracture is the irregular breakage surface produced by external force and has no preferred direction.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�e4baadccba6e�body���约96%的海洋物种和约70%的陆地脊椎动物物种消失。主流解释是西伯利亚暗色岩大火成岩省的喷发，释放巨量CO₂和SO₂，引发温室增温、海洋缺氧与海洋酸化，最终导致生态系统崩溃。�-Roughly 96% of marine species and about 70% of terrestrial vertebrate species went extinct. The leading explanation is the eruption of the Siberian Traps large igneous province, which released vast CO₂ and SO₂, causing greenhouse warming, ocean anoxia, and acidification that collapsed ecosystems.�ans��src��(Science（二叠纪末大灭绝研究）�)Science (end-Permian extinction research)��id�e5f830dbeba3�body�ٓ从东向西跨过这条线要把日期加一天，从西向东则减一天。坐飞机跨越时，可能“跳过”或“过两次”某一天。كCrossing it westward adds a day, eastward subtracts one. A flight across it can make you “skip” a date or experience one twice.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�e7471ba14088�body��,岩石中的磁性矿物在冷却时记录下当时磁场方向，显示地球磁场在数百万年尺度上多次发生南北极倒转，两次倒转间隔从数万到数百万年不等。最近一次倒转（布容-松山倒转）约发生在78万年前，倒转期间磁场减弱但不会消失。�cMagnetic minerals in cooling rocks lock in the field direction of their time, showing that Earth's magnetic poles have flipped many times over millions of years, with reversals separated by tens of thousands to millions of years. The most recent (Brunhes-Matuyama) occurred about 780,000 years ago; during a reversal the field weakens but does not vanish.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�e7be36e894e8�body�ِ海水在寒冷地区被冷却，又因蒸发和结冰失去淡水使盐度升高，温度低、盐度高让海水更重，于是沉入深海。٣In cold regions the water cools and loses fresh water through evaporation and ice formation, raising its salinity; colder and saltier water is denser, so it sinks.�ans��src��UL. D. Talley et al., Descriptive Physical Oceanography, 6th ed., Academic Press, 2011�UL. D. Talley et al., Descriptive Physical Oceanography, 6th ed., Academic Press, 2011��id�ea6e89a09767�body��西风带位于中纬度，盛行自西向东的风，由副热带高压吹向副极地低压并经地转偏向力偏转形成。它带来频繁的冷暖空气交绥和移动性天气系统。南半球海洋广阔，西风带尤其强劲，被称为咆哮西风带。�jThe westerly belt lies in the mid-latitudes and is dominated by winds from west to east, formed as air moves from the subtropical high toward the subpolar low and is deflected by the Coriolis force. It brings frequent clashes of warm and cold air and moving weather systems. Over the open southern ocean the westerlies are especially strong, the roaring forties.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�ea83f1ef9492�body��3地球平均密度（约5.5 g/cm³）远高于地壳岩石，说明内部存在致密物质（铁质内核）；全球磁场的存在要求有导电的外核；铁陨石的成分与地核的铁镍组成一致；此外，地球的自由振荡（长周期振动）等观测也为内部结构提供了约束。�KEarth's mean density (about 5.5 g/cm³) far exceeds crustal rocks, requiring dense interior material (an iron-rich core); the global magnetic field requires a conducting outer core; iron meteorites match the core's iron–nickel composition; and observations such as Earth's free oscillations also constrain the internal structure.�ans��src�� 《普通地质学》(舒良树)�General Geology (Shu Liangshu)��id�eaa3cc6cdc17�body��{黄土像厚厚的棉被，传热很慢，地下窑洞温度一年四季变化很小，所以冬天不冷、夏天不热。�zLoess is a poor conductor of heat, so cave homes stay at a steady temperature year-round—cool in summer, warm in winter.�ans��src��=刘东生《黄土与环境》，中国海洋出版社，1985�ALiu Tungsheng, Loess and the Environment, China Ocean Press, 1985��id�earth_19_005�body��HSAR主动发射微波并接收回波,微波既能穿透云层又不依赖太阳光照,白天黑夜均可成像。干涉处理将两次过境的相位逐像素比对,把相位差换算为视线向位移,精度可达厘米乃至毫米级;这一原理使InSAR成为监测断层蠕滑、火山隆起和城市沉降的主力工具。��A SAR actively transmits microwaves and records the returns; the signal penetrates cloud and needs no sunlight, so imaging continues day and night. Interferometry compares the phase of repeat passes pixel by pixel, converting phase differences into line-of-sight displacements accurate to centimeters or even millimeters, which has made InSAR a workhorse for monitoring fault creep, volcanic inflation, and urban subsidence.�ans��src��Massonnet 与 Feigl 1998 年发表于 Reviews of Geophysics 的综述:雷达干涉测量及其在地表变化探测中的应用لMassonnet, D. & Feigl, K.L., Reviews of Geophysics, 1998: Radar interferometry and its application to changes in the Earth's surface��id�earth_19_008�body��z松散沉积层剪切波速低、卓越周期长,会把基岩传来的震动选择性放大;当放大的频段与高层建筑的自振周期吻合时,共振使楼层晃动幅度剧增。1985年墨西哥城地震震中距市区约三百五十公里,湖相软土的长周期放大却令市中心高楼大面积倒塌,此后各国普遍要求按场地类别调整设计反应谱。��Loose sediments have low shear-wave velocities and long characteristic periods, selectively amplifying incoming motions; when the amplified band matches a building's natural period, resonance sharply multiplies floor accelerations. The 1985 Mexico City event struck from roughly 350 km away, yet long-period amplification in the old lakebed toppled mid-rise towers downtown — prompting codes worldwide to tune design spectra to site class.�ans��src��dEERI 调查报告:1985年9月19日墨西哥米却肯州地震考察(刊于 Earthquake Spectra, 1986)ٖEarthquake Engineering Research Institute, The Michoacán, Mexico Earthquake of September 19, 1985 — Reconnaissance Report, Earthquake Spectra, 1986��id�earth_19_018�body��l岩浆黏度随二氧化硅含量升高而增大:玄武岩浆稀薄炽热,气泡得以顺利逃逸,气体平和释放,熔岩便以流动方式铺开。富硅岩浆黏稠难散,挥发分被封闭在通道内不断聚集,直到压力撕碎岩浆,气体骤然膨胀驱动碎屑高速喷出。可见黏度与挥发分含量共同决定了喷发是溢流还是爆炸。�tMagma viscosity climbs with silica content: runny, hot basalt lets bubbles escape so gas vents gently and lava spreads as flows. Sticky silica-rich magma holds volatiles trapped until pressure shatters it apart and expanding gas blasts the fragments skyward at high speed. Viscosity acting together with volatile content thus decides whether an eruption pours or explodes.�ans��src��vSparks 1978 年发表于《Journal of Volcanology and Geothermal Research》的岩浆气泡成核生长动力学论文ٓR. S. J. Sparks, The dynamics of bubble formation and growth in magmas: a review and analysis, Journal of Volcanology and Geothermal Research, 1978��id�earth_19_020�body��z数千米的冰盖曾把岩石圈压弯,并将地幔物质挤向四周;冰雪消融后地幔开始黏弹性回弹,恢复过程延续至今。陆地抬升快于海面之处,验潮站记录到的海平面下降其实是岸线上升的假象。而在原冰盖外围的前缘隆起带,回流的地幔物质导致地面下沉,当地相对海平面反而升得比全球平均更快。��Ice sheets kilometers thick bowed the lithosphere downward and squeezed mantle material sideways; once the ice vanished, the mantle began a viscous rebound that continues today. Wherever land climbs faster than the sea surface, tide gauges log an apparent sea-level fall that is really rising shoreline. Beyond the former ice margin, on the forebulge, returning mantle drives the ground down, so relative sea level there outpaces the global average.�ans��src��vPeltier 2004 年发表于《Annual Review of Earth and Planetary Sciences》的冰期地球均衡与ICE-5G模型研究٢W. R. Peltier, Global glacial isostasy and the surface of the ice-age Earth: the ICE-5G (VM2) model and GRACE, Annual Review of Earth and Planetary Sciences, 2004��id�earth_20_002�body��y温盐环流如同一条横贯大洋的传送带,把低纬海区的热量经湾流及其延伸源源不断地输往北大西洋高纬海域。环流一旦减弱,向北的热量输送随之减少,西欧冬季气温可能显著偏低,海冰也会向南扩张。新仙女木期等古气候事件表明,这类环流的骤然变化可在几十年尺度上重塑区域气候格局。��The thermohaline circulation works like a conveyor belt spanning the oceans, steadily carrying low-latitude heat northward into the high-latitude North Atlantic through the Gulf Stream and its extension. A marked weakening would cut this poleward heat transport, likely making Western European winters substantially colder and allowing sea ice to expand southward. Palaeoclimate episodes such as the Younger Dryas show that abrupt shifts of this overturning can reshape regional climate within decades.�ans��src��bRahmstorf S., Ocean circulation and climate during the past 120,000 years, Nature, 2002, 419(6903)�nRahmstorf, S. (2002). Ocean circulation and climate during the past 120,000 years. Nature, 419(6903), 207-214.��id�earth_20_005�body��`强烈的地面运动使坡体内裂隙扩展、岩土体松动,斜坡整体强度大幅下降。震后降雨极易沿这些损伤面入渗,触发新的崩塌滑坡,堆积在沟谷中的松散物质又为泥石流提供了充足物源。对汶川震区十余年的监测显示,区域滑坡活动水平大约需要十年才逐步回落到震前状态。��Strong shaking opens cracks and loosens rock and soil within slopes, sharply lowering the overall strength of hillsides. Rainfall after the quake infiltrates easily along these damaged surfaces and triggers fresh slides, while debris shed into gullies feeds years of post-seismic debris flows. More than a decade of monitoring in the Wenchuan earthquake zone shows that regional landslide activity took roughly ten years to decay back toward pre-earthquake levels.�ans��src�هFan Xian(樊茜)等,《地震诱发地质灾害链:模式、机制与影响》,Reviews of Geophysics,2019年,第57卷第2期,421-503页ُFan, X. et al. (2019). Earthquake-induced chains of geologic hazards: patterns, mechanisms, and impacts. Reviews of Geophysics, 57(2), 421-503.��id�earth_20_008�body��z高云中的六棱柱状冰晶在随机翻滚取向下,阳光经晶体相邻两个侧面发生折射,透射光集中在最小偏向角约22°处最亮,形成内缘锐利的光环。由于折射色散,晕的内侧偏红、外侧渐变为蓝紫色。卷云往往是一整套锋面雨带最先抵达的高云,因此民间日晕主雨的经验说法具备一定的天气学依据。�Hexagonal prism ice crystals tumbling randomly in high cloud refract sunlight through two adjacent side faces, and the transmitted light peaks near the minimum deviation angle of about 22 degrees, drawing a bright ring with a sharp inner edge. Because refraction disperses wavelengths, the halo's inner rim appears reddish and shades outward through blue and violet. Cirrostratus sheets usually arrive ahead of an approaching frontal system, which gives folk sayings linking halos to imminent rain a real meteorological footing.�ans��src��TLes Cowley大气光学网站(atoptics.co.uk);世界气象组织《国际云图集》�TLes Cowley's Atmospheric Optics site (atoptics.co.uk); WMO International Cloud Atlas��id�earth_20_012�body��N风沙流把沙粒沿迎风坡向上搬,坡角稳定在约10-15度;越过脊线后沙粒重力崩落,形成接近34度休止角的陡峭落沙坡。沙丘整体顺主导风向前进,移动速率大致与丘高成反比,故小沙丘迁移快、大沙丘迁移慢。植被固沙或水分增加时,流动沙丘可转为半固定状态。��Saltation carries grains up the windward face, which settles near 10-15 degrees; beyond the crest they avalanche under gravity, building a steep brink face close to the 34-degree angle of repose. The whole dune advances downwind at a rate roughly inversely proportional to its height, so small barchans migrate faster than large ones. When vegetation anchors the sand or moisture rises, a mobile dune turns semi-fixed.�ans��src��}吴正《风沙地貌学》,科学出版社,1987 ; 另见: Bagnold, The Physics of Blown Sand and Desert Dunes, Methuen, 1941�Bagnold, The Physics of Blown Sand and Desert Dunes, Methuen, 1941 ; see also: 吴正《风沙地貌学》,科学出版社,1987��id�earth_20_015�body��r高温地热系统需要浅成岩浆房或年轻火成岩体作热源,因而集中出现在洋脊、俯冲带与大陆裂谷等板块边界。常规水热系统还依赖渗透热储、盖层与大气降水补给,热水沿断裂带对流循环。干热岩则通过人工压裂在深部低渗高温岩体中造储,注入冷水取热,不依赖天然热储与天然流体。�"High-temperature systems need a shallow magma chamber or young igneous rock mass as their heat source, so they cluster at mid-ocean ridges, subduction zones, and continental rifts. Conventional hydrothermal systems additionally depend on a permeable reservoir, a caprock, and meteoric recharge, with hot water convecting along fault zones. Hot dry rock systems instead create a reservoir by hydraulic stimulation in deep, low-permeability hot rock and extract heat with injected cold water, needing neither a natural reservoir nor natural fluids.�ans��src�ٯ佟伟、章铭陶等《西藏地热》,科学出版社,1981 ; 另见: Barbier, Geothermal energy technology and current status, Renewable and Sustainable Energy Reviews, 2002ٱBarbier, Geothermal energy technology and current status, Renewable and Sustainable Energy Reviews, 2002 ; see also: 佟伟、章铭陶等《西藏地热》,科学出版社,1981��id�earth_20_018�body���湾流连同其延伸的北大西洋暖流向高纬输送了大量热量,但定量研究表明这只是部分原因。更关键的因子是常年盛行的偏西风,它们把海洋释放的热量与水汽源源送上欧洲大陆;北美一侧则因落基山地形使冷空气更容易倾泻到东岸。所以欧洲冬季温和是洋流、大气环流与地形共同作用的结果,而非湾流单独所为。�The Gulf Stream together with its North Atlantic extension carries a great deal of heat poleward, but quantitative studies show this accounts for only part of the difference. The decisive factor is the prevailing westerly winds, which deliver the heat and moisture released by the ocean onto the European continent, while on the American side the Rocky Mountains help cold air spill readily onto the eastern seaboard. Europe's mild winter thus reflects ocean currents, atmospheric circulation, and topography acting together.�ans��src�يR. Seager 等,《墨西哥湾流要对欧洲的暖冬负责吗?》,Bulletin of the American Meteorological Society,第83卷第1期,2002年ٖRichard Seager et al., Is the Gulf Stream Responsible for Europe's Mild Winters?, Bulletin of the American Meteorological Society, Vol. 83 No. 1, 2002��id�earth_20_020�body��Z在沙源有限、主风向单一的环境里,沙丘形成平缓的迎风坡和保持约34°休止角的背风滑落面。跃移的沙粒被风从迎风坡搬越丘顶,堆落在滑落面上,整座沙丘因此顺风整体前移。两翼沙量少,输沙更快完成,便逐渐拉长为指向下风向的两只尖角,勾出完整的新月形轮廓。��Where sand supply is scarce and one wind direction dominates, a dune builds a gentle windward slope and a lee avalanche face standing at the angle of repose of about 34°. Saltating grains are carried over the crest from the windward flank and settle on the slip face, so the whole dune advances downwind. The flanks hold little sand, so transport clears them faster and they stretch into two horns pointing downwind, tracing out the full crescent shape.�ans��src��qR. A. Bagnold,《风吹沙与沙漠沙丘物理学》(The Physics of Blown Sand and Desert Dunes),Methuen,1941年�KRalph A. Bagnold, The Physics of Blown Sand and Desert Dunes, Methuen, 1941��id�earth_21_005�body���俯冲板片脱水产生的流体交代地幔楔,将铜、钼带入浅位酸性岩浆房;岩浆出溶的含盐流体随后在斑岩体顶部裂隙网中沉淀金属,故矿床沿大陆边缘弧成带展布。SEDEX矿床则源于裂谷伸展:同生断裂把富金属热卤水排入海底卤水池,硫化物与盆地沉积物同层沉淀,因而局限于被动边缘或弧后盆地的层序之中。�Fluids liberated by the dehydrating slab metasomatize the mantle wedge, ferrying copper and molybdenum into shallow felsic chambers; saline magmatic fluids exsolved there then precipitate metals in fracture stockworks atop the porphyry intrusions, aligning deposits as belts along convergent margins. SEDEX ores instead reflect extension: growth faults vent metalliferous brines into seafloor brine pools where sulfides settle syntemporaneously with basin fill, confining them to passive-margin or back-arc sequences.�ans��src��KRobb, L., Introduction to Ore-Forming Processes, Blackwell Publishing, 2005�XLaurence Robb, Introduction to Ore-Forming Processes, Blackwell Publishing, Oxford, 2005��id�earth_21_008�body���关键在于河流输沙与波浪、潮汐三种动力的强弱对比。河流作用占优时,泥沙沿分流河口持续向海推进,形成密西西比河式的鸟足状外形;波浪能量强则把河口泥沙沿岸重新分配,堆出平滑的弧形轮廓;潮差大的区域,往复潮流冲刷出多条喇叭状汊道。这套三端元框架由Galloway于1975年提出,至今仍是三角洲分类的基础。��The controlling factor is the balance between river-borne sediment supply and marine wave versus tidal energy. Where river processes dominate, sediment keeps prograding seaward from distributary mouths into a Mississippi-style bird foot; strong waves rework the mouth deposits alongshore into smooth arcuate outlines; large tidal ranges scour several funnel-shaped channels instead. This three-end-member framework was proposed by Galloway in 1975 and still anchors delta classification.�ans��src���Galloway W. E.,《Process framework for describing the morphologic and stratigraphic evolution of deltaic depositional systems》,载于 Deltas: Models for Exploration,休斯顿地质学会,1975年��Galloway W. E., Process framework for describing the morphologic and stratigraphic evolution of deltaic depositional systems, in Deltas: Models for Exploration, Houston Geological Society, 1975��id�earth_21_015�body���重现期来自洪峰流量序列的频率分析:百年一遇洪水指任一年份超越概率为1%,并不是说恰好每隔一百年发生一次。该指标默认水文序列平稳,但城市化、水库调蓄与气候变化都在持续改变洪水的统计分布。因此现代流域管理通常把重现期与实时雨洪预报、淹没模拟以及韧性工程措施结合起来,而非将其单独当作设计标准。�7Derived from frequency analysis of peak-discharge records, a 100-year return period denotes a 1 percent chance of being exceeded in any given year, not an event recurring exactly once per century. The metric presumes hydrologic stationarity, yet urbanization, reservoir operation, and climate change keep shifting the statistical distribution of floods. Contemporary basin management therefore combines return periods with real-time rain-flood forecasting, inundation modeling, and resilience-oriented engineering instead of relying on them alone as design standards.�ans��src�ِMuir-Wood等,《洪水风险与气候变化:全球与区域视角》,Hydrological Sciences Journal第59卷,2014,DOI:10.1080/02626667.2013.857411٤Muir-Wood et al., 'Flood risk and climate change: global and regional perspectives', Hydrological Sciences Journal, vol. 59, 2014, DOI: 10.1080/02626667.2013.857411��id�earth_21_020�body���锆石晶格容纳铀却几乎排斥铅,初始铅可近似为零,且 238U→206Pb 与 235U→207Pb 两套衰变链可相互校验,谐和图解因此能识别并剔除后期铅丢失的样品。K-Ar 法依赖含钾矿物中氩的积累,氩封闭温度较低,火山岩的快速冷却恰好封存了喷发时刻的同位素信息。于是前者适合古老地体与碎屑锆石源区研究,后者常用于年轻火山事件的定年。�AZircon accepts uranium into its lattice but rejects lead almost completely, so initial lead can be treated as zero; the two decay chains 238U-to-206Pb and 235U-to-207Pb also cross-check each other, letting concordia diagrams flag samples that suffered later lead loss. K-Ar dating instead relies on argon accumulated in potassium-bearing minerals; with a low closure temperature, rapid cooling of volcanic rock seals in the isotopic signature of eruption time. U-Pb therefore suits ancient terranes and detrital provenance work, while K-Ar commonly dates young volcanic events.�ans��src��[G. Faure 与 T. M. Mensing 合著《Isotopes: Principles and Applications》第三版,Wiley�QG. Faure and T. M. Mensing, Isotopes: Principles and Applications, 3rd ed., Wiley��id�earth_22_002�body���解理是晶体沿结合力最弱的原子面劈开的习性。石盐为离子键矿物，钠、氯离子堆成的立方格子在三组相互垂直的方向上键强一致，故发育完全立方体解理；石英是硅氧四面体连成的架状硅酸盐，各方向都被牢固的Si–O键锁定，没有薄弱面，受力时只能形成贝壳状不规则断口。解理方位因此直接反映晶体内部结构。��Cleavage is a crystal’s tendency to split along atomic planes where bonding is weakest. Halite is an ionic mineral: Na⁺ and Cl⁻ ions pack into a cubic lattice with identical bond strengths along three mutually perpendicular directions, giving perfect cubic cleavage. Quartz is a framework silicate locked by strong Si–O bonds in every direction, leaving no weak plane, so it fails irregularly with conchoidal curved fractures. Cleavage orientation thus mirrors the internal crystal structure.�ans��src��tAnthony, J.W. 等，《矿物手册》（Handbook of Mineralogy），美国矿物学会，1995–2003年分卷出版�mAnthony, J.W. et al., Handbook of Mineralogy, multi-volume set, Mineralogical Society of America, 1995–2003��id�earth_22_005�body���海啸波长可达数百公里，远大于海水深度，属于浅水长波，传播速度只取决于水深：c=√(gh)，在4000米深的大洋上约每小时700公里。逼近海岸后水深变浅，波速随之下降，但波动能量守恒使波长被压缩、振幅被放大，形成高达数米以上的破坏性波浪。根据海深图可预先算出走时，这正是太平洋海啸预警中心发布抵达时刻警报的依据。�;A tsunami’s wavelength — hundreds of kilometers — far exceeds the ocean depth, so it travels as a shallow-water long wave whose speed depends only on depth: c = √(gh), about 700 km/h over a 4000-meter-deep ocean. Approaching the coast, the shallowing seabed slows the wave, while conservation of energy compresses its wavelength and amplifies its height into destructive waves several meters tall. Because bathymetric charts allow travel times to be computed precisely, warning centers such as the Pacific Tsunami Warning Center issue advance arrival-time alerts.�ans��src��RLevin, B.W. 与 Nosov, M.A.《海啸物理学》（第2版），Springer，2016年�GLevin, B.W. & Nosov, M.A., Physics of Tsunamis, 2nd ed., Springer, 2016��id�earth_22_008�body���终年高温多雨使化学风化与淋溶极为强烈：可溶性盐基和大部分硅被雨水带走，难溶的铁铝氧化物（如赤铁矿、三水铝石）残留富集，将土壤染成红色，这一过程称为铁铝化。养分绝大部分储存在活生物量与地表枯落物中，矿质土体本身十分瘠薄；植被一经清除，浅表快速养分循环中断，裸露的红壤缺乏养分且易板结侵蚀，肥力随即迅速衰竭。��Perpetual heat and heavy rain drive extreme chemical weathering and leaching: soluble bases and most silica wash away, while insoluble iron and aluminum oxides such as hematite and gibbsite stay behind and stain the soil red—a process called ferrallitization. Almost all nutrients sit in living biomass and surface litter, not in the mineral soil. Clearing the forest breaks this fast, shallow nutrient cycle, exposing a leached soil that hardens and erodes, so fertility collapses quickly.�ans��src��~S.W. Buol、R.J. Southard、R.C. Graham、P.A. McDaniel，《土壤发生与分类》（第6版），Wiley-Blackwell，2011年�vS.W. Buol, R.J. Southard, R.C. Graham & P.A. McDaniel, Soil Genesis and Classification, 6th ed., Wiley-Blackwell, 2011��id�earth_22_015�body���富含有机质的细粒沉积物深埋后，其中干酪根在约60–120℃的生油窗内热裂解生成石油与天然气；压实作用和烃类自身的浮力将其排出烃源岩，沿多孔渗透的储层或输导层向上倾方向运移，遇连续致密封盖层受阻后，在背斜、断层遮挡或地层尖灭等圈闭中聚集成藏。烃源岩、储层、盖层、圈闭与适时的运移配置，共同构成完整的含油气系统。�Once organic-rich fine sediments are buried deeply enough, their kerogen cracks thermally into oil and gas inside the roughly 60–120 °C oil window. Compaction and the buoyancy of the hydrocarbons themselves expel them from the source rock, and they migrate updip along porous, permeable carrier beds until a continuous tight seal stops them, letting them pool in anticlinal, fault-blocked, or stratigraphic pinch-out traps. Source rock, reservoir, seal, trap, and well-timed migration together constitute a complete petroleum system.�ans��src��zMagoon 与 Dow 主编,《The Petroleum System—From Source to Trap》,AAPG Memoir 60（AAPG）,1994 (DOI: 10.1306/m60585)�sMagoon & Dow (eds.), 'The Petroleum System—From Source to Trap', AAPG Memoir 60 (AAPG), 1994, DOI: 10.1306/m60585��id�earth_23_002�body���大型低剪切波速省是核幔边界之上两个近乎对跖的巨型低速区，厚可达千余公里、绵延数千公里。剪切波明显减慢而压缩波变化较小，说明除高温外还存在成分异常，可能与富铁的布里奇曼石有关。它们被视为长期稳定的热化学堆，锚定深部地幔柱的根部；统计显示许多热点火山的投影恰落在其边缘陡峭的速度梯度带上。��Large low-shear-velocity provinces are two nearly antipodal giant slow zones atop the core-mantle boundary, up to about 1,000 km thick and thousands of kilometres across. Shear waves slow far more than compressional waves, implying compositional anomalies beyond heat alone, possibly iron-rich bridgmanite. They behave as long-lived thermochemical piles that anchor deep-plume roots, and statistics place the projections of many hotspot volcanoes on their steep marginal velocity gradients.�ans��src�يGarnero, E. J. 与 McNamara, A. K.：《地球下地幔的结构与动力学》，《科学》（Science），2008年，320卷626–628页�zGarnero, E. J. and McNamara, A. K., 'Structure and dynamics of Earth's lower mantle', Science, 2008, vol. 320, pp. 626-628��id�earth_23_005�body���夜光云悬浮在约83公里高空：日落后地面虽已没入地球阴影，该高度仍照得到掠过地平线的斜阳，微小冰晶对阳光的散射效率极高，故在暗黑天幕上泛出醒目的银蓝色。另一方面，甲烷排放增加经氧化转化为更多中间层水汽，叠加高层大气变冷，使冰云更易生成；观测显示数十年来夜光云出现得更频繁也更亮。�Noctilucent clouds float near 83 km altitude: after sunset the ground lies in Earth's shadow, yet that height still catches slanted sunlight skimming past the horizon, and the tiny ice crystals scatter it extremely efficiently, so the clouds glow striking silver-blue against the dark sky. Meanwhile, rising methane emissions oxidize into extra mesopause water vapour while the upper atmosphere cools, easing ice-cloud formation; observations show noctilucent clouds have become both more frequent and brighter over recent decades.�ans��src�لThomas, G. E. 等：《甲烷增长与中间层顶冰云出现的关系》，《自然》（Nature），1989年，338卷490–492页ّThomas, G. E., et al., 'Relation between increasing methane and the presence of ice clouds at the mesopause', Nature, 1989, vol. 338, pp. 490-492��id�earth_23_008�body���在地表持续抬升的地区，河流必须向下切割才能保持通向基准面的通道，河床坡度随岩石抬升速率调整，纵剖面呈上凸形，其陡度指数与抬升速率正相关。断层错动会让河床出现陡坎，即裂点；随后裂点如同一道侵蚀波向上游迁移，在下游遗留下低坡度的阶地。测定裂点与阶地的高度和位置，便可推算断层活动的时间与垂直断距。��Where the land rises steadily, a river must cut down to keep its route to base level, so the bed gradient adjusts to the rock-uplift rate and the profile turns convex, its steepness index tracking uplift. Fault movement oversteepens the bed into a knickpoint, which then sweeps upstream like a wave of erosion, stranding gentle terraces downstream. Measuring the heights and positions of knickpoints and terraces lets us date fault movements and estimate their vertical throw.�ans��src�قA.C. Whittaker，《景观如何记录构造与气候？》，Nature Geoscience 5卷，2012年，488-498页，DOI:10.1038/ngeo1486�|A.C. Whittaker, "How do landscapes record tectonics and climate?", Nature Geoscience 5, 488-498 (2012), DOI:10.1038/ngeo1486��id�earth_23_012�body���冷海水沿洋壳裂隙下渗并被加热，与玄武岩反应：镁几乎全部转入蚀变矿物而从流体中消失，钙、钾、铁、锰和硫化氢等则从岩石中淋出进入流体，端元热液因此高温、酸性强且具还原性。这些流体返回海洋时沉淀出金属硫化物烟囱。在全球尺度上，这一循环持续调节着海洋的镁、钙及多种微量金属收支。��Cold seawater percolates down cracks in the young crust and heats up, reacting with basalt: nearly all its magnesium is locked into alteration minerals and lost from the fluid, while calcium, potassium, iron, manganese and hydrogen sulfide are leached from the rock. End-member fluids therefore emerge hot, acidic and reducing, and they precipitate metal-sulfide chimneys on meeting seawater. Globally, this circulation continuously reshapes the ocean's budgets of magnesium, calcium and many trace metals.�ans��src��EElderfield与Schultz，《自然》第380卷第121–124页，1996年�:Elderfield, H. & Schultz, A., Nature 380, 121–124 (1996)��id�earth_23_015�body���二氧化碳在冷水中的溶解度明显高于暖水。赤道海域水温高，且信风驱动下层富碳海水上翻，使表层二氧化碳分压高于大气，故净释放；亚极地冷水溶解能力强，春季浮游植物光合作用又快速消耗碳酸盐体系中的碳，表层分压随之降到大气之下，转为净吸收。这种冷暖格局叠加生物泵，奠定了全球海气碳通量分布的基础。�Carbon dioxide dissolves much more readily in cold water than in warm. In the equatorial Pacific, warm surface waters plus trade-wind-driven upwelling of carbon-rich deeper water push surface pCO2 above atmospheric levels, so the ocean outgasses net. In cold subpolar seas strong solubility and springtime phytoplankton photosynthesis draw surface pCO2 below that of the air, making the region a sink. This warm-source, cold-sink pattern, modulated by the biological pump, anchors today's maps of global air-sea carbon flux.�ans��src��hTakahashi等，《深海研究II辑》第56卷第554–577页，2009年，doi:10.1016/j.dsr2.2008.12.009�_Takahashi, T. et al., Deep-Sea Research II 56, 554–577 (2009), doi:10.1016/j.dsr2.2008.12.009��id�earth_23_020�body���巨型管虫没有口和消化道，体内却栖居着大量化能合成细菌：热液流体中的硫化氢经管虫的特化器官吸收，随血液输送给共生硫氧化菌；细菌氧化硫化氢获得能量，将二氧化碳固定为有机物，并把一部分供给宿主。这种化能共生支撑起热液区不依赖阳光的高生产力群落，推翻了深海生命只能仰赖上层海洋沉降食物的观念。�Giant tube worms lack mouths and guts, yet their bodies house masses of chemosynthetic bacteria: hydrogen sulfide from vent fluid is taken up by specialized tissue and shipped through blood to sulfur-oxidizing symbionts; the bacteria oxidize sulfide for energy and fix carbon dioxide into organic matter, sharing part with the host. This chemosymbiosis sustains the highly productive, sun-independent communities of vent fields, overturning the notion that deep-sea life subsists solely on organic fallout from upper waters.�ans��src�٧Cavanaugh 等《热液管虫Riftia pachyptila体内的原核细胞：可能的化能自养共生者》Science 213(4506):340-342, 1981, DOI:10.1126/science.213.4506.340��Cavanaugh et al., "Prokaryotic Cells in the Hydrothermal Vent Tube Worm Riftia pachyptila Jones: Possible Chemoautotrophic Symbionts", Science 213(4506):340-342, 1981, DOI:10.1126/science.213.4506.340��id�earth_24_015�body��p富营养化是一部三幕剧。第一幕:农田化肥与生活污水带来过量氮磷,蓝藻等浮游植物获得无限自助餐,水面铺成绿漆。第二幕:大量藻类死亡下沉,底层微生物分解它们时消耗溶解氧,而斜温层阻止氧气补充,湖底沦为无氧区。第三幕:鱼类与底栖动物窒息逃离或死亡;更阴险的是某些蓝藻释放微囊藻毒素,直接威胁饮用水安全。治理的核心是切断营养盐源头而非杀死藻类本身——控源截污后,沉水植物重建与食物链修复需要数年到数十年,太湖与伊利湖的经验都证明这是场持久战。�;Eutrophication runs in three acts. First: fertilizer and sewage deliver excess nitrogen and phosphorus; cyanobacteria feast and paint the surface green. Second: massive algal die-offs sink, microbes decomposing them strip dissolved oxygen while the thermocline blocks resupply — bottom waters go anoxic. Third: fish and benthos suffocate or flee, and some cyanobacteria add microcystin poisons threatening drinking water. The cure is cutting nutrient sources, not killing algae; restoring submerged plants and food webs takes years to decades, as Taihu and Erie taught.�ans��src��TPaerl 等,《Mitigating harmful cyanobacterial blooms»,Water Research 第45卷,2011�UH. W. Paerl et al., Mitigating harmful cyanobacterial blooms, Water Research 45, 2011��id�earth_26_001�body���直答:冻土中封存着巨量有机碳,融化后被微生物分解,释放二氧化碳与甲烷,形成升温-融化-排放的正反馈。机理:多年冻土区储存的碳约为大气碳含量的两倍;活动层加深与热喀斯特塌陷让有机质接触到液态水和氧气,排水良好处以好氧分解产生二氧化碳为主,积水缺氧处厌氧分解产生甲烷,其单位质量增温效应远强于二氧化碳;冻土退化越快,碳排放越多,变暖进一步加速。��Permafrost stores enormous amounts of organic carbon that stayed locked away while frozen. Once it thaws, microbes decompose the ancient remains: well-drained oxygenated soils release carbon dioxide, while waterlogged anaerobic spots emit methane, far more potent per unit mass than carbon dioxide. Because the permafrost region holds roughly twice the carbon now in the atmosphere, more thaw means more emissions, which drive further warming in a classic positive feedback loop.�ans��src��cSchuur 等人发表于《Nature》的论文 Climate change and the permafrost carbon feedback(2015)�TSchuur E A G et al., Climate change and the permafrost carbon feedback, Nature, 2015��id�earth_26_008�body���直答:厄尔尼诺抬升赤道中东太平洋海温,使沃克环流上升支离开印度上空,季风对流受到压制。机理:常年暖池位于印度—西太平洋,旺盛对流维持季风槽;厄尔尼诺期间对流中心东移,印度上空转为异常下沉,水汽辐合与季风降水减弱,雨季中断延长;统计上多数严重旱年与厄尔尼诺对应,但印度洋海温和大气内部变率仍会调制结果。��El Niño warms the central-eastern equatorial Pacific and shifts the rising branch of the Walker circulation away from India. Convection normally anchored over the Indo-Pacific warm pool sustains the monsoon trough; when it migrates eastward, anomalous subsidence settles over the subcontinent, weakening moisture convergence, monsoon rainfall, and the rhythm of the rains. Most severe Indian droughts cluster in El Niño years, though Indian Ocean conditions and internal variability modulate each case.�ans��src���Webster 与 Magaña 撰写的 Monsoons: processes, predictability, and the prospects for prediction,载于 Shukla、Misra 主编《Monsoons》,International Geophysics Series 第67卷,Academic Press,1998��P. J. Webster and V. Magaña, Monsoons: processes, predictability, and the prospects for prediction, in J.-P. Shukla and V. Misra (eds.), Monsoons, International Geophysics Series vol. 67, Academic Press, 1998��id�earth_26_009�body���直答:承压水位下降使黏土层发生塑性压密,孔隙结构无法弹回。机理:砂砾层释水近似弹性变形,水位回升尚可小幅回弹;黏土压缩性强而渗透性低,排水固结缓慢,有效应力超过先期固结压力后颗粒重排、孔隙坍缩即成永久变形,即便停采使水位恢复,地面也难以抬升,墨西哥城与圣华金河谷的沉降因此长期固化。��Falling confined-aquifer heads permanently squeeze buried clay beds. Sands and gravels deform elastically, so levels bounce back modestly when pumping stops. Clays combine low permeability with high compressibility: once effective stress exceeds their preconsolidation pressure, grains repack and pores collapse for good. Even full recovery of water levels cannot raise the ground again, which is why subsidence in Mexico City and the San Joaquin Valley endures.�ans��src�ٙGalloway 与 Burbey,《Review: Regional land subsidence accompanying groundwater extraction》,Hydrogeology Journal,2011 (DOI: 10.1007/s10040-011-0775-5)ٕGalloway & Burbey, 'Review: Regional land subsidence accompanying groundwater extraction', Hydrogeology Journal, 2011, DOI: 10.1007/s10040-011-0775-5��id�earth_26_018�body���三角洲本质是一笔泥沙收支账：河流来沙超过沉降与海侵造成的损失就淤进，反之则蚀退。现代大坝拦截了绝大部分泥沙——阿斯旺高坝建成后尼罗河入海泥沙减少逾九成，河道采砂和水土保持又进一步削减供沙；与此同时沉积物自然压实、地下水与油气开采加速地面下沉，海平面还在上升，收支逆转使全球多数三角洲转入净淹没。��A delta is a sediment budget: land builds when river supply exceeds losses to compaction, subsidence and sea-level rise, and drowns otherwise. Modern dams intercept most of the load — Nile sediment reaching the sea fell by more than ninety percent after the Aswan High Dam — while sand mining trims supply further. Natural compaction, groundwater-driven sinking and rising seas settle the account from below, pushing most major deltas into net drowning.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�ed341d71ab8f�body�ٓ这里大多是石灰岩，雨水带二氧化碳变成弱酸，把岩石溶出裂缝和洞穴，剩下一根根孤立的石峰和清澈的漓江。٤The area is mostly limestone; rain mixed with CO₂ becomes weak acid that dissolves the rock into cracks and caves, leaving isolated towers and the clear Li River.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�ee0da12dc412�body�ه还在长。印度板块至今仍以每年几厘米的速度往北挤，喜马拉雅山平均每年大约升高几毫米到一厘米。�zYes. The Indian Plate still pushes north a few cm per year, so the range rises a few millimeters to a centimeter annually.�ans��src�ل尹安、哈里森《喜马拉雅—青藏高原造山带的地质演化》，《地球与行星科学年度评论》第28卷，2000وYin, A. & Harrison, T.M. (2000), Geologic evolution of the Himalayan–Tibetan orogen, Annual Review of Earth and Planetary Sciences, 28��id�ee7381608003�body��x阴天、夜晚或没风时它们就发不出电，所以供电不稳定，需要电池储能或其他电源来补位。�On cloudy nights or calm days they produce little, so supply is unsteady and needs batteries or other sources to fill the gaps.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�ef1b4796b461�body��预警(watch)指某一地区气象条件有利于龙卷生成，提醒居民保持警惕；警报(warning)则说明龙卷已被雷达或目击确认、正在或即将发生，需立即避险。两者由美国国家气象局发布，代表不同的确定程度。�GA tornado watch means conditions are favorable for tornadoes to form in an area and people should stay alert; a tornado warning means a tornado has been detected by radar or sighted and is occurring or imminent, requiring immediate shelter. Both are issued by the U.S. National Weather Service at different levels of certainty.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�ef839b3ec310�body���对流层（约0到10公里）从地面获得热量，所以越往上越冷，云和天气都发生在这里。平流层（约10到50公里）中臭氧吸收紫外线并加热空气，所以温度又随高度升高。更高的中间层、热层分别再次变冷、变热，热层顶部温度可达上千摄氏度，但空气极稀薄，感觉不到热。分层结构决定了天气现象、飞行航线与极光出现的位置。��The troposphere (about 0-10 km) is heated from the ground, so temperature drops with altitude and all weather happens here. In the stratosphere (about 10-50 km) ozone absorbs ultraviolet light and warms the air, so temperature rises again. Above them the mesosphere cools once more while the thermosphere heats up, reaching thousands of degrees at its top yet feeling cold because the air is so thin. This layering fixes where clouds, aircraft routes, and auroras occur.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�f0b885b5bfe7�body��b全球土壤有机碳（约1500–2400 Pg C）远高于大气（约800 Pg）和植被中的碳量，因为植物残体在土壤中分解缓慢且部分被稳定化（与矿物结合、被团聚体包裹）。耕作翻耕增加通气、加速有机质氧化分解释放CO₂；传统农业百年来已使许多农田损失了原有有机碳的30%–50%。��Global soil organic carbon (about 1500–2400 Pg C) far exceeds carbon in the atmosphere (~800 Pg) and vegetation, because plant residues decompose slowly in soil and are partly stabilized (bound to minerals, occluded in aggregates). Tillage aerates the soil, accelerating organic-matter oxidation and CO₂ release; conventional farming has already cost many croplands 30%–50% of their original organic carbon.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�f3b09bbf4c24�body�ٓ体感温度是人体实际感到的冷热，受风、湿度和日照影响。闷热天汗水难蒸发，散热差，就会觉得比气温更热。٩Apparent temperature is what your body actually feels, affected by wind, humidity and sun. In muggy weather sweat hardly evaporates, so it feels hotter than the reading.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�f404b70ba774�body���典型原位技术包括抽出处理、空气扰动、可渗透反应墙（如零价铁降解氯代烃）以及生物修复。选择取决于污染物类型、含水层渗透性与场地条件，修复往往耗时数年。�Typical in-situ methods include pump-and-treat, air sparging, permeable reactive barriers (e.g., zero-valent iron degrading chlorinated solvents), and bioremediation. Choice depends on contaminant type, aquifer permeability, and site conditions, and cleanup often takes years.�ans��src��LFetter 所著教科书《Applied Hydrogeology》第4版(Waveland Press,2001)�CFetter C W, Applied Hydrogeology, 4th edition, Waveland Press, 2001��id�f4dab296d7d8�body���厚层玄武岩岩浆缓慢冷却时均匀收缩，产生垂直于冷却面的六边形或多边形裂隙，风化后显出规则的石柱，如爱尔兰巨人堤。这是物理收缩破裂的典型结果。��Thick basalt cools slowly and contracts evenly, forming hexagonal or polygonal cracks perpendicular to the cooling surface; weathering reveals regular columns like the Giant's Causeway in Ireland. It is a classic contraction-fracture result.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�f515e4cc731b�body�ف青藏高原隆起形成巨大的热源和地形屏障，加剧了海陆气压差，使东亚和南亚季风更强、更规律。٧The rising plateau became a huge heat source and barrier, strengthening land-sea pressure contrasts and making East and South Asian monsoons stronger and more regular.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�f611fc288770�body�ل厚层石灰岩被垂直裂缝切割，雨水沿缝溶蚀，缝隙越来越宽，留下一根根石柱，看上去像石头森林。�rVertical cracks in limestone widen as rain dissolves the rock, leaving tall stone pillars that look like a forest.�ans��src��B福特、威廉姆斯《岩溶水文与地貌学》，Wiley，2007�NFord, D.C. & Williams, P.W., Karst Hydrogeology and Geomorphology, Wiley, 2007��id�f7dd5acbf525�body�ف地壳像浮在软流圈上的木块，冰盖压沉、冰退后慢慢弹起，北欧和加拿大仍在以每年厘米级回升。لCrust floats on the mantle like wood; ice weighed it down and it is still rebounding centimeters per year in Scandinavia and Canada.�ans��src��^Stein & Wysession,《地震学、板块与构造学导论》第2版,剑桥大学出版社,2013�zC. Stein and M. Wysession, An Introduction to Seismology, Plates, and Tectonics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2013��id�f957a1147e58�body��{地面太晒太干，明渠的水会大量蒸发；坎儿井用暗渠把雪山融水引到绿洲，既保水又少蒸发。يThe surface is scorching and dry, so open channels lose water to evaporation; underground karez carry meltwater to oases with little loss.�ans��src��B中国联合国教科文组织全国委员会《新疆坎儿井》�?China National Commission for UNESCO, The Xinjiang Karez System��id�fbea9166ebcf�body�ل远古海洋里的浮游生物死亡后沉到海底，被泥沙掩埋，在地下高温高压下经过上百万年变成油和气。�~Tiny sea organisms died and sank, were buried by mud, and over millions of years of heat and pressure turned into oil and gas.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�fd1b22d827cf�body�ٍ冰层年份可用层次计数，冰中氧同位素、气泡的温室气体和粉尘记录着当时的温度、大气成分与沙尘活动。هAnnual layers can be counted, while oxygen isotopes, trapped greenhouse gases and dust record past temperature, atmosphere and aridity.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�fe1ed120b41e�body��o高压系统停滞不动，下沉气流压制云雨、晴朗增温，使某地区连续多日被高温笼罩。ـA stationary high-pressure system sinks air, suppresses clouds and rain and lets clear skies bake one region with heat for days.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�ff93a8a745f9�body��x海拔高、空气稀薄又干净，云少，太阳辐射几乎没被挡住，所以又冷又晒，紫外线特别强。ٕHigh altitude means thin, clean air with few clouds, so solar radiation reaches the ground almost undimmed—cold but intensely sunny with strong UV.�ans��src��D卢特根斯、塔巴克《大气：科学导论》，Pearson，2011�\Lutgens, F.K. & Tarbuck, E.J., The Atmosphere: An Introduction to Meteorology, Pearson, 2011��id�071d761d1cbd�body��,急流是高空狭窄的强风带，由极地与热带之间的温度梯度驱动，沿冷暖空气交界处蜿蜒。其波状路径决定冷暖气团的南北进退，并引导气旋与锋面移动。美国海洋大气管理局指出急流位置偏移会显著改变区域的干旱与降水格局。�wA jet stream is a narrow, fast upper-level wind band driven by the temperature contrast between polar and tropical air, meandering along the boundary of warm and cold masses. Its wavy path governs the north-south excursions of air masses and steers cyclones and fronts. NOAA notes that shifts in the jet's position markedly change regional drought and precipitation patterns.�ans��src��>盛裴轩 等,《大气物理学》,北京大学出版社,2003�HSheng Peixuan et al., Atmospheric Physics, Peking University Press, 2003��id�0a4516e86501�body���沃克环流是热带太平洋上的热力环流，走东西向：西太平洋海温高，湿热空气上升成深对流与降雨，高空向东流；东太平洋冷水上翻、海温低，空气下沉而干旱。信风把暖水继续推向西岸，冷暖差与环流相互加强，这套海气正反馈即它的核心。厄尔尼诺是它减弱、上升支东移，拉尼娜是它增强。别与哈得来环流搞混：那是南北向的子午环流，沃克是纬向环流。��The Walker circulation is a thermally direct cell over the tropical Pacific, running east-west: above the warm western ocean moist air rises into deep convection and rain, then flows eastward aloft, while over the eastern ocean, cooled by upwelling, air sinks and the weather stays dry. The trade winds keep pushing warm water westward, so the temperature contrast and the circulation reinforce each other, and this air-sea feedback is its core. El Niño is its weakening, with the rising branch shifting east; La Niña is its strengthening. Do not confuse it with the Hadley cell: that one overturns north-south, whereas the Walker circulation is the zonal cell on the equator.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�173dab91904d�body��R范艾伦带是地球磁层中被磁场俘获的高能带电粒子区域，分为内外两层环绕地球。它们把太阳风与宇宙射线中大部分粒子束缚在高空，减少到达地表的辐射。范艾伦在1958年通过早期卫星探测首次确认了这些带的存在，NASA的范艾伦探测器后续做了精细测量。�|The Van Allen belts are regions of the magnetosphere where energetic charged particles are trapped by Earth's field, arranged in inner and outer layers. They confine most solar-wind and cosmic-ray particles at high altitude, reducing radiation reaching the surface. Van Allen confirmed them with early satellites in 1958, and NASA's Van Allen Probes later measured them in detail.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�2027be0b7358�body��&奥加拉拉含水层横贯北美大平原，储存着更新世遗留的地下水，灌溉着美国大片小麦与玉米带。其补给速率极慢，而抽取速度远超自然回补，导致水位持续下降。美国地质调查局的研究显示部分地区已出现不可持续的枯竭。�=The Ogallala Aquifer underlies the North American Great Plains, holding Pleistocene-era groundwater that irrigates vast US wheat and corn belts. Recharge is extremely slow while pumping far exceeds natural replenishment, so water levels keep dropping. USGS studies show unsustainable depletion in parts of the region.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�25d2ea4f2aa2�body���风切变是风速或风向在短距离内的明显差异：垂直切变发生在上下层之间，水平切变在同一高度上。近地面风被摩擦和地形转向，高空风由气压场主导，两层常对不上方向。它的强弱看差值而非风速本身，两层都不算快而方向相反，照样是强切变。强垂直切变会把发展中的雷暴上部吹离底部、切断暖湿入流，使对流难以为继；低空风切变则在起降瞬间改变空速与升力，格外危险。��Wind shear is a marked difference of wind speed or direction over a short distance: vertical shear between layers at different heights, horizontal shear along a single level. Friction and terrain turn the wind near the ground while the upper wind follows the pressure field, so the two layers often fail to line up. Its strength is that difference rather than the wind speed itself, so two sluggish layers blowing opposite ways still give strong shear. Strong vertical shear blows the top of a developing thunderstorm off its base and cuts off the warm moist inflow, so convection struggles to persist; low-level shear, changing airspeed and lift together during takeoff and landing, is what makes it so hazardous for aircraft.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�35bd92118611�body��Y硅酸盐四面体由一个硅原子居中、四个氧原子居角构成，是地球富硅富氧成分下最稳定的结构单元。它们通过共享氧原子连接成岛状、链状、片状或架状，形成从橄榄石到长石再到云母的多样矿物。克莱因与赫尔伯特的《矿物学手册》详细列出了这些聚合方式。��The silicate tetrahedron, a silicon atom at the center and four oxygens at the corners, is the most stable unit given Earth's silicon- and oxygen-rich composition. By sharing oxygens they link into isolated, chain, sheet, or framework structures, yielding diverse minerals from olivine to feldspar to mica. Klein and Hurlbut's Manual of Mineralogy details these polymerization styles.�ans��src��aKlein 与 Hurlbut《Manual of Mineralogy》；Deer、Howie 与 Zussman《Rock-Forming Minerals》�SKlein & Hurlbut, Manual of Mineralogy; Deer, Howie & Zussman, Rock-Forming Minerals��id�385121dc86cb�body��A变质作用指固态岩石在升温、增压或流体的作用下矿物重排而不熔融，通常发生于地下十几到数十公里。接触变质由岩浆热力主导，区域变质则与造山带的深埋和定向压力相关。布赫与弗雷在《变质岩岩石成因》中系统梳理了对应的矿物组合。��Metamorphism rearranges a rock's minerals in the solid state under heating, pressure, or fluid action without melting, typically tens of kilometers underground. Contact metamorphism is driven by magmatic heat, while regional metamorphism accompanies deep burial and directed pressure in mountain belts. Bucher and Frey's Petrogenesis of Metamorphic Rocks catalogs the corresponding mineral assemblages.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�3d6f92eeb149�body���赤道受热上升的空气在高空向两极流动，到南北纬约30°上空堆积下沉，构成哈得来环流的下沉支。下沉中空气被压缩变暖，水汽难凝结，所以云少雨稀，地面形成副热带高压带。它随太阳直射点移动，夏季偏北、冬季偏南，中国东部的梅雨与伏旱都跟它的进退有关。易混的是，同一纬度上大陆西岸多沙漠而东岸湿润，因为高压西侧把海上湿空气送上了岸。��Air heated at the equator rises and flows poleward aloft, piling up to sink near 30° latitude as the descending limb of the Hadley cell. Sinking, it is compressed and warms, water vapour can no longer condense, so cloud and rain are scarce and a subtropical high builds at the surface. The belt drifts with the sun, poleward in summer and back toward the equator in winter, and the plum rain front and summer droughts of eastern China follow its advance and retreat. What misleads people is that at this same latitude western continental margins are mostly desert while eastern coasts stay humid, because the western flank of the high pushes moist ocean air ashore.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�46955f647d7f�body��9威尔逊旋回描述大洋盆地从张开、扩张、俯冲到最终闭合，并可能重新开启的反复过程。它把大陆裂解、漂移、碰撞造山串联成一个循环，适用于盘古超大陆的聚合与裂解。威尔逊在1966年提出这一框架，统一了之前零散的板块运动观察。�qThe Wilson cycle describes the cyclic opening, spreading, subduction, and eventual closure of ocean basins, which may then reopen again. It links continental rifting, drift, and collisional mountain-building into one loop, as seen in the assembly and breakup of Pangaea. Wilson proposed the framework in 1966, unifying earlier fragmentary observations of plate motions.�ans��src��uWilson《Did the Atlantic close and reopen?》（1966，Nature）；Kearey《The New Penguin Dictionary of Geology》�hWilson, Did the Atlantic close and reopen? (1966, Nature); Kearey, The New Penguin Dictionary of Geology��id�4a6f1306a5d5�body��蜿蜒河流的外侧受侵蚀、内侧沉积，使河道侧向摆动并不断加宽曲流带。当洪水冲开曲颈最窄处抄近路，废弃的河曲便与主河道隔绝，形成牛轭湖。利奥波德与沃尔曼在1957年用统计关系描述了河道形态的这种演化。�;A meandering river erodes its outer bank and deposits on the inner one, swinging sideways and widening the meander belt. When a flood cuts across the narrow neck of a loop, the abandoned bend is isolated as an oxbow lake. Leopold and Wolman described this morphological evolution with statistical relations in 1957.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�52cfb37b6615�body���矩震级基于断层破裂面积、平均滑移量与岩石刚度计算地震矩，能客观反映特大地震的真实能量，且不受震中距与仪器限制。它已成为大型地震的标准度量，解决了里氏震级饱和的问题。�#Moment magnitude is based on the seismic moment, fault rupture area times average slip times rock rigidity, so it objectively reflects the true energy of very large quakes without saturating. It has become the standard for big earthquakes, fixing the saturation problem of the Richter scale.�ans��src��GHanks & Kanamori（1979）《地球物理研究杂志》矩震级标度َHanks, T.C. & Kanamori, H. (1979), A moment magnitude scale, Journal of Geophysical Research, 84(B5), 2348–2350, doi:10.1029/JB084iB05p02348��id�58515b580a81�body��	上升流由风把表层水吹离海岸，深层富营养冷水随之上涌补充表层。这些营养盐触发浮游植物大量繁殖，支撑起庞大的食物链与渔获。斯韦德鲁普在1942年的《海洋》中系统描述了风生上升流的动力学。�(Upwelling occurs when wind drives surface water away from coast and deep, nutrient-rich cold water rises to replace it. Those nutrients trigger blooms of phytoplankton that support a vast food chain and large catches. Sverdrup described the dynamics of wind-driven upwelling in The Oceans (1942).�ans��src��cRachel Carson,《The Sea Around Us》Oxford University Press,1951;中译《环绕我们的海洋》�HR. Carson, The Sea Around Us, Oxford University Press, 1951; Chinese ed.��id�6268c7ac82a5�body��A碳主要储存在大气、海洋、陆地植被与土壤以及岩石圈中，通过光合作用、呼吸、燃烧与溶解等过程交换。人类化石燃料排放每年向大气净增数十亿吨碳，打破了原有的自然平衡。施莱辛格在《生物地球化学》中系统梳理了各储库的相对规模。�qCarbon resides mainly in the atmosphere, oceans, land vegetation and soils, and the geosphere, exchanging through photosynthesis, respiration, combustion, and dissolution. Human fossil-fuel emissions add billions of tons of carbon to the atmosphere each year, upsetting the natural balance. Schlesinger's Biogeochemistry lays out the relative sizes of these reservoirs.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�6749c3cf2201�body���潮湿空气沿迎风坡爬升，膨胀冷却，水汽凝成雨雪落下，翻过山脊时已变干。干空气在背风坡下沉时被增大的气压压缩，按干绝热方式升温，降得越多越暖，吹来又热又干的风。阿尔卑斯山的焚风里，同一海拔背风坡比迎风坡更暖更干，所以它能迅速融化积雪、催熟作物。它只限于山后狭长一带，风向一转就消失；热不是从别处搬来，而是下沉压缩造成的。��Moist air forced up the windward slope expands and cools until its water condenses out as rain or snow, so by the time it crosses the ridge it has turned dry. Sinking down the lee slope it is squeezed by increasing pressure and warms dry-adiabatically, the further it drops the warmer it gets, arriving as a hot, parched wind. In an Alpine foehn, at the same height the lee side is warmer and drier than the windward side, which is why it melts snow fast and ripens crops early. It reaches only a narrow strip below the ridge and dies the moment the wind reverses; the heat is not carried in from somewhere else, it comes from compression during descent.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�6dacda0824f8�body��`火山碎屑流是沿火山坡高速奔涌的炽热气体、灰与岩块的混合物，温度可达数百摄氏度且速度超过每小时百公里。由于其密度大且贴地流动，它能越过地形障碍并瞬间吞没大片区域，如摧毁庞贝的维苏威喷发。费舍尔与海肯在1982年系统总结了这类沉积的成因与危害。�QA pyroclastic flow is a hot mixture of gas, ash, and rock fragments racing down a volcano's flanks, reaching hundreds of degrees and speeds over 100 km/h. Dense and ground-hugging, it overruns terrain and buries vast areas within moments, as when Vesuvius destroyed Pompeii. Fisher and Heiken summarized their origin and hazards in 1982.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�79aa18833a0d�body���溯源侵蚀发生在谷头：水流集中在细沟、坡陡流急，加上源头下方渗流掏空支撑，陡壁不断崩落，谷头便朝分水岭后退、河谷延长。沟一旦抢到更大汇水面积，流量与能量齐升，后退自我放大，这是谷头比下游发展快的原因。边界在水与岩性：源头没水或遇抗蚀岩层即停止；若邻谷坡更陡、基准面更低，沟头反被截走——河流袭夺正是它重画水系分界的结果。��Headward erosion works at the head of a valley. There the water is squeezed into a small channel on a steep slope, so it cuts hard, and seepage at the head undercuts its support until the steep wall keeps collapsing; the valley head steps backward toward the divide and the valley lengthens. Once a gully gains a larger catchment, discharge and energy rise together and its own retreat feeds on itself, which is why heads advance faster than lower reaches. The limits are water and rock: a head with no flow, or one protected by resistant rock, stops retreating, and if a neighbouring valley has a steeper slope and a lower base level, that head is cut off instead - river capture is precisely headward erosion redrawing the water divide.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�863f8b79ebcb�body��低纬空气在赤道受热上升，在高空向两极流动并在副热带下沉，形成闭合的经向环流。下沉气流造成副热带高压与沙漠带，而上升支带来多雨的赤道辐合带。霍尔顿在《动力气象学导论》中给出这一环流的定量描述。�qAir near the equator is heated and rises, then flows poleward aloft and sinks around the subtropics, closing a meridional circulation. The sinking branch produces subtropical high pressure and desert belts, while the rising branch feeds the rainy intertropical convergence zone. Holton's An Introduction to Dynamic Meteorology gives a quantitative account of this cell.�ans��src��>盛裴轩 等,《大气物理学》,北京大学出版社,2003�HSheng Peixuan et al., Atmospheric Physics, Peking University Press, 2003��id�885ddd94bfe6�body���河流阶地是被废弃的古谷底，河流下切后悬在洪水之上，成为阶梯状平台。形成要两步：先侧蚀堆积出宽阔谷底，再重新下切，老谷底便脱离泛滥。下切可来自构造抬升或基准面下降，也可来自气候与来沙变化让河流重调比降，所以阶地记的是水沙与基准面关系的改变，不等于地壳在抬。它也不再是河漫滩，判定要看下部河床砾石、上部漫滩细粒的二元结构。��A river terrace is an abandoned valley floor left hanging above the floodwater when the river cuts down, forming a step-like bench. It takes two stages: lateral erosion and deposition first make a wide floor, then renewed incision leaves it out of the flood. Cutting down may come from tectonic uplift or a fall in base level, but also from climate or sand-supply change that makes the river re-adjust its slope, so terraces record a shift in the balance between water, sediment and base level rather than proof that the crust is rising. They are no longer floodplains either, and identifying one means looking for the two-part structure of bed gravels below and overbank fines above.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�8a29ff47249e�body��矿床是地质作用把有用组分在地壳里堆到能在当前技术与价格下开采的程度，判据是品位、储量与开采条件，不是含量高于平均值就行。这种集中靠岩浆分异、热液搬运沉淀、沉积与风化，因为多数元素在普通岩石中稀薄分散，要再富集好几个数量级才谈得上采矿。矿床因此是个经济概念：低品位矿与老尾矿今天不算矿，涨价或选冶过关后就可能变成矿，伴生组分也要看有没有回收途径。�An ore deposit is material that geological processes have concentrated in the crust to a degree that can be mined profitably under current technology and prices; the test is grade, tonnage and mining conditions, not merely content above average. That concentration comes from magmatic differentiation, the transport and precipitation of hydrothermal fluids, sedimentation and weathering, because most elements sit thinly dispersed in ordinary rock and must be gathered by several more orders of magnitude before mining is worth discussing. So a deposit is an economic idea: low-grade ore and old tailings do not count as a mine today, yet a higher price or a new beneficiation route can turn them into one, and a by-product element only counts if there is a way to recover it.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�91b7c5b3ae99�body��5典型土壤从地表向下依次为富含有机质的表土层、淋溶层、淀积层、母质层与基岩。降水把上层的黏粒与矿物向下搬运，在淀积层重新沉积，形成清晰的层次分化。布雷迪与韦尔在《土壤的本质与性质》中详细解释了这些层次的发育。�RA typical soil from the surface down shows an organic-rich topsoil, an eluvial layer, an illuvial layer, parent material, and bedrock. Rainfall transports clay and minerals downward, redepositing them in the illuvial layer and creating clear layering. Brady and Weil explain this horizon development in The Nature and Properties of Soils.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�94c3c2cc8a86�body���大气中的水汽全球平均驻留时间仅约 8–10 天便通过降水被清除，因为大气含水总量虽小、但循环通量极大。这一短周期使降水对温度与环流变化高度敏感。�/Globally, atmospheric water vapor has a mean residence time of only about 8-10 days before it is removed by precipitation, because the total atmospheric store is small relative to a very large cycling flux. This short turnover makes precipitation highly sensitive to temperature and circulation changes.�ans��src��GTrenberth 等（2009）《美国气象学会公报》地球能量收支�lTrenberth, K.E. et al. (2009), Earth's Global Energy Budget, Bulletin of the American Meteorological Society��id�9a091b9cb6de�body���转换断层是两盘沿其走向只做水平剪切错动的板块边界，它常把洋中脊错断成一截一截，沿线地震浅、垂直升降小，既不造山也无深源地震。它容易被误认成普通走滑断层：真错动只发生在相邻两段洋中脊之间，脊外侧两盘其实同向移动，图上巨大的错距只是假象，并非实际位移量。圣安德烈斯断层就是把洋中脊的转换段延伸到大陆上的例子。�gA transform fault is a plate boundary whose two sides only slide horizontally along its strike. It commonly cuts mid-ocean ridges into offset segments, and quakes along it are shallow with little vertical movement, so it builds no mountains and has no deep-focus earthquakes. It is easily mistaken for an ordinary strike-slip fault: real displacement happens only between two adjacent ridge segments, because outside them both sides move in the same direction, so the huge offset on a map is an appearance, not the actual amount of slip. The San Andreas fault is a ridge transform segment extended onto a continent.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�9beb602986d1�body���板块运动的背景是地幔对流，但推拽力多来自板块自身：冷而密的板片在海沟下沉，拖住后面的板块，即板片拖拽；洋中脊抬高，新洋壳沿重力向两侧滑出，即脊推。一般认为板片拖拽最强，故有长俯冲带的板块最快，每年数厘米，与指甲生长同量级。易混的是把对流当传送带直接拖着岩石圈：对流只管输运热量，直接做功的是重力，板底拖曳有时反成阻力。��Mantle convection sets the background, but the forces that move plates come mostly from the plates themselves: a cold, dense slab sinks at a trench and drags the plate behind it, which is slab pull, while the mid-ocean ridge stands high and the young crust slides gravitationally outward, which is ridge push. Slab pull is generally held to be the strongest, which is why plates with a long subduction zone at their edge move fastest, a few centimetres a year, the same order as fingernail growth. The confusion to avoid is treating convection as a conveyor belt that drags the lithosphere along: convection only carries heat, gravity does the direct work, and basal drag can even act as resistance.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�9d2c5c24f79e�body��飑线是一条狭长的强雷暴带，多排在冷锋或冷空气外流边界前缘：雷暴的冷下沉把低层空气铺开成冷空气堤，暖湿空气撞上堤被强烈抬升，前方不断点起新单体、后方老单体消亡，整条线像传送带般前推。它比单个雷暴大而持久，一个单体只活几十分钟，整条能撑好几个小时。易混的是锋面雨带：锋面降水通常缓和成片，飑线的标志是风力突增、风向急转，气压与温度几分钟内跳变，还常伴冰雹。�A squall line is a long, narrow band of severe thunderstorms, usually riding just ahead of a cold front or a cold-air outflow boundary: the cold downdraft of each storm spreads low-level air into a dam of cold air, warm moist air hitting that dam is lifted hard, new cells keep igniting at the front while old ones die at the rear, and the whole line advances like a conveyor belt. It is larger and longer-lived than a single storm, which lasts only tens of minutes, whereas the line can hold together for several hours. The confusion is with a frontal rain band: frontal precipitation is gentle and widespread, while the signature of a squall line is wind rising suddenly, the direction swinging, pressure and temperature jumping within minutes, and often hail with it.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�a3b9c52a2830�body��H季风是随季节反转的大尺度风系，根源是海陆间巨大的热力差异造成气压季节性反转。亚洲拥有最高耸的青藏高原与最广袤的陆地，夏季大陆剧烈增温形成强低压，把印度洋湿空气吸向内陆。韦伯斯特在2006年对亚洲季风的机制与变率做了综合论述。�pA monsoon is a seasonal reversal of large-scale winds rooted in the huge thermal contrast between land and ocean that flips pressure patterns. Asia combines the towering Tibetan Plateau with the largest landmass, so summer heating creates a strong low that draws moist Indian Ocean air inland. Webster synthesized the Asian monsoon's mechanics and variability in 2006.�ans��src��M王斌(Bing Wang)、傅泰夫(Taifu Fu)主编,The Asian Monsoon,Springer,2008�@Bing Wang and Taifu Fu (eds.), The Asian Monsoon, Springer, 2008��id�acec147c0a16�body���干旱区的大风挟着沙粒长期打磨地表，遇到软硬不均的古代河湖沉积，软的先被刮走，硬的留下，一排排土丘与沟槽便顺着主风向平行排列，这就是雅丹。它是刻出来的而不是堆出来的：沙丘是风把沙堆高，雅丹是风把地面挖低。另一种易混是丹霞，同样干旱、同样被侵蚀塑形，但以红色陆相地层和流水作用为主；雅丹的垄槽走向还能反过来帮你判断古风向。��In arid country, wind loaded with sand abrades the surface over long stretches of time. Where the bed is unevenly hard—old lake or river deposits—softer parts are scoured away first and tougher remnants stand, so ridges and troughs end up in parallel rows aligned with the prevailing wind: that is a yardang. Note that it is carved rather than built—a dune is sand piled up by wind, a yardang is ground dug down by wind. The other confusion is Danxia landform, equally arid and equally shaped by erosion but dominated by red continental beds and running water. Because yardang rows track the wind, they can also be read backwards to infer paleo-wind direction.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�afc03b49c8d2�body��环流涡是受信风、西风与科里奥利力共同约束的副热带大型环流，风应力旋度在中心累积水柱高度。洋流沿等压线流动，海岸地形与西风漂流闭合整个环路。斯托梅尔在1965年对湾流的动力学做了开创性刻画。�KA gyre is a large subtropical circulation shaped by trade winds, westerlies, and the Coriolis force, with wind-stress curl piling water at its center. Currents flow along pressure contours, and coastlines plus the Antarctic Circumpolar Current close the loop. Stommel gave a pioneering dynamical picture of the Gulf Stream in 1965.�ans��src��UL. D. Talley et al., Descriptive Physical Oceanography, 6th ed., Academic Press, 2011�UL. D. Talley et al., Descriptive Physical Oceanography, 6th ed., Academic Press, 2011��id�b2f99a890b08�body��#P波是纵波、可在固液气体中传播，S波是横波、只能穿过固体，二者速度随介质密度与刚性变化。S波在约2900公里深处突然消失，揭示其下方为液态外核；P波的折射则勾勒出内外核边界。莱曼在1936年据此发现了固态内核。�~P waves are compressional and travel through solids, liquids, and gases, while S waves are shear waves that pass only through solids, and both change speed with density and rigidity. S waves vanish abruptly near 2,900 km depth, revealing the liquid outer core below, and P-wave refraction outlines the inner-core boundary. Lehmann used this in 1936 to discover the solid inner core.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�c7fa4e262093�body��B洋中脊是张裂型板块边界，地幔物质在此上涌减压熔融，岩浆侵入并喷发形成玄武岩质新生地壳。新地壳随海底扩张向两侧推移，并在冷却中记录下地磁场的极性反转，形成对称的磁条带。麦克唐纳在1986年系统描述了洋中脊的构造与热液活动。�bMid-ocean ridges are divergent boundaries where upwelling mantle melts by decompression, and magma intrudes and erupts to form fresh basaltic crust. New crust is carried sideways by seafloor spreading and, as it cools, records magnetic reversals as symmetric stripes. Macdonald described the ridge's tectonics and hydrothermal activity in detail in 1986.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�d29c3a8e6e0a�body���海水密度由温度和盐度决定，分层本质是密度分层。太阳加热表层，风浪搅出温度均匀的混合层；其下温度骤降成温跃层、盐度骤变成盐跃层，合称密度跃层。轻上重下，翻动须克服浮力，垂向交换很弱，深层的氧与营养盐难以上返。它并非处处存在：高纬冬季表层水又冷又咸而下沉，对流击穿跃层，深层水由此补充；河口有大量淡水时，分层改由盐度主导。�,Seawater density is set by temperature and salinity, so stratification is really density layering. The sun warms the surface and wind stirs a mixed layer of nearly uniform temperature; below it temperature drops sharply as the thermocline and salinity as the halocline, and together these make the pycnocline. With light water over dense water, anything that mixes vertically has to work against buoyancy, so exchange is weak and the oxygen and nutrients of the deep water struggle to return upward. The structure is not the same everywhere: in winter at high latitudes the surface becomes cold and salty and sinks, and convection punches through the thermocline, which is where the deep water is renewed; and where a river mouth delivers a lot of fresh water, salinity takes over as the control on the layering.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�d70fb67c4b6d�body��,南极与格陵兰的冰层逐年积雪压实，把当时的大气气体与粉尘封存在气泡和层中。通过分析冰芯中的氧同位素、甲烷与二氧化碳浓度，可还原温度与温室气体历史。佩蒂等在1999年发表的东方站冰芯覆盖了过去42万年的完整记录。�RYearly snow in Antarctica and Greenland compacts into ice that traps the era's atmospheric gases and dust in bubbles and layers. Analyzing oxygen isotopes, methane, and carbon dioxide in the core reconstructs temperature and greenhouse-gas history. Petit and colleagues published the Vostok core in 1999, covering 420,000 years of record.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�e2a47ea44b56�body��K龙卷风源于强雷暴中的中气旋，当上升气流与风切变使暖湿与干冷空气剧烈旋转，便可能下伸成漏斗。中纬度常是冷干极地气团与暖湿热带气团交锋之地，提供了最易产生超级单体的环境条件。马科夫斯基与理查森在2009年综述了龙卷形成的物理机制。�kA tornado develops from a mesocyclone within a strong thunderstorm, where updrafts and wind shear make warm-moist and dry-cold air rotate violently and stretch into a funnel. Mid-latitudes are where cold polar and warm tropical air masses collide, yielding the classic environment for supercells. Markowski and Richardson reviewed tornado-genesis physics in 2009.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�e4bb43294e18�body��)海平面上升会淹没低平海岸并加剧风暴潮侵蚀，而海退则暴露出新的潮坪与阶地。波浪与沿岸流持续搬运泥沙，使岬角被削平、海湾被充填，形成动态平衡的海岸线。伯德在《海岸地貌学》中系统描述了这些过程的相互作用。�VRising sea level submerges low coasts and intensifies storm-surge erosion, while regression exposes new tidal flats and terraces. Waves and longshore currents constantly move sediment, trimming headlands and filling bays into a dynamically balanced shoreline. Bird's Coastal Geomorphology systematically describes these interacting processes.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�earth_24_005�body���雪在极地逐层堆积,压实成冰时把当时的空气封存成气泡,冰芯因此是一部双向档案:测水中氧18与氘之比可重建降雪时的温度;抽取气泡能直接测定八十万年前大气的二氧化碳与甲烷浓度;硫酸盐峰对应远古火山喷发。冰穹C的EPICA冰芯已回溯80万年,显示其间二氧化碳从未超过300ppm,而今天已突破420ppm——冰芯由此成为检验人类活动影响最硬的证据之一。�9Snow piles up layer by layer in polar regions, sealing each era's air as bubbles when it compacts to ice. A core is therefore a two-sided archive: oxygen-18 and deuterium ratios in the water reconstruct past temperatures, the trapped bubbles give direct readings of atmospheric carbon dioxide and methane up to eight hundred thousand years back, and sulfate spikes mark great eruptions. The EPICA Dome C core spans 800 millennia, showing CO2 never exceeded 300 ppm — today it exceeds 420 ppm, making ice cores among the hardest evidence of human influence on climate.�ans��src��ZLüthi 等,《High-resolution carbon dioxide concentration record」,Nature 第453卷,2008�WD. Lüthi et al., High-resolution carbon dioxide concentration record, Nature 453, 2008��id�earth_24_009�body��,岩浆冷却时,其中的磁性矿物会沿当时地磁方向定向排列并冻结。1963年瓦因与马修斯指出:若洋中脊不断喷出新岩浆并把两侧老海底对称推向远方,反复发生的地磁南北倒转就会把海底磁化成以脊为轴、左右镜像的正负条带。几年后海上磁力仪剖面证实了这种斑马纹,由条带宽度推算的扩张速率又与陆上熔岩放射性测年标定的地磁年代表吻合——海底扩张由假说变为测量事实,大陆漂移由此获得动力机制,板块构造就此奠基。��When lava cools, its magnetic minerals freeze aligned with the ambient geomagnetic field. In 1963 Vine and Matthews proposed that if mid-ocean ridges keep erupting new crust and convey older seafloor symmetrically outward, recurring geomagnetic reversals would stripe the seafloor into mirror-image normal and reversed bands centered on the ridge. Ship-towed magnetometer profiles soon mapped those zebra stripes, and spreading rates computed from stripe widths matched the geomagnetic polarity timescale calibrated by radiometric dating of land lavas — seafloor spreading became measurement, continental drift gained its mechanism, and plate tectonics was born.�ans��src��SVine 与 Matthews,《Magnetic anomalies over oceanic ridges»,Nature 第199卷,1963�WF. J. Vine and D. H. Matthews, Magnetic anomalies over oceanic ridges, Nature 199, 1963��id�earth_24_018�body��]锰结核是数百万年缓慢沉淀的杰作:铁锰氧化物从海水与沉积物孔隙水中层层吸附镍、钴、铜与稀有金属,以每百万年几毫米的速度包覆核石生长,克拉里昂-克利珀顿区的储量据估超过陆地同类矿藏总和。电动车电池需求让它成为焦点——多金属结核恰好富含电池所需的镍钴铜锰。争议同样巨大:深海生态脆弱而未知,采集搅起的沉积物羽流可能摧毁海底生物群落;国际海底管理局仍在制定开采规章。它是一张未来资源牌,也是一场科学未知数与商业时钟的赛跑。��Manganese nodules are million-year masterworks: iron-manganese oxides adsorb nickel, cobalt, copper and rare metals layer by layer from seawater and pore waters, growing millimeters per million years around cores; the Clarion-Clipperton Zone likely holds more of these metals than all known land deposits combined. EV batteries put nodules center stage since they concentrate battery nickel-cobalt-copper-manganese exactly. The fight is equally large: abyssal ecosystems fragile and unmapped, sediment plumes from collectors could bury communities, and the International Seabed Authority still writes mining rules — a future resource card racing commercial clocks against unknown science.�ans��src��Hein 与 Koschinsky,《Deep-Ocean Ferromanganese Crusts and Nodules》,收录于 Treatise on Geochemistry 第2版,Elsevier,2014�J. R. Hein and A. Koschinsky, Deep-Ocean Ferromanganese Crusts and Nodules, in Treatise on Geochemistry 2nd ed., Elsevier, 2014��id�ebf023c58354�body�ي当两个大陆相撞拼合，原先的大洋消失，留下的缝合带记录了这次碰撞，如喜马拉雅的雅鲁藏布缝合带。�jWhere colliding continents close an ocean, the leftover seam records the collision, e.g. the Indus suture.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�f295e7c82fbe�body���城市热岛指城区气温明显高于周边郊区的现象，源于混凝土、沥青吸热多且植被少、散热慢。夜间郊区快速辐射冷却，而城市蓄积的热量持续释放，使城乡温差拉大。�9The urban heat island is the tendency for city centers to be warmer than surrounding rural areas, because concrete and asphalt absorb heat and there is little vegetation to cool by evapotranspiration. At night rural areas radiatively cool quickly while the city releases stored heat, widening the temperature gap.�ans��src��6美国环保局（EPA）《城市热岛缓解》报告�,U.S. EPA, Reducing Urban Heat Islands report��id�f65646357ab4�body��?气溶胶是悬浮的微小颗粒，一部分直接反射阳光使地表变冷，另一部分作为云凝结核改变云的反照率。人为硫酸盐气溶胶的冷却效应部分抵消了温室气体的增温，但其寿命短、空间分布不均。查尔森等人在1992年量化了人为气溶胶的气候强迫。�iAerosols are suspended fine particles; some reflect sunlight directly and cool the surface, while others act as cloud condensation nuclei altering cloud albedo. Anthropogenic sulfate aerosols cool somewhat, offsetting part of greenhouse warming, but they are short-lived and unevenly distributed. Charlson and colleagues quantified this aerosol forcing in 1992.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�f993aedd0c52�body���火山灰不是尘土，而是炸碎的玻璃质岩屑，有棱角、多孔，能被喷发云带到很远。干时轻飘，受潮结块增重、压塌屋顶；堵塞进气与过滤系统，被喷气发动机吸入后在涡轮处熔化再凝固，推力可骤失；细粒入肺、锐粒伤眼与气道；在地表污染水源、遇水成泥流。灰的影响范围远大于熔岩流；气候变冷主要靠伴生二氧化硫生成的平流层气溶胶，灰本身沉降很快。��Volcanic ash is not dust but shattered glassy fragments, angular and full of pores, carried far by the eruption cloud. Dry it drifts lightly; once damp it cakes, gains weight and collapses roofs. It chokes air intakes and filters, and after being sucked into a jet engine it melts onto the turbine and re-solidifies, so thrust can vanish in an instant. Fine grains hurt the lungs, sharp ones the eyes and airways; on the ground it fouls water and turns into mudflows with rain. Ash reaches far beyond any lava flow, and what actually cools the climate is the stratospheric aerosol made from accompanying sulfur dioxide, since ash itself settles out quickly.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�fec7c46f7ada�body�ٺ火山活动可形成火山锥、熔岩台地、破火山口和熔岩隧道等地貌。喷发后的冷却与塌陷还会塑造独特的火山高原和火山岛，例如夏威夷群岛。��Volcanic activity creates landforms such as volcanic cones, lava plateaus, calderas, and lava tubes. Cooling and collapse after eruptions also shape distinctive volcanic highlands and islands, like the Hawaiian Islands.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�00e1aa82d6d8�body��o密度大的大洋板块钻到另一板块之下沉入地幔的地方，常形成海沟和强烈地震火山。�\Where a dense oceanic plate dives under another into the mantle, making trenches and quakes.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�013849ca886c�body��?过度放牧和干旱使植被消失，土壤被风沙带走。�AOvergrazing and drought strip vegetation, letting sand take over.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�0273b57b8abf�body���解理是矿物沿特定薄弱方向规则裂开成平滑平面的性质，断口则是矿物不按规律破裂形成的不规则表面。云母易沿一层层解理剥开，而石英常呈贝壳状断口。��Cleavage is a mineral's tendency to split along preferred weak directions into smooth planes; fracture is its irregular breakage when no cleavage direction is followed. Mica cleaves into sheets, while quartz typically shows a conchoidal fracture.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�04f410d8bfec�body��太阳风带来的带电粒子被地球磁场引导聚集到南北磁极附近，与高层大气中的氧原子和氮分子碰撞激发，以光的形式释放能量。氧常发出绿光或红光，氮则偏蓝紫色，于是形成夜空中舞动的极光。�Charged particles from the solar wind are funneled by Earth's magnetic field toward the magnetic poles, where they collide with oxygen and nitrogen in the upper atmosphere and emit light. Oxygen often glows green or red and nitrogen blue-purple, producing the dancing auroras.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�05c9b0b48daa�body���干旱使土壤与植被覆盖下降、地表松散，强风更易卷起沙尘形成沙尘暴，并可能远距离传输影响空气质量与冰雪反照率。这是干旱半干旱区典型的灾害链。��Drought reduces soil moisture and vegetation cover, leaving loose surfaces that strong winds easily lift into dust storms, which can travel far and affect air quality and snow or ice albedo. This is a classic hazard chain in arid and semi-arid regions.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�07352b5124df�body��l黑潮是沿西太平洋向北流的高温高盐暖流，影响日本和中国东海岸的气候与渔业。�aThe Kuroshio is a warm, salty western-Pacific current shaping climate and fisheries of East Asia.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�0a4a154cc6f6�body�ٮ云母晶体内部是层状硅酸盐结构，层内为强共价键，层间仅为弱范德华力。因此容易沿层间裂开成薄片，这种性质称为极完全解理。��Mica has a layered silicate structure with strong bonds inside sheets but weak van der Waals forces between them. It thus splits easily along layers into thin sheets, a property called perfect cleavage.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�0c04e3162999�body�ف沙漠空气干燥、云少，白天太阳辐射几乎全到地面而升温快；夜里缺乏云层保温，热量迅速散失。�~Dry desert air and few clouds let sunlight heat the ground fast by day, and at night lacking cloud cover heat escapes quickly.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�0ca4d2421e88�body��它们不依赖光合作用而依赖化学合成：化能自养细菌氧化热液中的H₂S、H₂或CH₄获取能量，固定CO₂合成有机物；巨型管虫、热液虾等动物与这些细菌共生。这是人们发现的首个完全依赖化学能的生态系统。�;They depend on chemosynthesis rather than photosynthesis: chemoautotrophic bacteria oxidize H₂S, H₂, or CH₄ in vent fluids for energy and fix CO₂ into organic matter; giant tubeworms and vent shrimp live in symbiosis with these bacteria. It was the first ecosystem found to rely entirely on chemical energy.�ans��src�٧Cavanaugh 等《热液管虫Riftia pachyptila体内的原核细胞：可能的化能自养共生者》Science 213(4506):340-342, 1981, DOI:10.1126/science.213.4506.340��Cavanaugh et al., "Prokaryotic Cells in the Hydrothermal Vent Tube Worm Riftia pachyptila Jones: Possible Chemoautotrophic Symbionts", Science 213(4506):340-342, 1981, DOI:10.1126/science.213.4506.340��id�0cf7d98df2c1�body��b沿岸风吹走表层海水，深层冷水涌上来填补，把海底沉积物里的硝酸盐、磷酸盐等营养盐带到透光层。浮游植物大量繁殖，浮游动物、小鱼到大鱼的食物链随之兴旺，形成著名渔场，如秘鲁沿岸和加利福尼亚海域。上升流海水温度低，还能让沿岸气候偏凉、雾气弥漫。��When coastal winds blow surface water offshore, cold deep water rises to replace it, carrying nitrates, phosphates, and other nutrients from the seafloor up into the sunlit zone. Phytoplankton bloom, and the food chain from zooplankton to small then large fish flourishes, creating famous fisheries off Peru and California. The rising cold water also keeps coastal climates cool and foggy.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�0d3a3b8fe6ae�body��2经典的五因素为母质、气候、生物、地形和时间。母质决定矿物组成基础；气候（温度与降水）控制风化速度；生物提供有机质并改善结构；地形影响排水与侵蚀；时间决定发育程度。同一母质在不同气候下会形成截然不同的土壤。��The classic five factors are parent material, climate, organisms, topography, and time. Parent material sets the mineral base; climate (temperature and precipitation) controls weathering rates; organisms supply organic matter and improve structure; topography governs drainage and erosion; and time determines the degree of development. Identical parent materials under different climates yield very different soils.�ans��src�� 《普通地质学》(舒良树)�General Geology (Shu Liangshu)��id�0da12ee264b2�body���在石灰岩、白云岩等可溶性岩石分布区，略带酸性的雨水沿裂隙溶蚀岩石，长期作用下形成地下溶洞、地下河，洞顶塌陷则成天坑（落水洞）。我国桂林山水、云南石林都是典型的喀斯特地貌。�,In regions of soluble rock such as limestone and dolomite, mildly acidic rainwater dissolves the rock along fractures, over time carving underground caves and streams; when a cave roof collapses, it forms a sinkhole. Guilin's peaks and the Stone Forest in Yunnan, China, are classic karst landscapes.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�0df37f4b02a8�body��{火山灰和熔岩风化成富含钾、磷等矿物的土壤，疏松透气又养分足，所以火山脚下常是良田。فVolcanic ash and lava weather into loose soil rich in potassium, phosphorus and more, making fertile farmland on volcanic flanks.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�0e81a1c69fc3�body���珊瑚体内的虫黄藻通过光合作用为珊瑚提供大部分能量，也赋予其鲜艳的颜色；当海水异常偏暖（通常比夏季均值高约1摄氏度并持续数周）、污染或酸化时，虫黄藻被驱逐或死亡，白色骨骼显露，就是白化。若压力及时解除，珊瑚可重新接纳虫黄藻而恢复；若压力持续，珊瑚会饿死。近年全球性的海洋高温事件已多次引发大面积白化。�Zooxanthellae inside coral tissues supply most of the coral's energy through photosynthesis and give corals their vivid colors; when seawater stays unusually warm (about 1 C above the summer average for weeks) or under pollution and acidification, the algae are expelled or die and the white skeleton shows through—bleaching. If the stress ends quickly, corals can take up new zooxanthellae and recover; if it persists, they starve. Global marine heatwaves have repeatedly caused mass bleaching in recent years.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�0f1dc8d30056�body�ف黄土本身疏松、垂直节理发育，加上降水集中、坡度大、植被少，雨水一冲就容易带走表层沃土。�wLoose, cracked loess plus concentrated rainfall, steep slopes and sparse vegetation lets rain wash away topsoil easily.�ans��src��=刘东生《黄土与环境》，中国海洋出版社，1985�ALiu Tungsheng, Loess and the Environment, China Ocean Press, 1985��id�1030f66c5350�body���飓风在温暖（约26℃以上）的洋面上形成，海面水汽上升释放潜热，使中心气压降低并旋转增强，最终发展为具风眼的风暴。它们在东亚称台风，在美洲附近称飓风。��Hurricanes form over warm ocean water above about 26°C, where rising moisture releases latent heat, lowering central pressure and spinning the system up into a storm with an eye. They are called typhoons in East Asia and hurricanes near the Americas.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�104b055f0e3f�body�٘地球自西向东转，不同经度见到太阳的时刻不同，所以每差15°大约差1小时；纬度是南北位置，和“几点钟”无关。٠Earth spins west to east, so different longitudes see the Sun at different times—about 1 hour per 15°. Latitude is north–south and unrelated to clock time.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�11d0dcd11f17�body��/岩石循环描述岩石在地球内部与外部之间不断转化的过程：岩浆冷却成火成岩，火成岩经风化侵蚀变为碎屑并沉积成沉积岩，二者在高温高压下变质为变质岩，变质岩再熔融回到岩浆。它把板块运动、风化和火山等过程连成一体。�]The rock cycle describes how rocks are continually transformed between Earth's interior and surface: magma cools to igneous rock, which weathers and erodes into sediments that form sedimentary rock, and both can be metamorphosed under heat and pressure, then melted back to magma. It links plate tectonics, weathering, and volcanism into one system.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�1224163183e9�body�ٴ永冻层是连续两年以上保持冻结、含冰的地下土层，主要分布于高纬度和高海拔地区。气候变暖使它解冻，会释放甲烷并造成地面塌陷。��Permafrost is ground that stays frozen with ice for two or more consecutive years, mainly in high latitudes and altitudes. Warming thaws it, releasing methane and causing the ground to collapse.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�1359ffeefc08�body�ٜ台风眼是风暴中心下沉气流的区域，周围狂风暴雨绕圈跑，唯独中间空气下沉、云散风小，像风暴里的“安静小屋”。�wThe eye is the center where air sinks; the violent winds rotate around it, leaving the middle strangely calm and clear.�ans��src��W伊曼纽尔《热带气旋》，《地球与行星科学年度评论》第31卷，2003�ZEmanuel, K.A. (2003), Tropical cyclones, Annual Review of Earth and Planetary Sciences, 31��id�1426d41dc480�body���含水层是能储存并传导地下水的岩层或土层。孔隙含水层靠砂砾等颗粒间的孔隙储水（如河流沉积），裂隙含水层则依赖岩石中的裂隙与溶孔（如石灰岩、火成岩），后者非均质性更强。�An aquifer is a rock or soil layer that stores and transmits groundwater. Porous aquifers rely on spaces between grains like sand and gravel, while fractured aquifers depend on cracks and cavities in rock such as limestone or igneous rock, the latter being far more heterogeneous.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�14b6bc152584�body���河流在平缓地带侧蚀加强，凹岸冲刷、凸岸堆积，使河道逐渐弯成蛇曲（meander）。当洪水切穿两个相邻河弯的颈部，河流改走直道，被遗弃的旧河弯便封闭成新月形的牛轭湖。�@On flat terrain a river erodes more on its sides, cutting into outer banks and depositing on inner ones, so the channel gradually bends into snake-like meanders. When a flood cuts across the narrow neck between two bends, the river takes a shortcut and the abandoned loop is sealed off into a crescent-shaped oxbow lake.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�1522acf67a27�body��f鲸鱼尸体沉到海底，成为深海生物数年的食物与栖息地，是独特的生态系统。�UA dead whale sinking to the seabed feeds deep-sea life for years, a unique ecosystem.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�161c52b2654b�body��y相对湿度是空气里实际水汽量占同温度下最多能容纳水汽量的百分比，100%就是饱和要凝结。ٝRelative humidity is the percent of water vapor present versus the maximum at that temperature; 100% means the air is saturated and vapor begins to condense.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�16aa4a503b63�body��\大洋板块比下面软流层的岩石更冷、更重、密度更大，于是会在海沟处像传送带一样弯折下沉进入地幔。俯冲板片在深处释放水分并诱发熔融，岩浆上升形成岛弧火山链，同时板片间的摩擦会引发频繁地震。著名的环太平洋火山地震带正是众多俯冲带拼接而成的。��Oceanic plates are colder, denser, and heavier than the asthenosphere below, so they bend and sink into the mantle at trenches like a conveyor belt. As the slab descends it releases water, triggering melting that feeds island-arc volcano chains, while friction between plates generates frequent earthquakes. The famous Pacific Ring of Fire is exactly a chain of such subduction zones.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�16cd478a1110�body�ٮ常用摩氏硬度计，把矿物按能否互相划伤分为1到10级，滑石最软为1，金刚石最硬为10。它反映的是相对抗划伤能力，而非绝对硬度。ٶThe Mohs scale ranks minerals from 1 to 10 by which can scratch which; talc is softest at 1 and diamond hardest at 10. It reflects relative scratch resistance, not absolute hardness.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�193849e67c5d�body���当曲流颈部被洪水冲决或渐进颈缩使河道直接连通，便发生截弯取直。旧河道废弃成牛轭湖，主河流程缩短、坡降变陡，下游输沙与侵蚀格局随之改变。��When a meander neck is breached by flood or narrows until the channel reconnects directly, a cutoff occurs. The abandoned loop becomes an oxbow lake, the main channel shortens and steepens, and downstream sediment and erosion patterns shift.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�194f8604218b�body��f河流入海处淡水咸水交汇混合，泥沙淤积、养分丰富，是许多生物的育儿场。�UWhere a river meets the sea, fresh and salt water mix, making a nursery rich in life.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�19736874cf70�body��{地下气体和泥浆在压力作用下沿通道涌出地表，堆成锥形泥丘，常出现在油气或俯冲带地区。�oPressurized gas and mud rise along channels and pile into muddy cones, common in oil-gas or subduction regions.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�19b4a820aa35�body���岩浆在地下缓慢冷却形成颗粒较粗的侵入型（深成）火成岩如花岗岩；喷出地表快速冷却则形成颗粒细甚至玻璃质的喷出型（火山）火成岩如玄武岩。冷却速度决定了晶体大小。��Magma that cools slowly underground forms coarse-grained intrusive (plutonic) rocks like granite; lava that cools quickly at the surface forms fine-grained or glassy extrusive (volcanic) rocks like basalt. Cooling rate sets crystal size.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�1a6a79e51e44�body�ف汛期到来前先腾出库容，洪水来时把一部分水拦在库里、慢慢放，削减下游洪峰，保护两岸城乡。ٯBefore the flood season the reservoir empties space; when floods come it holds back part of the water and releases it slowly, cutting the downstream peak and protecting towns.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�1aa6b464f878�body��全新世是地质年代表中当前的世，属于第四纪，始于最后一次大冰期结束、气候转暖之时。按国际地层委员会界定，它大约始于约1.17万年前，并延续至今；其后人类活动显著的“人类世”提案尚未被正式采纳。�1The Holocene is the current epoch in the geologic time scale, part of the Quaternary, beginning as the last major ice age ended and climate warmed. As defined by the ICS, it began about 11,700 years ago and continues to the present; the proposed 'Anthropocene' following it has not been formally ratified.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�1aa926576279�body��q盐度是每千克海水中溶解盐的克数，平均约35克，蒸发强或降水多的海区盐度会变化。�nSalinity is grams of dissolved salt per kg of seawater, averaging about 35, varying with evaporation and rain.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�1b33d09a7770�body���地震仪用悬挂的重锤配合固定基座，地面震动时基座随动而重锤因惯性基本不动，二者相对位移被记录下来形成地震波曲线。多个台站联合就能反推震源位置与震级。��A seismograph suspends a mass above a fixed base; when the ground shakes, the base moves but the mass tends to stay put by inertia, and their relative motion is recorded as a wave trace. Networks of stations then locate the source and estimate magnitude.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�1c71879ccaf6�body���生物土壤结皮是由苔藓、地衣与蓝藻等形成的地表覆盖，能固沙并减少风蚀。过度放牧、踩踏与车辆碾压会破坏结皮，使下层疏松粉尘直接暴露，起沙阈值降低，沙尘释放随之大幅上升。�Biological soil crusts are surface covers of mosses, lichens, and cyanobacteria that stabilize sand and reduce wind erosion. Overgrazing, trampling, and vehicle traffic destroy them, exposing loose dust and lowering the threshold for entrainment, so dust emission rises sharply.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�1e2d24bea12f�body�ٴ沙漠多出现在副热带高压带（干燥少雨）或山脉背风面（雨影效应）等蒸发远大于降水的地区。它们并非都炎热，也有寒冷的极地沙漠。��Deserts form where evaporation far exceeds rainfall, such as under subtropical high pressure or on the dry lee side of mountains (rain shadow). Not all are hot; there are also cold polar deserts.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�1f4315313536�body�ل增加绿地和水体、推广高反射屋面与透水铺装、预留通风廊道，都能降低市区温度、改善人居环境。هMore greenery and water, reflective roofs, permeable pavements and ventilation corridors all cool cities and improve living conditions.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�207eaa17bac9�body���显生宙从约5.4亿年前至今，分为古生代、中生代和新生代。古生代鱼类与早期陆地植物繁盛，中生代是恐龙时代，新生代则是哺乳动物和人类的时代。��The Phanerozoic, from about 540 million years ago to today, splits into the Paleozoic, Mesozoic, and Cenozoic eras. Fish and early land plants rose in the Paleozoic, dinosaurs ruled the Mesozoic, and mammals and humans rose in the Cenozoic.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�21507f6c4f9f�body��8圣安德烈斯断层是太平洋板块与北美板块之间的转换边界，两盘水平错动而不新生或消减地壳。由于断层带并非完美平直，应力在弯曲处长期积累，一旦超过摩擦强度便突然释放引发地震。华莱士等人对该断层的滑动历史做了系统编录。�iThe San Andreas Fault is a transform boundary between the Pacific and North American plates, where blocks slide past each other without creating or destroying crust. Because the fault is not perfectly straight, stress builds up at bends and releases suddenly as earthquakes when friction is exceeded. Wallace and colleagues cataloged its slip history in detail.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�218d39de64d8�body���沙丘形态取决于风向稳定性、风速、沙源供给与植被覆盖：单向风形成新月形沙丘，多向风易成星状沙丘，植被固定则发育抛物线沙丘。沙丘还会随风力缓慢迁移。�Dune form depends on wind-direction consistency, wind speed, sand supply, and vegetation: unidirectional winds build crescent barchans, variable winds yield star dunes, and vegetated settings produce parabolic dunes. Dunes also migrate slowly with the wind.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�22b6b9f27b2b�body���海冰是海面直接冻结的浮冰，冰架是连在陆地冰盖、伸入海中的浮冰平台，冰盖则是覆盖大陆的巨厚冰体。前两者漂浮不直接影响海平面，冰盖融化则会抬升海平面。�Sea ice is frozen ocean surface that floats, an ice shelf is a floating platform of ice attached to and fed by a land ice sheet, and an ice sheet is a vast thick ice mass over a continent. The first two float and don't directly raise sea level; melting ice sheets does.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�22d7d3f77507�body���搬运能力指河流能够搬运的泥沙粒径与总量。经典水力学经验表明，推移质输运率约与流速的 6 次方成正比，因此流速稍有增加，河流搬运沙石的能力便急剧上升，洪水期输沙量由此剧增。�JTransporting capacity is the size and total mass of sediment a river can carry. Classic hydraulic experience holds that bedload transport scales with roughly the sixth power of flow velocity, so even a modest speed increase sharply raises the river's ability to move sand and gravel, which is why flood-stage sediment loads surge.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�22f38cf6caa7�body��l平流层中的臭氧能吸收大部分有害紫外线，保护地表生物免受晒伤和癌变等伤害。�Ozone in the stratosphere absorbs most harmful ultraviolet rays, protecting surface life from sunburn, cancer and other damage.�ans��src��>盛裴轩 等,《大气物理学》,北京大学出版社,2003�HSheng Peixuan et al., Atmospheric Physics, Peking University Press, 2003��id�2374159f35fb�body���滑坡是斜坡上的岩土体在重力作用下失稳、整体向下滑动的现象。常见触发因素包括持续强降雨使土体饱和、地震震动、火山活动、人类削坡或开挖，以及河道或波浪的侵蚀掏空坡脚。�#A landslide is the downslope movement of rock or soil under gravity when a slope becomes unstable. Common triggers include prolonged heavy rain that saturates the ground, earthquake shaking, volcanic activity, human cutting or excavation of slopes, and erosion at the toe by rivers or waves.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�2407af696694�body��c生物活着时不断从大气吸收碳-14，死后吸收停止，体内碳-14就按5730年的半衰期慢慢衰变成氮-14。测出剩余碳-14的比例，就能算出生物的死亡时间。因为碳-14含量每五千多年就减半，一般只能可靠测定约5万年以内的有机样品，更老的样品要改用钾-氩或铀-铅等其他方法。��While alive, organisms continually take up carbon-14 from the atmosphere; at death uptake stops and the isotope decays to nitrogen-14 with a half-life of 5,730 years. Measuring the remaining fraction tells when the organism died. Because the amount halves every few thousand years, the method is reliable only for organic samples younger than about 50,000 years; older materials require other techniques such as potassium-argon or uranium-lead dating.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�2503a5de988d�body��地幔因核幔边界受热而升温上浮、在岩石圈下方冷却下沉，形成热对流环，这种黏性流动对岩石圈板块施加拖曳与推动。板块在洋中脊张裂、在海沟俯冲下沉，其运动速率（每年数厘米）与地幔对流模式高度相关。�SThe mantle warms near the core-mantle boundary, rises, cools beneath the lithosphere, and sinks, forming thermal convection cells whose viscous drag both pulls and pushes the overlying tectonic plates. Plates diverge at mid-ocean ridges and subduct at trenches at rates of a few centimeters per year, closely tracking mantle flow patterns.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�25b673352c2b�body���不一定。断层是岩石的破裂面，只有当两侧长期黏滞闭锁、应力积累到突然滑动才会发震（地震断层）。有些断层以缓慢无震滑动（蠕滑）方式释放应力，较少引发强震。��Not always. A fault is a fracture plane; earthquakes occur only when sides lock and stored stress slips suddenly (seismic fault). Some faults release stress by slow aseismic creep, causing fewer strong quakes.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�261852203fcd�body�ٓ在高温高压或岩浆热液环境中，特定元素结晶形成美丽坚硬的矿物，如刚玉（红蓝宝石）、绿柱石（祖母绿）。٫Under high temperature and pressure or from magmatic fluids, specific elements crystallize into beautiful hard minerals like corundum (ruby, sapphire) and beryl (emerald).�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�2697b66a4938�body�٪地球46亿年历史分为冥古宙、太古宙、元古宙和显生宙四个宙。前三个宙统称前寒武纪，显生宙则是多细胞生命大量出现的时期。��Earth's 4.6-billion-year history is divided into four eons: Hadean, Archean, Proterozoic, and Phanerozoic. The first three are called the Precambrian, while the Phanerozoic is when abundant multicellular life appeared.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�272e4214d455�body��e丹麦解剖学家斯丹诺提出地层层序律：在未受扰动的地层序列中，下面的岩层总是比上面的先沉积、更老。他还补充了原始水平原理——沉积层最初是水平的，如今倾斜或褶皱说明后来发生了构造变动。地层层序律配合化石演替规律，就建立了相对地质年代的基本框架。��Danish anatomist Nicolas Steno proposed the law of superposition: in an undisturbed sequence, a lower layer was deposited before and is older than the one above it. He also added the principle of original horizontality—sediments settle in horizontal beds, so tilted or folded strata record later deformation. Superposition, combined with the succession of fossils, gives geologists the basic framework of relative geologic age.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�277ba172d6b6�body��C约45亿年前，一颗火星大小的天体（被称为“忒伊亚”）以斜角撞击年轻的原始地球，撞击溅射出的物质在绕地轨道上聚集成月球。这一假说能解释月球缺铁、地球与月球的氧同位素组成一致以及月球轨道倾斜等特征，是目前被广泛接受的理论。�gAbout 4.5 billion years ago, a Mars-sized body (called Theia) struck the young proto-Earth at an oblique angle; debris ejected by the impact aggregated in orbit to form the Moon. The hypothesis explains the Moon's iron depletion, the identical oxygen-isotope composition of Earth and the Moon, and the Moon's inclined orbit, and is the widely accepted theory.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�27d569856aca�body��_摩氏硬度表把矿物按相互刻划的能力分成1到10级：滑石是1，金刚石是10。硬度高的矿物能在硬度低的矿物表面留下划痕，反之则不能，差别来自矿物晶体内部化学键的强弱。野外鉴别时常用指甲（约2.5）、铜币（约3.5）和小刀（约5.5）快速测定未知矿物的硬度范围。��The Mohs scale ranks minerals by their ability to scratch one another, from talc at 1 to diamond at 10. A harder mineral scratches a softer one but not the reverse, and the difference reflects the strength of bonds inside each crystal. In the field, common tools such as a fingernail (about 2.5), a copper coin (about 3.5), and a knife blade (about 5.5) quickly bracket an unknown mineral's hardness.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�29773eb9d7f7�body��r极地附近夏季短凉、冬季漫长严寒，地下是冻土，只长低矮苔藓地衣，树木难以生存。�ZNear the poles summers are brief and cold; frozen ground limits plants to moss and lichen.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�2aa1918f4d31�body��科里奥利效应源于地球自转：在旋转的地球上，运动的物体（如风、洋流）在北半球向右偏、南半球向左偏。它使全球风带和洋流呈旋转状分布，也是热带气旋旋转方向（北半球逆时针、南半球顺时针）的原因。�KThe Coriolis effect arises from Earth's rotation: moving objects such as winds and currents are deflected to the right in the Northern Hemisphere and to the left in the Southern Hemisphere. It shapes global wind belts and ocean gyres and determines the spin direction of tropical cyclones (counterclockwise north, clockwise south).�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�2bb8ed3f2074�body���转换型边界是两块板块水平错动、相互滑过的边界，地壳既不生成也不消亡。最著名的例子是美国加州的圣安德烈亚斯断层，容易积累应力并引发地震。��A transform boundary is where two plates slide horizontally past each other, so crust is neither created nor destroyed. The best-known example is California's San Andreas Fault, where stored stress regularly causes earthquakes.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�2d0d5760b7b1�body��3主要有三类：盾状火山（如夏威夷，坡度缓、熔岩流动性强、多为宁静喷发）、成层火山/层状火山（如富士山、圣海伦斯，坡度陡、爆发性强）和火山渣锥（规模小、由喷发的碎屑堆积而成）。不同类型取决于岩浆成分与喷发方式。�/The three main types are shield volcanoes (e.g., Hawaii—broad, gentle slopes, fluid lava, effusive eruptions), composite/stratovolcanoes (e.g., Fuji, Mount St. Helens—steep, explosive), and cinder cones (small, built from ejected fragments). The type depends on magma composition and eruptive style.�ans��src��<Press & Siever,《Understanding Earth》W. H. Freeman 多版�LF. Press and R. Siever, Understanding Earth, W. H. Freeman, various editions��id�30517ceba102�body��%含水层是能储存并传导地下水的多孔岩石或砂砾层，像天然“地下水库”。当地表水（雨水、河水）通过入渗缓慢渗入地下、到达饱和带时，就完成了“补给”（recharge）。过度抽取或补给减少会使含水层枯竭、地面沉降。�<An aquifer is a porous rock or gravel layer that stores and transmits groundwater, acting like a natural underground reservoir. When surface water (rain or rivers) infiltrates downward and reaches the saturated zone, it is 'recharged.' Over-pumping or reduced recharge can deplete aquifers and cause land subsidence.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�325c04d63451�body���喷发将二氧化硫送入平流层形成硫酸盐气溶胶，反射太阳辐射使地表降温约0.1至0.5℃，并可能扰动季风与降水。1991年皮纳图博火山即造成全球平均气温短暂下降约0.5℃。�Eruptions inject sulfur dioxide into the stratosphere, forming sulfate aerosols that reflect sunlight and cool the surface by about 0.1 to 0.5°C while perturbing monsoons and rainfall. The 1991 Pinatubo eruption briefly lowered global mean temperature by about 0.5°C.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�3362447160ab�body��1依靠地震层析成像：地震波在不同岩石中的传播速度不同，全球台网记录的海量地震波到时数据经反演后，可像医学CT一样重建地球内部的速度异常图像。低速异常通常对应较热或富含流体的区域，高速异常对应较冷或致密的区域。�cThrough seismic tomography: seismic waves travel at different speeds through different materials, and inverting the millions of arrival-time records from the global seismograph network reconstructs velocity-anomaly images of the interior, like a medical CT scan. Slow anomalies mark hotter or fluid-rich regions; fast anomalies mark colder or denser ones.�ans��src�� 《普通地质学》(舒良树)�General Geology (Shu Liangshu)��id�33ae95f8ef55�body�ٺ近岸有河流直送大量泥沙、生物碎屑也多，堆积快；深海远离陆源，主要靠极细的悬浮尘和浮游生物残骸缓缓飘落，所以每千年只积几厘米。��Nearshore areas get direct river mud and lots of debris, so they build fast; the deep sea is far from land sources and relies on fine dust and plankton remains drifting down, accumulating only centimeters per millennium.�ans��src��cRachel Carson,《The Sea Around Us》Oxford University Press,1951;中译《环绕我们的海洋》�HR. Carson, The Sea Around Us, Oxford University Press, 1951; Chinese ed.��id�33fb4e7a3889�body��o冰岛位于大西洋中脊与地幔热点的叠加处，地壳薄、岩浆活动强烈，因而火山密集。نIceland sits where the Mid-Atlantic Ridge meets a mantle hotspot, with thin crust and intense magmatism, so volcanoes are dense there.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�364a8c0e25c0�body�ٻ地球最早期生命迹象可追溯到约35亿至38亿年前，以微生物和叠层石等形式存在。它们出现于大气富含二氧化碳、尚无游离氧的太古宙海洋中。��The earliest signs of life on Earth date to roughly 3.5 to 3.8 billion years ago, as microbes and stromatolites. They arose in Archean oceans rich in carbon dioxide but with little free oxygen.�ans��src��8Wicander & Monroe,《Historical Geology》Cengage 多版�TR. Wicander and J. S. Monroe, Historical Geology, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�382d3f0476eb�body���因为它们生存时限短、地理分布广、数量丰富且特征明显，能精确指示地层时代。三叶虫可限定寒武纪至二叠纪，菊石可限定泥盆纪至白垩纪末期，地质学家据此划分并对比地层。�EBecause they have short stratigraphic ranges, wide geographic distribution, abundance, and distinctive morphology, making them precise age indicators. Trilobites constrain the Cambrian through the Permian, and ammonites the Devonian through the end of the Cretaceous, so geologists use them to subdivide and correlate strata.�ans��src�� 《普通地质学》(舒良树)�General Geology (Shu Liangshu)��id�3cdcd00063d7�body�و20 世纪以来全球平均海平面已上升约 20 多厘米，且近几十年的速度明显加快，目前约每年 3 到 4 毫米。ٍSince 1900 the global mean sea level has risen about 20-plus centimeters, and the rate has accelerated recently to roughly 3–4 mm per year.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�3d745fa61180�body�ف沿海大量抽淡水会打破淡水与海水的平衡，咸水便向内陆地下含水层推进，使井水变咸无法饮用。ـHeavy coastal pumping upsets the fresh-salt water balance, letting seawater push into aquifers so wells turn salty and unusable.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�3dbd70894f1c�body��>内核是固态的铁镍合金，外核是液态铁。主要证据：S波能穿过内核却无法穿过外核，而S波不能在液体中传播，说明外核为液态；P波穿过内核的传播时间随路径方向变化（各向异性），且地球自转的长周期变化与内核和地幔的差速旋转有关。��The inner core is solid iron–nickel, the outer core liquid iron. Key evidence: S waves pass through the inner core but not the outer core—S waves cannot travel through liquids, so the outer core must be liquid; P-wave travel times through the inner core vary with path direction (anisotropy), and long-term changes in Earth's rotation relate to differential rotation between the inner core and the mantle.�ans��src�� 《普通地质学》(舒良树)�General Geology (Shu Liangshu)��id�3e640af4ec1e�body�ٟ火山把大量硫酸盐气溶胶送入高空，这些微粒会反射阳光，使到达地面的太阳辐射减少，从而让全球平均温度暂时降低。ٺEruptions inject sulfate aerosols high into the atmosphere; these particles reflect sunlight, reducing solar radiation at the surface and temporarily lowering global average temperature.�ans��src��>盛裴轩 等,《大气物理学》,北京大学出版社,2003�HSheng Peixuan et al., Atmospheric Physics, Peking University Press, 2003��id�3eaaaeb0c720�body�ٷ磁层是地球磁场在太阳风作用下围成的保护性空间区域，像盾牌一样偏转带电粒子。它保护大气和生命免受太阳风与宇宙射线的直接侵袭。��The magnetosphere is the protective region shaped by Earth's magnetic field against the solar wind, deflecting charged particles like a shield. It protects the atmosphere and life from direct solar and cosmic radiation.�ans��src��>盛裴轩 等,《大气物理学》,北京大学出版社,2003�HSheng Peixuan et al., Atmospheric Physics, Peking University Press, 2003��id�3ef35862f9c3�body��{二者主要成分都是碳，但钻石中碳原子规则排列、极硬且透明，煤是疏松含杂质的碳集合体。وBoth are mainly carbon, but in diamond the atoms are neatly arranged making it hard and clear, while coal is a loose impure carbon mass.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�3f0c1c1ea299�body���要够潮湿的空气、够不稳定的大气（下面热上面冷，容易上冲），以及能把空气抬起来触发对流的力量（如地形或锋面），三者齐了就容易打雷下雨。ٶIt needs moist air, an unstable atmosphere (warm below, cold above, so air rushes up), and a lift to trigger convection (like terrain or a front); with all three, thunderstorms form.�ans��src��D卢特根斯、塔巴克《大气：科学导论》，Pearson，2011�\Lutgens, F.K. & Tarbuck, E.J., The Atmosphere: An Introduction to Meteorology, Pearson, 2011��id�3f67c479e170�body�ٺ莫氏硬度计用1到10的等级表示矿物相互刻划的相对硬度，滑石最软为1，金刚石最硬为10。它便于野外粗略鉴别矿物，但不是线性的绝对硬度。��The Mohs scale ranks minerals from 1 to 10 by their relative resistance to scratching, with talc softest at 1 and diamond hardest at 10. It helps rough field identification but is not a linear measure of absolute hardness.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�3fdeecaac167�body��C常见分层为：O层（枯枝落叶层）、A层（富含腐殖质、颜色深的淋溶层）、E层（浅色淋溶层，矿物被淋失）、B层（淀积层，黏粒和铁铝氧化物沉积）和C层（风化母质层）。下渗水把可溶物从上部带走并在下部淀积，形成淋溶—淀积的对应关系。�^Typical horizons are: O (litter layer), A (dark, humus-rich eluvial zone), E (light eluvial zone where minerals have been leached), B (illuvial zone where clay and iron/aluminum oxides accumulate), and C (weathered parent material). Percolating water removes soluble material from above and deposits it below, creating the eluvial–illuvial pairing.�ans��src�� 《普通地质学》(舒良树)�General Geology (Shu Liangshu)��id�404f9f4e4a10�body�٢尽快进坚固建筑的底层、地下室或没有窗户的内侧房间，用枕头护头；在户外则躲到低洼处趴下。千万别待在车里或桥下。پGet to the lowest floor or basement of a solid building, or an inner windowless room, protecting your head with a pillow; outdoors, lie in a low ditch. Never stay in a car or under a bridge.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�40b90e007e43�body���雨岛效应指城市及其下风向降水偏多的现象。城市粗糙表面增强湍流与上升运动、热岛提供不稳定能量、气溶胶充当凝结核，均可促进对流性降水，使城区及下风向雨量略增。�The rain-island effect is when cities and their downwind areas get more rainfall. Rough urban surfaces enhance turbulence and uplift, the heat island adds instability, and aerosols act as nuclei—all promoting convective precipitation and slightly raising city and downwind totals.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�41a70bc9118b�body��o冰川搬运的碎石泥土在融化时堆积下来，形成垄状的冰碛，记录着冰川曾到的位置。�WGlaciers drop carried debris as ridges called moraines, marking where ice once reached.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�41e648f2c59c�body��h潮汐主要由月球引力造成，太阳也贡献一部分。农历初一和十五，太阳、月球与地球大致排成一线，太阳和月球的引力叠加，涨落幅度最大，叫大潮。上弦月和下弦月时，太阳与月球的方向互相垂直，两个引力部分抵消，潮差最小，叫小潮。潮差大小还受海岸形状的影响。��Tides are driven mainly by the Moon's gravity, with the Sun adding a smaller contribution. Around the new and full moon the Sun, Moon, and Earth line up, so the two pulls combine into the largest tides, called spring tides. At the first and third quarters the Sun and Moon act at right angles and partly cancel, producing the smallest tides, called neap tides. Coastal shape also strongly affects how large the range becomes.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�427b3ab3e6eb�body�ٽ宝石是因其美观、稀有和耐久而被用来装饰的矿物或岩石，如钻石、红宝石和祖母绿。它们的价值取决于颜色、净度、切工和克拉重量等因素。ټGemstones are minerals or rocks prized for beauty, rarity, and durability in ornament, such as diamonds, rubies, and emeralds. Their value depends on color, clarity, cut, and carat weight.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�4305fe2f3440�body�٥溶洞是地下水长期溶蚀可溶性岩石（如石灰岩）形成的地下空洞，常伴生钟乳石和石笋。它们是喀斯特地貌的重要组成部分。��A solution cave is an underground void hollowed out by groundwater dissolving soluble rock like limestone, often bearing stalactites and stalagmites. Such caves are a key part of karst terrain.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�437942002d14�body��o河流弯曲过度，洪水冲断颈部取直，被抛弃的旧河道围成新月形死水湖，即牛轭湖。�`A river cuts off a tight meander during flood; the abandoned loop becomes a crescent oxbow lake.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�44f337c294d7�body���海水沿洋中脊裂隙下渗，被下方岩浆加热到几百度，成为高温热液并溶解大量硫和金属离子，再从海底喷出遇冷海水，金属硫化物迅速沉淀，堆成"黑烟囱"。这类热液系统形成的块状硫化物矿床富含铜、锌、金、银等，是重要的潜在矿产来源。陆地上许多层状金属矿也记载着古代海底热液活动的历史。�Seawater seeps down through fissures at mid-ocean ridges, is heated to hundreds of degrees by magma below, and dissolves sulfur and metal ions into a hot hydrothermal fluid. When this fluid vents into cold seawater, metal sulfides precipitate instantly and build black-smoker chimneys. Massive sulfide deposits created by these systems are rich in copper, zinc, gold, and silver and are an important potential mineral resource; many layered metal ores on land likewise record ancient seafloor hydrothermal activity.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�46a650ba6d8d�body��_夏季太阳直射点北移，陆地比海洋升温快、形成热低压，海上的暖湿气流被源源不断吸进内陆，这就是夏季风。湿润气流遇地形抬升和辐合上升，凝结成大范围降水，雨带随季风推进。青藏高原的加热作用还会加强南亚与东亚季风，使亚洲成为全球季风最强的区域。��In summer the sun moves north, land heats faster than the ocean and develops a thermal low, and warm moist maritime air is drawn inland continuously—the summer monsoon. The humid flow is lifted by terrain and convergence, condensing into broad rainfall as the rain belt advances with the monsoon. Heating from the Tibetan Plateau further strengthens the South and East Asian monsoons, making Asia the strongest monsoon region on Earth.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�4728ffb94c42�body���冰架是陆地冰盖向海洋延伸、漂浮在海上的厚冰体。它已浮于海水之上，融化不直接影响海平面；但其阻拦作用减缓了后方陆地冰流入海，一旦崩解，内陆冰流失加速，反而推高海平面。�%An ice shelf is a thick platform of glacial ice extending from the land and floating on the sea. Because it already displaces seawater, its melt doesn't directly raise sea level, but by buttressing land ice it slows its flow; once it collapses, inland ice loss accelerates and sea level rises.�ans��src��8Wicander & Monroe,《Historical Geology》Cengage 多版�TR. Wicander and J. S. Monroe, Historical Geology, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�48a0d03c519e�body���地面臭氧并非直接排放，而是氮氧化物与挥发性有机物在阳光照射下发生光化学反应二次生成，常见于夏季晴热、车流与工业排放高的城市。它是一种危害呼吸系统的关键空气污染物。�Ground-level ozone is not emitted directly; it forms secondarily when nitrogen oxides and volatile organic compounds undergo sunlight-driven photochemistry, common on hot, sunny days in cities with heavy traffic and industry. It is a key air pollutant harmful to the respiratory system.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�4af73e163e23�body�م甲烷吸收红外线的能力远强于二氧化碳，虽寿命较短，但百年尺度增温潜势约为二氧化碳的28到34倍。وMethane traps far more infrared per molecule than CO2; short-lived but its century-scale warming potential is about 28–34 times CO2's.�ans��src��>盛裴轩 等,《大气物理学》,北京大学出版社,2003�HSheng Peixuan et al., Atmospheric Physics, Peking University Press, 2003��id�4ce4dc7701dd�body���地幔和俯冲板块携带的结合水在高温低压下从岩浆中脱出，成为最主要挥发分。因此火山喷出气体以水蒸气为主，其次才是二氧化碳和硫化合物。��Water bound in the mantle and subducting slabs is released from magma at high temperature and low pressure, becoming the dominant volatile. Volcanic gas is thus mostly water vapor, then CO2 and sulfur compounds.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�4d67fb68217a�body��河口接收河流输入的陆源有机碳并支持本地高生产力，部分碳埋入沉积物成为“汇”；但同时水体呼吸与细菌分解又向大气释放 CO₂ 与 CH₄，使其成为“源”。净通量取决于径流、潮汐混合与初级生产力的平衡。�#Estuaries receive terrestrial organic carbon and support local productivity, burying some in sediments as a sink, while respiration and bacterial decay release CO₂ and CH₄ to the atmosphere as a source. The net flux depends on the balance of runoff, tidal mixing, and primary production.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�4d9d25e81dd5�body��c河漫滩是河流两侧洪水期才会淹到的平坦低地，沉积肥沃，宜农但也易涝。�VA floodplain is the flat land beside a river flooded at high water; fertile but risky.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�4e3afa43d641�body��r高原空气稀薄、云和水汽少，对紫外线的吸收和散射弱，所以地面接收的紫外线更强。�Thin air and little cloud or vapor on plateaus weakly absorb and scatter UV, so the ground receives stronger ultraviolet light.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�4e5626cf9fc9�body��流域是一片所有降水都顺着地势汇流到同一条河流（或湖泊、河口）及其支流的陆地范围，由分水岭（山脊线）界定边界。流域是自然水文管理的基本单元，上游的活动会直接影响下游的水质与水量。�'A watershed is the area of land where all precipitation drains to a common river (or lake/estuary) and its tributaries, bounded by a divide such as a ridge line. It is the basic unit of natural hydrologic management, and activities upstream directly affect water quality and quantity downstream.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�4ee39fd0ecb8�body�ٗ等高线往高处凸出的“V”字通常代表山谷（河流常沿此流）；若往低处凸出，则多是山脊。看凸向就能判断地形。٤A “V” pointing to higher ground usually marks a valley (where a stream often runs); a “V” pointing downhill marks a ridge. The direction tells the landform.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�4fb067ae2196�body���约5.4亿年前的寒武纪初期，多细胞动物门类在相对短时间内大量出现，化石记录中突然丰富的硬壳和复杂身体结构即所谓大爆发，标志着显生宙的开始。��In the early Cambrian about 540 million years ago, multicellular animal groups appeared in great numbers over a relatively short time; the sudden abundance of hard shells and complex body plans in the fossil record marks the start of the Phanerozoic Eon.�ans��src��8Wicander & Monroe,《Historical Geology》Cengage 多版�TR. Wicander and J. S. Monroe, Historical Geology, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�5022e75a2110�body��#岩石圈是刚性、能传递弹性波的低温外层，软流圈则是部分熔融、力学强度低、可发生缓慢黏性流动的塑性层。两者边界主要由温度达到部分熔融阈值和岩石流变性质突变决定，深度通常在大陆约100至200公里、大洋更浅。�yThe lithosphere is the rigid, cool outer shell that transmits elastic seismic waves, whereas the asthenosphere is a partially molten, mechanically weak layer that flows viscously over long times. Their boundary is mainly defined by the onset of partial melting and a sharp change in rock rheology, typically at 100 to 200 km depth beneath continents and shallower under oceans.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�502e694fc5c1�body��b当地下水被夹在不透水的上下两层之间的承压含水层里，含水层像一根被堵住两端的水管。若补给区地势较高，水压会把水抬到高于含水层顶部的位置；打井穿透上部隔水层后，水就沿井管自动涌出甚至喷成喷泉。这类井叫自流井，能自流的关键是承压水头高于井口。��When groundwater is trapped between two impermeable layers in a confined aquifer, the layer behaves like a sealed pipe. If the recharge area sits at higher elevation, pressure lifts the water above the top of the aquifer; once a well pierces the upper seal, water rises on its own and may even spray like a fountain. Such artesian wells flow because the pressure head stands higher than the well opening.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�50bd00cb9cf4�body���低黏度、气体易逸出的岩浆形成溢流式喷发，熔岩平静流出（如夏威夷）；高黏度、富气体的岩浆则猛烈爆破，抛射火山灰与碎屑（如圣海伦斯）。岩浆成分与含气量决定喷发方式。�
Low-viscosity magma that releases gas easily produces effusive eruptions where lava flows quietly, as in Hawaii; high-viscosity, gas-rich magma explodes violently, hurling ash and fragments, as at Mount St. Helens. Magma composition and gas content decide the style.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�50c29e0bfd9f�body��测高卫星向海面发射微波脉冲并测量往返时间，结合轨道与校正模型得到海面高度，精度可达厘米级。长期观测显示全球平均海平面以约3至4毫米/年的速率上升，主要由海水增温膨胀与冰川融化造成。�%Altimetry satellites emit microwave pulses to the sea surface and time the return, combining orbit and correction models to derive sea-surface height with centimeter precision. Long records show global mean sea level rising about 3 to 4 mm per year, mainly from thermal expansion and ice melt.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�51b8ed013cb1�body���在汇聚板块边界，密度较大的大洋岩石圈俯冲到另一板块之下，沿贝尼奥夫带沉入地幔；冷的板片下沉驱动地幔对流并引发深海沟、火山弧与强震。俯冲也是地幔物质和挥发分循环的关键通道。�7At convergent boundaries, the denser oceanic lithosphere dives beneath another plate along the Benioff zone into the mantle; the cold slab's sinking drives mantle flow and produces deep trenches, volcanic arcs, and large earthquakes. Subduction is also a key conduit for recycling mantle material and volatiles.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�522252d271a8�body��l印度板块持续向北挤压欧亚板块，使地壳缩短增厚，山脉以每年几毫米速度抬升。ٍThe Indian plate keeps pushing into the Eurasian plate, shortening and thickening the crust, lifting the range by a few millimeters per year.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�5226bbe572ad�body���海表水和空气交换，二氧化碳溶入后被浮游生物利用，死后遗体沉入深海，把碳锁在海底，这叫生物泵；整个过程把碳从大气搬到深海需要很久。��Surface water exchanges with the air; dissolved CO2 is used by plankton whose remains sink, locking carbon in the deep sea—the biological pump—which moves carbon from air to abyss over a long time.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�527df7bd438a�body�ٱ冰冻圈是地球表层所有以固态水存在的部分，包括冰川、冰盖、海冰、积雪和永冻层。它对全球能量平衡和海平面变化起着关键作用。ٻThe cryosphere is all the frozen water at Earth's surface—glaciers, ice sheets, sea ice, snow, and permafrost. It plays a central role in the global energy balance and sea-level change.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�5312fe452438�body���大洋环流涡是受风与地转偏向力驱动、在各大洋中形成的巨大环状洋流系统，全球约有五个。塑料垃圾在副热带涡中聚集，形成如「太平洋垃圾带」这样的漂浮废弃物集中区。��An ocean gyre is a large, circular current system driven by winds and the Coriolis effect, with about five across the global ocean. Plastic debris collects in subtropical gyres, forming concentrations like the Great Pacific Garbage Patch.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�5487dbaace88�body�ِ瀑布顶部多为坚硬岩石，下方软岩被水流掏蚀崩塌，崖壁因此一点点向河流源头方向后退，如尼亚加拉瀑布。يA waterfall's hard ledge sits above softer rock that erodes and collapses, so the cliff edge moves slowly upstream, as with Niagara Falls.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�548935b4fa66�body��岩石循环描述三类岩石在地球内外力作用下不断转化的过程：岩浆冷却成火成岩，风化堆积成沉积岩，高温高压下又可变成变质岩，再熔融回到岩浆。板块运动与地表侵蚀是推动这一循环的主要动力。�BThe rock cycle describes how the three rock types transform under Earth's internal and surface processes: magma cools into igneous rock, weathering and burial form sedimentary rock, and heat and pressure create metamorphic rock, which can melt back to magma. Plate tectonics and erosion are the main engines of this cycle.�ans��src��9Plummer 等《物理地质学》第16版（McGraw-Hill）�WPlummer, C.C., Carlson, D.H. & Hammersley, L., Physical Geology (16th ed., McGraw-Hill)��id�549fec587341�body��r石灰岩布满裂缝和溶洞，雨水很快漏到地下深处，地表存不住水，所以地上反而干旱。�dLimestone is full of cracks and caves, so rain quickly drains underground and the surface stays dry.�ans��src��B福特、威廉姆斯《岩溶水文与地貌学》，Wiley，2007�NFord, D.C. & Williams, P.W., Karst Hydrogeology and Geomorphology, Wiley, 2007��id�54b20fc055b6�body��$超级火山指喷发量极大（通常超过1000立方公里火山物质）、可形成巨大破火山口（caldera）的火山系统。黄石是活超级火山，最近一次形成现今破火山口的喷发约在64万年前，其喷发物曾覆盖北美大片地区并影响全球气候。�ZA supervolcano is a volcanic system capable of extraordinarily large eruptions (typically over 1,000 cubic km of material) that create huge calderas. Yellowstone is an active supervolcano whose most recent caldera-forming eruption occurred about 640,000 years ago and whose ejecta once blanketed much of North America and affected global climate.�ans��src��<Press & Siever,《Understanding Earth》W. H. Freeman 多版�LF. Press and R. Siever, Understanding Earth, W. H. Freeman, various editions��id�56ca28e7cf27�body���大西洋中脊是横贯大西洋底部、由板块张裂形成的海底山脉，是离散型边界的典型代表。新的洋壳在此不断生成，使大西洋以每年数厘米的速度加宽。��The Mid-Atlantic Ridge is a seafloor mountain chain running down the Atlantic along a divergent boundary where plates pull apart. New oceanic crust forms there, widening the Atlantic by a few centimeters each year.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�57d6565a88f5�body���沙漠粉尘含铁、磷等营养元素，跨洋沉降到贫营养海域后可促进浮游植物生长，如撒哈拉粉尘滋养了大西洋与亚马孙流域。这是陆地向海洋输送生命元素的重要通道。�␀Desert dust carries iron, phosphorus, and other nutrients; deposited across oceans into nutrient-poor waters it fuels phytoplankton growth, as Saharan dust nourishes the Atlantic and the Amazon. It is a key land-to-ocean conduit of life-essential elements.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�5a2cf259f018�body��含水层系统中的弱透水夹层（隔水层）在承压水头下降时缓慢排水、压缩，其释水与压密存在滞后，可在开采停止后延续数十年。这种“延迟沉降”使沉降不会随停采立即终止，给基础设施留下长期风险。�"Aquitards—low-permeability layers—drain and compact slowly as confined head drops, with a lag so their compaction can persist for decades after pumping stops. This delayed subsidence means sinking does not halt immediately when extraction ends, leaving long-term risk to infrastructure.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�5a85659806ed�body��)生物地球化学循环是元素在生物圈、岩石圈、水圈与大气圈间迁移转化的过程。碳与氮有显著的气态库（CO₂、N₂），而磷几乎没有气态阶段，主要在岩石—土壤—水体间循环，因此磷常成为淡水与近岸系统的限制性营养盐。�SBiogeochemical cycles are the pathways by which elements move among the biosphere, lithosphere, hydrosphere, and atmosphere. Carbon and nitrogen have major gaseous reservoirs (CO₂, N₂), whereas phosphorus has essentially no gaseous phase and cycles mainly through rock–soil–water, so it often limits freshwater and coastal systems.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�5b718a66d6d0�body��o洪水冲刷、泥沙淤积使河道摆动，或地壳抬升改变坡度，河流便会逐渐迁移或改道。لFloods and sediment build-up make channels shift, or crustal uplift changes the slope, so rivers gradually migrate or change course.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�5c6896b8951c�body��玄武岩由基性岩浆（如地幔部分熔融的产物）快速冷却形成，富镁铁矿物，因此颜色深；花岗岩由酸性岩浆缓慢冷却形成，富含石英和长石，因此颜色浅。岩浆的化学成分与冷却速度共同决定了矿物组合。�QBasalt forms from mafic magma (e.g. partial melting of the mantle) that cools quickly and is rich in iron- and magnesium-bearing minerals, giving a dark color; granite forms from felsic magma that cools slowly and is rich in quartz and feldspar, giving a light color. Both magma chemistry and cooling rate control the mineral assemblage.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�5c68aec2d3f6�body���厄尔尼诺期间赤道东太平洋海表异常增温，东西太平洋温差减小，信风减弱，暖池东移并抑制西太平洋降水、引发东太平洋上升流减弱。这通过大气遥相关影响全球天气与渔业。�During El Niño the equatorial eastern Pacific warms anomalously, the east-west temperature gradient shrinks, trade winds weaken, the warm pool shifts east, and upwelling off the eastern Pacific fades. Through atmospheric teleconnections this reshapes global weather and fisheries.�ans��src�ُTimmermann, A. 等，《El Niño–Southern Oscillation complexity》，Nature 第559卷535–545页，2018年，DOI: 10.1038/s41586-018-0252-6وTimmermann, A. et al., El Niño–Southern Oscillation complexity, Nature, vol. 559, pp. 535–545, 2018, DOI: 10.1038/s41586-018-0252-6��id�5d604422a839�body���麦加利烈度表用罗马数字I到XII表示地震在地表和人类感受上的破坏程度，依据房屋损毁、人群反应等实际现象评定。它与衡量能量的震级不同，同一地震在不同地点烈度不同。�The Mercalli scale uses Roman numerals I to XII to describe how strongly an earthquake is felt and how much damage it causes, based on observed effects like building damage and human reaction. Unlike magnitude, intensity varies by location for the same quake.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�5d7ff87cdab3�body��o多来自周围岩石风化剥蚀及干涸湖盆、古河流沉积物，经风长期搬运分选堆积而成。�xMostly from weathered rock and deposits of dried lakes or ancient rivers, transported and sorted by wind over long time.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�5f1bee717dd2�body���大洋环流是海水大规模、持续的水平流动，由风、海面温度和盐度差异共同驱动。湾流是一支把墨西哥湾温暖海水送往北大西洋的强流，显著温暖了西欧气候。�Ocean currents are large, persistent movements of seawater driven by wind, temperature, and salinity differences. The Gulf Stream is a strong current carrying warm water from the Gulf of Mexico into the North Atlantic, markedly warming Western Europe's climate.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�5f55577a6a7b�body�ٺ温暖湿润年份树木长得快，年轮较宽；干旱寒冷年份年轮窄。通过测量系列树木年轮宽度并交叉定年，可重建数百上千年的温度与降水变化。��In warm wet years trees grow faster and rings are wider; in dry cold years rings are narrow. Measuring and cross-dating ring widths reconstructs centuries to millennia of temperature and precipitation change.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�5fd96953d1e9�body���火山泥流是火山喷发或降雨触发、由火山灰与水混合而成的泥石流，可沿河谷高速流动数十公里。它流动性强、隐蔽突然，能掩埋城镇，历史上曾多次造成重大伤亡。��A lahar is a mudflow of volcanic ash mixed with water triggered by eruptions or rain, which can rush down valleys at high speed for tens of kilometers. Fast-moving and sudden, it can bury towns and has caused major loss of life historically.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�60e961f3bf6a�body��<热点是地幔柱把熔融物质从深部输送到岩石圈的近乎固定位置，板块在其上方移动时留下一串火山。夏威夷从西北端的古老死火山到东南端的活跃基拉韦厄，显示了板块向西北漂移的轨迹。摩根在1971年用热点理论统一解释了这类链状火山。�pA hotspot is a near-stationary source where a mantle plume delivers melt to the lithosphere, and a plate drifting above it leaves a chain of volcanoes. Hawaii's chain, from ancient extinct volcanoes in the northwest to active Kilauea in the southeast, records the plate's northwestward motion. Morgan used hotspot theory in 1971 to explain such linear volcanic chains.�ans��src��`Morgan,《热点理论与大西洋和太平洋板块的漂移》,Nature第233卷,342-343页,1971�sJ. F. Morgan, Hot-spot theory and the drift of the Atlantic and Pacific plates, Nature, 1971, vol. 233, pp. 342-343��id�6202e613e9e0�body�ٙ丹霞是流水把红色砂砾岩切出来的，多在我国南方湿润区；雅丹是干旱区大风把湖相土丘吹蚀出来的，颜色偏灰黄。ٚDanxia is carved by water from red sandstone in wetter south China; Yardang is shaped by wind from lake-bed mounds in dry northwest, gray-yellow in color.�ans��src��=普雷斯、西弗尔《理解地球》，W.H. Freeman，2001�?Press, F. & Siever, R., Understanding Earth, W.H. Freeman, 2001��id�6222c512bebc�body���海沟是板块俯冲的入口，下沉的板块在深处摩擦、破裂，会沿着一条倾斜的“贝尼奥夫带”引发从浅到深的一系列地震，所以海沟边缘地震又多又强。��A trench marks where a plate starts subducting; the sinking slab grinds and breaks at depth, triggering a tilted Wadati-Benioff zone of earthquakes from shallow to deep, so trench edges are quake-prone and violent.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�623634038bb6�body��:在洋中脊处，地幔上涌的熔岩沿裂隙喷出，冷却后形成新的玄武岩洋壳，把两侧更老的洋壳向两边推开。海底以每年约2到5厘米的速度扩张，与大西洋两岸逐年远离的趋势相符。洋壳在洋中脊新生、在俯冲带消亡，整个洋盆因此不断更新。��At a mid-ocean ridge, magma rising from the mantle erupts along the rift, cools into new basaltic crust, and pushes the older seafloor aside. Spreading proceeds at roughly 2-5 cm per year, matching the steady separation of the coasts on either side of the Atlantic. New crust forms at the ridge and old crust is consumed at subduction zones, so ocean basins continually renew themselves.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�628cea14acfc�body���雪在压密成冰的过程中会封存气泡，气泡内保存着当时的大气。钻取冰芯后，分析不同深度气泡的空气即可获得CO₂、CH₄等气体的历史浓度；南极的多姆C和EPICA冰芯已将记录延伸到约80万年前。�(As snow compacts into ice, it seals air bubbles preserving the atmosphere of the time. By drilling ice cores and analyzing air trapped at different depths, scientists reconstruct past CO₂ and CH₄ concentrations; the Antarctic Dome C and EPICA cores extend the record back about 800,000 years.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�6403d439f560�body��o海底地震后，浮标和海底压力计测到异常，系统推算海啸到达时间并提前发布警报。�VAfter a seafloor quake, buoys and pressure gauges detect waves and issue timed alerts.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�655fbeb64547�body���平流层空气垂直混合很慢、降水无法清除其中颗粒，硫酸盐气溶胶可随环流全球扩散并停留1至2年，持续反射阳光使地表降温。这与对流层气溶胶数日即被雨水清除形成对比。�The stratosphere mixes vertically very slowly and has no rain to wash out particles, so sulfate aerosols spread globally and persist for one to two years, continuously reflecting sunlight and cooling the surface. This contrasts with tropospheric aerosols cleared by rain within days.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�669ea21df03e�body��玄武岩是低黏度、富含铁镁、二氧化硅含量较低的岩浆喷发形成的深色火山岩；流纹岩则来自高黏度、二氧化硅含量高、富含碱金属的岩浆，颜色偏浅且常含气孔。二者都属火山岩，但成分和产状差异明显。�'Basalt forms from low-viscosity, iron-magnesium-rich magma with lower silica, making a dark volcanic rock. Rhyolite comes from high-viscosity, silica-rich, alkali-metal-rich magma, is lighter in color and often vesicular. Both are volcanic rocks but differ greatly in composition and occurrence.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�675431c079ee�body��海洋酸化指海水因吸收大气中过量二氧化碳，发生化学反应生成碳酸，使表层海水pH下降的现象。自工业化以来海洋已吸收了约30%的人为CO₂排放，表层pH从约8.2降至约8.1，威胁珊瑚和贝类等钙化生物。�?Ocean acidification is the decrease in seawater pH as the ocean absorbs excess atmospheric CO₂, which forms carbonic acid. Since industrialization the ocean has taken up about 30% of human CO₂ emissions, lowering surface pH from about 8.2 to about 8.1 and threatening calcifying organisms like corals and shellfish.�ans��src��)加里森《海洋学》，Cengage，2015�JGarrison, T., Oceanography: An Invitation to Marine Science, Cengage, 2015��id�68188b99beb5�body��o非洲板块向北挤欧亚板块，使地中海两侧的边界互相靠拢，盆地被一点点挤压变窄。�QAfrica pushes into Eurasia, squeezing the Mediterranean basin narrower over time.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�689c2a432bae�body��5大多数海啸由海底地震突然抬升或沉降海床引发，少数来自海底滑坡或火山喷发。最直观的前兆是海水在数分钟内异常退去，露出大片海床，随后巨浪袭来。美国海洋大气管理局的海啸预警中心与Synolakis的研究都强调了这一退潮信号。�eMost tsunamis are triggered by submarine earthquakes that abruptly uplift or drop the seafloor, with a few from underwater landslides or eruptions. The clearest warning is the sea rapidly retreating far offshore within minutes, exposing the seabed before the wave arrives. NOAA's Tsunami Warning Center and Synolakis's work both stress this drawdown signal.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�692933a0fd4b�body���钻石和石墨都是纯碳，但原子排列方式不同：钻石在高温高压下原子紧锁成坚硬透明晶体，石墨的碳原子层松散易滑，所以一个最硬、一个能写字。��Both are pure carbon but arranged differently: diamond's atoms lock tightly under high pressure into a hard clear crystal, while graphite's carbon layers slide easily, so one is hardest and the other writes.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�6d9ae8e7e62d�body�٥昼夜温差使岩石表层与内部热胀冷缩不一致，长期产生疲劳微裂；在干旱区这种热力风化尤其明显，常使岩面剥落呈鳞片状。��Daily temperature swings make a rock's surface and interior expand and contract unevenly, gradually fatigue-cracking it; in arid regions this thermal weathering is pronounced, flaking surfaces into scales.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�6dac7a9c1969�body�٫条痕是矿物在无釉瓷板上划出的粉末颜色，往往比表面颜色更稳定。例如黄铁矿表面金黄，但条痕呈绿黑色，可借此与真金区分。��Streak is the color of a mineral's powder when scratched on unglazed porcelain, often more consistent than its surface color. Pyrite looks golden but leaves a greenish-black streak, helping distinguish it from real gold.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�6e5abe0e670a�body��c在喀斯特区地表水渗入溶洞，沿暗道流动形成地下河，常从泉眼重新涌出。�TIn karst, water flows through caves as underground rivers that re-emerge at springs.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�6e5bda30f992�body�ٴ珊瑚分泌碳酸钙形成骨骼，其氧同位素和微量元素比例随生长时海水温度改变。珊瑚每年生长带还可定年，由此重建热带海表温度变化。��Corals secrete calcium carbonate skeletons whose oxygen isotopes and trace elements shift with the seawater temperature at growth. Annual growth bands also date them, reconstructing tropical sea-surface temperature change.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�70d2f9f21945�body���可溶性碳酸盐岩在含有CO2的雨水溶蚀下形成溶洞与管道，地表水沿裂隙汇流成地下河，常在洼地集中排泄成泉或伏流。这类系统供水重要但极易受污染且难以追踪。�(Soluble carbonate rocks are dissolved by CO2-rich rainwater to form caves and conduits; surface water collects along fractures into underground rivers that emerge as springs or resurgences in depressions. These systems are vital water sources but highly vulnerable to pollution and hard to trace.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�714e80f70257�body�٢龙卷风是从雷暴云底伸向地面的高速旋转气柱，风力极强、破坏集中。它常伴随超级单体风暴，在美国中部平原尤为常见。��A tornado is a rapidly spinning column of air extending from a thunderstorm to the ground, with intense concentrated destructive winds. It often forms with supercell storms and is especially common on the central U.S. plains.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�7310520e384d�body��`冷暖气团相遇的交界面叫锋面，空气被迫抬升，常带来阴雨或大风天气。�TA front is the boundary of air masses; rising air there brings clouds, rain or wind.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�731f911a12cf�body�ل已有岩石在高温高压或化学流体作用下矿物成分和结构改变，形成变质岩，如大理石由石灰岩变来。١Existing rocks changed in mineral composition and texture under high temperature, pressure, or fluids become metamorphic rocks, e.g. marble comes from limestone.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�75a00a33c023�body�٨壤土是砂、粉砂和黏土比例较为均衡的土壤，既保水又透气、耕作性良好。它通常被认为是最适宜农业的土壤质地，肥力较高。��Loam is soil with a balanced mix of sand, silt, and clay, holding water yet draining well and easy to work. Often seen as the best agricultural texture, it is generally fertile and productive.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�77d4c57e6e4c�body�٥地幔岩石在极高温度和压力下，会表现出“塑性”，在漫长岁月里极其缓慢地蠕变流动，这种对流把地球内部的热量带上来。٣Under huge heat and pressure, mantle rock behaves plastically and creeps extremely slowly over geologic time; this convection carries Earth's internal heat upward.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�797a5522ab00�body�ه内地核处在地球最深处，压力极大，高压把铁的熔点抬得比实际温度还高，所以铁被“压成”了固体。ْThe inner core sits under enormous pressure, which raises iron's melting point above its actual temperature, so the iron is squeezed into a solid.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�79b269f839d0�body���土壤侵蚀是表土被水、风或人为活动剥蚀搬运的过程，常因植被破坏和陡坡开垦而加剧。它会降低土地肥力、淤积河道，是严重的环境与农业问题。��Soil erosion is the removal and transport of topsoil by water, wind, or human activity, worsened by clearing vegetation and farming steep slopes. It lowers fertility, silts up rivers, and is a serious environmental and agricultural problem.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�7a36c77b389b�body�ف缓坡排水快、不积涝，又避开河洪和瘴气，采光通风也好；洼地易淹、潮湿，所以古人多选坡地。فSlopes drain fast, avoid floods and dampness, and get better light and air; hollows flood and stay humid, so people chose slopes.�ans��src��=普雷斯、西弗尔《理解地球》，W.H. Freeman，2001�?Press, F. & Siever, R., Understanding Earth, W.H. Freeman, 2001��id�7ae0142e5913�body���富营养化使表层藻类暴发性生长，其死亡下沉后被细菌分解耗尽溶解氧，加上层化抑制垂直混合，在陆架与海湾形成低氧或缺氧区。这类死区威胁鱼类生存并释放温室气体氧化亚氮。�"Eutrophication fuels algal blooms whose sinking detritus is decomposed by bacteria that consume dissolved oxygen; with stratification limiting vertical mixing, low- or no-oxygen zones form over shelves and bays. Such dead zones threaten fish and can release nitrous oxide, a greenhouse gas.�ans��src��TPaerl 等,《Mitigating harmful cyanobacterial blooms»,Water Research 第45卷,2011�UH. W. Paerl et al., Mitigating harmful cyanobacterial blooms, Water Research 45, 2011��id�7cd1ea083655�body�ٷ沿海含水层下方常有海水入侵形成的咸淡水过渡带。过量抽取淡水会使水位下降，海水向内陆和向上补给，导致井水变咸，称为咸水入侵。��Beneath coastal aquifers lies a saltwater-freshwater transition zone from seawater intrusion. Over-pumping lowers freshwater levels, letting seawater move inland and upward, salinizing wells, a process called saltwater intrusion.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�7fa11a3ebd4a�body��]深海洋流流速很慢，完成一次全球深浅水交换大约需要一千到两千年。�{Deep currents move very slowly; one full global exchange of deep and surface water takes roughly one to two thousand years.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�807f1c2c13b7�body��#珊瑚、树木年轮和湖泊沉积中的氧同位素与元素比值保留了ENSO的季节性信号，显示其强度与频率在千年尺度上并非恒定，例如中全新世与中世纪暖期曾出现不同于今的ENSO态。这些记录帮助检验气候模式对ENSO的模拟能力。�.Oxygen-isotope and elemental ratios in corals, tree rings, and lake sediments preserve ENSO's seasonal signal, showing its intensity and frequency varied over millennia, e.g., distinct ENSO states in the mid-Holocene and Medieval Warm Period. Such records test climate models' ability to simulate ENSO.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�809f172ee573�body���最底部的岩层最老。这被称为叠加定律（地层层序律），由尼古拉斯·斯特诺在17世纪提出：在未被翻转的沉积序列中，先沉积的岩层位于后沉积岩层之下。��The bottommost layer is the oldest. This is the law of superposition, proposed by Nicolas Steno in the 17th century: in an undeformed sequence, strata deposited first lie beneath those deposited later.�ans��src�� 《普通地质学》(舒良树)�General Geology (Shu Liangshu)��id�81a764b9d95f�body���震源深度是地下断层破裂处到地表的距离。浅源地震（通常小于70千米）能量衰减少，对地表破坏更大；深源地震能量在途中损耗多，地表影响相对较小。��Focal depth is the distance from the rupture to the surface. Shallow quakes (usually under 70 km) lose little energy and damage the surface more; deep quakes dissipate energy on the way and affect the surface less.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�82542d6435c1�body���厄尔尼诺指赤道东太平洋海温异常偏暖的现象，通常每2到7年出现一次，持续数月到一年多。正常年份信风把表层暖水吹向西太平洋，东太平洋靠上升流降温；厄尔尼诺时信风减弱，暖水回流到东太平洋，热带大气环流随之改变。它常导致南美西部暴雨、澳大利亚与东南亚干旱，也会改变中国夏季的降水格局。��El Nino is the abnormal warming of the eastern equatorial Pacific, recurring roughly every 2-7 years and lasting months to more than a year. Normally trade winds pile warm surface water in the western Pacific while upwelling cools the east; during El Nino the winds slacken, warm water sloshes eastward, and the tropical atmospheric circulation reorganizes. It often brings flooding to western South America, drought to Australia and Southeast Asia, and shifts summer rainfall patterns in China.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�845a2b201db3�body���它们都以硅氧四面体（SiO₄）为基本结构单元。四面体之间共享氧原子的方式不同——孤立四面体、单链、双链、片状或三维骨架——决定了矿物的物理性质，如解理方向和硬度。�They all share the silica tetrahedron (SiO₄) as their basic building block. How these tetrahedra share oxygen atoms—as isolated units, single or double chains, sheets, or a three-dimensional framework—governs physical properties such as cleavage direction and hardness.�ans��src�� 《普通地质学》(舒良树)�General Geology (Shu Liangshu)��id�84ad880ba90f�body�ٱ三角洲是河流入海或入湖时因流速骤减、泥沙堆积形成的扇形平地。它土地肥沃、物种丰富，却也易受热带气旋和海平面上升的威胁。��A delta is a fan-shaped plain of sediment built where a river slows and drops its load as it meets the sea or a lake. Fertile and biodiverse, deltas are also vulnerable to storms and sea-level rise.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�85b27574e6cb�body��{露天剥离破坏地表、尾矿占用土地、酸性水和粉尘持续污染水土，生态修复往往需要数十年。قOpen pits scar the land, tailings occupy ground, and acid water and dust keep polluting soil and water for decades of restoration.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�861bd6f92cda�body���冷锋是冷气团推动暖气团，锋面陡、移动快，暖空气被迅速抬升，常带来短促的雷雨大风，雨区窄而急，过境后气温明显下降。暖锋则是暖气团沿冷气团表面缓慢爬升，坡度缓、移动慢，形成大范围连绵的层状云和细雨，雨区宽而持久。我国春秋两季的天气变化大多与这两种锋面的交替有关。��A cold front is cold air advancing into warm air; its surface is steep and fast-moving, so the warm air is lifted abruptly, bringing brief thunderstorms and gusty wind, followed by a sharp temperature drop. A warm front is warm air slowly climbing over cold air; its surface is gentle, producing widespread stratus and steady light rain over a broad area. Much of the day-to-day weather change in spring and autumn in China relates to the alternation of these two fronts.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�8800cec98cca�body��u玄武岩来自贫硅的岩浆、流动性强、喷发较温和；流纹岩富硅、黏稠，易引发剧烈爆炸。�^Basalt from low-silica fluid lava erupts gently; silica-rich rhyolite is sticky and explosive.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�890939138bbb�body�٨辐射强迫是指某种因素（如多排的二氧化碳）使地球进出能量之差改变了多少；正强迫让地球净吸收能量而升温，负值则降温。٬Radiative forcing is the change in Earth's net energy balance caused by a factor like added CO2; positive forcing means net energy gain and warming, negative means cooling.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�8a235ecd91b8�body��l高寒地区积雪多年不化，新雪把旧雪压实，排走空气变成粒雪，再在更大压力下重结晶成致密的冰川冰。冰川冰达到足够厚度后，底部在重压下会像软糖一样缓慢变形，并沿山坡向下流动，一年只移动几米到几百米。冰川既是水体也是缓慢流动的侵蚀工具，磨出U形谷等地貌。��In cold highlands snow persists year after year; fresh snow compresses the old layers, expels air to form granular firn, and then recrystallizes under great pressure into dense glacier ice. Once thick enough, the ice deforms like taffy under its own weight and creeps downhill, advancing only meters to hundreds of meters per year. A glacier is both a water reservoir and a slow-moving erosional tool that carves U-shaped valleys.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�8c7f02ddce72�body��r多源于山地、冰川或湖泊，雨水积雪汇成小溪，逐渐汇聚成河，如长江源出青藏高原。ٓOften from mountains, glaciers or lakes; rain and snow become streams that join into a river, e.g. the Yangtze starts on the Qinghai-Tibet Plateau.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�8d86dc0a4c59�body���树木每年春夏生长快、形成颜色浅的早材，夏秋生长慢、形成颜色深的晚材，一年一圈年轮。水分充足、温度适宜的年份年轮宽，干旱或寒冷的年份年轮窄，同一地区的树木在同一年长出的年轮宽窄模式互相吻合。通过交叉定年，科学家能把年轮序列延伸到几千年甚至更久，读出历史时期的旱涝与冷暖。��Each year a tree grows fast, pale spring wood and slow, dark late-summer wood, producing one ring. Rings are wide in wet, mild years and narrow in dry or cold ones, and trees in the same region share matching ring patterns for the same calendar years. By cross-dating, scientists extend ring chronologies back thousands of years and read droughts, floods, and temperature swings from them.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�8d9ea4304122�body���它们显示递进变质：板岩由泥岩轻度变质、具板状劈理；千枚岩进一步重结晶、现丝绢光泽；片岩结晶更明显、片状矿物定向排列。反映温度压力逐步升高。��They show progressive metamorphism: slate is low-grade from mudrock with slaty cleavage; phyllite is further recrystallized with silky sheen; schist has clearer crystals and aligned flaky minerals. They reflect rising temperature and pressure.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�8e18c3684c16�body��r强震中饱和砂土里的水压骤升，土粒失去支撑像液体一样流动，建筑会突然下沉倾斜。�RQuakes raise pore pressure in wet sand so it flows like liquid, sinking buildings.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�8e65fa5ecd73�body�ف钻井把地下热水或蒸汽引上来，推动涡轮发电机发电，用过的热水还可回灌地下，比较清洁稳定。ًWells bring up hot underground water or steam to spin a turbine generator; the cooled water can be re-injected, making it clean and steady.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�8f4a0cbfaff6�body�ٽ风眼是飓风中心一片相对平静、少云无风的圆形区域，被周围高耸的眼墙所包围。眼墙内风雨最猛，穿过风眼后会遭遇另一侧同样强烈的天气。��The eye is a relatively calm, clear, low-wind circle at a hurricane's center, ringed by the towering eyewall. The eyewall holds the storm's fiercest winds and rain, and the other side brings equally violent weather after the eye passes.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�906a5d242ed4�body���海冰反照率高，能反射大量阳光；海冰消融露出深色海面，吸收更多热量，进一步升温并加速消融，形成反照率正反馈。这种“北极放大”使北极增温速率约为全球平均的 2–3 倍。��Sea ice has high albedo, reflecting sunlight; its loss exposes dark ocean that absorbs more heat, warming further and melting more—an albedo positive feedback. This Arctic amplification makes Arctic warming roughly 2–3 times the global average.�ans��src��8Wicander & Monroe,《Historical Geology》Cengage 多版�TR. Wicander and J. S. Monroe, Historical Geology, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�90b31368a185�body���莫霍面是地壳与地幔之间的分界界面，因地幔岩石比地壳致密，地震波在此处速度明显跃增。它由克罗地亚地震学家莫霍罗维奇（Andrija Mohorovičić）在1909年通过研究地震折射波首次识别。�␀The Moho is the boundary between the crust and the mantle, marked by a sudden increase in seismic-wave velocity because mantle rock is denser than crustal rock. Croatian seismologist Andrija Mohorovičić identified it in 1909 from refracted seismic waves.�ans��src��<Press & Siever,《Understanding Earth》W. H. Freeman 多版�LF. Press and R. Siever, Understanding Earth, W. H. Freeman, various editions��id�90fdc4c33cd7�body�ٱ放射性同位素会按固定速率衰变，半衰期是其中一半原子衰变所需的时间。比较岩石中母核与子核的比例，就能推算出它的形成年代。ٴRadioactive isotopes decay at a fixed rate; the half-life is the time for half of them to decay. Comparing parent and daughter isotopes in a rock lets scientists calculate its age.�ans��src��8Wicander & Monroe,《Historical Geology》Cengage 多版�TR. Wicander and J. S. Monroe, Historical Geology, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�9320d1252c92�body��u抽水使含水层孔隙水压下降、砂层被压实，原本支撑的孔隙塌缩，地面就不可逆地沉降。�sPumping lowers pore pressure so aquifers compact irreversibly, and the lost support makes the ground sink for good.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�94babab2c6d1�body��`暖湿空气强烈上升，水汽冷凝成积雨云，云内电荷分离产生闪电和雷声。ىWarm moist air rises strongly, condenses into cumulonimbus clouds, and charge separation inside the cloud produces lightning and thunder.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�9534ad16033c�body��#冰架是陆地冰川延伸入海后漂浮在海上的冰舌，前缘不断崩解形成冰山。冰架像瓶塞一样支撑着背后的冰川；当冰架因暖海水从底部加热或表面融水而变薄、碎裂，失去支撑的陆地冰川会加速滑入海洋，从而推高海平面。�ZAn ice shelf is the floating extension of a land glacier that spreads over the sea, calving icebergs at its front. It acts like a cork, buttressing the glacier behind it; when it thins or breaks apart because warm ocean water heats it from below or surface meltwater weakens it, the grounded glacier accelerates into the ocean, raising sea level.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�962bbcd98ac4�body���冰期是地球长期偏冷、大陆冰川大规模扩展的时段，间冰期则是相对温暖、冰川退缩的阶段。最近一次大冰期约在1万年前结束，我们目前处于间冰期中。��An ice age is a long cold span when continental glaciers expand greatly; an interglacial is a warmer interval when ice retreats. The last great ice age ended about 10,000 years ago, and we are now in a warm interglacial.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�96cd5c098bd1�body���地震预报试图在震前给出时间、地点和强度，目前科学上尚不可靠。地震预警利用地震波中速度快的 P 波先于破坏性的 S 波到达的时差，在强震抵达前数秒至数十秒发出警报，以降低伤亡。�&Prediction attempts to specify a quake's time, place, and size in advance—still unreliable scientifically. Early warning exploits the travel-time gap between the fast P wave and the damaging S wave to issue alerts seconds to tens of seconds before strong shaking arrives, reducing casualties.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�97930269bcd8�body�ل海洋地壳薄而重、主要是玄武岩；大陆地壳厚而轻、成分更接近花岗岩，所以大陆能高高露出海面。�kOceanic crust is thin and dense basalt; continental crust is thicker and lighter granite, so it rides high.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�97d3ffa076ce�body���水中较重的氧-18和较轻的氧-16在蒸发和降水中的比例随温度改变。海洋有孔虫壳或冰芯中两者的比值，可反推当时海温和全球冰量，是研究古温度的关键工具。�The ratio of heavier oxygen-18 to lighter oxygen-16 in water shifts with temperature during evaporation and precipitation. The ratio in seafloor foraminifera shells or ice cores infers past sea temperature and global ice volume, a key paleotemperature tool.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�98b8761e2507�body�٨从地面向上依次为对流层、平流层、中间层、热层和外层大气。对流层天气多变，平流层含臭氧层，热层温度极高且存在极光。��From the ground up: troposphere, stratosphere, mesosphere, thermosphere, and exosphere. The troposphere holds the weather, the stratosphere contains the ozone layer, and the thermosphere is extremely hot and hosts auroras.�ans��src��>盛裴轩 等,《大气物理学》,北京大学出版社,2003�HSheng Peixuan et al., Atmospheric Physics, Peking University Press, 2003��id�99558a4ba140�body���沙尘在大气顶部反射入射阳光使地表降温，但在大气中吸收并向下再辐射长波辐射，对地表又有增温作用。其净效应取决于粉尘高度、光学厚度及下垫面反照率，区域差异显著。��Dust reflects incoming sunlight at the top of atmosphere, cooling the surface, yet absorbs and re-emits longwave radiation downward, warming it. The net effect depends on dust altitude, optical depth, and surface albedo, varying strongly by region.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�99562641f5b2�body�ٜ在超级单体风暴里，上升气流被风切变拧成旋转的涡管（中气旋），当旋转向下延伸到地面，就形成了漏斗状的龙卷。٭In a supercell, updrafts are twisted by wind shear into a rotating column (mesocyclone); when that rotation stretches down to the ground, it becomes a funnel-shaped tornado.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�9a92f0e82d51�body��u干旱区因过度放牧、毁草和气候变干，土地肥力下降、植被消失，逐渐变成荒漠的过程。�WDrylands lose fertility and vegetation to overuse and drying, slowly turning to desert.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�9eb5d7f42528�body��h马里亚纳海沟最深处约11000米，是地球海洋的最低点，压力是海面的千倍以上。�hIts deepest point is about 11,000 m, the lowest spot in the ocean, under over 1000× sea-level pressure.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�9fd32847ec24�body��相对定年只判断岩层或化石的“先后顺序”（如叠覆律：下老上新），但不给出具体年数。绝对定年则利用放射性同位素的半衰期为岩石测定具体年代（如铀—铅、钾—氩法），把相对顺序锚定到真实的时间坐标上。�?Relative dating only determines the sequence of rock layers or fossils (e.g., the law of superposition: lower is older), without giving numerical ages. Absolute dating uses the half-lives of radioactive isotopes (e.g., uranium–lead, potassium–argon) to assign actual ages, anchoring the relative order to real time.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�a013544cab82�body���黄土高原的厚层黄土主要来自西北干旱区的粉尘，经风力远距离搬运堆积而成，历时数百万年。疏松多孔的黄土极易被水侵蚀，形成千沟万壑的地貌。��The thick loess of the Loess Plateau mainly came as dust from arid northwest regions, carried and deposited by wind over millions of years. Loose porous loess erodes easily by water, creating a deeply ravined landscape.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�a0503ab215fb�body���大理岩主要由方解石（CaCO₃）组成，通常由石灰岩经接触变质或区域变质作用形成。方解石重结晶使大理岩比石灰岩更致密、颗粒更粗，且遇稀盐酸会剧烈起泡。�Marble consists mainly of calcite (CaCO₃) and typically derives from limestone through contact or regional metamorphism. Recrystallization makes marble denser and coarser-grained than limestone, and it effervesces vigorously with dilute hydrochloric acid.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�a05c57f1c706�body��u海底地震、火山或滑坡突然使大量海水移位，形成高速长浪，登陆时浪高骤增造成灾害。ٖA seafloor quake, volcano or landslide suddenly displaces huge volumes of water, forming fast long waves that grow tall near shore and cause disaster.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�a0b6461f1002�body�ّ它从1958年起在夏威夷连续测得大气二氧化碳浓度，显示其逐年攀升并叠加年度呼吸起伏，是变暖的关键证据。لSince 1958 it has recorded atmospheric CO2 at Hawaii, showing a rising trend with yearly breathing cycles—key evidence of warming.�ans��src��>盛裴轩 等,《大气物理学》,北京大学出版社,2003�HSheng Peixuan et al., Atmospheric Physics, Peking University Press, 2003��id�a0c269951a55�body��&矿物须同时满足：天然形成、无机、固态、有确定的化学成分、内部原子呈有序晶体排列。莫氏硬度计由弗里德里希·莫斯于1812年提出，用1（滑石）到10（金刚石）的十种标准矿物表征相对划痕硬度，数值越大越难被划伤。�3A mineral must be naturally occurring, inorganic, solid, with a definite chemical composition and an ordered crystalline atomic structure. The Mohs hardness scale, proposed by Friedrich Mohs in 1812, ranks relative scratch hardness from 1 (talc) to 10 (diamond), where a higher number scratches a lower one.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�a24ba032dffa�body��o地震多沿板块边界分布，最著名的是环太平洋带和横贯欧亚的地中海—喜马拉雅带。�^Quakes cluster on plate boundaries, especially the Pacific Ring and the Alpine-Himalayan belt.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�a2aa7908e410�body���两个大陆板块密度相近、都不下沉，碰撞处岩石被挤压抬升，形成高大的褶皱山脉，如喜马拉雅山就是印度板块与欧亚板块碰撞的结果。这类边界常伴随强烈地震。�3Because both continental plates have similar low density, neither subducts; instead the rock between them is squeezed and pushed upward into great folded mountain ranges. The Himalaya formed this way from the collision of the Indian and Eurasian plates, and such boundaries often produce strong earthquakes.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�a380167017a1�body�٨当高空出现稳定的高压脊（阻塞高压），空气下沉增温、云少日照强，而且系统几天不动，同一地方就被持续炙烤，形成热浪。پWhen a stable high-pressure ridge (blocking high) sits aloft, air sinks and warms, skies clear, and if the pattern stalls for days the same area is baked continuously, producing a heat wave.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�a5616297922c�body��地表臭氧是有害的光化学污染物，是夏季光化学烟雾的主要成分。它不是直接排放的，而是氮氧化物（NOx）与挥发性有机物（VOCs）在强烈阳光下经光化学反应生成的，会刺激呼吸道、危害农作物。�Ground-level ozone is a harmful photochemical pollutant and a main component of summertime photochemical smog. It is not emitted directly but forms when nitrogen oxides (NOx) react with volatile organic compounds (VOCs) under strong sunlight; it irritates airways and damages crops.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�a63f6ac4a014�body�ٍ黄河下游是“地上悬河”，河床因泥沙堆积比两岸还高，一旦决口就另寻低处改道，历史上曾大改道多次。ٜIts lower reach is a suspended river whose bed, raised by silt, sits above the land; a breach sends it to a new low path—it has changed course many times.�ans��src��W米尔曼、米德《全球河流输沙入海》，《地质学杂志》第91卷，1983�pMilliman, J.D. & Meade, R.H. (1983), World-wide delivery of river sediment to the oceans, Journal of Geology, 91��id�a6dea073ba32�body���爆发式喷发以黏稠、富气体的岩浆为主，气体猛烈释放形成火山灰柱和碎屑流；溢流式喷发则岩浆稀薄、气体易逸出，熔岩平静地漫流。岩浆的黏稠度和含气量决定了喷发方式。��Explosive eruptions involve viscous, gas-rich magma whose violent gas release throws up ash columns and pyroclastic flows; effusive eruptions have fluid magma that lets gas escape so lava flows quietly. Magma viscosity and gas content decide the style.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�a7a4597a27cb�body�ٍ岩石圈是坚硬的岩石外壳，包括地壳和上地幔顶部；其下的软流圈较软、能缓慢流动，板块就浮在它上面。�bThe rigid lithosphere (crust + upper mantle top) sits on the softer, slowly flowing asthenosphere.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�a7ae41c17e80�body���格陵兰冰盖融化会直接使海平面上升，因为它是储存在陆地上的冰，融水会汇入海洋；北极海冰本来就漂浮在海面上，根据阿基米德原理，其融化不改变海平面，就像杯中冰块融化后水位不变。�8Melting of the Greenland Ice Sheet directly raises sea level because it is ice stored on land and its meltwater flows into the ocean; Arctic sea ice already floats on the sea, so by Archimedes' principle its melting does not change sea level, just as ice cubes melting in a glass leave the water level unchanged.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�a89eba4309f8�body��,弹性回跳说由里德（Harry Reid）在研究1906年旧金山大地震后于1910年提出：地壳因板块挤压而缓慢变形、积累弹性应变，一旦超过岩石强度便突然断裂错动，释放的能量形成地震。它解释了断层两侧为什么会在震后“弹回”原状。�FProposed by Harry Reid after the 1906 San Francisco earthquake (1910), elastic rebound theory holds that crustal rocks deform slowly under stress, storing elastic strain until they break and slip suddenly, releasing energy as an earthquake. It explains why fault blocks 'spring back' to their original positions after a quake.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�a8bb268f457a�body��v典型剖面自上而下包括：O层（地表有机落叶层）、A层（表土，富含有机质）、E层（淋溶层，矿物被冲刷流失）、B层（心土/淀积层，富集从上层淋下的物质）和C层（母质层，风化的基岩碎屑），最下常为R层基岩。美国农业部自然资源保护局（NRCS）的《土壤系统分类》采用此框架。��A typical profile, top to bottom, includes the O horizon (surface organic litter), A horizon (topsoil, rich in organic matter), E horizon (eluviated, leached of minerals), B horizon (subsoil, enriched by material leached from above), and C horizon (parent material of weathered rock fragments), underlain by R (bedrock). The USDA Natural Resources Conservation Service's Soil Taxonomy uses this framework.�ans��src��^美国农业部自然资源保护局（USDA NRCS）《土壤系统分类》（Soil Taxonomy）�CUSDA Natural Resources Conservation Service (NRCS), 'Soil Taxonomy'��id�a9013383287d�body�ٴ这两大冰盖储存了地球上绝大部分的陆地冰，若全部融化可使全球海平面上升数十米。它们的质量变化也通过融水影响大洋环流与气候。��These two ice sheets hold most of Earth's land ice, and if fully melted could raise global sea level by many tens of meters. Their changing mass also affects ocean circulation and climate through meltwater input.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�aa039222bce9�body���土壤是陆地最大的活跃碳库，其有机碳储量超过植被与大气碳之和，受温度、湿度和土地利用影响而释放或固存。土壤碳的微小变化即可显著影响大气CO2浓度。�Soil is the largest active terrestrial carbon pool, holding more organic carbon than vegetation and the atmosphere combined, and it releases or stores carbon depending on temperature, moisture, and land use. Even small soil-carbon changes can noticeably shift atmospheric CO2.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�ad8854a85d87�body���约四分之一人为排放的CO2被海水吸收，与海水反应生成碳酸并释放氢离子，降低海水pH值。自工业革命以来表层海水pH已下降约0.1单位（酸度增加约30%），影响珊瑚与贝类的钙化。�About a quarter of anthropogenic CO2 is absorbed by the ocean, where it forms carbonic acid and releases hydrogen ions, lowering seawater pH. Since the industrial revolution surface pH has fallen about 0.1 units (roughly 30% more acidic), impairing calcification in corals and shellfish.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�addde42e9ebb�body��A俯冲带是密度较大的大洋板块在海沟处俯冲到另一板块之下的边界，携带的水降低地幔楔熔点，诱发弧岩浆作用。沿美洲西岸的安第斯型陆缘便是大洋板块俯冲到大陆板块之下形成的火山弧。这类边界也是地球上最强地震与海啸的主要发生地。��A subduction zone is a boundary where a denser oceanic plate dives beneath another plate at a trench, and the water it carries lowers the melting point of the overlying mantle wedge, triggering arc magmatism. The Andean margin of South America is an example where oceanic lithosphere subducts under continental crust to form a volcanic arc. These boundaries also generate the planet's largest earthquakes and tsunamis.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�b0b5761a1cb4�body�ي黄土疏松怕水，夏季暴雨顺着坡面冲刷，把松软的黄土一点点冲走，天长日久就刻出了密密麻麻的沟壑。�jLoose loess erodes easily; summer rainstorms wash the soft soil downhill, carving dense gullies over time.�ans��src��=刘东生《黄土与环境》，中国海洋出版社，1985�ALiu Tungsheng, Loess and the Environment, China Ocean Press, 1985��id�b0e8040fc132�body��(温室气体允许太阳短波辐射进入、却阻挡地表长波（红外）辐射逃逸，使热量滞留近地面，从而温暖地球。自然温室效应让地表平均温度维持在约15°C（若无则约-18°C）；主要温室气体包括水汽、二氧化碳、甲烷和氧化亚氮。�\Greenhouse gases let incoming solar shortwave radiation through but trap outgoing longwave (infrared) radiation from the surface, warming the lower atmosphere. The natural greenhouse effect keeps Earth's average surface near about 15°C (versus roughly -18°C without it); the main gases are water vapor, carbon dioxide, methane, and nitrous oxide.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�b1702c78cdcc�body��_丹霞地貌的岩层是约一亿年前沉积的红色陆相砂砾岩，红色来自当时气候干燥、铁质被氧化成氧化铁。地壳抬升后，流水沿垂直节理切割，加上长期风化剥蚀，把原本平坦的红色盆地刻成赤壁丹崖、群峰如林的景观。断块抬升与差异侵蚀共同塑造了这类奇特的地貌。��Danxia landforms are carved from red terrestrial sandstones and conglomerates deposited about 100 million years ago in an arid climate, where iron oxidized and rusted the beds red. After crustal uplift, streams cut along vertical joints while weathering ate back the rock, turning a flat red basin into sheer red cliffs and clustered towers. Block uplift combined with differential erosion sculpted these striking landscapes.�ans��src��-中国地质调查局（丹霞地貌研究）�2China Geological Survey (Danxia landform research)��id�b1746474b3f9�body�ٙ南方更靠近海洋、又常受夏季风和台风影响，暖湿气流抬升容易成云下雨；北方离海远、干冷空气更强，降水就少。٘The south is closer to the ocean and often hit by monsoons and typhoons, so moist air rises and rains; the north is farther from the sea with drier air.�ans��src��*王斌《亚洲季风》，Springer，2006�+Wang, B., The Asian Monsoon, Springer, 2006��id�b1ca83b6ffbd�body���寒武纪大爆发发生在约5.4亿年前的寒武纪早期，短时间内出现了绝大多数动物门类，海洋生物形态快速多样化。它留下了以澄江生物群为代表的丰富化石记录。��The Cambrian explosion, about 540 million years ago, saw most major animal groups appear in a geologically short span as marine life diversified rapidly. It left rich fossil records such as the Chengjiang biota.�ans��src��8Wicander & Monroe,《Historical Geology》Cengage 多版�TR. Wicander and J. S. Monroe, Historical Geology, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�b2db0383a8c7�body�٠冰川移动时像砂纸一样磨蚀和拔蚀基岩，把碎屑裹入冰中带走。它常雕出U形谷、冰斗和由堆积物构成的终碛堤（冰碛）。ٿAs glaciers move they scrape and pluck at bedrock like sandpaper, carrying debris within the ice. They carve U-shaped valleys and cirques and leave ridges of deposited debris called moraines.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�b348d85ed9cb�body��{石笋每年增长一圈，其厚度和同位素组成随雨季、温度而变化，定年后可逐年重建季风强弱。ٗStalagmites grow a layer each year; their thickness and isotopes track rainfall and temperature, so dated samples rebuild monsoon history year by year.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�b51389243123�body��地震会发出速度不同的两种波：纵波（P波）跑得快但破坏小，横波（S波）跑得慢但破坏大。预警系统用靠近震中的台站先检测到P波，随即自动估算震级和位置，通过电信网络向更远地区广播警报，因电信号速度远快于S波，警报可比破坏性震动早到几秒到几十秒，足够人们躲避或让列车停车。由于从震中向外传播的S波与警报信息在竞赛，震中附近存在无法提前预警的盲区，系统只能提供有限的时间窗口。�7Earthquakes radiate fast but gentle P-waves and slower, destructive S-waves. An early warning network detects the P-wave at stations near the epicenter, quickly estimates magnitude and location, and broadcasts alerts by telecommunications; because electrical signals outpace the S-waves by a huge margin, alerts arrive seconds to tens of seconds before the damaging shaking—enough to take cover or stop trains. Because the S-waves and the alert race outward from the same source, a blind zone exists near the epicenter and the warning window is necessarily limited.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�b52b2ce1bff4�body�ٽ曲流是河流在低坡度平原上呈弯曲蜿蜒的河道。水流惯性使凹岸侵蚀、凸岸沉积，弯曲不断加剧并向侧向迁移，最终可能截弯取直形成牛轭湖。��A meander is a sinuous bend in a river on low-gradient plains. Flow inertia drives erosion on the outer (concave) bank and deposition on the inner (convex) bank, deepening the curve and migrating it laterally until cutoff forms an oxbow lake.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�b5724e29f367�body�ٱ蒸腾是植物通过叶片气孔把体内水分释放到大气中的过程，与蒸发一起构成「蒸散」。它是水循环中将陆地水分送回大气的重要环节。��Transpiration is how plants release water from inside their leaves through stomata into the air, joining evaporation as 'evapotranspiration.' It is a major way land water returns to the atmosphere in the water cycle.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�b70b8f3620ec�body���城市热岛指城区气温明显高于周边郊区的现象。成因包括建筑与路面高蓄热、植被减少削弱蒸散降温、人为热排放以及峡谷形态阻碍散热。夜间尤为显著，可达数摄氏度之差。�.The urban heat island is when city temperatures markedly exceed surrounding suburbs. Causes include heat-storing buildings and pavements, less vegetation reducing evaporative cooling, anthropogenic heat release, and canyon geometry trapping heat. It is strongest at night, differing by several degrees.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�b7ecd3f11b94�body���花岗岩多组节理把岩体分割成块，地表附近的温差和水的渗入使棱角处风化更快，逐渐磨圆成球状风化（洋葱剥落）。这是典型的物理风化结果。��Granite's joint sets divide the rock into blocks; near the surface, temperature swings and water penetration weather the corners faster, rounding them into spherical weathering (onion peeling). It is a classic physical-weathering result.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�bc94f4e66f91�body�ٺ按光照从浅到深，主要分为透光层、弱光层和深海无光层。透光层有充足阳光供光合作用，越往下越暗越冷，无光层则终年漆黑、压力巨大。�From shallow to deep by light, the ocean is divided into the sunlit (epipelagic), twilight (mesopelagic), and midnight (bathypelagic and deeper) zones. The sunlit layer has enough light for photosynthesis; deeper zones grow darker, colder, and more pressurised.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�bc9c3cf0428e�body��8大气二氧化碳溶于海水生成碳酸，降低海水的pH与碳酸根离子浓度，使海洋酸化。珊瑚与贝类需要用碳酸根构建碳酸钙外壳，酸性增强会抑制钙化甚至溶解已有壳体。多尼等人在2009年综述指出这一化学转变正以地质尺度罕见的速度发生。��Atmospheric carbon dioxide dissolves in seawater to form carbonic acid, lowering pH and carbonate-ion concentration, which is ocean acidification. Corals and shellfish need carbonate to build calcium-carbonate shells, and rising acidity inhibits calcification and can dissolve existing shells. Doney and colleagues noted in 2009 that this chemical shift is happening at a rate rare in geologic history.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�bd303fd347f2�body��这与米兰科维奇循环——地球轨道参数（偏心率、地轴倾角、岁差）的周期性变化——有关。轨道几何的微小改变改变了太阳辐射的季节与纬度分布，并经气候系统内的反馈放大，从而驱动冰期与间冰期的交替。� It is linked to Milankovitch cycles—periodic changes in Earth's orbital eccentricity, axial tilt, and precession. Small shifts in orbital geometry alter the seasonal and latitudinal distribution of insolation, which climate feedbacks amplify, driving glacial–interglacial alternation.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�bd682640f605�body��?水流冲刷凹岸、淤积凸岸，河道逐渐弯成蛇形。�EWater erodes one bank and deposits on the other, bending the channel.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�be48e3a0d8c6�body�ٷ海平面上升主要来自两方面：海水受热膨胀（热膨胀）和陆地冰川、冰盖融化注入海洋。两者都随全球变暖而加剧，威胁沿海城市与岛屿。��Sea level rises mainly for two reasons: ocean water expands as it warms (thermal expansion) and land ice melts into the sea. Both are amplified by global warming, threatening coasts and islands.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�bea71828d999�body���热红外传感器接收地表发射的长波辐射并反演地表温度，城市建成区因混凝土吸热、绿化少而显著高于周边农田与林地。长时间序列温度图可量化热岛强度及其随城市扩张的变化。�3Thermal-infrared sensors record emitted longwave radiation and retrieve land surface temperature; urban built-up areas run markedly hotter than surrounding fields and forests because concrete stores heat and greenery is scarce. Long time series map heat-island intensity and its change with urban expansion.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�c1d7a57e1c33�body�ل地震多发生在板块边界和活断层带，板块活动强烈的地区如环太平洋带地震频发，板块内部则较少。ِQuakes cluster at plate boundaries and active faults; active zones like the Pacific Ring of Fire quake often, while plate interiors are quieter.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�c313d61685d8�body��o强对流云中冰粒被上升气流反复托起，层层裹上水再冻结，越长越大后落地成冰雹。هIn strong storm clouds ice pellets are lifted repeatedly by updrafts, coating with water that freezes, growing until they fall as hail.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�c3a0d2c1d4bb�body���约2.1万年前的末次盛冰期，全球气温比今低约4至6℃，大规模冰盖覆盖北美与北欧，海平面比今低约120米，盛行风与干旱带位置明显不同。这一状态由冰芯、海洋与湖泊沉积物等多指标重建。�KAt the Last Glacial Maximum about 21,000 years ago, global temperatures were roughly 4 to 6°C lower, massive ice sheets covered North America and northern Europe, sea level was about 120 m lower, and prevailing winds and dry belts sat in different positions. This state is reconstructed from ice cores, marine, and lake sediments.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�c57c6839a69f�body���主动雷达发射微波并接收回波，微波波长比云雨粒子大得多，可穿透云、雾和雨幕，因此不受天气与昼夜限制。这使它在热带雨林和极夜地区成为不可替代的观测手段。�!Active radar transmits microwaves and records the return echo; microwave wavelengths are far larger than cloud and rain droplets, so they penetrate cloud, fog, and rain, operating regardless of weather or daylight. This makes radar indispensable over tropical rainforests and polar nights.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�c6cd7cbd3b92�body�ه本质是同一种热带气旋，只是发生的海域叫法不同：西北太平洋称台风，大西洋和东北太平洋称飓风。ٌThey are the same kind of tropical cyclone; the name differs by region: typhoon in the NW Pacific, hurricane in the Atlantic and NE Pacific.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�c70f8f89b1b9�body�� 雪层层层压实到完全封闭气泡需要一段深度（封闭深度），此前的孔隙仍与大气连通。因此气泡封存的是稍晚时期的大气，形成数百年的“气体—冰年龄差”。在南极冰芯中这一差值可达数百年，解读记录时必须校正。�8Snow must compact to a sealing depth before bubbles close off, while pores above remain open to the atmosphere. Thus the trapped air records slightly later atmospheric composition, creating a gas–ice age difference of up to several centuries in Antarctic cores that must be corrected when interpreting records.�ans��src��8Wicander & Monroe,《Historical Geology》Cengage 多版�TR. Wicander and J. S. Monroe, Historical Geology, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�c935e6572a08�body���河流弯曲处外侧侵蚀、内侧堆积，使河弯越来越弯；洪水期水流可能冲断脖颈、取直河道，被遗弃的旧弯便封闭成新月形的牛轭湖。密西西比河平原多见此类地貌。�*On a meandering river the outer bank erodes while the inner bank deposits, so bends grow tighter; during a flood the flow may cut across the neck and straighten the channel, leaving the abandoned loop sealed off as a crescent-shaped oxbow lake. The Mississippi Delta plain shows many such features.�ans��src��3丁曼《物理水文学》，Waveland Press，2015�7Dingman, S.L., Physical Hydrology, Waveland Press, 2015��id�c9a80aaad28e�body���大理岩是石灰岩或白云岩在高温高压下重结晶形成的变质岩。原岩中的方解石颗粒长大并重新联结，使大理岩更致密、具晶粒结构，并常呈现美丽纹理。��Marble is a metamorphic rock formed by recrystallization of limestone or dolomite under heat and pressure. Calcite grains in the parent rock grow and rejoin, making marble denser with a crystalline texture and often beautiful veining.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�c9b179b36a56�body��地质年代表是把地球约46亿年历史按代、纪、世等层级划分的时间框架，标注了重大事件与生物演化节点。它由国际地层委员会（ICS，隶属国际地质科学联合会 IUGS）负责制定和定期更新，是全球地质学的共同语言。�zThe geologic time scale is a hierarchical framework dividing Earth's ~4.6-billion-year history into eons, eras, periods, and epochs, marking major events and evolutionary milestones. It is maintained and periodically updated by the International Commission on Stratigraphy (ICS), under the International Union of Geological Sciences (IUGS), serving as geology's common language.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�ca6b196fbd3b�body��{塑料随河流入海破碎成微粒，被浮游生物和鱼类误食后沿食物链上行，还可能吸附有毒物质。ـPlastics wash to sea and break into particles eaten by plankton and fish, moving up the food chain and carrying toxic chemicals.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�cacfde84cf06�body���反照率是地表反射太阳辐射的比例：冰雪反照率很高（可超过0.8），深色海洋或森林则很低。当冰盖融化、露出暗色地表，会反射更少阳光、吸收更多热量，形成正反馈，进一步加速变暖。�5Albedo is the fraction of incoming solar radiation reflected by a surface: snow and ice have high albedo (over 0.8), while dark oceans or forests have low albedo. When ice melts and exposes dark ground, less sunlight is reflected and more heat is absorbed, creating a positive feedback that amplifies warming.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�caddec82827e�body���山地冰川（谷冰川）限于山谷中，受地形约束流动；大陆冰川则覆盖广阔大陆，如南极和格陵兰冰盖，厚度可达数千米。前者塑造峡谷，后者影响全球海平面。�Alpine (valley) glaciers are confined to mountain valleys and flow with the terrain, while continental glaciers blanket huge land areas like the Antarctic and Greenland ice sheets, kilometers thick. The former carve canyons; the latter affect global sea level.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�cafecf70696c�body���摩氏硬度把十种标准矿物从滑石（最软）到金刚石（最硬）排成一列，用互相刻划谁能在谁身上留痕，就能大致判断一块矿物的硬度、从而帮助鉴别。٤The Mohs scale ranks ten reference minerals from talc (softest) to diamond (hardest); by scratching tests you estimate a specimen's hardness, aiding identification.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�cb218f647bc4�body��F魏格纳指出，南美洲东岸与非洲西岸的海岸线能像拼图一样吻合，且两洲在地层、古生物（如已灭绝的中龙）和古气候（如冰川遗迹）上高度对应。他在1912年提出、1915年于《海陆的起源》中系统阐述这一假说，为后来的板块构造学说奠定了基础。��Wegener noted that the coasts of South America and Africa fit together like puzzle pieces, and that the two continents share matching rock strata, fossils (such as the extinct reptile Mesosaurus), and ancient climate evidence (such as glacial deposits). He proposed the idea in 1912 and developed it in his 1915 book 'The Origin of Continents and Oceans,' laying groundwork for later plate tectonics.�ans��src��V魏格纳（1915）《海陆的起源》（Die Entstehung der Kontinente und Ozeane）�8A. Wegener, 'The Origin of Continents and Oceans' (1915)��id�cbfc163b601b�body��U早期火星拥有更厚的CO₂大气，有液态水形成的河流、湖泊，甚至可能存在巨大海洋；如今它寒冷干燥、大气稀薄。证据包括干涸的河谷与三角洲、盖尔撞击坑的古湖泊沉积、含水矿物（黏土、硫酸盐），以及好奇号和毅力号发现的过去宜居环境的化学证据。�aEarly Mars had a thicker CO₂ atmosphere, rivers and lakes of liquid water, and possibly a vast ocean; today it is cold, dry, and thin-atmosphered. Evidence includes dry river valleys and deltas, ancient lake deposits in Gale crater, water-bearing minerals (clays, sulfates), and chemical signs of past habitability found by Curiosity and Perseverance.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�cc167674a433�body��)里氏震级由查尔斯·里克特于1935年提出，适用于地方性较小地震，对极大地震会“饱和”而低估。现代科学界改用矩震级（Mw），它基于地震矩（断层面积×滑移量×岩石刚度），能更准确地描述大型地震，二者均为对数尺度。�IThe Richter scale, introduced by Charles Richter in 1935, works well for local, smaller quakes but 'saturates' and underestimates very large ones. Scientists now use moment magnitude (Mw), based on seismic moment (fault area × slip × rock rigidity), which describes big earthquakes more accurately; both are logarithmic scales.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�cca9076d6023�body��,浮游植物通过光合作用把表层海水中的CO₂转化为有机碳，经浮游动物摄食后以粪便颗粒和生物残骸形式沉降到深海，部分碳被长期封存。这一过程把碳从表层转移到深层，降低了表层海水CO₂分压，使大气CO₂不断向海洋溶解。�kPhytoplankton convert CO₂ dissolved in surface waters into organic carbon by photosynthesis; grazed by zooplankton, the carbon sinks as fecal pellets and dead organisms, some being sequestered in the deep ocean long-term. This transfers carbon from surface to depth, lowering the surface partial pressure of CO₂ so the ocean keeps absorbing atmospheric CO₂.�ans��src��H《自然-地球科学》(Nature Geoscience) 海洋生物地球化学泵�-Nature Geoscience (Ocean biogeochemical pump)��id�d23d72046ae5�body��{边界处板块相互挤压、张裂或错动，应力集中释放引发地震，岩浆也容易沿薄弱带上升喷发。قAt boundaries plates collide, separate or slide, concentrating stress that triggers quakes and lets magma rise through weak zones.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�d342c0cffd82�body�ٓ含重碳酸钙的水滴从洞顶向下滴落时,溶解的二氧化碳部分逸出,碳酸钙便一点点沉淀,自洞顶向下堆积成钟乳石。��As drips of calcium-bicarbonate-rich water seep from the cave ceiling, some of the dissolved carbon dioxide escapes, so calcium carbonate precipitates bit by bit and builds the stalactite downward from the ceiling.�ans��src��?Ford & Williams,《洞穴与洞穴岩溶》,Academic Press,2007�ID. C. Ford and M. W. Williams, Caves and Cave Karst, Academic Press, 2007��id�d4b62749f565�body���绿地通过植物蒸散消耗热量并为遮荫，降低周边气温；冷屋面采用高反照率材料反射太阳辐射、减少吸热，降低屋面与近地温度。两者都是缓解热岛的低成本的适应性措施。��Greenery cools via plant evapotranspiration and shade; cool roofs use high-albedo materials to reflect solar radiation and absorb less heat, lowering roof and near-surface temperatures. Both are low-cost adaptive measures against the heat island.�ans��src��6美国环保局（EPA）《城市热岛缓解》报告�,U.S. EPA, Reducing Urban Heat Islands report��id�d538362c8232�body��u风化剥蚀的碎屑、生物遗骸或化学沉淀物在水底一层层堆积，经压实和胶结后固结成岩。ٞWeathered fragments, remains of organisms, or chemical precipitates accumulate in layers at the bottom of water and harden through compaction and cementation.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�d5b5a0202885�body���长石是地壳中含量最丰富的矿物族，占地壳矿物总量约六成，常见于花岗岩等岩石中。它风化后形成黏土和土壤的关键成分，也是陶瓷和玻璃工业的重要原料。��Feldspar is the most abundant mineral group in the crust, making up roughly 60% of crustal minerals and common in rocks like granite. It weathers into clays and soil ingredients and is vital to ceramics and glass making.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�d609548a9d20�body�ي常见征兆有：山坡出现新裂缝、树木歪斜、井泉突然变浑或干涸、坡脚有小崩塌。发现这些要尽快撤离。ٕWarnings include new cracks on the slope, leaning trees, suddenly muddy or dry springs, and small falls at the foot. If you see these, leave quickly.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�d6e8cbefde5b�body���海水入侵是咸淡水界面因淡水压力下降而向陆地方向推移的现象。沿海过量抽取地下水降低了淡水头，原本平衡的界面被打破，咸水楔上溯污染井水，威胁饮水与农业灌溉。�Seawater intrusion is the landward movement of the saltwater–freshwater interface when freshwater pressure drops. Coastal over-pumping lowers the freshwater head, upsetting the balance so the saline wedge advances and contaminates wells, threatening drinking and irrigation supplies.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�d761307f82e4�body���湾流把加勒比海的暖水沿美国东岸向北输送，途中成为北大西洋暖流，抵达西欧沿岸时仍比同纬度海水暖得多。暖水加热空气，再经偏西风把热量送到大陆，使伦敦、巴黎等地比同纬度的北美东部冬季高约5到10摄氏度。这股暖流是北大西洋表层环流的一部分，输送量约为全世界河流总流量的百倍。�The Gulf Stream carries warm Caribbean water up the US East Coast and, as the North Atlantic Current, still arrives off Western Europe far warmer than the surrounding sea at the same latitude. The warm water heats the air and the prevailing westerlies carry that heat inland, making London and Paris some 5-10 C milder in winter than eastern North America at the same latitude. It is part of the North Atlantic's surface circulation and transports roughly one hundred times the flow of all the world's rivers combined.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�d888b985699e�body���通常要求持续大风（如每小时 35 英里以上）、大量吹雪，且能见度降到很低（如不足 0.4 公里）并维持至少三小时，重点在“风+雪+看不清”而不只是下得多。��Typically it needs sustained strong wind (e.g., over 35 mph), blowing snow, and visibility under about 0.4 km lasting at least three hours—emphasis on wind plus snow plus poor visibility, not just heavy snowfall.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�d8f9d3f64201�body���喀斯特是石灰岩等可溶岩被雨水（含碳酸）溶蚀、形成溶洞、天坑与地下河的地貌。中国南方与桂林山水便是典型，地表水常漏入地下使地面少河流。�Karst is terrain where soluble rock like limestone is dissolved by rainwater carrying carbonic acid, producing caves, sinkholes, and underground rivers. Southern China and the Guilin hills are classic examples, with surface water often vanishing underground so streams are scarce.�ans��src��9Plummer 等《物理地质学》第16版（McGraw-Hill）�WPlummer, C.C., Carlson, D.H. & Hammersley, L., Physical Geology (16th ed., McGraw-Hill)��id�d9f23728b022�body���离散型边界是两块板块相互张裂、彼此远离的地方，地幔物质上涌冷却形成新地壳。典型例子是洋中脊和东非大裂谷，常伴随浅源地震和火山活动。��A divergent boundary is where two plates pull apart, and upwelling mantle material cools to form new crust. Examples include mid-ocean ridges and the East African Rift, often with shallow earthquakes and volcanism.�ans��src��^Stein & Wysession,《地震学、板块与构造学导论》第2版,剑桥大学出版社,2013�zC. Stein and M. Wysession, An Introduction to Seismology, Plates, and Tectonics, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2013��id�daeff5678c47�body���水分子一端带正电、一端带负电，能拉开许多离子化合物和极性分子，把它们均匀分散。这种极性使水可溶解盐、糖等大量物质，因而有万能溶剂之称。��A water molecule has a positive end and a negative end, so it can pry apart many ionic and polar substances and disperse them evenly. This polarity lets water dissolve salts, sugars, and many other materials, earning it the name universal solvent.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�daf122c047ed�body���由风驱动的表面洋流（如墨西哥湾流）把低纬度的暖水输向高纬度，把冷水带回热带，在全球重新分配热量，使沿海和大陆气候更温和。它们与深层温盐环流共同构成地球的“热量传送带”。�0Wind-driven surface currents, such as the Gulf Stream, carry warm water from low latitudes toward high latitudes and return cold water toward the tropics, redistributing heat globally and moderating coastal and continental climates. Together with deep thermohaline flow they form Earth's 'heat conveyor.'�ans��src��cRachel Carson,《The Sea Around Us》Oxford University Press,1951;中译《环绕我们的海洋》�HR. Carson, The Sea Around Us, Oxford University Press, 1951; Chinese ed.��id�dbe62df9e93d�body��震级（如里氏、矩震级）衡量地震释放的能量大小，由地震波振幅确定，一次地震只有一个震级。烈度描述地表某处实际感受到的破坏程度，随距离震中和地质条件变化，同一地震可有多个烈度值。�'Magnitude (e.g., Richter, moment magnitude) measures the energy released, derived from seismic-wave amplitude, and a quake has a single magnitude. Intensity describes the actual shaking and damage at a location, varying with distance and local geology, so one quake yields many intensity values.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�dc2748daeb0a�body��$太阳短波辐射穿过大气到达地表，地表以红外长波形式再辐射热量。二氧化碳、水汽等气体吸收这些红外辐射并重新向各方向发射，使低层大气和地表升温。阿伦尼乌斯在1896年首次定量计算了二氧化碳对地表温度的影响。�hSolar shortwave radiation passes through the atmosphere to the surface, which re-emits heat as infrared longwave radiation. Gases like carbon dioxide and water vapor absorb that infrared and re-emit it in all directions, warming the lower atmosphere and surface. Arrhenius first calculated carbon dioxide's effect on surface temperature quantitatively in 1896.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�dc967f01bf27�body���板岩是页岩在较低温压条件下经区域变质作用形成的。变质过程中片状矿物（如绿泥石、云母）定向排列，形成垂直于主应力的板理，使岩石能沿板理劈开。��Slate forms from shale by regional metamorphism at relatively low temperature and pressure. During metamorphism, platy minerals such as chlorite and mica align perpendicular to the principal stress, producing a slaty cleavage along which the rock splits.�ans��src�� 《普通地质学》(舒良树)�General Geology (Shu Liangshu)��id�dd0bb05fb449�body��s它坐落在地壳裂开的“裂谷”里，地层不断下陷，湖水就越积越深，最深处超过1600米。ٌIt sits in a continental rift where the crust is pulling apart and sinking, so the basin keeps deepening; its maximum depth exceeds 1,600 m.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�dfb8858db570�body���同位素测年测的是矿物最后结晶或变质重置的时间，而非外表。若岩石经历了后期热事件重设了「时钟」，或外貌因风化改变，就会出现年龄与外观不符的情况。��Isotopic dating measures when minerals last crystallized or were reset by metamorphism, not their looks. If rock later underwent heating that reset the 'clock', or weathering changed appearance, age and look can mismatch.�ans��src��8Wicander & Monroe,《Historical Geology》Cengage 多版�TR. Wicander and J. S. Monroe, Historical Geology, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�e0a8e11ca544�body�ل海水太咸不能直接用，当地河流少、污染和人口多让淡水供不应求，所以还得靠调水、节水和水库。٤Seawater is too salty to use, and with few local rivers, pollution and huge populations, fresh water falls short, so cities rely on transfer, saving and reservoirs.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�e17f4ef26789�body���岩浆上升会压裂岩石并移动地下流体，监测主要靠三大信号：地震仪捕捉岩浆涌动引起的小地震群和火山震颤；GPS与卫星雷达（InSAR）测出山体膨胀变形；气体站检测二氧化硫等火山气体异常增加。把这些信号结合起来，就能判断岩浆是否在上升并发布预警。不过目前仍无法精确预测喷发时刻，只能给出概率性的警报。��Rising magma fractures rock and shifts underground fluids, so monitoring relies on three main signals: seismometers pick up swarms of small quakes and volcanic tremor; GPS and satellite radar (InSAR) measure swelling of the edifice; and gas stations detect surges of sulfur dioxide and other volcanic gases. Combining these signals reveals whether magma is ascending and allows warnings to be issued. Still, the exact moment of eruption cannot yet be predicted, only probabilistic alerts.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�e1bcd663a57d�body�ٱ地球把热量以红外线的形式向外辐射；大气中的温室气体会拦住一部分红外辐射再放回地面，于是热量收支达到平衡，温度保持稳定。ٴEarth radiates its heat as infrared light; greenhouse gases intercept part of that infrared and re-radiate it back down, so the energy budget balances and temperature stays steady.�ans��src��>盛裴轩 等,《大气物理学》,北京大学出版社,2003�HSheng Peixuan et al., Atmospheric Physics, Peking University Press, 2003��id�e29c78019f5d�body���它们分别是地球轨道形状（偏心率，约 10 万年）、地轴倾斜角度（约 4 万年）和地轴指向的进动（约 2 万年）的缓慢周期变化，三者叠加塑造了冰期—间冰期节律。ٽThey are slow cycles in orbital shape (eccentricity, ~100 kyr), axial tilt (obliquity, ~41 kyr), and wobble of Earth's spin axis (precession, ~21 kyr); together they set the ice-age rhythm.�ans��src��8Wicander & Monroe,《Historical Geology》Cengage 多版�TR. Wicander and J. S. Monroe, Historical Geology, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�e2ff0485e8d4�body��P波（初波）是纵波，质点前后振动、传播最快，能通过固体、液体和气体。S波（次波）是横波，质点上下/左右振动、较慢，且只能穿过固体、不能通过液体。二者到达的时差常被用来估算震中距离。�eP-waves (primary) are compressional waves that vibrate along the direction of travel, move fastest, and pass through solids, liquids, and gases. S-waves (secondary) are shear waves that vibrate perpendicular to travel, are slower, and can travel only through solids—not liquids. Their arrival time difference is used to estimate distance to the epicenter.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�e4c290733ba5�body��u太阳光线在赤道近乎垂直，单位面积能量多；两极光线斜射且被大气削弱多，能量分散。ٖAt the equator sunlight hits nearly straight on, concentrating energy; at the poles it slants and is weakened by the atmosphere, spreading energy out.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�e7d60176fd62�body���可以看硬度（真宝石通常能在玻璃上留痕却不易被划伤）、观察折射带来的火彩、以及用放大镜找天然包裹体；最可靠还是送检，因为仿品越来越像。ټCheck hardness (real gems scratch glass yet resist scratches), look for refractive 'fire', and use a loupe for natural inclusions; the surest way is a lab test, since fakes keep improving.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�e861979f3e9d�body���暖流（如北大西洋暖流）把低纬热量带向高纬，使沿岸冬季温和；寒流（如秘鲁寒流）降低沿岸气温并常带来干旱与雾。洋流因此重塑全球热量分布与降水格局。�%Warm currents such as the North Atlantic Drift carry low-latitude heat toward high latitudes, keeping nearby coasts mild in winter; cold currents such as the Peru Current cool coastal air and often bring aridity and fog. Currents thus reshape the global distribution of heat and precipitation.�ans��src��+Garrison《海洋学》第9版（Cengage）�NGarrison, T., Oceanography: An Invitation to Marine Science (9th ed., Cengage)��id�e872624a0d36�body��冰芯气泡的甲烷浓度在冰期低、间冰期高，并与南北半球温度变化同步起伏，反映湿地排放对温度的敏感响应。Dansgaard-Oeschger事件中甲烷快速上升常被用作北半球突然增温与全球碳循环联动的证据。�NMethane in ice-core bubbles is low during glacials and high during interglacials, rising and falling in step with hemispheric temperatures, reflecting the sensitivity of wetland emissions to warming. Rapid methane rises during D-O events are taken as evidence of abrupt Northern Hemisphere warming coupling to the global carbon cycle.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�e8cf7bb03dc5�body�ٱ当海水富营养化又遇到温暖稳定的天气，某些藻类会爆发性繁殖形成赤潮；部分藻类释放毒素，被贝类富集后就可能毒害吃海鲜的人。ٷWhen nutrient-rich, warm, calm water lets some algae explode in number, a red tide forms; certain algae release toxins that accumulate in shellfish and can poison people who eat them.�ans��src��cRachel Carson,《The Sea Around Us》Oxford University Press,1951;中译《环绕我们的海洋》�HR. Carson, The Sea Around Us, Oxford University Press, 1951; Chinese ed.��id�earth_19_001�body��Q震级度量的是震源释放的能量,属于地震自身的属性;烈度刻画的是某一地点感受到的震动强弱,取决于震中距、传播路径和场地条件。软弱土层会有选择性地放大某些频段的震动,使得位于软土盆地上的城市遭受的破坏反而可能超过离破裂带更近的基岩场地。��Magnitude measures the energy released at the source and is an intrinsic property of the event, whereas intensity describes how strongly shaking is felt at a given site, governed by distance, propagation path, and ground conditions. Soft soils selectively amplify particular frequency bands, so a city sitting on a soft basin can be hit harder than rock sites much closer to the rupture.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�earth_19_004�body��R冰架漂浮时排开的海水体积与其自身质量相当,崩解或融化并不直接改变海平面;但冰架如同闸门,约束着后方陆地冰流的速度。拉森B冰架于2002年解体后,原本受其阻挡的冰川流速成倍加快,更多的陆地冰被送入海洋,这部分质量转移才是海平面上升的直接来源。��While floating, an ice shelf displaces seawater equal to its own mass, so its breakup adds nothing directly to sea level; the concern is that shelves buttress the grounded ice behind them. After Larsen B disintegrated in 2002, the tributary glaciers it restrained accelerated severalfold, flushing more land ice into the ocean — and that transfer of mass is what actually lifts sea level.�ans��src��rRignot 等 2004 年发表于 Geophysical Research Letters 的论文:拉森B冰架崩塌后南极半岛冰流加速ٚRignot, E. et al., Geophysical Research Letters, 2004: Accelerated ice discharge from the Antarctic Peninsula following the collapse of Larsen B ice shelf��id�earth_19_010�body���1985年该火山仅发生一次规模不大的火山碎屑喷发,喷发柱的热量足以融化山顶冰帽,融水裹挟新鲜火山灰沿河谷加速下泄,形成时速数十公里的火山泥流,掩埋了四十余公里外的阿尔梅罗镇,逾两万三千人罹难。灾后复盘指出,若当时的警戒建议得到落实,伤亡本可大幅避免,这也促使各国把泥流模拟纳入火山风险评估。��The 1985 eruption was modest, yet its heat melted the summit ice cap and the floodwater mixed with fresh ash, racing down valleys as lahars moving tens of kilometers per hour that buried Armero more than forty kilometers away, killing over twenty-three thousand people. Post-event reviews concluded that acting on earlier warnings would have saved most lives, a lesson that pushed lahar modeling into standard volcanic risk assessment.�ans��src�٬Voight,《The 1985 Nevado del Ruiz volcano catastrophe: anatomy and retrospection》,Journal of Volcanology and Geothermal Research,1990 (DOI: 10.1016/0377-0273(90)90027-d)٪Voight, 'The 1985 Nevado del Ruiz volcano catastrophe: anatomy and retrospection', Journal of Volcanology and Geothermal Research, 1990, DOI: 10.1016/0377-0273(90)90027-d��id�earth_19_011�body��O承压含水层之上隔着不透水的顶板,其中的水承受着从高处补给区传来的静水压力。只要补给区比井口高出足够多,测压面便会升至地表以上,钻孔一旦揭穿顶板,水就沿井管上升并自流。因此自流的水头取决于补给区与井口的高程差,再扣除水流沿途的损失。��A confined aquifer sits sealed beneath an impermeable cap, so its water carries static pressure transmitted from a recharge zone at higher ground. When that zone stands far enough above the wellhead, the potentiometric surface tops the land surface, and drilling through the cap lets water climb the casing and spill freely. The available head equals the elevation difference between recharge area and wellhead, minus losses along the flow path.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�earth_19_014�body��x大气中的二氧化碳溶入雨水形成碳酸,侵蚀硅酸盐岩石,释放的钙、镁离子被河流送入海洋并沉淀为碳酸盐沉积。板块俯冲与火山脱气随后把这些碳重新归还给大气。温度升高会加快风化、增强二氧化碳消耗,温度降低则相反,这一负反馈在数十万到数百万年尺度上压制了气候的大幅漂移。��Atmospheric CO2 dissolves in rainwater as carbonic acid, which attacks silicate rock; the freed calcium and magnesium ride rivers to the ocean and settle as carbonate sediments. Subduction and volcanic degassing later hand that carbon back to the atmosphere. Because warmer conditions speed up weathering and draw CO2 down faster while cooler ones slow it, the feedback loop suppresses large climate swings on timescales of hundreds of thousands to millions of years.�ans��src��~Berner、Lasaga 与 Garrels 1983 年发表于《American Journal of Science》的碳酸盐—硅酸盐地球化学循环模型��R. A. Berner, A. C. Lasaga, R. M. Garrels, The carbonate-silicate geochemical cycle and its effect on atmospheric carbon dioxide over the past 100 million years, American Journal of Science, 1983��id�earth_19_017�body���P波比S波跑得快,单台记录上两者的到时差随震中距增大而拉大,可直接换算出台站到震源的距离。一个距离只确定一个球面,至少三个台站的距离圆弧相交才能锁定震中,震源深度则依靠更多台站的到时残差联合求解。现代定位程序以速度模型对所有到时做最小二乘拟合,快速给出震中、深度和发震时刻。��P waves outrun S waves, and at each station the widening gap between their arrivals converts directly into a source-to-station range. One range defines only a sphere, so arcs drawn from at least three ranges must intersect to fix the epicenter, while depth is constrained jointly by residuals at many more stations. Modern location codes fit a velocity model to all observed arrivals by least squares, delivering epicenter, depth, and origin time almost immediately.�ans��src��gKennett 与 Engdahl 1991 年发表于《Geophysical Journal International》的IASPEI 91全球走时表ٍB. L. N. Kennett, E. R. Engdahl, Traveltimes for global earthquake location and phase identification, Geophysical Journal International, 1991��id�earth_20_001�body��0锋面是冷暖两种性质不同的气团之间狭窄的过渡带,密度较小的暖空气被迫沿锋面爬升。上升过程中空气绝热冷却,水汽达到饱和后凝结成层状云系,并形成大范围降水。准静止锋移动缓慢,受其控制的地区常出现连续多日的阴雨天气。��A front is a narrow transition zone between air masses of contrasting temperature and density, along which lighter warm air is forced to ascend. The rising air cools adiabatically until its water vapour condenses into stratiform cloud systems that yield widespread precipitation. Where a front moves only slowly, as with a quasi-stationary front, the region beneath it can see overcast, rainy weather lasting many days.�ans��src���朱乾根、林锦瑞、寿绍文等《天气学原理和方法》(第4版),气象出版社,2007 ; 另见: Wallace, J. M. & Hobbs, P. V. (2006). Atmospheric Science: An Introductory Survey (2nd ed.). Amsterdam: Academic Press.��Wallace, J. M. & Hobbs, P. V. (2006). Atmospheric Science: An Introductory Survey (2nd ed.). Amsterdam: Academic Press. ; see also: 朱乾根、林锦瑞、寿绍文等《天气学原理和方法》(第4版),气象出版社,2007��id�earth_20_004�body��Q迎风坡平缓且较长,气流携带砂粒沿坡爬升;背风坡短而陡,坡度接近干燥砂约34度的天然休止角,构成滑动面。跃移砂粒越过丘顶后在滑动面上堆积,经反复滑塌形成向背风侧倾斜的高角度交错层理。因此古老砂岩中交错层理的倾向可用来恢复沉积时的古风向。��The windward slope is long and gentle because wind-driven sand climbs it grain by grain, whereas the short lee slope rests close to the natural angle of repose of dry sand, about 34 degrees, forming an avalanche slip face. Saltating grains carried over the crest settle on this face, and repeated avalanching builds steeply dipping cross-bedding inclined downwind. The dip direction of such cross-beds preserved in ancient sandstones can therefore be used to reconstruct palaeowind directions.�ans��src�م吴正《风沙地貌学》,科学出版社,1987 ; 另见: Pye, K. & Tsoar, H. (2009). Aeolian Sand and Sand Dunes. Berlin: Springer.هPye, K. & Tsoar, H. (2009). Aeolian Sand and Sand Dunes. Berlin: Springer. ; see also: 吴正《风沙地貌学》,科学出版社,1987��id�earth_20_007�body���冰岛横跨大西洋中脊,欧亚板块与北美板块在此离散张裂,玄武质地壳薄且断裂渗透率高,浅部即存在岩浆热源,地温梯度远超全球平均。高温蒸汽田驱动Nesjavellir、Hellisheidi等地热电站发电,做功后的尾水再经管道接入区域供热网络。这种先发电、后供热的梯级利用方式,使地热与水电共同构成冰岛一次能源的两大支柱。�0Iceland straddles the Mid-Atlantic Ridge, where the Eurasian and North American plates pull apart, leaving thin, heavily fractured basaltic crust with magma heat sources at shallow depth and geothermal gradients far above the world average. High-temperature steam fields drive power plants such as Nesjavellir and Hellisheidi, and the spent fluid is piped onward into district-heating networks. This cascaded use, electricity first and district heat afterwards, makes geothermal, alongside hydropower, one of the two pillars of Iceland's primary energy supply.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�earth_20_010�body���AMOC如一条海洋传送带:湾流把温暖偏咸的海水送往北大西洋高纬,水体冷却增密后在拉布拉多海和北欧海发生深对流下沉,再沿深层向南折返,构成全球大洋输送带的核心环节。格陵兰冰盖融水与周边径流注入淡水,稀释表层海水并降低其密度,从而削弱驱动翻转的下沉支。IPCC AR6的综合评估认为,AMOC在本世纪很可能减弱,但在本世纪内完全崩溃的可能性不大。�KThe AMOC works like an ocean conveyor: the Gulf Stream carries warm, salty water northward, where cooling raises its density enough to drive deep convection in the Labrador and Nordic Seas, and the dense water returns southward at depth as the core limb of the global overturning. Meltwater runoff from Greenland freshens the surface North Atlantic, lowering its density and weakening the sinking branch that powers the overturning. The IPCC AR6 assessment concludes the AMOC is very likely to weaken over the 21st century, though a complete collapse within the century remains unlikely.�ans��src��gCaesar等,《观测到的大西洋经向翻转环流减弱指纹》,Nature,2018年,第556卷,197-201页قJ. Caesar et al. (2018), Observed fingerprint of a weakening Atlantic Ocean overturning circulation, Nature, vol. 556, pp. 197-201��id�earth_20_011�body��+落水洞是地表水集中灌入岩溶含水层的通道,河水沿溶蚀扩大的裂隙转入地下,便成为伏流。当地下河洞顶塌陷露出竖井,就形成可直接观测水位的天窗。随着溶蚀基准面下降,地下河不断向深部袭夺,地表水系逐步被地下管网取代。��Sinkholes are points where surface water pours into the karst aquifer; when a river disappears along dissolution-widened fractures it becomes a sinking stream. Where a cave roof collapses and exposes a shaft, a karst window forms through which the underground river's level can be observed directly. As the dissolution base level lowers, subterranean piracy captures flow at ever greater depth and the pipe network progressively replaces the surface drainage.�ans��src�ـ袁道先《中国岩溶学》,地质出版社,1993 ; 另见: Ford & Williams, Karst Hydrogeology and Geomorphology, Wiley, 2007قFord & Williams, Karst Hydrogeology and Geomorphology, Wiley, 2007 ; see also: 袁道先《中国岩溶学》,地质出版社,1993��id�earth_20_014�body��^活动层冬季冻结产生冻胀,夏季融化后融土排水不畅引起融沉,路基随冻融循环反复变形。黑色沥青路面吸热量大于天然地表,抬高路基地温,使堤下多年冻土上限持续下降并发生热融沉陷。青藏工程实践中以块石路基和热棒等被动冷却结构把热量导出,维持冻土热稳定。�Winter freezing of the active layer causes frost heave, and summer melt leaves waterlogged thawed soil that settles, so the roadbed deforms through every freeze-thaw cycle. Dark asphalt absorbs more heat than the natural ground, raising subgrade temperatures and steadily lowering the permafrost table beneath the embankment, which triggers thaw subsidence. Qinghai-Tibet engineering practice relies on passive cooling structures such as ballast embankments and thermosyphons to vent heat and keep the underlying permafrost stable.�ans��src��w周幼吾等《中国冻土》,科学出版社,2000 ; 另见: French, The Periglacial Environment, 3rd ed., Wiley, 2007�yFrench, The Periglacial Environment, 3rd ed., Wiley, 2007 ; see also: 周幼吾等《中国冻土》,科学出版社,2000��id�earth_21_004�body��Z锆石晶格容纳U4+却排斥Pb2+,初始普通铅近乎为零,子体几乎全为放射成因,误差源极少。238U→206Pb与235U→207Pb两链并行计时,若两组年龄在谐和图上重合,即证明晶体自结晶以来未丢失母子体元素;加之Pb封闭温度高于900°C,锆石即使经历后期变质仍能保存原始结晶年龄。��Zircon lattices admit U4+ yet exclude Pb2+, leaving near-zero initial common lead and hence few error sources. The parallel clocks of 238U→206Pb and 235U→207Pb are tested on concordia: coincident dual ages certify that parent-daughter elements were never lost since crystallization. With Pb closure above 900 °C, zircon retains its primary crystallization age even through later metamorphism.�ans��src��UDickin, A. P., Radiogenic Isotope Geology (2nd ed.), Cambridge University Press, 2005�UAlan P. Dickin, Radiogenic Isotope Geology, 2nd ed., Cambridge University Press, 2005��id�earth_21_007�body��{道路、屋顶等不透水面把下渗压缩到接近零,降雨的大部分直接变成地表径流,密集排水管网又在几分钟到几十分钟内把它汇入河道。两者叠加使洪水过程线被明显“尖化”:洪峰流量增大、峰现时间提前。因此现代流域治理强调透水铺装、雨水花园和上游滞蓄湿地,以恢复下渗并削减洪峰。��Impervious surfaces such as roads and rooftops push infiltration close to zero, so most rainfall turns directly into overland flow, and dense storm drains deliver it to channels within minutes. Together these effects sharpen the flood hydrograph, raising the peak discharge while moving it earlier in time. Modern basin management therefore relies on permeable paving, rain gardens, and upstream detention wetlands to restore infiltration and trim that peak.�ans��src��lChow V. T.、Maidment D. R. 与 Mays L. W.,《Applied Hydrology》,McGraw-Hill,1988年,城市水文学章节�iChow V. T., Maidment D. R. & Mays L. W., Applied Hydrology, McGraw-Hill, 1988, chapter on urban hydrology��id�earth_21_010�body���根源是海陆热力差异的季节反转:夏季大陆升温远快于海洋,陆地上空形成热低压,把湿润气流从海上吸入内陆并带来集中降水;冬季大陆迅速冷却转为冷高压,干冷空气调头流向海洋,降水骤减。此外,青藏高原夏季强烈的抬升加热如同高空调热泵,显著放大了亚洲季风的强度,也造成雨季来临时的爆发式突变。�The root cause is the seasonal flip of the land-sea thermal contrast: in summer the continent heats far faster than the ocean, a thermal low forms over land, and moist air is drawn from the sea inland, delivering concentrated rainfall; in winter the land cools quickly into a cold anticyclone and dry air flows back toward the sea, collapsing the rains. On top of this, intense elevated heating of the Tibetan Plateau acts like an upper-level heat pump in summer, amplifying the Asian monsoon and sharpening its abrupt onset.�ans��src�ٲWebster, Magaña, Palmer, Shukla,《Monsoons: Processes, predictability, and the prospects for prediction》,Journal of Geophysical Research: Oceans,1998 (DOI: 10.1029/97jc02719)ٷWebster, Magaña, Palmer, Shukla et al., 'Monsoons: Processes, predictability, and the prospects for prediction', Journal of Geophysical Research: Oceans, 1998, DOI: 10.1029/97jc02719��id�earth_21_014�body���对流云中霰粒与冰晶碰撞起电,可在云底与地面之间积累出每米数百千伏的强电场。当局部场强逼近空气击穿阈值,先导顶端发射的流光汇聚成直径厘米级、温度上万开尔文的高温通道,以约50米的步长间歇式向下推进。先导一旦接地便触发回击,瞬时电流平均可达30千安左右,通道骤然增亮并激起冲击波,这就是我们听到的雷声。�SCollisional charging between graupel and ice crystals inside convective clouds accumulates electric fields reaching hundreds of kilovolts per meter between cloud base and ground. Once the local field nears air breakdown, streamers launched at the leader tip merge into a hot channel centimeters wide at tens of thousands of kelvin, probing downward in intermittent steps of roughly 50 meters. When the leader touches ground it triggers the return stroke, carrying instantaneous currents averaging about 30 kiloamperes; the channel flares brilliantly and drives the shock wave we hear as thunder.�ans��src��MRakov 与 Uman,Lightning: Physics and Effects,Cambridge University Press,2003�PRakov and Uman, Lightning: Physics and Effects, Cambridge University Press, 2003��id�earth_21_017�body��~波能与潮能的相对强弱决定海岸类型:浪控岸段沿岸流纵向搬运泥沙,塑造障壁岛与潟湖体系;潮控岸段则以宽阔潮坪和潮流砂脊占主导。当河流来沙不足以抵消海洋动力的再改造时,河口被淹没并展宽为漏斗状河口湾。钱塘江口与密西西比口的对比清楚展示了这两个端元之间的连续过渡谱系。��The relative strength of wave versus tidal energy sets the coastal type: on wave-dominated sectors longshore drift moves sand alongshore to form barrier islands backed by lagoons, whereas tide-dominated sectors favor broad tidal flats and tidal sand ridges. Where riverine supply cannot keep pace with marine reworking, the river mouth drowns and widens into a funnel-shaped estuary. Contrasting the Qiantang estuary with the Mississippi mouth illustrates the continuous spectrum between these two end members.�ans��src��TR. A. Davis 与 D. M. FitzGerald 合著《Beaches and Coasts》,Blackwell Publishing�NR. A. Davis Jr. and D. M. FitzGerald, Beaches and Coasts, Blackwell Publishing��id�earth_22_007�body���烃源岩中的干酪根靠温度驱动的热裂解生成油气，反应速率按阿伦尼乌斯定律随温度指数增长：低于约60 °C时，地质时间尺度内降解太慢，几乎不生油；高于约150 °C时，已生成的液态烃会进一步裂解为湿气与干气并残留碳质残渣。只有中间这段温压条件既能大量产出液态烃又不致将其破坏，故称生油窗，对应的埋深大致为一两千米到四五千米。��Oil forms as kerogen in source rocks cracks under heat, with reaction rates rising exponentially as temperature climbs. Below roughly 60 °C the kerogen degrades too slowly over geologic time to yield much oil; above about 150 °C liquid hydrocarbons already formed crack onward into wet and dry gas, leaving carbonaceous residue. Only this intermediate temperature range both produces abundant liquids and preserves them—the oil window, reached at depths of roughly one to five kilometers.�ans��src��bB.P. Tissot、D.H. Welte，《石油的形成与赋存》（第2版），Springer-Verlag，1984年�\B.P. Tissot & D.H. Welte, Petroleum Formation and Occurrence, 2nd ed., Springer-Verlag, 1984��id�earth_22_010�body���二者互为碳的同质多象变体，晶体结构决定宏观性质：金刚石中每个碳原子以sp³杂化与四个碳原子成键，形成牢固的三维共价网络，因而硬度居天然矿物之首且不导电；石墨由sp²键构成的六方原子层堆叠而成，层间仅靠微弱的范德华力维系，层片易于滑动，故质地柔软可作润滑剂，而层内离域的π电子能沿层面自由移动，使石墨成为良好的导体。�They are polymorphs of carbon, and crystal structure dictates behavior. In diamond each atom bonds to four neighbors through strong directional sp³ bonds, building a rigid three-dimensional framework—hence the hardest known mineral and an electrical insulator. Graphite stacks flat sp²-bonded hexagonal sheets held together only by weak van der Waals forces: the sheets slip easily, making it soft enough to serve as a lubricant, while delocalized electrons roam within each sheet, so graphite conducts along the layers.�ans��src��mW.A. Deer、R.A. Howie、J. Zussman，《造岩矿物导论》（第3版），Mineralogical Society，2013年ّW.A. Deer, R.A. Howie & J. Zussman, An Introduction to the Rock-Forming Minerals, 3rd ed., Mineralogical Society of Great Britain & Ireland, 2013��id�earth_22_014�body���厄尔尼诺指赤道中东太平洋海表持续异常增暖，与大气南方涛动合称ENSO。信风减弱后，赤道上升流和东侧冷水上翻随之减弱，暖水向东扩展推高中东部海温；海温升高又削弱沃克环流、进一步放松信风，这一相互放大的比耶克尼斯正反馈让暖状态自我维持。其后海洋波动调整改变相位，暖事件衰减乃至转为拉尼娜，并借遥相关扰动全球降水与气温。��El Nino denotes a large-scale, persistent anomalous warming of sea surface temperatures across the equatorial central and eastern Pacific, paired with the atmospheric Southern Oscillation in the ENSO cycle. Once the trade winds slacken, equatorial upwelling and the surfacing of cold eastern water weaken, letting warm water spread east and raising central-eastern sea temperatures; the warmer ocean then relaxes the Walker circulation and loosens the trades further. This mutually amplifying Bjerknes feedback sustains the warm state until oceanic wave adjustment shifts the phase toward decay or La Nina, while teleconnections perturb global rainfall and temperature.�ans��src�ُTimmermann, A. 等，《El Niño–Southern Oscillation complexity》，Nature 第559卷535–545页，2018年，DOI: 10.1038/s41586-018-0252-6وTimmermann, A. et al., El Niño–Southern Oscillation complexity, Nature, vol. 559, pp. 535–545, 2018, DOI: 10.1038/s41586-018-0252-6��id�earth_22_017�body���GSSP即全球界线层型剖面与点位：国际地层委员会在一套连续出露的地层中指定物理点位，作为阶等年代地层单位底界的全球标准。岩性界面常常穿时——同期不同盆地可分别沉积砂岩或灰岩，难以全球对比；而标志种的首现近似等时的“时间面”。因此金钉子以特定化石首现为主标志，辅以地球化学事件，保证地质年代表全球统一。�2A GSSP is a globally agreed physical point in a continuous, well-exposed section, designated by the International Commission on Stratigraphy as the standard base of a chronostratigraphic unit such as a stage. Lithological boundaries are often diachronous: sandstone and limestone may accumulate simultaneously in different basins, so facies cannot be correlated worldwide. The first appearance of a marker species, by contrast, approximates an isochronous time plane. Golden spikes therefore rely chiefly on fossil first appearances, aided by geochemical events.�ans��src��[Gradstein, Ogg, Schmitz & Ogg 主编，“The Geologic Time Scale 2020”，Elsevier，2020�TGradstein, Ogg, Schmitz & Ogg (eds.), "The Geologic Time Scale 2020", Elsevier, 2020��id�earth_23_004�body���水的沸点随压强升高。约2500米深的洋底静水压强近25兆帕，把海水的沸点线抬升至400°C左右，因此高温热液得以全程保持单一液相；只有在接近海底减压、逼近两相界线时才会闪蒸出汽。高温流体携带的金属硫化物遇冷海水立即沉淀，筑起烟囱体并支撑起化能合成生态系统，长期累积则形成海底块状硫化物矿床。��Water boils hotter under pressure: near 2,500 m depth the roughly 25 MPa hydrostatic load lifts seawater's boiling curve to around 400 degrees C, so hot vent fluid stays a single liquid phase and flashes to vapour only where it decompresses toward the two-phase boundary close to the seafloor. Dissolved metals precipitate instantly on mixing with cold seawater, building chimney walls that shelter chemosynthetic communities and, accumulated over millennia, seafloor massive-sulfide deposits.�ans��src�ٽVon Damm, K. L.：《海底热液活动：黑烟囱化学与烟囱体》，《地球与行星科学年鉴》（Annual Review of Earth and Planetary Sciences），1990年，18卷173–204页١Von Damm, K. L., 'Seafloor hydrothermal activity: black smoker chemistry and chimneys', Annual Review of Earth and Planetary Sciences, 1990, vol. 18, pp. 173-204��id�earth_23_007�body���海水中的溶解无机碳主要以碳酸氢根形式存在。新溶入的CO2会与碳酸根结合生成更多碳酸氢根，使游离CO2的相对增幅远大于总溶解无机碳的增幅，这一缓冲效应由雷维尔因子度量，现代海水约为10：大气CO2分压要升高约10%，表层海洋含碳量才增加1%。随着排放累积、酸化消耗碳酸根，海洋吸收CO2的化学容量还会进一步缩小。��Most dissolved inorganic carbon in seawater exists as bicarbonate. Newly absorbed CO2 reacts with carbonate ions to form yet more bicarbonate, so free CO2 grows proportionally far faster than total dissolved inorganic carbon - a buffering measured by the Revelle factor, about 10 today: atmospheric CO2 must rise roughly 10% for surface-ocean carbon to increase only 1%. As emissions accumulate and acidification consumes carbonate, this chemical uptake capacity keeps shrinking.�ans��src��nR. Revelle & H.E. Suess，《大气与海洋间的二氧化碳交换》，Tellus 9卷1期，1957年，18-27页ٵR. Revelle & H.E. Suess, "Carbon dioxide exchange between atmosphere and ocean and the question of an increase of atmospheric CO2 during the past decades", Tellus 9(1), 18-27 (1957)��id�earth_23_014�body���承压含水层夹在上下不透水的隔水层之间，补给区位于地势更高处，含水层中的水承受着超过大气压的压力。把各点的水头连成的假想曲面就是测压水位：凡是地面高程低于该面的地方，钻孔一旦揭穿隔水层，地下水便会自流涌出甚至喷出地表，形成自流井。澳大利亚大自流盆地即是经典例证，使干旱内陆无需水泵便能获得稳定水源。�A confined aquifer sits trapped between impermeable layers, and its recharge zone lies at higher elevation, so its water stands under pressure greater than atmospheric. The imaginary surface joining the hydraulic heads everywhere is the potentiometric surface: wherever the land lies below that surface, drilling through the confining layer lets groundwater flow out unaided, or even fountain upward — an artesian well. Australia's Great Artesian Basin is the classic case, supplying stable water to the arid interior without any pumping.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�earth_24_001�body��(格陵兰冰盖平均厚约1.6公里、覆盖约170万平方公里,全部融化将使全球海平面升高约7.4米,足以重塑绝大多数沿海城市。更麻烦的是它的正反馈机制:融水在冰面形成暗色池塘,吸收更多阳光加速消融;边缘冰川变薄后暖海水侵蚀接地线,冰流加快把内陆冰体更快送往海洋。冰盖对气候的响应存在滞后与不可逆性——一旦质量损失越过某条阈值,即使气温回落也可能持续亏损,这正是IPCC评估中最受关注的海平面临界系统之一。�`The Greenland Ice Sheet averages 1.6 kilometers thick over roughly 1.7 million square kilometers; melting it entirely would raise global sea level by about 7.4 meters, redrawing most coastlines. Feedbacks make it worse: meltwater pools darken the surface and soak up more sunshine, while thinning marine-terminating glaciers retreat and speed up, shipping interior ice seaward faster. Because ice sheets respond with lag and irreversibility, past a threshold of mass loss they may keep shrinking even if temperatures stabilize — making Greenland one of the most-watched tipping systems in IPCC assessments.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�earth_24_003�body��决定性因素是岩浆的二氧化硅含量与气体逃逸难度。夏威夷的玄武岩浆含二氧化硅仅约50%,黏度像蜂蜜,气泡能从容上浮逃逸,熔岩湖与火帘喷泉虽壮观却少致命爆发;维苏威式的俯冲带岩浆含二氧化硅60%以上,黏稠如沥青,还携带大量水汽与二氧化碳——气体被高压憋在岩浆房里,直到裂隙开启的瞬间才急速膨胀,把岩浆撕成数亿颗灰粒,以音速冲出地表,形成普林尼式喷发柱。一句话:黏的岩浆等于摇晃过的香槟。�OThe deciding factors are silica content and how hard it is for gas to escape. Hawaiian basalt holds only about fifty percent silica; it flows like honey and bubbles escape gently, producing lava lakes and fire fountains rather than deadly blasts. Subduction-zone magma like Vesuvius carries over sixty percent silica — sticky as tar — plus abundant water vapor and carbon dioxide. Gas stays pressurized until a fracture opens, then expands explosively, shredding magma into hundreds of millions of ash particles at sonic speed: a Plinian column. Viscous magma is simply shaken champagne.�ans��src��KFrancis 与 Oppenheimer,《Volcanoes》第2版,Oxford University Press,2004�PP. Francis and C. Oppenheimer, Volcanoes, 2nd ed., Oxford University Press, 2004��id�earth_24_007�body��␀确实有,那就是超级单体里倾斜的上升气流。雹胚被气流托举进入过冷水滴区,撞冻上一层冰后被甩出上升流或因重力下坠,再被另一支气流重新抬升,往复经历干湿交替生长:湿层冻结慢形成透明冰,干层快冻夹带气泡成乳白冰,层层年轮记录了它在云中的每一圈行程。垒球大小的冰雹要求上升气流速度超过每秒50米。1970年堪萨斯州科菲维尔落下一颗重约760克的冰雹,曾长期保持美国重量纪录。��There is one — the tilted updraft of a supercell. An embryo gets lofted into the supercooled droplets, accretes an ice layer, gets ejected or falls out, then is recaptured and lifted again; alternating wet and dry growth leaves clear and milky ice rings recording every lap through the storm. Softball-size hail demands updrafts exceeding fifty meters per second. The stone of roughly 760 grams that fell on Coffeyville, Kansas in 1970 held the U.S. weight record for decades.�ans��src���Browning, Foote,《Airflow and hail growth in supercell storms and some implications for hail suppression》,Quarterly Journal of the Royal Meteorological Society,1976 (DOI: 10.1002/qj.49710243303)��Browning, Foote, 'Airflow and hail growth in supercell storms and some implications for hail suppression', Quarterly Journal of the Royal Meteorological Society, 1976, DOI: 10.1002/qj.49710243303��id�earth_24_008�body��水在4摄氏度密度最大,这一反常性质使深湖夏季自然分层:晒暖的低密度表水层(epilimnion)浮在冷重的底水层(hypolimnion)之上,中间温度骤降的斜温层像隐形盖板阻止混合,底层溶解氧只出不进,渐被分解耗尽。秋季表层变冷变重,大风一搅,密度差消失,整湖翻转:氧气送回湖底,营养盐翻上表层,奠定来春藻类格局。温带深湖每年混合一至两次;不少浅水热带湖全年频繁混合,少数深湖则近乎永久分层。�GWater is densest at four degrees Celsius, and that anomaly stratifies deep lakes in summer: warm low-density epilimnion floats over cold hypolimnion, with the thermocline as an invisible lid blocking mixing, so bottom oxygen is consumed faster than replenished. Autumn cools the surface until wind erases the density contrast and the whole lake turns over, sending oxygen down and nutrients up — setting the next spring's algae stage. Deep temperate lakes mix once or twice yearly; many shallow tropical lakes mix constantly, while a few deep ones stay near-permanently stratified.�ans��src��LWetzel,《Limnology: Lake and River Ecosystems》第3版,Academic Press,2001�QR. G. Wetzel, Limnology: Lake and River Ecosystems, 3rd ed., Academic Press, 2001��id�earth_26_011�body��n海岸侵蚀由波浪冲击、泥沙供应不足和海平面上升三重因素叠加驱动。当海平面上升时，波浪基面抬高，原本稳定的沙滩被冲刷后无法自然补充。全球约四分之一沙质海岸在上世纪已净退缩，加勒比和西非部分地区尤为严重。防护手段从硬式海堤到基于自然的牡蛎礁修复不等。�'Coastal erosion is driven jointly by wave attack, insufficient sediment supply and rising sea level. As sea level climbs, the wave base rises and nearshore water deepens, so waves strike farther inland and once-stable beaches are flushed away faster than sand can be replenished; where rivers bring less material, retreat runs to several meters a year. About a quarter of the world sandy coasts retreated net over the last century, worst around the Caribbean and West Africa. Responses range from hard seawalls to nature-based oyster reef restoration.�ans��src��^Masselink and Hughes, Introduction to Coastal Processes and Geomorphology, Hodder Arnold, 2003�dG. Masselink and M. Hughes, Introduction to Coastal Processes and Geomorphology, Hodder Arnold, 2003��id�earth_26_016�body���因为季风爆发是非线性跳变而非渐变。春末印度半岛强烈加热使海陆热力差接近全年峰值，跨赤道的索马里急流将充沛水汽输向次大陆；一旦整层大气可降水量越过临界值，深对流的潜热释放会反过来加强低空辐合，正反馈使环流在一两周内完成春夏环流型的切换，于是喀拉拉沿岸雨量骤增，形成六月上旬标志性的季风爆发。�Because onset is a nonlinear jump, not a ramp. Intense late-spring heating brings the land-sea thermal contrast near its annual peak, and the cross-equatorial Somali jet delivers abundant moisture to the subcontinent; once column-integrated precipitable water crosses a critical threshold, latent heat release from deep convection reinforces low-level convergence, and this positive feedback flips the circulation to its summer regime within one to two weeks — producing the celebrated rainfall burst over Kerala in early June.�ans��src��<王斌(B. Wang)主编,The Asian Monsoon,Springer/Praxis,2006�7B. Wang (ed.), The Asian Monsoon, Springer/Praxis, 2006��id�eb4da6dc5cfc�body�� CFCs化学性质稳定，能上升到平流层，在强烈紫外辐射下分解并释放氯原子；一个氯原子可通过催化循环破坏成千上万个臭氧分子，把O₃转化为O₂。南极冬季低温形成的极地平流层云会加剧这一过程，形成“臭氧洞”。�uCFCs are stable enough to reach the stratosphere, where intense UV radiation breaks them apart, releasing chlorine atoms; a single chlorine atom destroys tens of thousands of ozone molecules through a catalytic cycle, converting O₃ to O₂. The very cold conditions forming polar stratospheric clouds over Antarctica intensify the process, producing the “ozone hole.”�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�ed18d40dcca8�body���臭氧层位于平流层，能吸收有害紫外线保护生命。氟利昂等氯氟烃释放的氯原子会催化分解臭氧分子，造成南极臭氧洞，促使1987年《蒙特利尔议定书》限制其生产。�The ozone layer in the stratosphere absorbs harmful ultraviolet radiation, protecting life. Chlorine from chlorofluorocarbons (CFCs) catalytically destroys ozone molecules, creating the Antarctic ozone hole and prompting the 1987 Montreal Protocol to phase out these chemicals.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�eeb5cd899c9b�body��当高纬或高山的降雪在年内积累量超过消融量，雪被压实成粒雪（firn）并最终重结晶为冰川冰。冰川通过两种主要方式移动：底部滑动（冰与基岩界面融水润滑）和内部塑性变形（冰在自身重力下缓慢流动）。�3Where snowfall accumulates faster than it melts in cold high latitudes or mountains, snow compacts into firn and eventually recrystallizes into glacial ice. Glaciers move mainly by basal sliding (lubricated by meltwater at the bed) and internal plastic deformation (ice flowing slowly under its own weight).�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�f0e482019ebb�body��u拉尼娜是赤道东太平洋海温异常偏冷的状态，常使西太平洋台风增多、美洲西部更干旱。�oLa Niña is unusually cold eastern Pacific water, often bringing more west-Pacific typhoons and drier Americas.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�f219c879dc9a�body�ٷ旋转需要科里奥利力来启动，而赤道上科里奥利力为零，空气难以形成旋转的低气压中心，所以飓风一般在离赤道至少约 5 度以外才生成。��Spin needs the Coriolis force to get started, but it is zero at the equator, so a rotating low-pressure center can't form there; hurricanes need to be at least about 5 degrees from the equator.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�f225338d1f62�body���汇聚型边界是两块板块相互碰撞、彼此靠近的地方，常形成海沟、火山弧和巨大山脉。当一块大洋板块俯冲到另一块板块之下时，会引发深源地震和强烈火山活动。��A convergent boundary is where two plates collide and move toward each other, often forming trenches, volcanic arcs, and large mountain ranges. When one oceanic plate subducts beneath another, it produces deep earthquakes and intense volcanism.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�f2b34bb6f1c8�body���造山运动（orogeny）多发生在板块碰撞处，地壳被挤压褶皱、断裂并抬升成山，如喜马拉雅山由印度与欧亚板块碰撞而成。火山活动也能单独堆出山脉。��Mountain building (orogeny) mostly occurs where plates collide, folding, faulting, and lifting the crust into ranges—the Himalayas rose as India met Eurasia. Volcanism can also build mountains on its own.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�f2e26d488271�body��o非洲板块内部受张裂应力拉薄地壳，形成一系列断裂谷地，未来可能演化成新海洋。هInside the African plate, extensional stress thins the crust forming a chain of rift valleys that may become a new ocean in the future.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�f3c0283cfe70�body���岩石圈由地壳和地幔最顶部坚硬的一层组成，约一百多公里厚，整体是刚性的。软流层在岩石圈之下，温度接近岩石熔点，呈缓慢蠕动的塑性状态。板块就是一块块岩石圈，它们像大木筏一样在软流层上缓慢漂移，因为软流层虽然仍是固体，却能在长时间尺度上流动，既支撑又运送上方的板块。��The lithosphere is the rigid outer shell made of the crust plus the stiff top of the mantle, about 100 km thick or more. Beneath it lies the asthenosphere, where rock approaches its melting point and deforms by slow creep. Tectonic plates are pieces of lithosphere that drift like rafts across the asthenosphere, because that layer, though still solid, can flow over long timescales, supporting and carrying the plates above it.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�f415a4aee0d8�body�ٮ它们改变了热带太平洋的海温格局，进而挪动大气环流和急流位置，通过“遥相关”把影响传到很远的地方，引起别处干旱或暴雨。��They reshape tropical Pacific sea-surface temperatures, shifting atmospheric circulation and jet streams, and via 'teleconnections' send impacts far away, causing droughts or floods elsewhere.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�f439707bb99c�body�ف地球内部放射性衰变和残余热量使岩层升温，地下水循环受热形成温泉或干热岩，可被开发利用。٘Radioactive decay and residual heat warm rocks inside Earth; circulating groundwater heated this way forms hot springs or hot dry rock usable as energy.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�f5e9311860a0�body��'海底扩张指新的洋壳在大洋中脊处由地幔物质上涌冷凝形成，并逐年向两侧推开，老洋壳则在俯冲带重新沉入地幔。这一理论由哈里·赫斯（Harry Hess）在1962年的《大洋盆地的历史》中系统提出，为大陆漂移提供了关键机制。�USeafloor spreading is the process by which new oceanic crust forms at mid-ocean ridges from upwelling mantle material and is pushed outward over time, while older crust is consumed at subduction zones. Harry Hess proposed the concept in his 1962 paper 'History of Ocean Basins,' providing the mechanism that made continental drift plausible.�ans��src��<Press & Siever,《Understanding Earth》W. H. Freeman 多版�LF. Press and R. Siever, Understanding Earth, W. H. Freeman, various editions��id�f5edef45a487�body��河流把陆地岩石风化释放的溶解盐（主要是氯化钠）带入海洋，而蒸发只带走纯水、留下盐分，盐分便在海中长期累积。全球海洋平均盐度约为35‰（即每千克海水约35克盐），但会随蒸发、降水和结冰而变化。�gRivers carry dissolved salts—mainly sodium chloride—released by weathering of rocks into the ocean, while evaporation removes only pure water and leaves the salt behind, so salts accumulate over geologic time. The global average salinity is about 35‰ (roughly 35 g of salt per kg of seawater), varying with evaporation, precipitation, and ice formation.�ans��src��cRachel Carson,《The Sea Around Us》Oxford University Press,1951;中译《环绕我们的海洋》�HR. Carson, The Sea Around Us, Oxford University Press, 1951; Chinese ed.��id�f646ff5dc529�body���主流证据指向一颗小行星撞击（墨西哥尤卡坦的希克苏鲁伯陨石坑），引发全球尘埃遮日、气候骤冷与酸雨。这导致非鸟恐龙灭绝，并为哺乳动物崛起让路。��Leading evidence points to an asteroid impact (the Chicxulub crater in Mexico's Yucatan) that threw up global dust, chilling climate and acid rain. It killed non-avian dinosaurs and opened the way for mammals.�ans��src��8Wicander & Monroe,《Historical Geology》Cengage 多版�TR. Wicander and J. S. Monroe, Historical Geology, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�f76dc95f8537�body��春季农业径流将大量氮磷送入河口，夏季水温升高与层化增强抑制了氧气垂向混合，底部耗氧加剧，缺氧区在夏秋扩张；秋冬混合增强、营养输入减少后面积又收缩。密西西比河口的墨西哥湾缺氧区即呈此年度循环。�\Spring agricultural runoff delivers abundant nitrogen and phosphorus to estuaries; summer warming and stronger stratification curb vertical oxygen mixing while bottom respiration consumes it, expanding hypoxia in late summer. With autumn–winter mixing and less nutrient input the zone shrinks—the Gulf of Mexico hypoxia shows this annual cycle.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�f816934ce44b�body���火山形变指火山地表因岩浆侵入或撤离而发生隆起或沉降。GPS 与卫星雷达（InSAR）可测出毫米级变化。持续隆起往往意味着岩浆正在补给，是预测喷发的重要指标之一。�Volcanic deformation refers to uplift or subsidence of a volcano's surface caused by magma intruding or withdrawing. GPS and satellite radar (InSAR) detect millimeter-scale changes. Sustained uplift often signals magma recharge and is a key indicator for eruption forecasting.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�ff441ccfdc2f�body���丹霞由陆相红色砂砾岩经抬升后，在垂直节理控制下被流水与风化沿裂隙下切、崩塌而成赤壁丹崖。其色彩来自岩石中氧化铁，集中分布于中国东南丘陵。��Danxia forms from continental red sandstone and conglomerate uplifted and then incised and collapsed along fractures by water and weathering, producing red cliffs. The color comes from iron oxide in the rock, concentrated in the hills of southeast China.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�092cceca7c09�body���热点是地幔深处一股相对固定、上升的炽热物质柱（地幔柱）；太平洋板块缓缓移过它，火山就在不同位置依次喷发，于是形成从东南向西北年龄递增的岛链。��A hotspot is a relatively fixed upwelling plume of hot mantle material; as the Pacific plate drifts over it, volcanoes erupt at successive spots, forming the Hawaiian chain whose islands get older from southeast to northwest.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�1a044b8563cb�body���珊瑚虫体内住着虫黄藻，藻类通过光合作用给珊瑚供能、并赋予颜色；水温过高时珊瑚会把藻类赶走，失去颜色就变成白化，长期白化会饿死珊瑚。��Corals host zooxanthellae algae that photosynthesize and feed the coral while giving it color; when water gets too warm, corals expel the algae, turning white (bleaching), and prolonged bleaching starves them.�ans��src��H《十万个为什么》第六版地球分册,少年儿童出版社,2013�VTen Thousand Whys: Earth volume, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�1b7de7114ac0�body���蒸腾是植物通过叶片气孔把根部吸收的水分以水汽形式释放到空气中的过程，与蒸发合称蒸散。森林区域的蒸散可显著抬升局地湿度并促进降水。�Transpiration is the release of water vapor through leaf stomata from water a plant has drawn up by its roots; together with evaporation it is called evapotranspiration. In forested regions this flux can markedly raise local humidity and feed precipitation.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�4897f5feebcf�body���同一次放电同时发出光和声，先看到闪电只因两者速度悬殊：光速约30万公里每秒，几乎瞬间到达；空气中声速约340米每秒，1秒才走几百米。这段差距还能用来估算距离，延迟每多约3秒，雷暴就大约远1公里。容易被误读的是雷声常常隆隆不断，这并不是打雷在持续发生，而是放电路径上不同点产生的声音先后抵达，又被地面与云底反射拉长。��One and the same discharge emits light and sound together, and the flash comes first only because their speeds differ so greatly: light travels about 300,000 km/s and arrives almost instantly, while sound in air travels about 340 m/s, only a few hundred metres in one second. That gap also lets you estimate distance, since every three extra seconds of delay puts the storm roughly one kilometre farther away. The rolling thunder that follows is easy to misread: the strike is not still happening, but sound generated at different points along the channel arrives at different times, and reflections from the ground and cloud base stretch it out.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�4ae0ac4a49a3�body�ٴ海山是海底的火山锥。当板块缓慢移过地幔中的固定热点，火山就在不同位置依次喷发，留下一串年龄递进的海山（如夏威夷海山链）。��Seamounts are underwater volcanic cones. As a plate moves slowly over a fixed mantle hotspot, volcanoes erupt at successive spots, leaving an age-progressive chain like the Hawaiian seamounts.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�509ec80d875a�body���俯冲带是密度较大的大洋板块俯冲到另一板块之下的边界，下插的板块把海床拉出深而窄的沟槽，如马里亚纳海沟。这里也是火山弧与特大地震的高发地。�A subduction zone is a boundary where a denser oceanic plate dives beneath another plate; the descending slab pulls the seafloor into a deep, narrow trench such as the Mariana Trench. These zones also host volcanic arcs and the planet's largest earthquakes.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�54c2fa17c370�body���按成因湖泊可分为构造湖、火口湖、冰川湖、河成湖和人工湖等。例如贝加尔湖是构造断裂形成的深水湖，而许多堰塞湖由滑坡或火山物质堵塞河道而成。��By origin, lakes are classified as tectonic, crater, glacial, fluvial, and artificial, among others. Lake Baikal is a deep tectonic rift lake, while many barrier lakes form when landslides or volcanic debris block a river.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�5fee7d5a4508�body�٢造山是极慢的过程，往往需要数百万年。例如喜马拉雅山从印度与亚洲碰撞至今约五千万年仍在长高，比人类历史长太多。��Mountain building is extremely slow, usually taking millions of years. The Himalayas, for example, have been rising for about 50 million years since India collided with Asia and are still growing.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�617e35165b72�body���地质年代从大到小依次为宙、代、纪、世、期。例如显生宙包括古生代、中生代和新生代，每个代又细分为若干纪，用于描述地球和生命的演化顺序。��Geologic time units from largest to smallest are eon, era, period, epoch, and age. For example, the Phanerozoic Eon includes the Paleozoic, Mesozoic, and Cenozoic eras, each subdivided into periods that describe Earth and life history.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�64fb30b95fae�body���抗震建筑通过柔性结构、隔震支座和加固框架来吸收和分散地震能量。例如基础隔震技术让建筑底部与地基间设置缓冲层，可显著减小传到楼上的震动。�Earthquake-resistant buildings use flexible structures, base isolators, and reinforced frames to absorb and spread seismic energy. For example, base isolation places cushioning layers between a building and its foundation, greatly reducing shaking transmitted upstairs.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�6ea606b8813c�body���树木对气候有两类作用。生物的把碳锁进木材与土壤，蒸腾把水送回大气，耗热增湿，林冠因此比裸地凉。物理的靠粗糙冠面加强湍流交换，又压低反照率，把更多太阳辐射留在地表。两者方向可以相反：在积雪的高纬地带，树林遮住明亮的雪地，多吸收的辐射足以盖过蒸腾与固碳的降温好处，净效应可以是增温。种树未必降温，得看纬度、水分和雪。�tTrees act on climate in two ways. The biological one locks carbon into wood and soil and returns water to the air by transpiration, spending heat and adding humidity, so a canopy sits cooler than bare ground. The physical one uses a rough crown to strengthen turbulent exchange and lowers albedo, leaving more sunlight at the surface. The two can point opposite ways: in high latitudes where snow lies, trees hide the bright snowfield and the extra radiation absorbed can outweigh the cooling from transpiration and storage, so the net effect can be warming. Planting does not guarantee cooling; latitude, water and snow decide.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�6fca3ef94d97�body���颜色常受微量杂质影响、易变，不如条痕可靠；条痕是矿物粉末在素瓷板上的颜色，由成分与晶体结构决定，更稳定。鉴定时条痕往往比外表颜色更具判别价值。�Color is often altered by trace impurities and can be misleading, whereas streak, the color of a mineral's powder rubbed on a porcelain plate, is set by composition and structure and stays consistent. For identification, streak is usually more diagnostic than surface color.�ans��src��-Nesse《矿物学导论》第3版（Oxford）�JNesse, W.D., Introduction to Mineralogy (3rd ed., Oxford University Press)��id�703ed48c179a�body�٥宝石的颜色主要来自晶体中微量的过渡金属杂质或结构缺陷。例如少量铬让刚玉变红成为红宝石，让绿柱石变绿成为祖母绿。��A gemstone's color mainly comes from trace transition-metal impurities or structural defects in the crystal. For example, a little chromium turns corundum red into ruby, and colors beryl green into emerald.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�722f5d92111d�body���受地球自转影响，北半球运动物体向右偏、南半球向左偏，使各大洋形成顺时针（北）或逆时针（南）的副热带环流涡。风应力与地转偏向共同塑造了五大洋盆的环流格局。�&Because Earth rotates, moving objects deflect to the right in the Northern Hemisphere and left in the Southern, so subtropical gyres spin clockwise north of the equator and counterclockwise to the south. Wind stress and the Coriolis force together shape the five major ocean-basin circulations.�ans��src��+Garrison《海洋学》第9版（Cengage）�NGarrison, T., Oceanography: An Invitation to Marine Science (9th ed., Cengage)��id�81691503de73�body���标准化石是生存时间短、分布广、特征明确的生物化石，可作为特定地质年代的标记。在两地层中发现同一种标准化石，便推断它们形成于同一时期，再结合放射性定年校准绝对年龄。�Index fossils are remains of organisms that lived briefly, ranged widely, and are easy to identify, serving as markers for specific geologic ages. Finding the same index fossil in two layers suggests they formed in the same period, and radiometric dating then pins down absolute ages.�ans��src��9Plummer 等《物理地质学》第16版（McGraw-Hill）�WPlummer, C.C., Carlson, D.H. & Hammersley, L., Physical Geology (16th ed., McGraw-Hill)��id�85e66c7f75a8�body�ٍ冬天陆地比海冷，空气在陆地上方下沉形成高压，风从干冷的陆地吹向海洋，所以冬季风又干又冷、少雨。ٮIn winter the land is colder than the sea, air sinks over it and creates high pressure, so wind blows from the dry cold land toward the ocean—dry and cold with little rain.�ans��src��*王斌《亚洲季风》，Springer，2006�+Wang, B., The Asian Monsoon, Springer, 2006��id�8a2fbb7205d0�body���雨水与河水渗入地下、储存在砂砾含水层中，这个过程叫补给，通常很缓慢。若抽水速度长期超过补给速度，水位下降、含水层压缩，便形成枯竭与地面沉降。��Rain and river water seep into the ground and store in sandy or gravelly aquifers, a slow process called recharge. If pumping long exceeds recharge, water levels drop and the aquifer compacts, leading to depletion and land subsidence.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�9ded21f58377�body���二者同素异形体，差异全在原子排列：金刚石中每个碳原子与四个邻居形成强三维共价键网络；石墨是层状结构，层内强、层间仅靠弱范德华力结合。于是金刚石极硬、石墨却柔软易剥层。�GBoth are allotropes of pure carbon, but their atom arrangement differs: in diamond each carbon bonds strongly to four neighbors in a 3-D covalent network, while graphite stacks in sheets held together only by weak van der Waals forces between layers. Hence diamond is extremely hard, whereas graphite is soft and flakes easily.�ans��src��-Nesse《矿物学导论》第3版（Oxford）�JNesse, W.D., Introduction to Mineralogy (3rd ed., Oxford University Press)��id�a4ca557c9fec�body��{珊瑚礁虽只占海底一小部分，却养育了约四分之一的海洋物种，还能保护海岸免受波浪侵蚀。�zCovering a small part of the seabed, reefs shelter about a quarter of marine species and protect coasts from wave erosion.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�a7b86006ae30�body�ٖ一是海水变暖体积膨胀（热膨胀），二是冰川和冰盖融化把原本锁在陆地上的水送回海洋，两者共同抬升海平面。٦One is thermal expansion as warming water expands; the other is meltwater from glaciers and ice sheets returning land-locked water to the ocean. Both raise sea level.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�a8737773533d�body�ٱ主要是风。信风和西风在海面摩擦，把上层海水吹动，再加上地球自转的科里奥利力让水流偏转，于是形成巨大的环流圈（洋流环）。ٚMainly wind. Trade winds and westerlies drag the surface water via friction, and Earth's rotation (Coriolis force) deflects the flow, creating huge gyres.�ans��src��cRachel Carson,《The Sea Around Us》Oxford University Press,1951;中译《环绕我们的海洋》�HR. Carson, The Sea Around Us, Oxford University Press, 1951; Chinese ed.��id�aab019308cd4�body�٢拉尼娜时赤道东风比常年更强，西太平洋暖水更集中、东太平洋更冷，上升流增强，天气异常的方向往往与厄尔尼诺相反。ٵIn La Niña the trade winds are stronger than usual, warm water piles further west and the east cools with enhanced upwelling, so weather anomalies tend to oppose those of El Niño.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�c2564e4b7592�body��~顺着等高线把坡改成一级级小平台，能拦住雨水、减少冲刷，让坡地也能存水种稻，还不塌方。�wContour terraces turn slopes into flat steps that trap rain, cut erosion and let rice grow on hills without landslides.�ans��src��-赫德森《土壤保持》，Batsford，1995�0Hudson, N.W. (1995), Soil Conservation, Batsford��id�c8c889d59b70�body�ٔ海洋吸收了大量人为排放的二氧化碳，二氧化碳溶于水生成碳酸，使海水 pH 下降、酸度上升，这就是海洋酸化。ٙThe ocean absorbs much of the CO2 humans emit; dissolved CO2 forms carbonic acid, lowering seawater pH and raising acidity—this is ocean acidification.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�ca05146632b6�body�ه细颗粒物可深入肺部引发疾病，同时散射阳光并有冷却作用，还会改变云的性质，使气候估算更复杂。ٓFine particles penetrate lungs and cause disease, while scattering sunlight they cool the climate and alter clouds, complicating climate estimates.�ans��src��>盛裴轩 等,《大气物理学》,北京大学出版社,2003�HSheng Peixuan et al., Atmospheric Physics, Peking University Press, 2003��id�cf21ffb5d87c�body�ٲ里氏震级由地震波振幅推算地震释放的能量，每升1级能量约增32倍。它只对中近震、中小震级可靠，对特大远震现代已改用矩震级(Mw)。�The Richter scale estimates the energy released by an earthquake from the amplitude of seismic waves, with each step up meaning roughly 32 times more energy. It is reliable only for nearby, moderate events; for large or distant quakes modern seismology uses the moment magnitude (Mw).�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�cf9e19db1d33�body���河流是流域的搬运带，把上游侵蚀的细粒泥沙与养分带到下游。河口变宽变平、又遇静止咸水，流速骤降，海水电解质还把带电黏粒聚成絮团沉下，最细最富矿物的部分先停在这里，堆成深厚冲积层。关键是补给在循环：洪水定期漫滩摊回新沙，养分不会被种光。它也不是天生的：排水不畅会盐渍涝渍，上游筑坝截沙断了沙源后河口还会下沉、遭海水倒灌。�A river is the conveyor belt of its catchment, carrying the fine sediment and nutrients freed by erosion downstream. At the mouth the channel widens and flattens, the water meets relatively still salt water, and velocity drops sharply; electrolytes in the sea also clump the charged clay colloids into flakes that sink, so the finest and most mineral-rich fraction is the first to stop here, building a thick alluvial layer. What matters is that the supply keeps cycling: floods spill over the banks and lay fresh silt back on the surface, so the nutrients are never cropped out. This fertility is not a gift of the place either - poor drainage brings salinity and waterlogging, and once a dam upstream traps the sediment the mouth loses its supply, sinks, and takes in salt water.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�earth_26_012�body���直答:EGS靠人工压裂在高温干热岩中造出裂隙储层,注入冷水取热发电,无需天然温泉或蒸汽田。机理:先钻注采井对,以水力压裂连通天然节理形成换热网络;泵入的水流经灼热裂隙面吸热,从生产井返回地面驱动涡轮发电后回灌循环;主要瓶颈一是诱发微地震风险,需实时监测并调控注水压力,二是深井钻探与建井成本高昂,经济性依赖长寿命单井出力。��EGS builds its own reservoir: wells drilled into hot dry rock are hydraulically fractured so natural joints link into a heat-exchange network, no natural springs needed. Cold water pumped down absorbs heat from the hot fracture surfaces and returns through the production well to drive turbines before reinjection. The main bottlenecks are induced microseismicity, managed by monitoring and pressure control, and the high cost of deep drilling and completion.�ans��src��DTester et al., The Future of Geothermal Energy, MIT-led report, 2006�JJ. W. Tester et al., The Future of Geothermal Energy, MIT-led report, 2006��id�earth_26_015�body���直答:青藏高原的冰川雪盖孕育长江、黄河、印度河、雅鲁藏布江、湄公河等亚洲大河,下游供水人口超过十亿,故称亚洲水塔。机理:冰川如同固体水库,夏汛融水补给径流;变暖使退缩加速,短期内融水反而增多,越过峰值后冰储量萎缩,旱季流量锐减,灌溉、水电与生活用水全面承压;这些大河多为跨国流域,水量分配使相关国家的博弈与协同治理成为地缘政治议题。�Tibetan glaciers and snowpacks mother great rivers such as the Yangtze, Yellow River, Indus, Brahmaputra and Mekong, sustaining over a billion people downstream — hence the Water Tower of Asia. Glaciers act as solid reservoirs feeding summer runoff; warming accelerates retreat, so meltwater rises at first, but past its peak the ice stock shrinks and dry-season flows dwindle, stressing irrigation, hydropower and daily use alike. Most of these rivers cross borders, so allocation disputes make joint governance a geopolitical issue.�ans��src�كImmerzeel、van Beek 与 Bierkens 合著论文 Climate change will affect the Asian water towers,载于《Science》第328卷(2010)�oImmerzeel W W, van Beek L P H, Bierkens M F P, Climate change will affect the Asian water towers, Science, 2010��id�f9325e731e0b�body�ي我国在北回归线以北，房子朝南能最大限度地迎接冬日阳光、保暖，同时背对寒冷的偏北风，住着舒服。�yNorth of the Tropic, south-facing homes catch the low winter sun for warmth and turn their backs to cold northerly winds.�ans��src��D卢特根斯、塔巴克《大气：科学导论》，Pearson，2011�\Lutgens, F.K. & Tarbuck, E.J., The Atmosphere: An Introduction to Meteorology, Pearson, 2011��id�fedc47782520�body�٥湾流把墨西哥湾的温暖海水一路送到北大西洋，把热量从低纬带给欧洲沿岸，所以西欧冬天比同纬度的加拿大东岸温暖得多。��The Gulf Stream carries warm water from the Gulf of Mexico across the North Atlantic, delivering heat to Europe's coast, so western Europe is far milder than Canada's east coast at the same latitude.�ans��src��cRachel Carson,《The Sea Around Us》Oxford University Press,1951;中译《环绕我们的海洋》�HR. Carson, The Sea Around Us, Oxford University Press, 1951; Chinese ed.��id�195d5b2aef1d�body��~湖底碳酸钙结晶像天然“过滤层”让水极清，加上藻类和光线散射，水就呈现出梦幻的蓝绿色。ُCalcium-carbonate deposits on the lake beds act like a natural filter, and with algae and light scattering the water shows a dreamy blue-green.�ans��src��H《十万个为什么》第六版地球分册,少年儿童出版社,2013�VTen Thousand Whys: Earth volume, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�32f3581b7a74�body�ه长江江宽水深、支流多，从西部一直通到海边，能跑大船运货，航运价值极高，像“黄金”一样宝贵。ٜThe Yangtze is wide and deep with many tributaries, navigable from the west to the sea by large ships, making its shipping value extremely high—like gold.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�95fd7eb2c273�body�٫台风在温暖的西北太平洋上生成，登陆后一路深入内陆会因摩擦和失去暖湿海水能量而迅速减弱，所以沿海首当其冲、内陆很少。ٝTyphoons form over the warm NW Pacific; after landfall friction and loss of warm-sea energy quickly weaken them, so the coast is hit first and inland rarely.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�earth_25_007�body��河流冲刷岩石时带走了微量的盐分,几亿年来源源不断送进海洋,而水蒸发走了、盐留了下来,越攒越咸。平均每一公斤海水含盐约35克。死海的盐度更高到人都能漂起来。雨水是淡水,因为它在蒸发时把盐留在了海里。�)Rivers nibble tiny salt from rocks delivering it to oceans for eons; water evaporates away but salt stays behind, growing saltier — about thirty-five grams per kilogram on average. The Dead Sea is saltier still, floating swimmers easily. Rain is fresh because evaporation leaves salt in the sea.�ans��src��H《十万个为什么》第六版地球分册,少年儿童出版社,2013�VTen Thousand Whys: Earth volume, 6th ed., Juvenile and Children Publishing House, 2013��id�08280721f0df�body�ٖ盛冰期海平面比今天低约120米，白令海峡变成连着亚洲和北美的“陆桥”，古人便从西伯利亚走过陆桥进入美洲。٥At the last glacial maximum sea level was about 120 m lower, turning the Bering Strait into a land bridge linking Asia and North America, which people walked across.�ans��src��8Wicander & Monroe,《Historical Geology》Cengage 多版�TR. Wicander and J. S. Monroe, Historical Geology, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�09451cf1b536�body�ي锂主要来自两类地方：澳大利亚等地的硬岩矿（锂辉石），以及南美“锂三角”盐湖里晒卤水提取的锂。٢Lithium comes mainly from hard-rock mines (spodumene) in places like Australia, and from brine pumped out of salt lakes in South America's “lithium triangle.”�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�0a8e7eae551d�body�٢科罗拉多河在几百万年里不断向下冲刷、加上风雨剥蚀，把高原一层层切深，形成了今天十几公里宽、上千米深的大峡谷。٢Over millions of years the Colorado River cut downward while weather eroded the sides, slicing the plateau into a canyon over ten km wide and more than a km deep.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�0d6fb0b12882�body�ٖ西伯利亚是大陆腹地，冬天极度严寒、冷空气堆积成高气压，一旦气压失衡就向南爆发，席卷我国带来大风降温。لSiberia's continental interior gets brutally cold, piling up high-pressure air that bursts southward into China with wind and chill.�ans��src��-丁一汇《中国季风》，Springer，1994�-Ding, Y., Monsoons over China, Springer, 1994��id�20b9b231dd0a�body�ٔ正常情况下高处更冷、空气上升;逆温时反而高处更暖，像盖子压着，污染物没法向上扩散，雾霾就积在城市里。ٕUsually it is cooler aloft and air rises; in an inversion warmer air sits above, acting like a lid so pollutants can't rise and smog builds up below.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�312ffbde0345�body��搬运能力(competence)指河流能搬动的最大颗粒粒径，随流速的平方急剧增大；搬运容量(capacity)是单位时间内能携带的总泥沙量，与流量和坡度相关。洪水期流速骤增，二者都显著上升，塑造河床与三角洲。�Competence is the largest particle size a river can move and rises sharply with the square of flow velocity; capacity is the total sediment load it can carry per unit time, linked to discharge and slope. Both surge during floods, reshaping channels and deltas.�ans��src��3丁曼《物理水文学》，Waveland Press，2015�7Dingman, S.L., Physical Hydrology, Waveland Press, 2015��id�3c6ab2b049d6�body�ه海水盐度太高，喝下会让身体失水。淡化要脱去盐分（如反渗透或蒸馏），非常耗电，所以成本不低。ٞSeawater is too salty and makes the body lose water. Desalination removes salt (by reverse osmosis or distillation) but uses a lot of energy, so it is costly.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�415f88a3d820�body���对流层顶是对流层与平流层之间的过渡层，此处温度随高度不再下降、形成稳定逆温，抑制了空气的垂直对流。因此云和风暴基本被限制在其下方，商用飞机也多在其附近巡航以避开颠簸。�(The tropopause is the boundary where the troposphere meets the stratosphere; temperature stops falling with height there, creating a stable inversion that suppresses vertical convection. Clouds and storms are thus largely confined below it, and airliners often cruise near it to avoid turbulence.�ans��src��D卢特根斯、塔巴克《大气：科学导论》，Pearson，2011�\Lutgens, F.K. & Tarbuck, E.J., The Atmosphere: An Introduction to Meteorology, Pearson, 2011��id�482aca422d89�body�ل火山穹丘由黏稠熔岩慢慢堆成，坡面圆缓；角峰是冰川从四面把山体啃成尖角，所以形状截然不同。ٟA lava dome is built by slow, sticky lava, giving gentle rounded slopes; an arête/horn is carved sharp by glaciers on several sides, so shapes differ sharply.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�4d63c4c2d695�body�٧20世纪初德国科学家魏格纳提出，说各大陆曾是一整块后来裂开漂移。当时缺少“什么力量推动”的证据，所以被很多人嘲笑。ٜIn the early 1900s German scientist Wegener argued continents were once one and drifted apart. Lacking a driving-force mechanism, many scientists mocked it.�ans��src��8Wicander & Monroe,《Historical Geology》Cengage 多版�TR. Wicander and J. S. Monroe, Historical Geology, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�5727472c3a45�body��{雨季把多余的河水拦在库里，减轻下游洪水；旱季再放水下流，补给灌溉和饮用，一库两用。ٓIn rainy season it stores excess flow to cut downstream floods; in drought it releases water for irrigation and drinking—one reservoir, two jobs.�ans��src��3丁曼《物理水文学》，Waveland Press，2015�7Dingman, S.L., Physical Hydrology, Waveland Press, 2015��id�5c4c9cff5c35�body�ٟ这叫“热岛效应”：水泥沥青吸热快、绿地水体少、汽车空调排热多，加上高楼挡风，热量散不出去，城里就比郊外热。٠The urban heat island: concrete absorbs heat, there is less greenery and water, traffic and AC add heat, and buildings trap it—cities run hotter than suburbs.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�5f486568dda8�body�ٖ可以。向冷云播撒碘化银或盐粉当凝结核，让过冷水滴结冰或变大，等条件合适时就能多下一点雨（人工增雨）。ٝYes. Seeding cold clouds with silver iodide or salt gives nuclei so supercooled droplets freeze or grow, squeezing out a bit more rain when conditions allow.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�69aa7c87bca6�body�ٮ动画里先显示泛大陆完整的恐龙分布，再随时间把大陆缓缓拉开，原本相连的栖息地随之断开，化石记录就和今天各大陆对应起来。ٵThe animation first shows dinosaurs across a united Pangaea, then slowly pulls the continents apart; formerly connected habitats split, matching today's fossil record per continent.�ans��src��8Wicander & Monroe,《Historical Geology》Cengage 多版�TR. Wicander and J. S. Monroe, Historical Geology, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�795369326a18�body�ٷ因为地表像大海一样有“热惯性”：夏至后地面吸收的热量仍多于散失，气温继续升；冬至后放热仍多于吸热，气温继续降，最值会滞后。٢The surface has thermal inertia: after the solstice the ground still gains more heat than it loses, so temperatures keep rising (or falling) before peaking later.�ans��src��D卢特根斯、塔巴克《大气：科学导论》，Pearson，2011�\Lutgens, F.K. & Tarbuck, E.J., The Atmosphere: An Introduction to Meteorology, Pearson, 2011��id�7e5630876659�body�ٹ雨滴在下落时可能遇到干燥暖层被完全蒸发，形成“雨幡”（virga）；或者雨云正好从你头顶偏开了一点。这叫“预报有雨却没下到本地”。ٛFalling drops can evaporate in a dry warm layer below (virga), or the rain cloud simply missed your spot. That is why a forecast of rain may not reach you.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�956caa45a869�body��~一级级田坎像台阶拦住径流，减缓流速、增加下渗，让雨水还没冲走泥土就被田块“接住”了。�cEach terrace step slows runoff and boosts infiltration, catching rain before it can wash soil away.�ans��src��-赫德森《土壤保持》，Batsford，1995�0Hudson, N.W. (1995), Soil Conservation, Batsford��id�a934a8b621ac�body�ٙ季风区内部雨水多、沼泽林密难行，边缘地带既有绿洲水源又较干旱易通行，于是商队沿河西走廊等半干旱带往来。يThe monsoon core is rainy and overgrown; its arid edge offers oasis water yet easy travel, so caravans used semi-arid corridors like Hexi.�ans��src��6中国科学院地理研究所《中国自然地理》�`Chinese Academy of Sciences, Institute of Geographical Sciences, The Physical Geography of China��id�a978aae82dac�body���破火山口是岩浆大规模喷空后，上方岩层因失去支撑而塌陷形成的巨大碗状洼地，如黄石与托巴。它不靠喷发物堆叠成锥，而是塌陷，规模常远超普通火山锥。�A caldera is a large bowl-shaped depression formed when a magma chamber empties in a massive eruption and the overlying roof collapses, as at Yellowstone and Toba. Rather than building a cone from ejected material, it collapses, often on a far larger scale than ordinary volcanic cones.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�abd79aa3ede2�body�ف太强会暴雨成灾、江河泛滥；太弱则伏旱少雨、田地开裂，所以季风不稳是东亚旱涝交替的主因。ٕToo strong brings floods; too weak brings summer drought and cracked fields—monsoon variability drives East Asia's alternating floods and droughts.�ans��src��*王斌《亚洲季风》，Springer，2006�+Wang, B., The Asian Monsoon, Springer, 2006��id�b0c3f35cf0f1�body���转换边界上两块板块水平错动、既不生成也不消亡地壳，圣安德烈亚斯断层便是太平洋板块与北美板块的右旋滑动边界。应力沿断层积累并周期性释放，造成浅源走滑型地震。�*At a transform boundary two plates slide horizontally past each other without creating or destroying crust; the San Andreas Fault is the right-lateral boundary between the Pacific and North American plates. Stress builds along the fault and releases periodically in shallow strike-slip earthquakes.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�b2ad061df79d�body�٨夏天陆地比海洋升温快，空气受热膨胀上升，近地面形成低压，海洋相对高压，风便从高压的海吹向低压的陆，把水汽带进去。ٛLand warms faster than the sea in summer; rising air creates low pressure over land while the sea stays high, so wind flows sea to land, carrying moisture.�ans��src��*王斌《亚洲季风》，Springer，2006�+Wang, B., The Asian Monsoon, Springer, 2006��id�b3b58dc0f461�body�٫大气对初始条件极其敏感，一点点误差会被放大，所以超过约两周的预报就不可靠了——这就是“蝴蝶扇翅可能引发远方风暴”。٨The atmosphere is exquisitely sensitive to initial conditions, so tiny errors balloon and forecasts beyond about two weeks lose reliability—the butterfly's wing idea.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�c074110ad2bc�body�ٍ冰岛正好压在大西洋中脊和地幔热点上，火山和温泉很多；同时高纬度又有大面积冰川，冰与火同时存在。ٮIceland sits on the Mid-Atlantic Ridge and a mantle hotspot, so it has many volcanoes and hot springs, yet its high latitude also bears huge glaciers—fire and ice together.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�c96e1f6f3df1�body�ٓ南有祁连雪山供水、北有沙漠戈壁相隔，中间这条狭长绿洲带是中原通往西域唯一易行的通道，所以商旅必走。١With the Qilian snows to the south and desert to the north, this narrow green belt was the only practical path from China to the west, so caravans had to use it.�ans��src��]联合国教科文组织世界遗产中心《丝绸之路：长安—天山廊道的路网》�\UNESCO World Heritage Centre, Silk Roads: the Routes Network of Chang'an–Tianshan Corridor��id�cce8c51925c7�body��~都江堰引水灌田，加上盆地周山挡寒、内部温暖湿润，物产丰足，自古就粮仓殷实，故称天府。وDujiangyan irrigates the fields while surrounding mountains block cold and keep it warm-humid, yielding abundant crops—hence the name.�ans��src��E联合国教科文组织世界遗产中心《青城山—都江堰》�NUNESCO World Heritage Centre, Mount Qingcheng and Dujiangyan Irrigation System��id�ce880c85675e�body���地球约97%的水是海洋咸水，淡水中绝大部分又被封存在冰川与深层地下水，真正可供人类直接利用的河湖淡水不足总量的1%。这种高度不均凸显了淡水资源的珍贵。�About 97% of Earth's water is salty ocean water, and most freshwater is locked in glaciers and deep groundwater, leaving rivers and lakes accessible to people at well under 1% of the total. This extreme imbalance underlines how precious usable freshwater is.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�cf78f01d6f33�body��$该团队综合33个大型三角洲的数据，指出20世纪人为活动（水库截沙、地下水与油气开采、三角洲平原压实）使许多三角洲的地面沉降与相对海平面上升速率翻倍。研究警示若不干预，大量人口密集三角洲将面临淹没风险。�KThe team combined data from 33 major deltas and showed that 20th-century human actions, dam sediment trapping, groundwater and hydrocarbon withdrawal, and delta-plain compaction, doubled the rate of sinking and relative sea-level rise for many deltas. They warned that without intervention, populous deltas face growing flood risk.�ans��src��>Syvitski 等（2009）《自然·地球科学》Sinking deltas�YSyvitski, J.P.M. et al. (2009), Sinking deltas due to human activities, Nature Geoscience��id�d54beda6225a�body�ه冰雹需要强盛的上升气流把冰粒反复托起、层层裹冰，暖季对流最猛，高空又够冷，才结得出大冰雹。ٔHail needs strong updrafts to toss ice grains up and coat them repeatedly; warm-season convection is fiercest while the upper air stays cold enough.�ans��src��D卢特根斯、塔巴克《大气：科学导论》，Pearson，2011�\Lutgens, F.K. & Tarbuck, E.J., The Atmosphere: An Introduction to Meteorology, Pearson, 2011��id�ddf7adb8642d�body��{风小、逆温层像盖子一样压在头顶时，污染物散不出去，在城里越积越浓，就容易形成雾霾。�qWith little wind and a temperature inversion acting like a lid, pollutants can't disperse and build up into smog.�ans��src��E雅各布《大气化学导论》，Princeton University Press，1999�UJacob, D.J. (1999), Introduction to Atmospheric Chemistry, Princeton University Press��id�de713296d77c�body�ي海水升温降温都慢（比热大），像“恒温器”缓和沿海气温；内陆离海远，夏天更热冬天更冷，温差大。٬The sea warms and cools slowly (high heat capacity), buffering coastal temperatures like a thermostat; far inland, summers are hotter and winters colder with bigger swings.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�fda8f6727a82�body�ٖ会，这叫“地面沉降”。抽走地下水后，松散地层失去支撑被压密，地面就缓缓下沉，上海、华北平原都出现过。ُYes—land subsidence. Removing groundwater compacts loose strata, and the surface slowly sinks, as seen in Shanghai and the North China Plain.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�0032a3a76fb9�body��7雪球地球假说认为约7亿年前的成冰纪，冰川曾推进到赤道，全球被冰壳包裹。支持证据包括赤道地区发现的冰川沉积、后因二氧化碳积累而出现的盖帽碳酸盐岩。霍夫曼等人在1998年发表奠基性论文，基施文克则提供了早期的机制解释。��The snowball-Earth hypothesis argues that during the Cryogenian around 700 million years ago, glaciers reached the equator and ice sheathed the globe. Evidence includes glacial deposits found at equatorial latitudes and the cap carbonates that formed once carbon dioxide built up afterward. Hoffman and colleagues published the foundational paper in 1998, and Kirschvink provided an early mechanism.�ans��src�٘Hoffman 等《Snowball Earth》（1998，Science）；Kirschvink《Late Proterozoic low-latitude glaciation》（1992，Geological Society of America）�pHoffman et al., Snowball Earth (1998, Science); Kirschvink, Late Proterozoic low-latitude glaciation (1992, GSA)��id�00782680d24b�body��在均衡状态下，河流比降随汇水面积增大而减小，满足 S ∝ A^(-θ)（θ 为凹度），由物质守恒与水流功率平衡导出。岩性坚硬段形成陡坎，强降水区下切更快，使剖面形态记录区域气候与构造的相互作用。�/At equilibrium, channel slope decreases with drainage area as S ∝ A^(−θ) (θ the concavity), derived from mass conservation and stream-power balance. Resistant lithology creates knickpoints, and high precipitation accelerates incision, so the profile encodes the interplay of climate and tectonics.�ans��src��@《自然·地球科学》(Nature Geoscience) 地貌演化研究�&Nature Geoscience, landscape evolution��id�016eb3da3293�body��重力波由山地气流、对流等激发，在稳定层结大气中向上传播并随密度减小而增幅，破碎后把动量沉积到高层，驱动中间层环流与准两年振荡。这种波-平均流相互作用是数值模式必须参数化的关键过程。�lGravity waves are generated by mountain flow and convection and propagate upward through stably stratified air, growing in amplitude as density drops; when they break they deposit momentum into higher layers, driving mesospheric circulation and the quasi-biennial oscillation. This wave-mean-flow interaction is a key process that climate models must parameterize.�ans��src��aFritts & Alexander（2003）《地球物理评论》重力波动力学与中层大气效应综述ٙFritts, D.C. & Alexander, M.J. (2003), Gravity wave dynamics and effects in the middle atmosphere, Reviews of Geophysics, 41(1), doi:10.1029/2001RG000106��id�0497ff5ff5ea�body��y位于对流层之上约10至50公里，气温随高度上升，气流平稳，商用飞机和臭氧层都在这一层。يAbove the troposphere from about 10 to 50 km, temperature rises with height and air is calm; airliners and the ozone layer are found here.�ans��src��>盛裴轩 等,《大气物理学》,北京大学出版社,2003�HSheng Peixuan et al., Atmospheric Physics, Peking University Press, 2003��id�056dd692705f�body���植物输入的根系与残体碳经微生物代谢转化为难以降解的「微生物残体碳」，并通过矿物结合进入稳定库，这一过程称为微生物碳泵。它解释了为何部分新输入碳可封存数十年至百年以上。�Plant root and residue carbon is metabolized by microbes into resistant microbial necromass that binds to minerals and enters stable pools, a process called the microbial carbon pump. It explains how some newly added carbon can be sequestered for decades to over a century.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�0588059019d1�body�ٍ利用全球地震波穿过地球的速度差异，反演出地幔冷热不均的结构，揭示地幔柱、俯冲板片和下地幔结构。يUsing how seismic waves speed through Earth, it inverts images of warm and cold mantle, revealing plumes, slabs and deep-mantle structure.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�066b898652ca�body��5鲍文反应系列由诺曼·鲍文在1920年代通过实验总结：岩浆冷却时矿物按一定顺序结晶——不连续系列为橄榄石→辉石→角闪石→黑云母，连续系列为斜长石成分由钙长石渐变为钠长石。它解释了火成岩矿物组合的规律及分异结晶现象。�~Bowen's reaction series, formulated by Norman Bowen in the 1920s from experiments, shows the order in which minerals crystallize as magma cools: a discontinuous branch (olivine → pyroxene → amphibole → biotite) and a continuous branch (plagioclase shifting from calcium-rich to sodium-rich). It explains the mineral assemblages of igneous rocks and fractional crystallization.�ans��src��`N. L. Bowen 1928《火成岩的演化》；Tarbuck & Lutgens《地球：物理地质学导论》�KN. L. Bowen (1928), 'The Evolution of the Igneous Rocks'; Tarbuck & Lutgens��id�068787588ec4�body���火山碎屑流是高温气体与碎屑混合的高速密度流，温度可达数百摄氏度、速度超每小时百公里。它沿山坡倾泻、所到之处焚毁一切，1902年培雷火山即以此摧毁圣皮埃尔城。��A pyroclastic flow is a high-speed density current of hot gas and debris, reaching hundreds of degrees and over 100 km/h. It pours down slopes destroying everything; in 1902 Mount Pelée's flow obliterated Saint-Pierre city.�ans��src��KFrancis 与 Oppenheimer,《Volcanoes》第2版,Oxford University Press,2004�PP. Francis and C. Oppenheimer, Volcanoes, 2nd ed., Oxford University Press, 2004��id�06d939deaabe�body���S波是横波，必须靠物质的剪切弹性传播，而液体无法承受剪切应力，因此S波在抵达液态外核时会被完全阻挡，形成“S波影区”。这一观测是地球外核为液态的最关键地震学证据。�(S-waves are shear waves that require a material's ability to resist shear, but liquids cannot support shear stress, so S-waves are completely blocked at the liquid outer core, producing an 'S-wave shadow zone.' This observation is the key seismological evidence that Earth's outer core is liquid.�ans��src�كStein & Wysession《地震学、地震与地球结构导论》（An Introduction to Seismology, Earthquakes, and Earth Structure）�ZS. Stein & M. Wysession, 'An Introduction to Seismology, Earthquakes, and Earth Structure'��id�071d41508717�body�ي海山是未露出海面的火山锥，盖奥特则是顶部被古代波浪夷平、后又沉没的死火山，记录板块漂移历史。لA seamount is a submarine volcanic cone; a guyot is one whose top was planed flat by ancient waves then sunk, recording plate drift.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�078448224704�body���米兰科维奇循环指地球轨道偏心率、地轴倾角和岁差的长周期变化，改变各纬度接收到的太阳辐射季节分布。这些微弱变化叠加共振，触发并调节约十万年尺度的冰期与间冰期。��Milankovitch cycles are long-period changes in Earth's orbital eccentricity, axial tilt and precession that alter seasonal solar radiation by latitude. Their combined resonance triggers and paces the roughly 100,000-year glacial-interglacial rhythm.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�09a59d39e348�body�ٺ云既能反射阳光又能保温，且小到公里尺度难以被气候模型直接算清；变暖后云量、高度、厚度的变化方向不完全确定，会放大或减弱增暖。��Clouds both reflect and trap radiation, yet they occur at scales too small for models to resolve directly; how cloud amount, height, and thickness change as it warms is uncertain, so they may amplify or damp warming.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�09bac8429983�body���对流层上部，中纬度暖空气与极地冷空气之间的温度差使气压梯度随高度急剧增强，科里奥利力与之平衡，形成狭窄的强风带——极地急流。温度梯度越强，急流越强，冬季常更强且偏南。急流中的罗斯贝波弯曲带动高空气压系统移动，直接引导地面气旋路径，因此天气预报必须追踪急流。飞机顺风飞行可以省油省时，跨大西洋向东的航班常比向西快一两小时。�{High in the troposphere, the temperature contrast between warm mid-latitude air and cold polar air makes the pressure gradient strengthen sharply with altitude; balanced by the Coriolis force, this produces a narrow band of strong winds—the polar jet stream. The stronger the temperature gradient, the stronger the jet, which is usually faster and farther south in winter. Rossby-wave undulations of the jet steer upper-level pressure systems and guide surface cyclone tracks, so forecasters must watch it. Planes fly with it to save fuel and time, making eastbound transatlantic flights one to two hours quicker than westbound ones.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�09e93b4fc944�body���急流是高空西风带中狭窄、强而快的西风气流带，风速可超过每小时300公里。它位于温度梯度大的锋区上方，对地面气旋路径和航空飞行都有重要影响。��A jet stream is a narrow, fast ribbon of westerly wind high in the atmosphere, with speeds exceeding 300 km/h. It lies above sharp temperature gradients at frontal zones and strongly influences surface storm tracks and aviation routes.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�0a601ecc823f�body���混合层深度由风搅拌、浮力通量（冷却与蒸发使表层变重）和海浪破碎共同决定，季节上冬季加深、夏季变浅。它调控海气间热量与碳的交换速率，是气候模式中的关键变量。�+Mixed-layer depth is controlled by wind stirring, buoyancy flux (cooling and evaporation that make surface water heavier), and wave breaking, deepening in winter and shoaling in summer. It regulates the rate of heat and carbon exchange between ocean and atmosphere, a key variable in climate models.�ans��src��UL. D. Talley et al., Descriptive Physical Oceanography, 6th ed., Academic Press, 2011�UL. D. Talley et al., Descriptive Physical Oceanography, 6th ed., Academic Press, 2011��id�0bbb1872a521�body��{板块在固定热点上缓慢移动，先后形成的火山连成一串，如夏威夷岛链指示太平洋板块方向。�ZA plate drifts over a fixed hotspot, leaving a chain of volcanoes like the Hawaiian chain.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�0cc6273ee0c5�body�ٷ这和副高位置、引导气流以及台湾岛地形有关：当副高呈东西向摆布，台风沿其南缘西北行，常登陆浙闽；台湾中央山脉也会让路径偏折。��It depends on the subtropical high and steering flow plus Taiwan's terrain; when the high bridges east-west, storms ride its southern edge NW toward Zhejiang–Fujian, and Taiwan's mountains deflect them.�ans��src��W伊曼纽尔《热带气旋》，《地球与行星科学年度评论》第31卷，2003�ZEmanuel, K.A. (2003), Tropical cyclones, Annual Review of Earth and Planetary Sciences, 31��id�0e2a3cfea019�body�ق末次冰消时可能有淡水大量灌入北大西洋，削弱AMOC使热量向北输送中断，全球在千年内骤然回冷。ىAs ice melted, a freshwater flood may have weakened the AMOC and cut heat to the north, plunging the globe back cold within a millennium.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�0f9b16007434�body��␀海洋锋面是两种性质不同的水体交汇、存在明显温盐梯度的狭窄过渡带。它常伴随强烈的垂直运动和丰富的生物聚集，是渔场和天气系统活跃的地带。海湾流与 Labrador 寒流交汇处就是著名例证。�dAn ocean front is a narrow transition zone where two water masses of different properties meet, showing a sharp temperature and salinity gradient. It often brings strong vertical motion and rich biological aggregation, making productive fishing grounds and active weather zones. The meeting of the Gulf Stream and the Labrador Current is a classic example.�ans��src��cRachel Carson,《The Sea Around Us》Oxford University Press,1951;中译《环绕我们的海洋》�HR. Carson, The Sea Around Us, Oxford University Press, 1951; Chinese ed.��id�0fa702ba9611�body��~不同矿床和含铅汽油的铅同位素组成不同，比对土壤、冰芯和人体样本就能锁定污染来自哪里。ْLead from different ores and gasoline has distinct isotope signatures; matching soils, ice cores and human samples pins down the pollution source.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�101194431e52�body���团粒结构是土壤颗粒黏结成的小团块，使孔隙兼顾通气与保水。良好团粒能抗侵蚀、利根系生长，有机质和蚯蚓等活动有助于形成；耕作不当会破坏它。��Aggregate structure is soil particles bound into small crumbs that balance air-filled and water-held pores. Good aggregation resists erosion and aids roots; organic matter and earthworm activity build it, while poor tillage destroys it.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�103b86d499d2�body���太阳辐射以可见光为主，穿过大气加热地表；地面则以红外线向外辐射。二氧化碳、水汽、甲烷等温室气体能吸收特定波段的红外光，再向各个方向重新辐射，其中射向地面的部分把热量截留在大气低层，这就是温室效应。没有它地球平均气温约-18摄氏度；温室气体浓度升高则使这个截留增强，地面升温。这种机制与玻璃温室的"捂热"不同，本质是大气吸收再回辐射。�bSolar radiation, mostly visible light, passes through the atmosphere and warms the surface, which then radiates infrared outward. Greenhouse gases—carbon dioxide, water vapor, methane—absorb infrared at specific wavelengths and re-emit it in all directions; the downward part traps heat in the lower atmosphere. That is the greenhouse effect. Without it Earth's average surface temperature would be about -18 C, and rising greenhouse gas concentrations strengthen the trapping and warm the surface. The mechanism differs from a physical glass greenhouse; it is absorption and reradiation by the atmosphere.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�105dc0441891�body���云内冰晶和霰粒（软雹）碰撞时，较轻的冰晶带上正电被上升气流带到云顶，较重的霰粒带负电沉到云底，形成上下电场，积累到足够强就放电成闪电。��Inside clouds, collisions between ice crystals and graupel (soft hail) separate charge: lighter crystals gain positive charge and rise to the top, heavier graupel gains negative and sinks, building a field that discharges as lightning.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�1108fe819029�body��外核为液态铁镍合金并含少量轻元素（如硫、氧、硅），能流动产生磁场；内核在相同高温高压下因压力更高而呈固态，成分以铁为主并富镍。内外核的相态差异由铁的高压相图与绝热温度梯度共同决定。�YThe outer core is a liquid iron-nickel alloy with minor light elements (sulfur, oxygen, silicon) that can flow and generate the field, while the inner core is solid under even higher pressure, composed mainly of iron with nickel. The phase difference is set by iron's high-pressure phase diagram together with the adiabatic temperature gradient.�ans��src��<Press & Siever,《Understanding Earth》W. H. Freeman 多版�LF. Press and R. Siever, Understanding Earth, W. H. Freeman, various editions��id�11d9b5fb5f3f�body��R快速运动主要取决于底部条件：冰床位于海平面以下，地热或摩擦生热使底冰达到融点，形成润滑的融水层，冰流通过底部滑动和冰内变形快速前进；同时冰架支撑减弱时冰流加速。冰架变薄使冰流末端阻力减小，接地线随即后退，更多冰体浮起，又进一步加速冰流——这种冰架变薄—接地线后退—冰流加速的正反馈是当前南极冰量损失的关键机制。松岛冰川等快速冰流把内陆冰输送到海洋，其质量损失已构成南极对海平面上升的主要贡献之一。��Fast flow is controlled by basal conditions: the bed lies below sea level, and geothermal or frictional heat melts the basal ice, creating a lubricating water layer along which the stream surges forward by basal sliding and internal deformation; loss of ice-shelf buttressing then accelerates the stream. Thinning of the shelf reduces resistance at the ice front, the grounding line retreats, more ice floats, and the stream accelerates further—this feedback of shelf thinning, grounding-line retreat, and stream acceleration is the key mechanism behind current Antarctic mass loss. Fast-flowing streams such as Pine Island Glacier drain the interior to the ocean, and their losses are among the main contributors to Antarctica's sea-level contribution.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�13374c2ec2f8�body���穹窿是岩层向上拱起的圆形或椭圆形构造，由岩浆底辟或盐丘上拱造成。顶部岩石被侵蚀后常出露老岩层，周围呈同心环状，如美国科罗拉多穹窿。��A dome is rock strata arched upward in a circular or elliptical form, caused by magmatic diapir or salt uplift. After the top erodes, older rocks are exposed with concentric rings around, as in the Colorado Plateau dome structures.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�14171e067fbe�body��G地幔因内部放射性衰变与残余热产生密度差，形成缓慢的对流环，把上方岩石圈板块带着移动。争议在于到底是地幔拖曳、洋脊推力还是板块俯冲时的重力滑沉占主导。图尔科特与舒伯特的《地球动力学》用黏性流体模型量化了这些力的相对贡献。��The mantle's internal heat from radioactive decay and residual warmth creates density differences that drive slow convection cells, carrying the overlying lithospheric plates. A debate persists over whether mantle drag, ridge push, or the slab pull of subducting plates dominates. Turcotte and Schubert's Geodynamics quantifies the relative contributions of these forces with viscous-fluid models.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�161a4f98493b�body���沃克环流是沿赤道太平洋的东西向大气环流：低层信风把暖水往西推，在西太平洋空气上升成云降雨，到东太平洋下沉，再沿低层吹回西边，形成一个闭环。��The Walker circulation is an east-west loop over the tropical Pacific: low-level trade winds push warm water west, air rises and rains in the west, sinks in the east, and returns westward near the surface, closing the loop.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�16f36af8be5e�body���在风化地球化学中，常用SiO2、Al2O3、Fe2O3的相对富集程度刻画风化强度。强风化下硅被淋失、铝铁相对富集，此比值越低说明风化越彻底，常用于判别古风化壳成熟度。��In weathering geochemistry, the relative enrichment of SiO2, Al2O3 and Fe2O3 gauges weathering intensity. Strong weathering leaches silica and enriches alumina and iron; a lower ratio means more complete weathering, used to judge paleoweathering maturity.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�1741205c53e8�body���接触变质发生在岩浆侵入体周围，热量使围岩在狭窄的接触晕内重结晶，温度高而压力低，形成角岩等，不含定向构造。区域变质是造山运动中大范围深埋加压加温的结果，分布面积广大，常伴随板岩、片岩、片麻岩等，特征是矿物定向排列的片理构造。两种作用都靠矿物重结晶实现，但温压组合和空间尺度截然不同，变质程度还可以用温压计定量估计。�<Contact metamorphism occurs in a narrow halo around an igneous intrusion, where heat alone recrystallizes the host rock under low pressure into hornfels and other rocks without foliation. Regional metamorphism accompanies mountain building, where rocks are deeply buried, squeezed, and heated over vast areas, producing slate, schist, and gneiss with a characteristic foliation from aligned minerals. Both rely on recrystallization, but their temperature-pressure conditions and spatial scales differ sharply, and metamorphic grade can be quantified with thermobarometers.�ans��src��《普通地质学》�General Geology (Shu Liangshu)��id�18b5c10285f8�body�ي魏格纳提出大陆曾连成一片（泛大陆），后分裂漂移。如今证据包括大陆轮廓吻合、相同化石跨洋分布。ٞWegener proposed continents were once joined (Pangaea) and later split and drifted; evidence includes matching coastlines and identical fossils across oceans.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�1c0baab77898�body��F地球磁场主要由液态外核中导电铁镍流体的对流（地磁发电机效应）产生，近似一个巨大的偶极磁场。地质记录显示磁场会不定期整体倒转（南北极互换），最近一次主要的布容—松山倒转约发生在78万年前，其机制与外核流体的复杂动力学有关。��Earth's magnetic field is mainly generated by convection of electrically conducting iron-nickel fluid in the liquid outer core—the geodynamo effect—approximating a giant dipole. Geological records show the field periodically reverses (north and south poles swap); the most recent major Brunhes–Matuyama reversal occurred about 780,000 years ago, tied to the complex dynamics of the outer-core flow.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�1c57647bdfa5�body���黄石位于北美板块下方的地幔热点之上；随着板块西移，热点先后在今天的俄勒冈、爱达荷到黄石留下一串火山痕迹，黄石是其中最年轻、仍在活动的一个。��Yellowstone sits over a mantle hotspot beneath North America; as the continent drifted west, the hotspot left a track of volcanism from Oregon/Idaho to Yellowstone, with Yellowstone the youngest and still active.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�1cc0ffc28673�body�ف温暖期海洋分层强、底层缺氧，黑色富含有机质页岩广布，既埋藏大量石油母质也造成生物危机。ٗIn warm periods the ocean stratified and the deep turned anoxic, laying down black organic shales that stored oil source-rock yet caused biotic crisis.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�1d34bc42d5e3�body��/极地涡旋是冬季平流层与对流层中围绕极地的持续性冷性气旋环流，由极夜与温度梯度维持。当涡旋减弱或分裂，冷空气便会向南爆发，造成中纬度异常寒潮。沃与波利亚科夫的研究描述了涡旋突然增温与地表冷事件之间的联系。�nThe polar vortex is a persistent cyclonic circulation around the pole in the winter stratosphere and troposphere, sustained by polar night and temperature gradients. When it weakens or splits, cold air spills southward and produces anomalous mid-latitude cold snaps. Waugh and Polyakov described the link between sudden stratospheric warming and surface cold events.�ans��src��>盛裴轩 等,《大气物理学》,北京大学出版社,2003�HSheng Peixuan et al., Atmospheric Physics, Peking University Press, 2003��id�1d836c77aee6�body��该框架将净辐射拆分为感热、潜热、土壤热通量与储热项。城市因反照率降低、蒸散减少，使更多能量转为感热与储热，潜热减少，导致近地升温。遥感地表温度结合通量观测可定量分离各分量贡献。�FThe framework splits net radiation into sensible, latent, soil, and storage fluxes. Cities, with lower albedo and less evapotranspiration, shift more energy into sensible heat and storage and less into latent heat, warming the surface. Remote-sensing land temperature with flux towers quantifies each component's contribution.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�1debf1b7896c�body��{气溶胶既能反射阳光降温，又能作云凝结核改变云量，其净效应是不确定但重要的冷却作用。�\Aerosols reflect sunlight and seed clouds, giving an uncertain but important cooling effect.�ans��src��>盛裴轩 等,《大气物理学》,北京大学出版社,2003�HSheng Peixuan et al., Atmospheric Physics, Peking University Press, 2003��id�1e4475e0113d�body��'海水蒸发时较轻的氧-16优先进入大气，导致冰期时海洋相对富集氧-18；有孔虫等海洋生物壳体的氧-18/氧-16比值因此记录下温度与冰量信号。通过校准的氧同位素—温度关系，可将壳体比值转化为古海水温度或大陆冰量指标。�`During evaporation lighter oxygen-16 preferentially enters the atmosphere, enriching the ocean in oxygen-18 during glacials; the oxygen-18/oxygen-16 ratio in foraminifera shells therefore records both temperature and ice volume. Calibrated isotope-temperature relations convert shell ratios into paleo-sea-temperature or continental-ice-volume proxies.�ans��src��B《自然-地球科学》(Nature Geoscience) 古海洋温度重建�8Nature Geoscience (paleo-sea-temperature reconstruction)��id�1fc435f2ae0e�body�ٷ土壤pH表示酸碱度，多数作物适宜6到7。过酸会使铝活化毒害根系并淋失钙镁；过碱则铁、磷等有效性下降。调节pH是土壤改良的重要手段。��Soil pH indicates acidity-alkalinity; most crops prefer 6–7. Too acid mobilizes toxic aluminum and leaches calcium and magnesium; too alkaline lowers availability of iron and phosphorus. Adjusting pH is key to soil improvement.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�206381bed169�body�ِ依据地层、化石和放射性同位素定年，将地球历史分为宙、代、纪、世等层级，反映生命和环境的重大变化。١Based on strata, fossils and radiometric dating, Earth's history is divided into eons, eras, periods and epochs reflecting major changes in life and environment.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�22184c60520b�body��T米兰科维奇理论指出，地球轨道的三类缓慢变化——离心率（约10万年）、转轴倾角/黄赤交角（约4.1万年）和岁差（约2.3万/1.9万年）——改变了各纬度接收的太阳辐射量，从而驱动更新世的冰期—间冰期循环。这些周期在深海沉积和冰芯记录中都能被识别。�^Milankovitch theory holds that three slow changes in Earth's orbit—eccentricity (~100 kyr), axial tilt/obliquity (~41 kyr), and precession (~23 kyr/19 kyr)—alter the amount of solar radiation reaching different latitudes, driving Pleistocene glacial–interglacial cycles. These periodicities are recognizable in deep-sea sediments and ice cores.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�22728d79001b�body��冰期时巨厚冰盖压沉了地壳（均衡沉降），冰盖消融后载荷减轻，地壳便缓慢回弹抬升，这一过程可持续数千年，称为冰后均衡回弹。现今斯堪的纳维亚和加拿大地盾仍在以每年数毫米到约1厘米的速度上升。�bDuring ice ages, the enormous weight of ice sheets depressed the crust (isostatic subsidence); after the ice melts and the load is removed, the crust slowly rises again—a process lasting thousands of years called glacio-isostatic rebound. Today Scandinavia and the Canadian Shield are still rising by several millimeters to about a centimeter per year.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�255897cde038�body���海洋吸收了气候系统九成以上的新增热量，其热含量变化受年际波动影响小、对辐射强迫响应稳定，比地表气温更能代表地球能量失衡。Argo浮标阵列提供了全球深海温度的连续观测。�2The ocean absorbs over 90% of the climate system's added heat; its heat content varies little year-to-year and responds stably to radiative forcing, making it a better measure of Earth's energy imbalance than surface air temperature. The Argo float array provides continuous global subsurface observations.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�2588af353a6c�body��~造山运动是地壳因板块碰撞而强烈褶皱、断裂和抬升，形成山脉的地质过程，如阿尔卑斯造山。ىOrogeny is the geologic process where crust folds, faults and uplifts strongly due to plate collisions, building mountains like the Alps.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�26031feebbf1�body��V大陆洪水玄武岩是短时间内喷出的巨量玄武岩，德干暗色岩的喷发恰与白垩纪末大灭绝部分重叠。它们释放的二氧化碳与气溶胶可造成长期温室变暖与酸雨，扰动全球碳循环。库尔蒂约等人指出这类喷发的时间常与生物危机吻合，但撞击事件的作用仍需区分。��Continental flood basalts are enormous volumes of basalt erupted over short intervals, and the Deccan Traps overlap in part with the end-Cretaceous mass extinction. The carbon dioxide and aerosols they release can drive long-term greenhouse warming and acid rain, disturbing global carbon cycling. Courtillot and colleagues noted such eruptions often coincide with biotic crises, though impact effects must be disentangled.�ans��src��<Press & Siever,《Understanding Earth》W. H. Freeman 多版�LF. Press and R. Siever, Understanding Earth, W. H. Freeman, various editions��id�2641bb06956b�body���在中高纬地区，年轮宽度、密度和同位素组成与生长季温度或降水密切相关，宽轮对应有利生长条件；通过交叉定年，可把活树、历史木材与地下残木的年轮序列拼接延长至上万年。为保证气候信号可靠，还需对每棵树进行去趋势（标准化），去除树木自身的年龄趋势（幼年轮宽、老年轮窄），使不同树之间的信号可比。局限在于：只覆盖中高纬陆地，分辨率通常为年，且年轮还受虫害、竞争等非气候因素影响；近百年CO₂施肥与氮沉降也可能改变树木的气候敏感性，使现代校准在更早时期失真。�At mid and high latitudes, ring width, density, and isotope composition correlate with growing-season temperature or moisture, wide rings marking favorable years; cross-dating stitches living trees, historical wood, and subfossil logs into chronologies spanning ten millennia. To extract a reliable climate signal, each series must be detrended (standardized) to remove the tree's own age trend—juvenile rings are wide, old rings narrow—so that trees are comparable. Limits: coverage is land-only at mid–high latitudes, resolution is typically annual, rings are also influenced by non-climatic factors such as pests and competition, and modern CO₂ fertilization and nitrogen deposition may have altered trees' climate sensitivity, degrading modern calibrations when applied to the past.�ans��src��'Nature（树木年轮气候学研究）�#Nature (dendroclimatology research)��id�2720cb59b0e0�body�ٓ上游孔雀河、塔里木河的水被大量引去灌溉，入湖水量锐减，加上气候变干，湖面最终干涸，只留下盐壳戈壁。مUpstream water was diverted for irrigation and the climate dried, so inflow plummeted and the lake dried to a salt-crusted wasteland.�ans��src��6中国科学院地理研究所《中国自然地理》�`Chinese Academy of Sciences, Institute of Geographical Sciences, The Physical Geography of China��id�273b478f0171�body�ٜ城市热岛让空气更易上升，烟囱和汽车排放的微粒提供更多凝结核，会刺激更多对流和闪电，这叫“城市雷电增强”。٩The urban heat island boosts rising air, and pollution particles add condensation nuclei, stimulating more convection and lightning—called urban lightning enhancement.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�2ac4cffcbaa6�body�ف熔岩在水下迅速冷却，外层结壳、内部继续挤涌，堆成挨在一起的枕状岩块，证明曾是海底喷发。�OLava cooling underwater forms rounded pillows, evidence of submarine eruptions.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�2d5353bbc58b�body���三角洲垂向序列把水深变化翻译成岩性。同一地点向上变粗，说明离河口渐近、水变浅，三角洲向海推进，即空间增长赶不上来沙，或相对海平面在降，属海退序列；向上变细则相反，是海水侵入的海进序列。岩芯配上水深指示的化石与波痕，能重建古海岸线与升降方向。谨慎在于：来沙增多与海平面下降能造出同样的向上变粗，序列本身分不开。�yA delta's vertical sequence translates changes in water depth into rock type. Coarsening upward at one place means it was shallowing and nearing the river mouth, the delta prograding seaward because space for sediment grew more slowly than the sand supply or relative sea level was falling, a regressive sequence; fining upward is the opposite, a transgressive one in which the sea floods in. Cores plus depth-indicating fossils and ripples let you restore the ancient shoreline and the sense of uplift. The caution is that more sand and a falling sea level make the same coarsening-up, and the sequence alone cannot tell them apart.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�2d6e6efc7b1f�body�ٍ不同地质时期沉积的岩层含铁、锰等矿物种类和多少不同，氧化环境也不一样，层层叠叠就显出多彩条纹。٤Layers deposited in different eras contain varying iron, manganese and other minerals and formed under different oxidation conditions, producing multicolored bands.�ans��src��=普雷斯、西弗尔《理解地球》，W.H. Freeman，2001�?Press, F. & Siever, R., Understanding Earth, W.H. Freeman, 2001��id�2d8e469d3876�body�ه模型显示传送带变慢会让西北欧明显变冷、热带雨带偏移、海平面重新分布并扰乱全球碳与热量分配。َModels show a slower conveyor could cool northwest Europe, shift tropical rains and redistribute sea level, disrupting global carbon and heat.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�2dfb010492ce�body��/厄尔尼诺是海气耦合现象：海温异常首先改变上方大气的对流和风场，而风场变化又反过来影响海洋上层的冷暖分布。这种正反馈使异常得以维持和发展，并通过沃克环流的减弱在全球传播。理解这一耦合是季节气候预测的核心。��El Nino is an ocean-atmosphere coupled phenomenon: sea temperature anomalies first alter the convection and winds above, and those wind changes in turn reshape the warm and cold patterns in the upper ocean. This positive feedback lets the anomaly persist and grow, spreading globally through a weakened Walker circulation. Understanding this coupling is central to seasonal climate prediction.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�2e6c6256efeb�body��7外核是导电流体，其湍流对流在科里奥利力作用下形成螺旋运动，通过自激发电机过程把机械能转化为磁能。内核凝固释放潜热并排出轻元素（如氧、硫），为外核对流提供热—组成双层驱动：轻元素上升与热量耗散共同维持强烈的对流。内核还起稳定作用，使极性倒转更有规律；若外核停止对流，磁场会在数万年内衰减消失。地震层析与数值模拟还表明，内核的不对称生长可能使对流呈现非对称形态，影响磁场的长期行为。��The outer core is a conducting fluid whose turbulent, Coriolis-driven helical convection generates magnetic energy from mechanical energy through a self-exciting dynamo. Inner-core crystallization releases latent heat and expels light elements (oxygen, sulfur), providing both thermal and compositional buoyancy that drives convection. The solid core also stabilizes the system, making reversals more regular; without outer-core convection, the field would decay away within tens of thousands of years. Seismic tomography and numerical dynamo simulations further suggest that asymmetric growth of the inner core shapes the convection pattern and influences the field's long-term behavior.�ans��src��!Nature（地球发电机研究）�Nature (geodynamo research)��id�2ef10543c7c9�body���破火山口是塌陷造成的负地形：岩浆房被喷发抽空，顶板失去支撑，沿环形断层整体下沉，留下远比喷发口宽大的碗状洼地。它和普通火山口是两回事：火山口在喷发口上，由喷发物堆筑或爆炸挖成，宽以百米计；破火山口切穿锥体，跨以公里计。塌陷后常见环状断块、火口湖与复活穹隆；也别把它等同于超级火山：岩浆房浅、顶板易塌时，中等喷发也能造出。��A caldera is a collapse landform rather than a built-up one: an eruption drains the magma chamber, the roof above it loses support and drops wholesale along ring faults, leaving a bowl far wider than the vent that erupted. It is not the same thing as an ordinary crater, which sits on the vent, is built of ejecta or blasted out, and measures hundreds of metres across, whereas a caldera cuts across the cone that stood there before and spans kilometres. Ring-faulted blocks, a crater lake and a resurgent dome are the usual aftermath; and a caldera should not be equated with a supervolcano either, since a shallow chamber under a fragile roof can collapse in a moderate eruption.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�2f83fa22bc84�body�٢酸化会减少海水中的碳酸根离子，而珊瑚和贝类需要用它来造碳酸钙外壳骨骼；离子变少，它们长壳变难，幼体也更脆弱。ٹAcidification lowers carbonate ion concentration, which corals and shellfish need to build calcium-carbonate shells and skeletons; with fewer ions, shells form poorly and larvae weaken.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�310dc6ad15d6�body��E矩震级由地震矩决定，等于岩石剪切模量、破裂面积与平均滑移量的乘积，直接反映破裂规模。里氏震级在极大地震上会饱和，无法区分能量差异，而矩震级在整个范围内都近似线性。汉克斯与金森博在1979年提出它，如今已成为地震学标准标度。�uMoment magnitude is based on seismic moment, the product of rock rigidity, rupture area, and average slip, and the scale grows roughly linearly across all sizes. The Richter scale saturates for very large events and cannot distinguish their energy, whereas moment magnitude does not. Hanks and Kanamori introduced it in 1979, and it is now the standard seismological scale.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�31b73ad86fe9�body���除了全球总量变化，还有地壳回弹、洋流改道、重力变化（失去冰盖后陆地“弹起”、对海水的引力改变）等，使某些沿岸海平面反而下降或上升更快。��Beyond the global total, factors like crustal rebound, shifting currents, and gravity changes (lost ice reduces its pull on nearby water, while land rises) make some coasts fall or rise faster than the average.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�31d812b48e22�body�ٙ地震释放的能量以波的形式在地球内部和表面传播，分纵波（快）、横波（慢）和面波，可用来探测地球内部结构。ىQuake energy travels as waves through and around Earth: P-waves (fast), S-waves (slow) and surface waves, used to probe Earth's interior.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�32e45f1c4ff0�body��W鲍文反应系列把矿物按结晶温度从高到低的顺序排成两支：连续系列从钙长石到钠长石，不连续系列从橄榄石到石英。它说明岩浆冷却时矿物依次分离结晶，残余熔体成分随之演化。这一规律由鲍文在1928年《火成岩的演化》中系统提出，是火成岩分类的基础。��Bowen's reaction series arranges minerals by falling crystallization temperature into two branches: a continuous series from calcium-rich to sodium-rich plagioclase and a discontinuous series from olivine toward quartz. It shows that as magma cools, minerals crystallize and separate in sequence while the residual melt evolves in composition. Bowen set this out in 1928 in The Evolution of the Igneous Rocks, founding igneous petrology.�ans��src�ُBowen《The Evolution of the Igneous Rocks》（1928，University of Chicago Press）；Tarbuck 与 Lutgens《地球：物理地质学导论》ٌBowen, The Evolution of the Igneous Rocks (1928, University of Chicago Press); Tarbuck & Lutgens, Earth: An Introduction to Physical Geology��id�33312e43f87b�body���海洋酸化指海水吸收大气 CO2 后生成碳酸、降低 pH 的过程。自工业革命以来表层海水 pH 已从约 8.2 降至约 8.1，相当于氢离子浓度上升约 30%，威胁珊瑚与贝类等钙化生物。�!Ocean acidification is the drop in seawater pH as the ocean absorbs atmospheric CO2 and forms carbonic acid. Since the preindustrial era surface pH has fallen from about 8.2 to about 8.1, a roughly 30% increase in hydrogen ion concentration, threatening corals and shell-forming organisms.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�34cf196de164�body���VEI 是用对数尺度衡量火山喷发规模的指数，从0到8级，每升一级喷出的物质体积约增10倍。它综合喷发柱高度和喷出物体积来反映喷发的强烈程度。��The VEI is a logarithmic scale from 0 to 8 ranking eruption size, with each step up about ten times more ejected material. It combines plume height and ejected volume to express how violent an eruption is.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�352404dc5d39�body���美国农业部土壤分类系统把土壤归为约12个土纲（order），如新成土、淋溶土、氧化土和冻土等。它们依据成土过程、气候和母质等特征划分，是全球土壤多样性的框架。��The USDA soil taxonomy groups soils into about twelve orders, such as Entisols, Alfisols, Oxisols, and Gelisols. Based on soil-forming processes, climate, and parent material, they frame global soil diversity.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�354f8a6710f0�body���自然碳循环靠海洋吸收和岩石风化等过程，把多余的碳慢慢移走要以万年计；而人类在短短两百年里排出了大自然需要很久才能消纳的量，所以浓度飙升。��The natural carbon cycle removes excess CO2 via ocean uptake and rock weathering over tens of thousands of years; humans emitted in two centuries what nature would take far longer to absorb, so concentrations spike.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�3565b77a661b�body���在高温高压条件下，浅色长英质矿物（长石、石英）与暗色镁铁质矿物（黑云母、角闪石）发生分离并分别集中成条带，形成片麻状构造。这种分带是变质分异的结果：高温塑性变形下矿物经压溶、扩散与重结晶，在应力方向分别富集，而非仅靠片状矿物的机械旋转定向。与板理相比，片麻状构造对应更高的变质级别，温度继续升高时岩石还可局部熔融形成混合岩。�KUnder high-grade conditions, light felsic minerals (feldspar, quartz) and dark mafic minerals (biotite, hornblende) segregate into distinct bands, producing gneissic banding. The banding results from metamorphic differentiation: under high-temperature plastic deformation, pressure solution, diffusion, and recrystallization concentrate minerals separately along the stress direction, not merely by mechanical rotation of platy minerals. Compared with slaty cleavage, gneissic banding marks a higher metamorphic grade, and with further heating the rock partially melts to form migmatite.�ans��src�� 《普通地质学》(舒良树)�General Geology (Shu Liangshu)��id�357e5f1436d1�body���海洋暖湿气流遇到山脉被迫抬升，冷却到饱和后凝结成云和降水，在迎风坡大量降雨，如喜马拉雅南麓和台湾东北部。空气翻过山脊下降时被绝热压缩、增温，水汽早已耗尽，于是背风坡降水稀少，形成雨影区，如青藏高原北侧的柴达木盆地。背风坡下坡风因增温变干而被称为焚风，冬春可造成气温骤升、积雪快速融化。这是地形控制气候的经典范例。�^Moist air from the sea is forced up over a mountain range, cools to saturation, and condenses into clouds and heavy rain on the windward side, as on the southern flank of the Himalaya and northeastern Taiwan. Once the air crosses the ridge it descends, is compressed and warmed adiabatically, and has already lost its moisture, so the leeward side gets little rain—the rain shadow, like the Qaidam Basin north of the Tibetan Plateau. The dry, warm descending wind, called a foehn, can sharply raise temperature and melt snow in winter and spring. This is a classic example of terrain controlling climate.�ans��src��$中国气象局（地形与降水）�>China Meteorological Administration (orographic precipitation)��id�357f804f2523�body��~造山带深处含金流体沿断层上升，在温压骤降时把金和石英一起沉淀在裂隙中，形成脉状金矿。لDeep gold-rich fluids rise along faults in orogens and precipitate gold with quartz in fractures when temperature and pressure drop.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�35f8d706e65a�body���G-R 定律指出，震级每增大 1 级，发生频率约降低为原来的 1/10，数学上表示为 log₁₀N = a − bM。其中 b 值通常接近 1，反映小地震远多于大地震的统计规律，是地震危险性评估的基础。�'The Gutenberg–Richter law states that each unit increase in magnitude reduces occurrence frequency by roughly a factor of ten, expressed as log₁₀N = a − bM. The b-value is typically near 1, reflecting that small quakes vastly outnumber large ones—a basis for seismic hazard assessment.�ans��src��@《自然·地球科学》(Nature Geoscience) 地震统计研究�(Nature Geoscience, earthquake statistics��id�374bb257def8�body���从总量看，水蒸气是最强的天然温室气体，但它随温度快速变化、主要由温度控制；二氧化碳虽然单次增温效率不如甲烷，但因存量巨大且停留上百年，对长期人为增暖贡献最大。��Water vapor is the strongest natural greenhouse gas by volume, but it responds quickly to temperature. CO2, though less potent per molecule than methane, persists for centuries in huge amounts and drives most long-term human warming.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�37d54c5ef770�body��正常年份赤道太平洋的强对流和降水集中在西太平洋暖池。厄尔尼诺时海温异常东移，对流和降雨中心也随之东移到中东部太平洋，使南美西岸多雨、印尼和澳大利亚干旱。这种雨带迁移是全球旱涝异常的重要来源。��In normal years intense convection and rainfall in the equatorial Pacific concentrate over the warm pool in the west. During El Nino the warm anomaly shifts east, moving the convection and rain center to the central and eastern Pacific, bringing rains to the west coast of South America and drought to Indonesia and Australia. This migration of the rain belt is a major source of global floods and droughts.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�3997199b98ce�body��~在俯冲带，较重的大洋板块俯冲到另一板块之下，下沉弯曲形成深邃的海沟，如马里亚纳海沟。�~At subduction zones a heavier oceanic plate dives beneath another, bending down to form deep trenches like the Mariana Trench.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�3a21ac823d78�body��{蛇绿岩套是洋壳和地幔岩被推到陆上的完整剖面，是证明板块曾俯冲、大陆碰撞的关键证据。�bAn ophiolite is ocean crust and mantle thrust onto land, key evidence of subduction and collision.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�3ca341dbb3e1�body�٫城市“热岛效应”让混凝土和沥青白天吸热、夜里慢慢放，加上高楼挡风、废气更多，使城区比郊外高出好几度，热浪时更危险。��The urban heat island effect lets concrete and asphalt store daytime heat and release it at night, while buildings trap air and add waste heat, making cities several degrees hotter and more dangerous during heat waves.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�3d56cf9482d3�body��{某些浮游藻类在富营养化海水中暴发性繁殖，使海水变色并可能释放毒素，危害鱼类和人类。ًSome plankton algae bloom explosively in nutrient-rich water, discoloring the sea and possibly releasing toxins harmful to fish and people.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�3dbfa6086358�body�ٍ它把气候、生物多样性、氮磷循环等设为人类安全带，越过边界会增加触发全球突变和不可逆变化的风险。ّIt sets safe limits for climate, biodiversity, nitrogen-phosphorus and more; crossing them raises the risk of abrupt, irreversible global change.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�3df6b4bc0e96�body���洋中脊涌出的岩浆冷却时，会被当时的地磁场磁化；随着板块把海底向两侧推开，一段段岩石就按冷却时的磁场方向正反交替，形成对称的磁条带，像磁带一样记下倒转历史。��Lava at mid-ocean ridges cools and locks in the prevailing magnetic direction; as plates spread the seafloor apart, rocks record alternating normal and reversed magnetization in symmetric stripes, like a tape of reversal history.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�3e57a98e3868�body��Dansgaard-Oeschger事件表现为北大西洋地区在数十年内气温骤升8至16℃、随后缓慢回落的准周期性摆动，与海洋环流（特别是大西洋经向翻转环流）的减弱和恢复相关。它们揭示气候系统存在阈值式、非线性的快速响应。�=Dansgaard-Oeschger events show quasi-periodic jumps of 8 to 16°C in North Atlantic temperatures within decades followed by slow cooling, linked to weakening and recovery of ocean circulation, especially the Atlantic Meridional Overturning Circulation. They reveal threshold-like, nonlinear, abrupt climate responses.�ans��src��?《自然-地球科学》(Nature Geoscience) 快速气候变化�)Nature Geoscience (abrupt climate change)��id�3e909898aa04�body��'极锋理论由比耶克尼斯在1919年提出，把中纬度气旋看作极地冷气团与热带暖气团交界面上发展的波动。气旋沿锋面成长、产生暖锋与冷锋，并在锢囚阶段达到最强后逐渐填塞。这一理论奠定了现代天气图分析与预报的基础。�CBjerknes proposed polar front theory in 1919, viewing mid-latitude cyclones as waves developing along the boundary between polar cold and tropical warm air masses. A cyclone grows along the front, spawning warm and cold fronts, peaks at occlusion, then fills. The theory founded modern weather-map analysis and forecasting.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�40467d075608�body��~包括水蒸气、二氧化碳、甲烷和氧化亚氮等，它们吸收红外辐射使大气保温，过量会加剧变暖。�They include water vapor, carbon dioxide, methane and nitrous oxide; they trap infrared radiation, and excess enhances warming.�ans��src��>盛裴轩 等,《大气物理学》,北京大学出版社,2003�HSheng Peixuan et al., Atmospheric Physics, Peking University Press, 2003��id�413f7171835c�body���风成黄土是风从干旱源区搬来、披覆在边缘的粉砂，连续、广布、易采样。层序中黄土层与古土壤层交替：干冷期风尘供强、成土弱，暖湿期堆积慢、土壤化强，气候摆动就成了层圈。粒度指示风力与源区远近，磁化率反映成土的水热状况。但这些都是替代指标：磁化率也受粒度与源区控制，须分区标定、对照有定年的记录，否则易把局部信号读成全球结论。�GAeolian loess is silt winnowed out of arid source areas and blanketed over their margins, and it makes a convenient archive because the sections are nearly continuous, spread over large areas and easy to sample. Loess layers alternate with buried soils: when it was cold and dry, dust supply was strong and soil formation weak; when warm and wet, accumulation slowed and pedogenesis intensified, so the climate swings are written as couplets. Grain size speaks to wind strength and distance from the source, magnetic susceptibility to the heat and moisture available during soil formation. Both are proxies, though - susceptibility also responds to grain size and source changes - so each region needs its own calibration and must be tied to records that carry a dating framework, otherwise a local signal gets read as a global conclusion.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�42072ff99374�body��{超基性岩富含铁镁矿物、几乎不含石英，如橄榄岩，主要来自上地幔，是地壳最少的岩石类。�dUltramafic rocks like peridotite are iron-magnesium rich, nearly quartz-free, from the upper mantle.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�44b76ad99803�body��D气候模拟显示，若全球变暖使格陵兰冰盖大量融化，淡水注入北大西洋会降低海水盐度和密度，削弱下沉驱动力。这可能影响温盐环流甚至使其局部减缓，进而改变欧洲气候和全球热量分配。不过目前主流观点认为短期内完全中断的可能性较低。�oClimate models suggest that if global warming melts the Greenland ice sheet massively, freshwater input to the North Atlantic would lower salinity and density and weaken the sinking drive. This could slow the thermohaline circulation and alter European climate and global heat distribution. Most studies, however, see a complete shutdown in the near term as unlikely.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�45c386530a38�body�ٽ融冰是淡水，会降低表层海水的盐度和密度，使本该下沉的水“太轻”而沉不下去，从而削弱北大西洋的翻涌，可能让环流减速甚至局部停滞。ٵMeltwater is fresh; it lowers surface salinity and density so the water can no longer sink, weakening North Atlantic overturning and potentially slowing or stalling the circulation.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�463a1d5e070e�body���晶体结构是矿物内部原子、离子或分子在三维空间中有规律重复排列的方式，决定了矿物的对称性。同一种化学成分若排列方式不同（同质多象），可形成性质迥异的矿物，如金刚石和石墨。�Crystal structure is the regular, repeating three-dimensional arrangement of atoms, ions, or molecules inside a mineral, which determines its symmetry. The same composition arranged differently (polymorphism) can form very different minerals, like diamond and graphite.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�47849d321fdc�body���气候敏感参数通常指在二氧化碳浓度翻倍时全球平均气温的平衡上升幅度，主流估计约为1.5至4.5摄氏度。它是综合云、冰雪和海洋反馈后的关键指标，用于评估长期增暖程度。�Climate sensitivity usually means the equilibrium global temperature rise when carbon dioxide concentration doubles, with a mainstream estimate of about 1.5 to 4.5 degrees Celsius. It is a key metric that integrates cloud, ice, and ocean feedbacks to gauge long-term warming.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�47b20f2eadf8�body���MJO是热带大气向东传播、周期约30–60天的对流与环流异常带，能影响季风爆发、厄尔尼诺演变乃至北美寒潮与热带气旋活动。它提供介于天气预报与季节预测之间的次季节可预报性窗口。�IThe MJO is an eastward-propagating band of tropical convection and circulation anomalies with a 30-60 day period that influences monsoon onset, El Nino evolution, North American cold outbreaks, and tropical cyclone activity. It provides a subseasonal predictability window between daily weather forecasting and seasonal outlooks.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�49103c712752�body���地层学研究岩层的顺序及其所记录的时间信息，是确立相对地质年代的基础。标准化石是生存时间短、分布广、特征明显的化石，可用来快速对比不同地点地层的相对年龄。�Stratigraphy studies the layering of rocks and the time information they record, forming the basis for relative geologic dating. Index fossils are those with short lifespans, wide distribution, and distinctive features, used to correlate the relative ages of strata at different sites.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�4b4e33af9c7d�body���冻土坡上的蠕变是重力与冻融的慢账：暖季活动层向下融化，下面仍是不透水的冻层，融水排不走，表层泡成软泥，抗剪强度大跌，土体便沿冻融界面顺坡缓流。冬季冰晶顶起颗粒，化冻后垂直回落，每次都把位移往坡下偏一点。它一年只走毫米到厘米，与有滑面、瞬时失稳的滑坡相反，线索是歪斜的醉汉林与弯弓的树根；活动层过湿时蠕移会升级成滑塌。��Creep on a frozen slope is a slow account kept by gravity and frost together. In the warm season the active layer thaws downward while the ground beneath stays frozen and impermeable, so meltwater cannot drain; the surface turns to soft mud whose shear strength collapses, and the layer flows downhill along that frozen interface. Winter ice crystals lift the particles and thaw drops them straight back down, each cycle nudging the displacement a little further downslope. It moves only millimeters to centimeters a year, the opposite of a landslide, which has a slip surface and fails at an instant; its tells are drunken forests of tilted trunks and roots bent into bows. Let the active layer get too wet and creep escalates into a real slide.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�4b544d655276�body�٢尽管只占海底很小面积，珊瑚礁却供养了约四分之一的海洋物种，生物多样性极高，像雨林一样是生命最密集的家园之一。ٯThough covering only a tiny fraction of the seafloor, reefs shelter about a quarter of all marine species, making them biodiversity hotspots as dense with life as rainforests.�ans��src��cRachel Carson,《The Sea Around Us》Oxford University Press,1951;中译《环绕我们的海洋》�HR. Carson, The Sea Around Us, Oxford University Press, 1951; Chinese ed.��id�4b87c18abbc5�body�ٓ河口泥沙多、淤积快的海岸（如黄河口）向海推进；受海浪侵蚀或海平面上升、又少泥沙补充的海岸则会后退。ىSediment-rich deltas (like the Yellow River mouth) grow seaward, while wave-eroded or sea-level-rise coasts with little sediment retreat.�ans��src��0伯德《海岸地貌学导论》，Wiley，2008�BBird, E.C.F. (2008), Coastal Geomorphology: An Introduction, Wiley��id�4bead6926626�body���冰川不是静止的冰，而是靠自重流动、底部融水润滑的固体河流。它啃噬基岩有两个办法：冻在冰底的砾石像砂纸磨过冰床；渗进裂隙的水反复融冻，把岩块撬起拔出并带走，这叫刨蚀。冰运的碎屑不分选不分层，黏土与巨石混在一起，巨石能被推到远离母岩之处，流水做不到。认地貌要把挖与堆分开：U形谷、冰斗、角峰是侵蚀产物，碛垄与鼓丘是堆积产物。�fA glacier is not standing ice but a solid river that moves under its own weight, lubricated by meltwater at its bed. It attacks bedrock two ways: gravel frozen into the base scours the floor like sandpaper, and water refreezing in cracks pries blocks loose and rips them out, which is plucking. Its load is unsorted and unlayered, clay and boulders mixed together, and a boulder can be pushed far from the rock it came from, something running water cannot do. When reading the landforms, separate digging from dumping: U-shaped valleys, cirques and horns are eroded, while moraine ridges and drumlins are piled up.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�4e31a0d244e6�body���约2.52亿年前的二叠纪末事件造成约90%海洋物种和七成陆地物种消失，是地球史上最严重的大灭绝。可能与西伯利亚大规模火山喷发导致的气候与海洋缺氧有关。��The end-Permian event about 252 million years ago wiped out ~90% of marine species and 70% of terrestrial ones, the worst mass extinction in Earth's history. It may link to Siberian flood-basalt volcanism causing climate shifts and ocean anoxia.�ans��src��8Wicander & Monroe,《Historical Geology》Cengage 多版�TR. Wicander and J. S. Monroe, Historical Geology, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�51b5dea5627f�body���AMOC 是北大西洋把温暖表层水向北输送、冷水向南深层回流的翻转环流，对欧洲气候至关重要。观测显示其流速自20世纪中叶以来减弱，且北大西洋冷斑与盐度变化提示可能逼近临界阈值。�8The AMOC is the North Atlantic overturning that carries warm surface water northward and returns cold water southward at depth, crucial for European climate. Observations indicate a weakening since the mid-20th century, with a North Atlantic cold blob and salinity shifts hinting it may approach a tipping point.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�527d86d4c2cf�body���稀土是17种性质相近的镧系加钪、钇元素，在地壳中并不算极稀少，但可经济开采的富集成矿极少、分离提纯困难。它们是永磁体、风机与电子设备不可替代的原料，因而成为战略资源。�Rare earths are 17 similar lanthanide plus scandium and yttrium elements; they are not extremely scarce in crust but rarely occur in economic concentrations and are hard to separate. They are irreplaceable in magnets, wind turbines, and electronics, making them strategic resources.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�529b335708d7�body�ٓ在永恒的黑暗中，生物发光用来求偶、诱捕猎物、驱敌或照明；发光由体内的荧光素和荧光素酶化学反应产生。٥In perpetual darkness, bioluminescence is used for mating, luring prey, defense, or illumination; it comes from a chemical reaction between luciferin and luciferase.�ans��src��cRachel Carson,《The Sea Around Us》Oxford University Press,1951;中译《环绕我们的海洋》�HR. Carson, The Sea Around Us, Oxford University Press, 1951; Chinese ed.��id�5414d472d5f9�body��G黄石的破火山口源于大规模岩浆房塌陷，过去数百万年发生过数次喷发量超过一千立方公里的超级喷发。克里斯滕森等人对黄石的岩浆管道系统做了详细重建，显示其喷发间隔漫长但不规律。这类喷发足以改变全球气候，因此被列为重点监测对象。�zYellowstone's caldera formed from collapse of a large magma chamber and has produced several supereruptions exceeding 1,000 cubic kilometers over the past millions of years. Christiansen and colleagues reconstructed its magmatic plumbing in detail, showing long but irregular intervals between eruptions. Such events can alter global climate, so the system is closely monitored.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�54721f8ade18�body�ٜ富含二氧化硅的熔岩若遇水急速冷却，原子来不及排列成晶体，就凝固成黑亮、贝壳状断裂的玻璃质岩石——黑曜石。٨Silica-rich lava that cools extremely fast in water leaves atoms no time to form crystals, so it solidifies as a black, glassy rock with shell-like fractures: obsidian.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�559730a7502c�body�ه山上的冰雪融水和山区降雨形成河流，出山口进入平原后下渗或溢出，正好在沙漠边养出一片片绿洲。مMountain snowmelt and rainfall form rivers that emerge at the piedmont and seep or surface at the desert edge, nurturing oases there.�ans��src��3丁曼《物理水文学》，Waveland Press，2015�7Dingman, S.L., Physical Hydrology, Waveland Press, 2015��id�55cb95d8ac23�body��高光谱传感器在数百个连续窄波段记录地物连续光谱，可捕捉矿物和植被的精细吸收特征（光谱指纹），从而区分成分相近的物质。它在地质填图、作物胁迫和污染识别中优于仅数个宽波段的多光谱数据。�?Hyperspectral sensors record contiguous narrow bands across hundreds of channels, capturing fine absorption features, spectral fingerprints, that distinguish materials with similar composition. This outperforms multispectral data with only a few broad bands for geological mapping, crop stress, and pollution detection.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�5651bef36180�body�ٽ那里是冷干的加拿大气团、暖湿的墨西哥湾气流和干热的西南气流交汇处，强烈的风切变和不稳定空气极易催生超级单体，从而频繁产生龙卷。٥There, dry Canadian air, moist Gulf air, and hot dry southwestern air collide; strong wind shear and instability readily spawn supercells, making tornadoes frequent.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�57132c771872�body��@海水中的氧有轻重两种同位素，温度较低时海洋生物壳体更倾向于吸收较重的氧-18，使壳体同位素比值随水温变化。通过测量有孔虫等化石壳体的氧-18与氧-16之比，可反推沉积时的温度。埃米利亚尼与沙克尔顿在1950至1970年代奠定了这一方法。�oSeawater oxygen comes in light and heavy isotopes, and at lower temperatures marine shells preferentially take up the heavier oxygen-18, so the shell's isotope ratio tracks water temperature. Measuring the O-18 to O-16 ratio in fossils like foraminifera reconstructs the temperature at deposition. Emiliani and Shackleton established the method in the 1950s to 1970s.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�57d81b39098c�body���东北信风将撒哈拉粉尘向西输送，并常由非洲东风波与热带东风急流（African Easterly Jet）组织成高浓度的沙尘层。这些粉尘可跨越大西洋抵达加勒比与美洲，每年有大量粉尘参与跨洋传输。�The northeast trade winds carry Saharan dust westward, organized by African easterly waves and the African Easterly Jet into concentrated dust layers. They can cross the Atlantic to the Caribbean and the Americas, with large amounts transported overseas each year.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�5805ad339af8�body���P波（纵波）是介质沿传播方向来回振动的压缩波，能穿过固体、液体和气体，速度最快，地壳内约每秒6公里；S波（横波）是质点垂直于传播方向振动的剪切波，速度约为P波的六成，且不能穿过液体。由于S波无法通过液态铁镍组成的地核外核，地震图上出现S波盲区，据此科学家推断外核是液态的。利用P、S波到时差还能定位震中并确定震源深度。�#P-waves are compressional waves with particles vibrating along the propagation direction; they pass through solids, liquids, and gases and are fastest, roughly 6 km/s in the crust. S-waves are shear waves with particles vibrating perpendicular to propagation, travel at about 60% of P-wave speed, and cannot pass through liquids. Because S-waves cannot cross Earth's liquid iron outer core, a shadow zone appears on seismograms—the evidence that the outer core is molten. The P-S arrival-time difference also locates epicenters and focal depths.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�58852df20c79�body��{枯水期河流水位低、推力弱，涨潮时海水沿河口上溯，把河口的水变咸，会影响自来水取水。هIn dry season the river is low and weak, so at high tide seawater pushes upstream and makes the estuary salty, troubling water intakes.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�597e9ac5cd42�body�ف季风是随季节反转的大范围风系，因海陆热力差异，夏季风从海洋吹向陆地带来降水，冬季相反。٬A monsoon is a large wind system that reverses with seasons; due to land-sea temperature differences, summer winds blow from sea to land bringing rain, winter the opposite.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�5ac15f74017d�body��厄尔尼诺年西太平洋暖池东移，使对流中心偏离西北太平洋，该海域的生成频数常略减但路径更偏东、影响范围变化。同时垂直风切变和海温分布改变，使个别台风更强。研究仍在细化这种年际关系。�iIn El Nino years the western Pacific warm pool shifts east, moving the convection center away from the western North Pacific, so genesis frequency there often dips slightly while tracks shift eastward. Changed vertical wind shear and sea temperature patterns can also make individual storms stronger. Research continues to refine this year-to-year relationship.�ans��src��W伊曼纽尔《热带气旋》，《地球与行星科学年度评论》第31卷，2003�ZEmanuel, K.A. (2003), Tropical cyclones, Annual Review of Earth and Planetary Sciences, 31��id�5b1b40ca92f7�body�ٺ黄河受鄂尔多斯地块和黄土高原构造控制，先向北切穿阴山前缘，再向东沿吕梁山南下，最后折向东入海，地形逼迫它画出巨大的“几”字。٩Tectonics of the Ordos block and Loess Plateau force the river north, then east along mountain fronts, then southeast, tracing a giant rectangle before reaching the sea.�ans��src��=普雷斯、西弗尔《理解地球》，W.H. Freeman，2001�?Press, F. & Siever, R., Understanding Earth, W.H. Freeman, 2001��id�5b632c2911e3�body��KPETM约5600万年前在数千年内向大气释放了相当于数万亿吨的碳，使全球温度骤升约5至8摄氏度。扎科斯等人指出海洋因此酸化、底栖有孔虫大量灭绝，与今日排放速率相比当年的释放其实相对缓慢。它提醒我们碳循环的临界点可能在快速扰动下被触发。��The PETM injected the equivalent of trillions of tons of carbon into the atmosphere within thousands of years about 56 million years ago, spiking global temperatures by roughly 5 to 8 degrees Celsius. Zachos and colleagues noted the oceans acidified and benthic foraminifera went extinct, yet today's release rate is far faster than then. It warns that carbon-cycle tipping points can be triggered by rapid perturbation.�ans��src�ِZachos 等《Rapid acidification》（2005，Science）；McInerney 与 Wing《PETM》（2011，Annual Review of Earth and Planetary Sciences）�YZachos et al., Rapid acidification (2005, Science); McInerney & Wing, PETM (2011, ARA&PS)��id�5cd60d113aa0�body���砂粒、粉粒和黏粒被黏土矿物与腐殖质胶结成疏松的小团聚体，就是团粒结构。团粒之间是大孔隙，管通气与排水；团粒内部是细毛管孔隙，管保水与保肥。两套孔隙兼备，水肥气热才能协调，因此它被视为肥沃土壤的标志。它和质地不是一回事：质地由颗粒粗细比例定下、几乎改不动，团粒结构却随有机质与耕作消长，大水漫灌或农机压实就能把它打散。�sSand, silt and clay cemented by clay minerals and humus into loose small clumps form aggregate structure. The gaps between clumps are large pores that aerate the soil and drain water, while the fine capillary pores inside each clump hold water and nutrients; with both pore sizes present, water, nutrients, air and heat stay balanced, which is why it counts as a mark of fertile soil. It is not the same thing as texture: texture is fixed by the proportion of particle sizes and hardly changes, whereas aggregate structure rises and falls with humus and tillage, and one heavy watering or machine compaction can break it apart.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�5e1a7d60ec77�body���地球自转让北半球运动的空气持续右偏、南半球左偏，而偏转方向总与运动方向垂直，所以它只改变风向，不给空气加速。纬度越高、风速越大，偏转越明显，赤道附近几乎不偏。真正推动空气的是气压梯度力，科里奥利力要等空气动起来才起作用；两者大致平衡时，风便沿等压线吹而不是直穿等压线，信风带、西风带和气旋的旋转都由此而来。��Earth's rotation makes moving air swing steadily right in the Northern Hemisphere and left in the Southern, and since the deflection always acts across the direction of travel, it turns the wind aside without speeding the air up. The swing grows with latitude and with wind speed, and near the equator it all but disappears. The pressure-gradient force is what actually drives the air, and Coriolis only takes hold once the air is already moving; when that deflection and the pressure gradient roughly balance, wind runs along the isobars instead of straight across them, which is where the trade winds, the westerlies and the spin of cyclones come from.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�5f9546a566c4�body�٬峡湾是冰川侵蚀出的U形谷在冰川消退后被海水淹没形成的狭长海湾，两岸陡峭、水深很大。挪威和智利南部海岸以大量峡湾著称。��A fjord is a long, narrow inlet with steep sides and great depth, formed when a glacial U-shaped valley was flooded by the sea after the ice retreated. Coasts of Norway and southern Chile are famous for them.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�61aa55b426e0�body�٫这里石灰岩广布、降水丰沛，地表水顺着溶洞和暗河奔流，常在地表看不见，却在地下汇成大河，个别还会以泉或伏流形式重现。ٓWidespread limestone and plenty of rain let surface water flow through caves and underground channels, often reappearing as springs or resurgences.�ans��src��B福特、威廉姆斯《岩溶水文与地貌学》，Wiley，2007�NFord, D.C. & Williams, P.W., Karst Hydrogeology and Geomorphology, Wiley, 2007��id�620002af11b8�body�ه地核外核的液态铁镍对流不稳定，磁场偶极会减弱、混乱后重建为相反方向，平均数十万年发生一次。ًThe swirling iron-nickel outer core becomes unstable, the dipole weakens and rebuilds flipped, on average every few hundred thousand years.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�634d692e8ca7�body��!火山碎屑流是火山喷发时沿山坡高速奔涌的炽热气体、灰烬和岩石碎块的混合物，温度可超700°C、速度可达每小时数百公里。它密度大、蔓延快且难以躲避，是历史上造成最多火山伤亡的灾害之一（如1902年培雷火山）。�=A pyroclastic flow is a fast-moving mixture of hot gas, ash, and rock fragments that races down a volcano's flanks, reaching temperatures above 700°C and speeds of hundreds of km/h. Dense, swift, and nearly impossible to outrun, it has caused some of history's deadliest volcanic disasters (e.g., Mont Pelée, 1902).�ans��src��<Press & Siever,《Understanding Earth》W. H. Freeman 多版�LF. Press and R. Siever, Understanding Earth, W. H. Freeman, various editions��id�636acf80a755�body���沉积落底或岩浆冷却时，岩石里的磁性矿物顺着当时地磁场取向并留住方向；地磁场极性还会正反交替，连续地层里就留下正、逆相间的磁化带。测出剖面磁化方向的变化，与标准极性年表比对，地层便有了年代框架。它自己不产出绝对年龄，年表靠海底磁异常条带加同位素定年标定；前提是层序连续、未倒转、无缺失，构造翻转和沉积间断都会让对比串位。��As sediment settles or magma cools, the magnetic minerals in the rock align with the field of the moment and lock its direction in; because the geomagnetic field reverses polarity, an unbroken sequence of strata becomes alternating bands of normal and reversed magnetization. Measure how the direction changes up a section and match that pattern to the standard polarity timescale, and the beds gain an age framework. The method yields no absolute age of its own—that timescale must be calibrated from seafloor magnetic anomalies plus radiometric dates. It also assumes continuous, unoverturned strata: folding or a sedimentary hiatus puts the correlation out of place.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�63a62e18b529�body�ل长期争论后，地震成像支持以全地幔对流为主，俯冲板片可沉入核幔边界，但部分地区存在滞留层。ٓLong debated, tomography now favors whole-mantle convection with slabs reaching the core-mantle boundary, though some regions show a stalled layer.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�64255a81bd16�body�ٜ岩浆在地下缓慢冷却成侵入岩（如花岗岩），晶体粗大；喷出地表快速冷却成喷出岩（如玄武岩），晶体细或成玻璃。ٴMagma cooling slowly underground forms intrusive rock (e.g. granite) with coarse crystals; erupting and cooling fast forms extrusive rock (e.g. basalt) with fine or glassy texture.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�64545fa7b5e9�body�ه海洋浮游生物遗骸在缺氧细泥中埋藏，经深埋升温演变成烃类，并在孔隙岩中运移聚集到圈闭里成矿。كMarine plankton buried in anoxic mud matures into hydrocarbons under heat and pressure, then migrates and pools in reservoir traps.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�64f28704e9a6�body���补给区是地表水渗入、补充含水层的高地或透水区；排泄区是地下水自然流出地表的地方，如泉、河流或湿地。理解二者对保护水源和管理污染至关重要。�A recharge area is where surface water infiltrates and replenishes an aquifer, often high permeable ground; a discharge area is where groundwater naturally surfaces, such as springs, rivers or wetlands. Understanding both is key to protecting water and managing pollution.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�655fb6811817�body��)城市冠层是街道峡谷内的近地空气层，受建筑几何与局地湍流主导，决定行人尺度的热感；城市边界层是覆盖整个城市的混合层，受区域环流与天气控制，决定城市尺度热异常的范围与强度。两者时空尺度不同，需分别建模。�uThe urban canopy layer is the near-ground air within street canyons, governed by building geometry and local turbulence, shaping pedestrian-scale heat. The urban boundary layer is the mixed layer over the whole city, controlled by regional circulation and weather, setting the extent and intensity of the city-scale anomaly. They differ in scale and need separate modeling.�ans��src��@《自然·地球科学》(Nature Geoscience) 城市气象研究�$Nature Geoscience, urban meteorology��id�66393125bb46�body���前提是气压与水汽含量不变：空气降温，饱和水汽压下降，实际水汽压一到饱和值、相对湿度成 100%，水汽就在草叶上凝出，这温度即露点。它衡量水汽的实际多少，比相对湿度更可比：同为 80% 的相对湿度，暖空气含水汽远多于冷空气，沿海闷夜露点几乎贴着气温，内陆干夜则低得多。表面本身已低于 0°C 时，水汽越过液态直接凝华为霜。��The premise is constant pressure and unchanged vapor content: as air cools, saturation vapor pressure falls, and once the actual vapor pressure reaches it, when relative humidity becomes 100%, vapor condenses on a grass blade, and that temperature is the dew point. It measures how much vapor is really there, so it is more comparable than relative humidity: at the same 80% relative humidity warm air holds far more vapor than cold air, and on a muggy coastal night the dew point sits almost against the temperature but on a dry inland night far below. Where the surface itself is already below 0°C, vapor skips the liquid and deposits as frost.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�663daea7ed41�body��x可溶性岩石（如石灰岩）被水溶蚀形成溶洞、天坑、石林等，我国桂林、云南石林是典型。ٔSoluble rock like limestone is dissolved by water to form caves, sinkholes and stone forests; Guilin and Yunnan's stone forest in China are typical.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�6829a80d9f8d�body���洋中脊喷出的玄武岩含磁性矿物，冷却到居里点以下时按当时地磁场方向被磁化。地磁场历史上多次倒转，新洋壳持续记录每次倒转，于是洋中脊两侧形成对称的、正反相间的磁条带，像磁带一样。海底磁异常图显示条带年龄随离脊距离增大而变老，与海底扩张的预测完全吻合，成为板块构造最有力的证据之一，也间接证实了古地磁学预言的地磁倒转史。�ZBasalt erupting at mid-ocean ridges contains magnetic minerals that lock in the direction of Earth's field when they cool below the Curie point. Because the geomagnetic field has reversed many times, newly formed crust records each flip, leaving symmetric stripes of normal and reversed polarity on both flanks of the ridge, like a tape recording. Maps of seafloor magnetic anomalies show stripes getting older away from the ridge, exactly as seafloor spreading predicts—one of the strongest confirmations of plate tectonics and independent proof of the reversal history paleomagnetism had predicted.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�68e54149b135�body���北大西洋高纬海面强烈冷却并蒸发，海水变冷变咸、密度增大而下沉，形成北大西洋深层水，向南流经大西洋底，绕南极进入印度洋与太平洋，在深层缓慢上涌，再随表层洋流回到北大西洋，构成全球温盐环流。温度与盐度共同决定密度，故称热盐环流。它把热量、氧和碳输送到全球深海，若格陵兰冰盖大量融水注入，淡化海水可能减弱甚至关闭输送带，对全球气候影响深远。�aIn the high-latitude North Atlantic, strong cooling and evaporation make surface water cold and salty, dense enough to sink as North Atlantic Deep Water; it flows south along the Atlantic bottom, rounds Antarctica into the Indian and Pacific Oceans, slowly upwells, and returns via surface currents—the global thermohaline circulation, named because temperature and salinity jointly set density. It delivers heat, oxygen, and carbon to the deep ocean worldwide; if large meltwater pulses from Greenland freshen the surface, the sinking could weaken or even shut down, with far-reaching climate consequences.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�692cf64b0b7b�body��黑碳强烈吸收可见光与红外辐射，既加热大气又沉降在雪冰上降低反照率加速融化（正反馈），同时若悬浮在对流层也可通过吸收抑制云的形成。它寿命短但增温潜势高，是仅次于CO2的重要短期气候强迫。�ZBlack carbon strongly absorbs visible and infrared radiation, heating the atmosphere and, when deposited on snow and ice, lowering albedo to accelerate melt (a positive feedback), while absorbing in the troposphere can also suppress cloud formation. Short-lived but with high warming potential, it is a major short-term climate forcing after CO2.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�69ab72543da4�body���俯冲板片比周围地幔冷而重，负浮力把它往深处拖。当下拖快过汇聚供给的速率，海沟与随之迁移的岩浆弧便朝洋侧后退，这就是板片回卷。回卷在上覆板块后侧造出空间：弧被拉伸减薄、地幔上升减压熔融，于是形成弧后盆地，俯冲角与震源分布随之调整。但回卷并非弧后扩张的唯一原因，地幔对流与沿走向拖曳也能拉开弧后；两速消长时海沟会转为推进。��A subducting slab is colder and denser than the mantle around it, so its negative buoyancy drags it downward. When that pull outruns the rate at which convergence feeds plate into the trench, the trench and the magma arc attached to it migrate oceanward - that is slab rollback. Rollback opens space behind the upper plate: the arc is stretched and thinned, mantle rises and melts by decompression, a back-arc basin forms, and the dip of the slab and the distribution of its earthquakes adjust accordingly. Rollback is not the only way to open a back-arc basin, however, since mantle convection and trench-parallel drag can stretch it too; and when the two rates change balance, the trench turns from retreating to advancing.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�69cbd9f28d9b�body���火山形态取决于岩浆黏度。夏威夷的岩浆是低硅、低黏度的玄武岩浆，气体易逸出，呈平静溢流，冷却后铺成坡度很小的盾状火山，如冒纳罗亚。环太平洋的层状火山喷发的则是高硅、高黏度的安山岩-流纹岩岩浆，黏稠塞住火山通道，气体积累到高压后爆炸性喷发，碎屑堆积成陡峭的层状锥，如富士山和维苏威。黏度由温度、SiO2含量和挥发分共同控制。��A volcano's shape reflects magma viscosity. Hawaii erupts low-silica, low-viscosity basalt that degasses easily and flows quietly, cooling into broad shield volcanoes like Mauna Loa. Around the Pacific rim, stratovolcanoes erupt high-silica, viscous andesite-rhyolite that plugs the conduit; gas builds up pressure until explosive eruptions pile steep cones of debris, as at Fuji and Vesuvius. Viscosity is set by temperature, silica content, and volatiles acting together.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�6a56b6db3784�body���大河河口形成的低密度羽流将淡水与营养盐（氮、磷、硅）输送到陆架，常促进浮游植物勃发与渔业生产力；但过量营养盐也可引发低氧“死亡区”，如密西西比河羽流下游的墨西哥湾缺氧区。�Low-density plumes from large rivers deliver freshwater and nutrients (N, P, Si) onto the shelf, often boosting phytoplankton blooms and fisheries productivity; but excess nutrients can trigger hypoxia dead zones, such as the Gulf of Mexico hypoxia linked to the Mississippi plume.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�6ac3e82e98e6�body��w高空太阳辐射把气体分子电离成带电粒子，形成能反射无线电波的电离层，约80公里以上。�[Solar radiation ionizes high air into charged layers that reflect radio waves above ~80 km.�ans��src��>盛裴轩 等,《大气物理学》,北京大学出版社,2003�HSheng Peixuan et al., Atmospheric Physics, Peking University Press, 2003��id�6b21a66b3213�body�ْ3颗卫星可算出你所在的球面交点（三维位置），但手机时钟不够准，第4颗用来校正时间误差，才能精确到米。٘Three satellites give your 3D position by intersection, but the receiver clock is imprecise, so a fourth corrects the time error and pins you to meters.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�6b356f0f1bf0�body���硅酸盐以硅氧四面体（一个硅原子被四个氧包围）为基本单元。这些四面体通过共用氧原子，连接成岛状、链状、层状或架状等不同结构，决定了矿物的物理性质。��Silicates are built from the silica-oxygen tetrahedron, one silicon surrounded by four oxygens. These tetrahedra share oxygen atoms to form isolated, chain, sheet or framework structures, which determine the mineral's physical properties.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�6c01838ec0a2�body�ـGRACE等观测显示许多农业区含水层净亏损，补给赶不上开采，长期将威胁饮水、灌溉与河流基流。ٖGRACE shows many farming regions have net aquifer loss, recharge lagging pumping, threatening long-term drinking water, irrigation and river baseflow.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�6c9cf70405af�body�ل利用铀、钾等放射性同位素按固定速率衰变，测出岩石或化石的年龄，是建立地质年代的关键方法。ٔUsing isotopes like uranium and potassium that decay at fixed rates, we measure the age of rocks or fossils, key to building the geologic timescale.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�6d19b3749a09�body��"正常年份信风把暖水推向西太平洋，南美沿岸不断上涌冷水；信风一弱，暖水东回，赤道中东太平洋海温比常年高几度，上涌与营养盐随之减少。对流中心则向东移，沃克环流被重整，远方的旱涝就这样连成一片。名字来自秘鲁渔民，他们常在圣诞前后察觉暖流，以「圣婴」称之。要分清：厄尔尼诺是 ENSO 的暖位相，与南方涛动是一件事的海、气两面，冷位相叫拉尼娜；它是年际变率，叠加而非等同长期趋势。�rIn a normal year the trade winds pile warm water against the western Pacific and cold water keeps upwelling off South America; when those winds slacken the warm pool sloshes back east, sea surface temperature in the central and eastern equatorial Pacific runs a few degrees above usual, and upwelling and its nutrient supply thin out with it. The rain-bearing convection then shifts east, the Walker circulation is reorganised, and that is how distant droughts and deluges end up linked. The name comes from Peruvian fishermen, who usually noticed this warm current around Christmas and called it the Christ Child. What to keep straight: El Niño is the warm phase of ENSO, the ocean side of one phenomenon whose atmospheric side is the Southern Oscillation, with La Niña as the cold phase; it is year-to-year variability riding on top of the long-term trend, not the trend itself.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�6d8dfc318f7a�body��厚冰盖压迫地壳使其下沉、地幔物质外移；冰消融后地壳缓慢回弹，周边因物质回流而下沉，形成“跷跷板”式均衡调整。今日北欧与加拿大仍以上升为主，而部分海岸则相对下沉，影响区域相对海平面。�Heavy ice depressed the crust and displaced mantle; after melt the crust slowly rebounds while peripheral areas subside as mantle flows back—a see-saw isostatic response. Today Fennoscandia and Canada still rise, while some coasts subside, shaping regional relative sea level.�ans��src��8Wicander & Monroe,《Historical Geology》Cengage 多版�TR. Wicander and J. S. Monroe, Historical Geology, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�6db5825f2073�body��三叶虫复眼的晶状体由方解石单晶构成，方解石的双折射等晶体光学性质本会使光线分离成像，但三叶虫将晶状体的光轴精确控制在垂直于透镜表面的方向，从而避免了重影，实现了能聚焦成像的矫正镜片。因为晶状体本身是矿物，比软组织更容易石化，数亿年前的晶状体结构与光学设计至今仍可用显微技术研究。这一发现成为自然光学工程的经典案例，也说明复杂的光学系统早在寒武纪就已演化出现。�lThe lenses of trilobite compound eyes are single calcite crystals; calcite's birefringence would normally split images, but trilobites oriented the lens optic axis precisely perpendicular to the lens surface, avoiding double images and producing corrective lenses that focus light. Because the lenses are themselves minerals, they fossilize far more readily than soft tissue, so lens structure and optical design from hundreds of millions of years ago can still be studied microscopically. This makes them a classic case of natural optical engineering and shows that sophisticated optics evolved already in the Cambrian.�ans��src��'Nature（三叶虫复眼结构研究）�)Nature (trilobite eye structure research)��id�6efca6cff3f7�body��f山顶的化石原本是海底沉积物: 含生物遗骸的泥沙在浅海压实成石灰岩或页岩，后来板块碰撞把地壳褶曲抬升，岩层被推到几千米高。珠峰顶那层石灰岩里能找到海百合茎与腕足类碎屑，它是特提斯洋的浅海沉积；青藏高原更年轻一些的层位里则出露菊石与海相页岩。抬升速率通常只有毫米每年量级，但几千万年累计就是几千米，所以「山上有海洋生物」不是巧合，而是板块构造最直接的一条证据——同一套逻辑也解释了为什么煤系地层里会出现热带植物化石。��Fossils on a summit began as seabed sediment: mud and shells compacted into limestone or shale in a shallow sea, and later plate collision folded and lifted that crust kilometres into the air. The limestone capping Everest preserves crinoid stems and brachiopod debris, laid down in the shallow Tethys ocean, while younger units across the Tibetan plateau expose ammonites and marine shales. Uplift runs only on the order of millimetres a year, but tens of millions of years add up to kilometres, so 'marine fossils on a mountain' is not a coincidence but the plainest evidence for plate tectonics. The same logic explains tropical plant fossils inside coal measures.�ans��src��8Wicander & Monroe,《Historical Geology》Cengage 多版�TR. Wicander and J. S. Monroe, Historical Geology, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�6f505b2c9b0d�body���外地核是液态的铁镍，因热量散失而缓慢对流，加上地球自转的科里奥利力把流动组织成旋涡，导电液体流动产生电流，电流再维持磁场，这就是地核发电机说。��The liquid iron-nickel outer core convects as it cools; Earth's rotation twists the flow via the Coriolis force into spirals, and moving conductor creates electric currents that sustain a magnetic field—the geodynamo.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�6f6f579fabd6�body���洋中脊是沿张裂边界延伸的全球海底山系：地幔上涌减压熔融，玄武岩在两侧添成新洋壳，两翼年龄与地形对称，磁异常条带向外排开。它是世界最长的山链，足以把地球绕一圈还有余，却几乎全埋在深海之下，冰岛是少数露出海面的地段。两处易混：中脊未必在海盆正中，东太平洋海隆就偏在洋盆一侧；脊轴被横向转换断层错成一段段，断层本身不扩张。��A mid-ocean ridge is the global chain of submarine mountains built along divergent plate boundaries: as mantle rises it melts by decompression, and the basalt is added to both sides as new oceanic crust, so the flanks mirror each other in age and shape and the magnetic stripes spread symmetrically outward. It is the longest mountain chain on the planet, long enough to wrap the Earth more than once, yet nearly all of its axis lies deep beneath the sea, with Iceland one of the rare places where it breaks the surface. Two confusions to avoid: a mid-ocean ridge need not sit in the middle of its basin, since the East Pacific Rise lies off-centre in the Pacific; and its axis is stepped into segments by transverse transform faults, which do not spread themselves.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�6ff09104f658�body���南极冰盖年复一年压实的雪封存着当年的空气气泡，其中的CO2与CH4浓度可直接测量，构成大气成分的直接档案。同时，降水中氧-18与氧-16的比值随温度变化，寒冷期较轻的氧-16更易留在冰盖中，使冰的δ18O曲线成为温度代用指标。欧洲南极冰芯计划（EPICA）的冰芯把记录延伸到约80万年前，显示CO2浓度与温度在冰期旋回中同步起伏，为理解大气、冰冻圈与碳循环的耦合提供了基准数据。�`Layer after layer of compressed snow in ice sheets traps air bubbles whose CO2 and CH4 concentrations can be measured directly—a true archive of past atmospheres. The ratio of oxygen-18 to oxygen-16 in precipitation also tracks temperature, because the lighter isotope is more readily locked into ice during cold periods, making the ice's d18O curve a temperature proxy. The EPICA ice core extends this record back about 800,000 years and shows CO2 and temperature rising and falling together through glacial cycles, providing benchmark data on the coupling of the atmosphere, cryosphere, and carbon cycle.�ans��src��!Nature（东方站冰芯记录）�Nature (Vostok ice core record)��id�73bb63ff4471�body��浮游植物光合作用固定CO2，死亡后形成颗粒物沉降至深海，部分被微生物分解、部分埋入沉积物，从而将碳从大气端隔离到深海。该过程效率受营养盐供给与食物链组成调控，是海洋长期碳汇的核心机制。�IPhytoplankton fix CO2 by photosynthesis; when they die, particles sink to the deep ocean, where some are remineralized by microbes and some are buried in sediments, sequestering carbon away from the atmosphere. Efficiency is regulated by nutrient supply and food-web structure and is central to the ocean's long-term carbon sink.�ans��src��H《自然-地球科学》(Nature Geoscience) 海洋生物地球化学泵�-Nature Geoscience (Ocean biogeochemical pump)��id�7477159e7196�body���地壳是硅酸盐外壳，含量排序由氧、硅、铝、铁打头：氧与硅结成硅氧四面体，连成长石、云母、石英等造岩矿物，两者合占绝大部分地壳质量，铝与铁再顶替其间的金属位置。按质量与按原子个数计，排序略有差别；也要分清地壳与整个地球或海水：铁在地球整体里更靠前，因为分化时大量铁沉入地核，而海水里占优的是氧与氢。��The crust is a silicate shell, which is why the abundance ranking opens with oxygen, silicon, aluminium and iron: oxygen bonds with silicon into the silicon-oxygen tetrahedron, and these link up into the rock-forming minerals feldspar, mica and quartz, so those two elements alone make up most of the crust by mass, while aluminium and iron fill the metallic positions among them. Ranking by mass and by number of atoms gives slightly different orders, and the crust is not the same as the whole Earth or the sea: iron ranks higher for the planet as a whole because differentiation sent much of it into the core, whereas seawater is dominated by oxygen and hydrogen.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�74e53b0e242e�body��7岩浆中二氧化硅越多（长英质/酸性），黏度越高、气体越难逸出，易积累压力造成猛烈爆发（如流纹岩）。二氧化硅少（镁铁质/基性，如玄武岩）则黏度低、气体易释放，多为平静的溢流式喷发。因此成分差异决定了火山的“脾气”。�kThe more silica a magma contains (felsic/acidic compositions), the higher its viscosity and the harder it is for gases to escape, so pressure builds and produces explosive eruptions (e.g., rhyolite). Low-silica (mafic/basaltic) magmas are fluid, letting gas escape easily and causing gentle effusive eruptions. Composition thus dictates a volcano's 'temperament.'�ans��src��<Press & Siever,《Understanding Earth》W. H. Freeman 多版�LF. Press and R. Siever, Understanding Earth, W. H. Freeman, various editions��id�76175d62c8c2�body�و约7亿年前地球可能几乎完全被冰覆盖，赤道也结冰，后因火山二氧化碳积累产生极强温室效应才解冻。ٔAround 700 million years ago Earth may have frozen nearly entirely, even at the equator, until volcanic CO2 built a strong greenhouse and thawed it.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�77c53eb1dc03�body��月球的潮汐鼓包并不正对月球，而是因地球自转比月球公转快而被"带"在前面，鼓包的引力反过来拉月球向前加速、拉地球自转减速。结果是角动量从地球自转向月球轨道转移，月球以每年约3.8厘米的速度远离地球（激光测月反射镜测得），同时地球自转每世纪约减慢近2毫秒。反过来，月球曾被潮汐锁定、永远同一面朝向地球，也是同类机制的结果。数十亿年前地球自转快得多，一天只有约20小时甚至更短。�TThe Moon's tidal bulge does not point exactly at the Moon: because Earth spins faster than the Moon orbits, the bulge is dragged ahead of it, and its gravity pulls the Moon forward while braking Earth's rotation. Angular momentum transfers from Earth's spin to the lunar orbit, so the Moon recedes about 3.8 cm per year (measured by lunar laser ranging) while Earth's day lengthens by nearly 2 milliseconds per century. The Moon's own tidal lock, always showing the same face, arises from the same mechanism. Billions of years ago Earth spun much faster, with days of only about 20 hours or less.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�786a1d5eed13�body�ِ渭河冲积出平坦肥沃的八百里沃野，四面有关山屏障、易守难攻，又有水利之便，所以周秦汉唐多定都于此。ىThe Wei River built a flat fertile plain, shielded by passes and easy to defend with good water, so many dynasties made it their capital.�ans��src��6中国科学院地理研究所《中国自然地理》�`Chinese Academy of Sciences, Institute of Geographical Sciences, The Physical Geography of China��id�78c52dd0a0e8�body�ٜ彗星靠近太阳时撒下尘埃和碎块，沿轨道铺成“碎片带”；地球每年穿过时，这些碎屑冲进大气燃烧，就成了流星雨。�zComets shed dust and debris that spread along their orbit; when Earth passes through, the bits burn up as a meteor shower.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�79157e32e001�body��气候临界点指系统在特定阈值被突破后发生不可逆或突变式转变的节点，例如格陵兰冰盖崩解或亚马孙雨林退化。一旦越过临界点，变化可能自我维持，即使减排也难以回头。识别临界点对评估长期风险非常重要。�cA climate tipping point is a threshold beyond which a system undergoes an irreversible or abrupt shift, such as the collapse of the Greenland ice sheet or degradation of the Amazon rainforest. Once crossed, the change may become self-sustaining and hard to reverse even with emission cuts. Identifying tipping points is vital for assessing long-term risk.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�7a8c2a0d7019�body�ي凸岸水流慢、泥沙堆积成平坦河滩，不易被洪水冲掏；凹岸虽深却易被侵蚀崩塌，所以城邑多落在凸岸。فThe convex bank has slow flow and builds flat, stable land, while the concave bank erodes; cities preferred the safe convex side.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�7b78a824e6e5�body�ف它提议把人类强烈改变气候、生物和地层的当代列为新地质世，标志地球进入受人类主导的时期。ّIt proposes naming our era the Anthropocene, where human activity so reshapes climate, life and strata that Earth enters a human-dominated epoch.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�7cb562bc395a�body��M当玄武岩冷却或沉积物沉积时，其中含铁矿物会沿当时地磁场方向排列，把磁场极性冻结下来。通过逐层测量这种原生剩磁，地质学家重建出倒转的时间序列，成为海底扩张的重要证据。梅里尔与麦克法登在《地球磁场》中系统论述了地磁倒转的机理。�KAs basalt cools or sediment settles, iron-bearing minerals align with the ambient field and lock in its polarity. Measuring this primary remanence layer by layer lets geologists reconstruct reversal sequences, a key proof of seafloor spreading. Merrill and McFadden's The Magnetic Field of the Earth details the reversal mechanism.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�7eb9a86aaba8�body���空气从高压流向低压，但科里奥利力使运动方向在北半球向右偏、南半球向左偏，最终风绕低压中心在北半球逆时针旋转，形成气旋；绕高压中心则顺时针旋转，形成反气旋。科里奥利力在赤道为零，所以台风、飓风必须形成于远离赤道、海温超过约26摄氏度的海域，并随气旋式旋转而加强。这一机制也解释了为什么北半球的台风都是逆时针转动。��Air flows from high to low pressure, but the Coriolis effect deflects motion to the right in the Northern Hemisphere and left in the Southern, so winds spiral counterclockwise around lows (cyclones) in the north and clockwise around highs (anticyclones). Because the Coriolis force vanishes at the equator, typhoons and hurricanes must form poleward of it, over seas warmer than about 26 C, intensifying as cyclonic rotation develops. This is why Northern Hemisphere typhoons always spin counterclockwise.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�7ec860d40976�body��主要储存在深海。冰期时生物泵效率更高，加上铁施肥增强、南极底水通风减弱、海冰覆盖面积扩大降低海气交换，使溶解无机碳和营养盐在深海积累。这一“深海碳库”增强机制是解释冰期CO₂低值的主流假说。�xMainly in the deep ocean. During glacials, a more efficient biological pump—strengthened iron fertilization, weaker Antarctic bottom-water ventilation, and wider sea-ice cover suppressing air–sea gas exchange—accumulated dissolved inorganic carbon and nutrients in the deep sea. This enhanced deep-sea carbon storage is the leading hypothesis for glacial CO₂ drawdown.�ans��src��!Nature（冰期碳循环研究）�&Nature (glacial carbon cycle research)��id�7f0603c31133�body���急流是对流层顶附近一条窄而长的强西风带，位于冷暖空气之间的锋区上方：温差越大，热成风平衡要求的高空西风越强，所以冬季比夏季更强、位置也更偏南。它像导轨一样引导高空槽脊和地面风暴东移，也让跨洋航班顺风省时、逆风误时。它并非固定的一条风带，会波动、分裂和南北摆动，一摆动就让某地持续偏旱或偏涝；它也在高空，地面风弱不代表急流消失。��The jet stream is a narrow, elongated ribbon of strong westerly wind near the tropopause, sitting above the front between cold and warm air: the greater the temperature contrast, the stronger the upper westerly that thermal-wind balance requires, so it is stronger and lies farther south in winter than in summer. It works like a track steering upper-level troughs and ridges and their surface storms eastward, and it makes transoceanic flights faster with a tailwind and slower into a headwind. It is not one fixed belt but waves, splits and shifts north and south, and each shift leaves one region persistently dry and another wet; and it sits aloft, so light surface wind does not mean the jet has gone.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�82abbd5cfed8�body���枕状熔岩是熔岩在水下喷发时因快速冷却而形成的一堆形似枕头的圆丘状岩体。它的存在是某地曾发生过水下火山活动、或古老岩石原属洋壳的重要证据。��Pillow lava is a pile of pillow-shaped mounds formed when lava erupts underwater and cools rapidly. Its presence is strong evidence that an area once had submarine volcanism or that ancient rocks originally belonged to oceanic crust.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�8392690d4f59�body���正常年份秘鲁沿岸有上升流把海底营养带上来了，养活大量鱼类；厄尔尼诺时东风减弱、暖水覆盖表层，上升流停滞，营养减少，鱼群随之减少。��Normally coastal upwelling brings nutrient-rich deep water to Peru, feeding fish; during El Niño weakened winds let warm water cap the surface, halting upwelling, so nutrients and fish decline.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�84a3f58e3c3a�body��2氮级联指活性氮在环境中依次引发一系列连锁效应：哈伯法固氮与化石燃料燃烧使人为活性氮激增，经淋溶造成水体富营养化、经反硝化与硝化释放氧化亚氮（强温室气体）并破坏平流层臭氧。人为固氮现已超过自然陆地固氮总量。�The nitrogen cascade is the sequence of linked effects of reactive nitrogen in the environment: Haber-Bosch fixation and fossil-fuel combustion have surged reactive N, causing eutrophication via leaching and emitting N₂O (a potent greenhouse gas) through denitrification and nitrification, while harming stratospheric ozone. Human fixation now exceeds natural terrestrial fixation.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�85d6fca59e20�body���河流流量是单位时间内通过某一断面的水量，通常用立方米每秒表示，等于断面面积乘以平均流速。它随降雨、融雪和季节波动，是水资源管理的关键指标。��River discharge is the volume of water passing a cross-section per unit time, usually cubic meters per second, equal to cross-sectional area times average velocity. It varies with rain, snowmelt, and season and is key to water management.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�85efd621d548�body���侵蚀基准面是河流下切所能达到的最低高程，通常以海平面为终极基准面。海平面下降会增大河流坡降，促进下切与峡谷形成；海平面上升则减弱下切、增强堆积，河口转为加积。�Base level is the lowest elevation a river can erode down to, with sea level as the ultimate base. Falling sea level steepens the river gradient, promoting incision and canyon cutting; rising sea level reduces incision and enhances deposition, shifting estuaries to aggradation.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�876dfde09ba0�body�ٽ是硅酸盐矿物（占陆地岩石约九成），因为它们的核心——硅和氧——是地壳里最多的两种元素，容易结合成石英、长石、云母等各种硅酸盐。٬Silicate minerals make up about 90% of crustal rocks because silicon and oxygen are the two most abundant crustal elements, readily forming quartz, feldspar, mica, and kin.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�87788a9364c3�body���急流位于不同温度气团交界（如极地冷气团与副热带暖气团）附近，温度梯度大导致强气压梯度，再加上高空摩擦小，于是形成狭窄的高速西风带。��Jet streams sit near boundaries of very different temperatures (polar vs subtropical air); the large temperature gradient drives a strong pressure gradient, and with little friction aloft, a narrow fast westerly wind forms.�ans��src��=盛裴轩等,《大气物理学》,北京大学出版社,2003�HSheng Peixuan et al., Atmospheric Physics, Peking University Press, 2003��id�8876d4445fbb�body���孢粉分析靠的是花粉外壁含极耐腐蚀的孢粉素，能在地层里长期保存，产量大、随风远扬，形态又常可辨到属甚至种。镜下计数、算出各植物类群的百分比就复原了古植被，再借植物分布受温湿度支配这层关系转译成气候。这是间接信号：风媒花粉产量占绝对优势，虫媒植物被系统性低估，远距搬运又混入外地花粉，所以它记的是区域植被而非脚下那片林。�(Pollen analysis works because the pollen wall is built from sporopollenin, which is extremely resistant to decay, so grains survive once buried in sediment; they are also produced in enormous quantities, carried far by the wind, and often distinguishable to genus or even species by shape. Counting them under a microscope and expressing each plant group as a percentage reconstructs the vegetation of the time, and climate comes in at the second step, since plant distributions are governed by temperature and moisture. Note that this is an indirect signal. Wind-pollinated plants flood the pollen rain and insect-pollinated ones are systematically under-represented, and long-distance transport mixes in pollen from far away, so a diagram records regional vegetation rather than the woods outside the site.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�8905801ed0a2�body��>特定波段的红外辐射一旦被气体强烈吸收到饱和，再增加该气体对穿透量的削减会递减，称作饱和效应。但上层大气因更稀薄而对新增气体仍敏感，使整体辐射强迫按对数而非线性增长。皮埃尔于贝尔在《行星气候原理》中讨论了这一细节。�eOnce a wavelength band is strongly absorbed to saturation, adding more gas yields diminishing reductions in transmitted radiation, the saturation effect. Yet the upper, thinner atmosphere still responds to added gas, so the radiative forcing grows logarithmically rather than linearly. Pierrehumbert discusses this nuance in Principles of Planetary Climate.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�8ac6a95ee752�body��-当巨型岩浆房排空后，上方岩石失去支撑而塌陷，形成碗状的大型破火山口，而非典型的锥形山峰。与之不同，盾状火山由流动性玄武岩层层溢流堆成平缓穹丘，并不发生塌陷。利普曼在1984年系统总结了破火山口塌陷的动力学。�*When a huge magma chamber empties, the overlying rock loses support and collapses into a basin-shaped caldera rather than building a conical peak. A shield volcano, by contrast, is a gentle dome built by fluid basalt flows and does not collapse. Lipman summarized caldera-collapse dynamics in 1984.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�8aef38179c6b�body�ٓ黄河每年把上亿吨泥沙送到入海口，泥沙在海里堆积、露出水面，陆地就一点一点向海推进，三角洲持续淤长。ْThe river dumps hundreds of millions of tons of silt at its mouth; the sediment builds above water and the land pushes seaward, growing the delta.�ans��src��W米尔曼、米德《全球河流输沙入海》，《地质学杂志》第91卷，1983�pMilliman, J.D. & Meade, R.H. (1983), World-wide delivery of river sediment to the oceans, Journal of Geology, 91��id�8b5e3cf57d3a�body���侵入岩在地下缓慢冷却，矿物有充足时间结晶，故颗粒粗大（如花岗岩）。喷出岩在地表快速冷却，结晶时间短，颗粒细甚至形成玻璃质（如黑曜石）。冷却速率直接决定结晶程度。�Intrusive rocks cool slowly underground, giving minerals time to grow large crystals, as in granite. Extrusive rocks cool fast at the surface, leaving little time to crystallize, yielding fine grains or even glassy texture, as in obsidian. Cooling rate directly controls crystallinity.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�8be3c4c50a8e�body��$P 波是压缩波，质点振动方向与传播方向一致，可在固、液、气体中传播；S 波是剪切波，质点垂直于传播方向振动，只能在有剪切刚度的固体中传播。地球液态外核无剪切刚度，因此 S 波无法通过，由此证实外核为液态。�_P waves are compressional, with particle motion along the propagation direction, and travel through solids, liquids, and gases. S waves are shear waves, with motion perpendicular to propagation, and require shear rigidity found only in solids. The liquid outer core lacks such rigidity, so S waves cannot pass—evidence that the outer core is molten.�ans��src��<Press & Siever,《Understanding Earth》W. H. Freeman 多版�LF. Press and R. Siever, Understanding Earth, W. H. Freeman, various editions��id�8e0ae05fc5b3�body���冰期是地球长期冷期，与太阳辐射在纬度和季节上的分布变化有关。大陆位置和山脉隆起改变大气环流，使高纬度能积累冰盖。冰盖扩张又通过反照率反馈进一步降温，冰期和间冰期因此交替。�fIce ages are long cold periods linked to changes in how solar radiation is distributed over latitude and season. The positions of continents and mountain uplift alter atmospheric circulation so that high latitudes can accumulate ice sheets. Ice-sheet growth then cools the planet further through albedo feedback, alternating glacial and interglacial periods.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�8e1ccfe5264a�body���热点火山由地幔深处相对固定的地幔柱提供岩浆，不依赖板块边界，如夏威夷群岛随板块移动形成一串火山。板块边界火山则直接由板块相互作用驱动，位置随边界变化。�"Hotspot volcanoes are fed by relatively fixed mantle plumes from deep in the mantle and do not depend on plate boundaries, as seen in the Hawaiian chain formed as the plate moved over the plume. Plate-boundary volcanoes are driven directly by plate interactions and shift with the boundary.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�8ffccedc3f6b�body���南极底层水由沿岸高密度冷水下沉形成，是经向翻转环流的重要组成部分。冰架融化的淡水输入降低海水密度、阻碍下沉，削弱底层水形成，可能减缓全球深层洋流并影响热量与碳的输送。�%Antarctic Bottom Water forms where dense coastal water sinks, a key part of the meridional overturning circulation. Freshwater from ice-shelf melt lowers density and hinders sinking, weakening bottom-water formation, which could slow global deep currents and disrupt heat and carbon transport.�ans��src��UL. D. Talley et al., Descriptive Physical Oceanography, 6th ed., Academic Press, 2011�UL. D. Talley et al., Descriptive Physical Oceanography, 6th ed., Academic Press, 2011��id�9003d68cfe14�body���硅酸盐矿物以硅氧四面体为基本结构单元，而硅和氧是地壳中含量最丰富的两种元素。它们通过共享氧原子连接成链、层或三维骨架，因此占据了已命名矿物的绝大多数。�Silicate minerals are built from silicon-oxygen tetrahedra, and silicon and oxygen are the two most abundant elements in the crust. These tetrahedra link by sharing oxygen into chains, sheets, or 3-D frameworks, so silicates make up the vast majority of known minerals.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�90ed969e479a�body��MENSO是热带中东太平洋海表温度与大气气压的周期性异常：厄尔尼诺时该区海温异常偏暖、信风减弱，拉尼娜时则偏冷、信风增强。“南方涛动”一名由吉尔伯特·沃克（Gilbert Walker）在1920年代提出，该现象会通过大气遥相关改变全球的降雨与干旱格局。��ENSO is the periodic fluctuation of sea-surface temperature and atmospheric pressure in the tropical central-eastern Pacific: El Niño brings unusually warm waters and weakened trade winds, while La Niña brings the opposite. The term 'Southern Oscillation' was coined by Gilbert Walker in the 1920s, and the phenomenon shifts global rainfall and drought patterns through atmospheric teleconnections.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�90f6a76db80e�body��%地震波穿过内核时，其走时与波形在数十年尺度上呈现细微变化，被解释为内核以每年约0.2至0.3度的速率相对地幔向东超速旋转（也存在周期性振荡的争议）。探测依赖重复地震在相近路径上记录的核震相（如PKIKP）差异。�wSeismic waves traversing the inner core show subtle, decadal changes in travel time and waveform, interpreted as the inner core spinning slightly faster than the mantle, roughly 0.2 to 0.3 degrees per year eastward, though a periodic oscillation is also debated. Detection relies on repeating earthquakes recorded along similar ray paths, comparing core phases such as PKIKP.�ans��src�ٱSong,《Joint inversion for inner core rotation, inner core anisotropy, and mantle heterogeneity》,Journal of Geophysical Research: Solid Earth,2000 (DOI: 10.1029/1999jb900436)ٯSong, 'Joint inversion for inner core rotation, inner core anisotropy, and mantle heterogeneity', Journal of Geophysical Research: Solid Earth, 2000, DOI: 10.1029/1999jb900436��id�91fcd371a87e�body���河流下切形成高出河面的阶梯状阶地，其拔河高度与年代序列反映区域地壳抬升速率，而阶地沉积与风化层则记录古气候波动。通过定年多级阶地可反演百万年尺度的构造—气候耦合。�Incision produces stepped terraces above the river; their height above the channel and age sequence reveal regional uplift rates, while terrace sediments and weathering record paleoclimate swings. Dating multiple terrace levels inverts million-year-scale tectonics-climate coupling.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�924070dfa1c1�body���黄土高原的沉积中，黄土层对应干冷的风成堆积期（冰期），古土壤层对应暖湿的风化期（间冰期）。二者交替堆叠，像天然气候年轮记录第四纪冰期旋回。��In the Loess Plateau, loess layers correspond to dry-cold wind-deposition glacial stages, while paleosol layers mark warm-humid weathering interglacials. Their alternating stacking acts like natural climate rings recording Quaternary glacial cycles.�ans��src��3刘东生,《黄土与环境》科学出版社,1985�6T. Liu, Loess and the Environment, Science Press, 1985��id�942b85384738�body�ٱ信风把赤道表层水向西推，西边海水堆积下沉后，在温跃层下方又向东回流，形成赤道潜流（如克伦威尔流），表层与深层方向相反。ټTrade winds push surface water westward; where it piles up and sinks in the west, it returns eastward below the thermocline as an equatorial undercurrent, so surface and deep flows oppose.�ans��src��cRachel Carson,《The Sea Around Us》Oxford University Press,1951;中译《环绕我们的海洋》�HR. Carson, The Sea Around Us, Oxford University Press, 1951; Chinese ed.��id�946188ed6ba2�body���温盐环流由海水的温度和盐度差异形成的密度差驱动，在全球海洋中缓慢循环，被称为「全球输送带」。它把表层热量带到深海，对全球气候调节至关重要。��Thermohaline circulation is driven by density differences from ocean temperature and salinity, slowly looping through the global ocean as a 'global conveyor belt.' It carries surface heat into the deep sea and is vital to climate regulation.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�94f34298ceb8�body�ى约24亿年前光合作用释放的氧气首次在大气中累积，消灭了厌氧生物、形成红层并奠定需氧生命的基础。نAbout 2.4 billion years ago oxygen from photosynthesis built up in air, killing anaerobes, forming red beds and enabling aerobic life.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�9564b20421b5�body�ٟ印度板块撞上欧亚板块使地壳快速抬升，而雅鲁藏布江又强烈下切，抬升和侵蚀“赛跑”，切出了世界上最深的大峡谷。٤The Indian plate colliding with Eurasia lifted the crust rapidly, while the river cut down just as fast; this uplift-erosion race carved the world's deepest canyon.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�9572932779e8�body��]魏格纳1912年提出大陆漂移说，依据包括：大西洋两岸海岸线形态吻合；巴西与西非的岩带和地层连续；舌羊齿植物群以及中龙、水龙兽等淡水生物化石跨洋分布；古冰川遗迹指向统一的冈瓦纳大陆冰盖；煤田、蒸发盐等古气候标志与现代纬度不符。这些几何、地层、生物、冰川和气候方面的证据，都指向各大陆曾连为一体。当时学界普遍反对，因为魏格纳没能提出令人信服的驱动力，直到20世纪60年代板块构造理论补上了机制，大陆漂移说才被重新接受。��In 1912 Wegener proposed continental drift, citing the jigsaw fit of Atlantic shorelines; continuous rock belts and strata across Brazil and West Africa; identical fossils on now-separated continents, including the Glossopteris flora and the freshwater reptiles Mesosaurus and Lystrosaurus; glacial striations implying a single Gondwana ice sheet; and paleoclimate markers such as coalfields and evaporites inconsistent with present latitudes. These geometric, stratigraphic, biologic, glacial, and climatic lines of evidence all pointed to formerly connected continents. Critics objected mainly because Wegener lacked a convincing driving force; only in the 1960s did plate tectonics supply the mechanism, and continental drift was finally vindicated.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�97027ffd2f42�body��^浮游植物分泌大量溶解有机碳（DOC），传统观点认为它被细菌利用后就短路了；而微生物环机制表明，异养细菌摄食DOC后自身又被微型浮游动物摄食，把碳和营养重新送回主食物链。微型浮游动物对细菌的摄食是这一环节的核心，它使细菌固定的碳进入浮游动物→鱼类的能量流；病毒裂解细菌与浮游植物时还会再次释放DOC，进一步驱动循环。这一环节还影响碳向深海的输出效率，因为细菌呼吸使部分碳滞留在表层水中，减少了可沉降到深海的有机碳比例。��Phytoplankton exude large amounts of dissolved organic carbon (DOC); the classic view held that its uptake by bacteria short-circuited the chain. The microbial loop, however, shows that heterotrophic bacteria are themselves grazed by microzooplankton, returning carbon and nutrients to the main food web; grazing by microzooplankton is the core step that funnels bacterially fixed carbon into the zooplankton→fish energy flow, and viral lysis of bacteria and phytoplankton releases more DOC to drive the loop. The loop also modulates carbon export efficiency, because bacterial respiration keeps some carbon in surface waters, reducing the fraction of organic carbon that can sink to depth.�ans��src��$Nature（海洋微生物环研究）�'Nature (marine microbial loop research)��id�97ecff73f774�body���夏威夷群岛上方的地幔热点固定在太平洋板块之下，来自地幔深处的热柱不断上涌提供岩浆，板块则向西北漂移，热点不断在新的位置"点燃"火山。于是西北端的火山最老、侵蚀最深，东南端的基拉韦厄火山最年轻、仍在喷发。热点火山链的方向和年龄梯度为板块运动的方向与速率提供了直接证据：考艾岛约500万年前喷发，而新火山活动延续至今。��A mantle hot spot sits fixed beneath the Pacific plate; a deep mantle plume feeds magma while the plate drifts northwest, so the plume lights volcanoes at new positions. The northwestern islands are therefore the oldest and most eroded, while Kilauea in the southeast is youngest and still erupting. The direction and age gradient of the chain give direct evidence of plate motion direction and speed: Kauai last erupted about 5 million years ago while the newest volcano is active today.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�9842e0d0c4eb�body���利用某些元素（如铀-铅、钾-氩）按固定半衰期衰变的特点，测岩石中母核与子核的比例即可算出形成年代。不同同位素适用不同时间尺度，铀-铅常用于古老锆石定年。��Some elements like uranium-lead and potassium-argon decay at fixed half-lives; measuring parent-to-daughter ratios in rock gives its formation age. Different isotopes suit different time scales, with U-Pb commonly dating ancient zircons.�ans��src��8Wicander & Monroe,《Historical Geology》Cengage 多版�TR. Wicander and J. S. Monroe, Historical Geology, Cengage Learning, various editions��id�9861dd9e4d47�body��%聚合程度主要决定内部键合方式、解理与定向硬度，但硬度并不随聚合程度单调增加：架状硅酸盐（石英）在所有方向都硬，片状硅酸盐（云母）因层间键弱而在垂直片层方向极软。橄榄石虽是岛状硅酸盐，但因晶格致密堆积，硬度（约6.5–7）反而高于链状的辉石和角闪石（约5–6）。解理方向完全受四面体链或面取向控制——辉石沿单链呈约90°的两组解理，角闪石沿双链呈约120°解理，云母沿片层呈完全解理。��Polymerization chiefly controls bonding, cleavage, and directional hardness, but hardness does not rise monotonically with it: framework silicates (quartz) are hard in all directions, while sheet silicates (mica) are very soft normal to the sheets because interlayer bonds are weak. Olivine, though an island silicate, is actually harder (about 6.5–7) than chain silicates such as pyroxene and amphibole (about 5–6) owing to its densely packed lattice. Cleavage direction is set by the orientation of tetrahedral chains or sheets—pyroxene cleaves in two directions at about 90 degrees along single chains, amphibole at about 120 degrees along double chains, and mica perfectly parallel to its sheets.�ans��src�� 《普通地质学》(舒良树)�General Geology (Shu Liangshu)��id�9885f5c5980b�body���承压含水层中水体主要靠含水层骨架与水的弹性压缩释放，称弹性贮水，响应快但贮水系数很小；潜水含水层则靠孔隙重力排水释水，称给水度（重力释水），贮水能力大但存在滞后。因此抽水时快速的水位响应多来自弹性贮水，长期均衡则取决于重力释水，二者的时间尺度差异决定水位变化与可持续开采量。��In confined aquifers, water is released mainly by elastic compression of the aquifer skeleton and the water itself—elastic storage—fast to respond but with a small storativity. In unconfined aquifers, pores drain by gravity—specific yield—which holds far more water but responds with a lag. Rapid head changes thus reflect elastic storage, while long-term yields depend on gravity drainage; this timescale contrast governs drawdown and sustainable extraction.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�9d0eec4f4baa�body�ف那里地磁场异常偏弱，对卫星和空间站辐射更强、易出故障，也被视为地磁可能正在重组的信号。ٜThere the field is unusually weak, exposing satellites and stations to stronger radiation and glitches, and is seen as a sign the field may be reorganizing.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�9fa09da44138�body��N温盐环流是由海水温度和盐度差异导致的密度驱动的大尺度深层洋流，北大西洋表层冷水下沉后沿深海洋流向南、最终在全球大洋循环并返回。它把热量和碳在各大洋间输送，对全球气候调节至关重要，其中“大西洋经向翻转环流（AMOC）”是核心环节。��Thermohaline circulation is a density-driven, large-scale deep ocean flow caused by differences in temperature and salinity; in the North Atlantic, cooling surface water sinks and travels south through the deep ocean before circulating globally and returning. It distributes heat and carbon across oceans and is vital to climate, with the Atlantic Meridional Overturning Circulation (AMOC) at its core.�ans��src��UL. D. Talley et al., Descriptive Physical Oceanography, 6th ed., Academic Press, 2011�UL. D. Talley et al., Descriptive Physical Oceanography, 6th ed., Academic Press, 2011��id�a0b94f60c5e4�body�ل大陆架是大陆向海洋自然延伸、水深较浅（一般小于200米）的平缓海底区域，渔业和油气资源富集。٘The continental shelf is the shallow (usually under 200 m), gently sloping seabed where continents extend into the ocean, rich in fisheries and oil gas.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�a10291378e28�body��[在南大洋等高营养低叶绿素（HNLC）海区，表层营养盐充足但缺铁，浮游植物无法充分利用；铁是光合作用与固氮酶系的关键辅因子，补铁可大幅提高初级生产力，IronEx II和SOFeX等试验均观测到叶绿素爆发。争议在于：碳沉降的净量与长期固碳效果难以准确评估，试验显示大部分新固定的碳在表层再矿化，向深海输出的比例远低于预期。还可能引发物种组成改变、有毒藻类爆发、深水缺氧等生态后果，而且公海投放难以监管，故未被接受为气候工程手段。�8In high-nutrient, low-chlorophyll (HNLC) regions such as the Southern Ocean, surface nutrients are abundant but iron is scarce, so phytoplankton cannot use them; iron is a key cofactor in photosynthesis and nitrogen-fixation enzyme systems, and iron addition dramatically raises primary production—experiments such as IronEx II and SOFeX observed chlorophyll blooms. Controversy stems from the difficulty of quantifying net carbon drawdown and long-term sequestration: experiments show much of the newly fixed carbon is remineralized in the surface layer, with far less exported to depth than hoped. Possible ecological consequences (shifted species composition, toxic blooms, deep-water hypoxia) and weak regulatory oversight over open-ocean releases mean iron fertilization is not accepted as a climate-engineering tool.�ans��src��'Nature（海洋铁施肥试验研究）�-Nature (ocean iron fertilization experiments)��id�a22308a2cf6c�body���超级火山指能发生8级（VEI-8）喷发、喷发物体积超过1000立方千米的火山，如黄石和托巴。喷发规模常用火山爆发指数（VEI）按对数分级，从0到8，每升一级喷发物体积约增10倍。�A supervolcano is one capable of a VEI-8 eruption ejecting over 1,000 cubic kilometers of material, such as Yellowstone or Toba. Eruption size is quantified by the Volcanic Explosivity Index (VEI), a logarithmic 0–8 scale where each step up means roughly ten times more ejected volume.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�a2d42d451dc7�body��海水吸收二氧化碳后生成碳酸并解离出氢离子，pH 随之下降；更麻烦的是氢离子会消耗碳酸根，压低碳酸钙饱和度。珊瑚、贝类和翼足类都靠碳酸根造壳与骨骼，饱和度一降，造壳更费能量，海水甚至可能溶掉已成的壳。两处易混：其一，海水仍属碱性，酸化指朝中性偏移而非变成酸；其二，pH 是对数标度，看着只降一点，氢离子浓度上升却明显得多。影响也不均匀：冷水、高纬和上升流区更早触及不饱和。�1When seawater takes up carbon dioxide, the gas forms carbonic acid and releases hydrogen ions, so pH falls; the nastier part is that those ions also consume carbonate, lowering the saturation state of calcium carbonate. Corals, shellfish and pteropods all build their shells and skeletons out of carbonate, so a lower saturation state means spending more energy on a shell, and the water can even start dissolving shells already made. Two things get mixed up here: first, seawater is still alkaline, and acidification means drifting toward neutral rather than turning into acid; second, pH is a logarithmic scale, so a drop that looks small on the meter is a much larger rise in hydrogen-ion concentration. The effect is also uneven, with cold water, high latitudes and upwelling zones reaching undersaturation first.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�a37f87cdf4d0�body�ل用钻探船取海底岩芯，读取古海洋与古气候、检验海底扩张和俯冲，并探寻地下深部生物圈与资源。ٖDrillships recover seafloor cores to read paleo-ocean and climate, test seafloor spreading and subduction, and probe the deep biosphere and resources.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�a39b216905b9�body�ٮ裂谷是岩石圈被拉伸变薄、中央下陷形成的狭长凹陷，常发育在大陆张裂的早期阶段。东非大裂谷就是板块未来可能分裂的活证据。��A rift valley is a long, narrow depression where the lithosphere is stretched thin and the center drops down, often marking the early stage of continental splitting. The East African Rift shows a continent actively pulling apart.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�a3d29122076f�body���板块持续相对运动，断层两盘被摩擦锁住、不能滑动，于是周围岩石像橡皮筋一样慢慢积累弹性应变。当应力超过摩擦强度，断层突然滑动，累积的应变瞬间释放，产生地震，岩石弹回未变形的位置，这就是弹性回跳理论。断层以特征周期重复破裂，形成"地震空区"，用来评估未来大震风险。1906年旧金山地震后，里德据此提出该理论，成为现代地震学的基石。�<Plates keep moving past each other, but friction locks the fault, so the surrounding rock stores elastic strain like a stretched rubber band. When stress exceeds the frictional strength, the fault slips suddenly, releasing the stored strain in an earthquake as the rock snaps back toward its undeformed shape—the elastic rebound theory. Faults rupture repeatedly with characteristic cycles, creating seismic gaps used to assess future large quakes. H.F. Reid proposed the theory after the 1906 San Francisco earthquake, and it remains a cornerstone of modern seismology.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�a3e84ad093a8�body��{海水过热或酸化使珊瑚把共生的虫黄藻排出，失去颜色和养分来源，持续白化便会大量死亡。ـOverwarm or acidified water makes corals expel their symbiotic algae, losing color and food, and prolonged bleaching kills them.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�a4d0737ba4cf�body���雷云下方电场在最高、最尖的物体顶端最强，容易先放电，所以高处更易被击中。避雷针是一根通地的金属针，主动引雷入地，让电流绕过建筑。��The electric field under a storm cloud is strongest at the tallest, pointiest tip, so it discharges there first. A lightning rod is a grounded metal point that draws the strike down harmlessly to earth, sparing the building.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�a7e0d0561930�body��x矩震级按断层面积、错动距离和岩石刚度算出的总能量，量程大、不封顶，适合衡量强震。�\Moment magnitude uses fault area, slip and rigidity for total energy; it has no upper limit.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�a8429b28b0cb�body��超级火山源自浅层巨大的岩浆房，其中高硅、富含挥发分的岩浆在持续压力下蓄势，一旦喷发往往以破火山口形式塌陷，喷出数千立方公里的火山灰与碎屑流。黄石热点区的三次超级喷发形成三个破火山口，最近一次约64万年前。这类喷发会向平流层注入大量硫酸盐气溶胶，遮蔽阳光、使全球气温在数年内显著下降，被称为"火山冬天"，其强度用VEI（火山爆发指数）8级衡量，比普通喷发高好几个量级。�HSupervolcanoes draw on huge shallow magma chambers of silica-rich, gas-charged magma under sustained pressure; when they erupt, the ground collapses into a caldera while thousands of cubic kilometers of ash and pyroclastic flows are expelled. Yellowstone's hot-spot system has produced three such calderas, the last about 640,000 years ago. These eruptions inject massive sulfate aerosols into the stratosphere, dimming sunlight and cooling global temperature for years in a volcanic winter; on the Volcanic Explosivity Index they rate 8, orders of magnitude above ordinary eruptions.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�a911d0251f03�body�ل当副热带高压位置偏北或冷空气太弱，雨带直接跳到华北，长江中下游就跳过梅雨，容易出现夏旱。٘If the subtropical high sits too far north or cold air is too weak, the rain band jumps to North China, skipping the Yangtze and causing summer drought.�ans��src��-丁一汇《中国季风》，Springer，1994�-Ding, Y., Monsoons over China, Springer, 1994��id�aa147dce323d�body�ٽ长期集中抽水会使井周围地下水位下降，形成向下凹陷的水位漏斗。多个漏斗叠加可造成区域水位持续下降、河流断流和地面沉降等连锁问题。��Sustained concentrated pumping lowers the water table around a well, forming a downward depression shaped like a cone. Overlapping cones cause regional water-level decline, dried rivers and subsidence as chained problems.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�aa36dd2e9484�body���抬升让山体变高、重力变大，而风化、河流切割和山体自身重量造成的地壳下沉（均衡调整）会抵消抬升；当侵蚀削低的速度赶上升高速度，山脉高度就趋于稳定。ٽUplift raises peaks and increases gravity, while weathering, river cutting, and isostatic sinking under the mass counter it; when erosion keeps pace with uplift, mountain height stabilizes.�ans��src��V舒良树 主编,《普通地质学》第3版(曾获全国首届优秀教材一等奖)�`Shu Liangshu ed., General Geology, 3rd ed. (winner of the 1st National Excellent Textbook Award)��id�ae15d1e8a67f�body�ٍ利用电波比地震波快的原理，在震中附近监测到初至波后，抢在破坏性横波到达前数秒至数十秒发出警报。ٱUsing that radio waves outrun seismic waves, sensors near the epicenter detect the first P-wave and alert before the damaging S-wave arrives, gaining seconds to tens of seconds.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�aea5b21da2a5�body�ٙ按米兰科维奇理论，偏心率周期约十万年最弱却主导冰期，可能由冰盖反照率与二氧化碳反馈放大所致，仍存争议。ّMilankovitch theory's weakest eccentricity cycle near 100 kyr ends up dominant, perhaps amplified by ice-albedo and CO2 feedbacks, still debated.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�aed1e49f6622�body��1大气 CO₂ 溶于雨水形成弱酸，化学风化硅酸盐岩消耗 CO₂ 并随河流以碳酸氢盐入海、最终固结成碳酸盐岩，实现长期碳移除。升温加速风化、增强碳消耗，从而冷却气候；降温则减弱，构成稳定气候的负反馈，时间尺度以万年计。�nAtmospheric CO₂ dissolves in rain to form weak acid that weathers silicate rocks, consuming CO₂ and carrying bicarbonate to the sea where it becomes carbonate rock—long-term carbon removal. Warming speeds weathering and carbon drawdown, cooling the climate; cooling slows it, a negative feedback stabilizing climate on timescales of tens of thousands of years.�ans��src��C《自然·地球科学》(Nature Geoscience) 长期碳循环研究�)Nature Geoscience, long-term carbon cycle��id�b0f3f565e107�body�م它指二氧化碳翻倍时全球平均气温的最终升幅，估计约在2.5到4摄氏度，是评估长期变暖的核心参数。�yIt is the eventual global warming from doubled CO2, estimated around 2.5–4°C, a core number for long-term projections.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�b112ad3065a7�body�ْ每下潜约 10 米增加 1 个大气压，1.1 万米深处水压超过 1000 个大气压，相当于每平方厘米压着一吨多重的东西。ِPressure rises about 1 atmosphere per 10 meters; at 11 km depth it exceeds 1000 atmospheres—roughly a ton pressing on every square centimeter.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�b11b1cf0bce1�body��<甲烷水合物是甲烷分子被水分子笼形包裹的固态物质，稳定存在于低温高压的海底沉积物中。它蕴藏可观的天然气资源，但全球变暖使海底升温可能触发其不稳定分解，释放强效温室气体甲烷。克文沃尔登在1993年综述了其分布与环境意义。�CMethane hydrate is methane trapped in cage-like water molecules, stable in cold, high-pressure seafloor sediments. It represents a sizable natural-gas resource, but warming that destabilizes the seabed could release potent methane greenhouse gas. Kvenvolden reviewed its distribution and environmental significance in 1993.�ans��src��K本题原挂出处与答案内容不符，已撤回；具体书目待补。�YPrevious citation withdrawn as unsupported for this answer; a specific source is pending.��id�b1b15eef18a5�body��o冷暖期海水和冰里氧-18与氧-16比例不同，测贝壳和冰芯的这个比例就能推算古温度。�\The O-18/O-16 ratio in shells and ice shifts with temperature, giving past climate readings.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021��id�b4f6f7eb1aca�body���夹在反复破裂的活跃段之间、却长期安静的断层段，就是地震空区。两侧不断释放应力，这一段因闭锁而把板块运动的变形攒在地下，一旦破裂便可能成为强震震源。关键是闭锁而非单纯的安静：靠无震蠕滑慢慢释放应变的断层，再久不发震也不算空区。空区也只是相对邻段的统计定位，远超平均复发间隔仍不破裂的例子不少，给不出发震时间。�SA seismic gap is a fault segment that stays quiet while those around it rupture again and again. Its neighbours keep releasing stress, but a locked gap stores the strain plate motion puts into the crust, so when it breaks it may host a large earthquake. The decisive ingredient is locking rather than quietness alone: a fault that sheds strain by aseismic creep is not a gap however long it goes without one. And a gap is only a position relative to its neighbours, since segments sitting far past their average recurrence interval without breaking are common, so it gives no time of occurrence.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�b5346720ca4f�body�ٺ寒冷干燥的空气吹过相对温暖开阔的湖面，从湖里捞起大量水汽和热量，上岸后遇冷陆地迅速凝结成窄而强的雪带，所以下风岸会暴雪成灾。��Cold dry air passes over a relatively warm open lake, picking up moisture and heat; on reaching cold land it condenses into narrow intense snowbands, dumping meters of snow on downwind shores.�ans��src��N周淑贞 束炯,《气象学与气候学》第3版,高等教育出版社,1997�^Zhou Shuzhen and Shu Jiong, Meteorology and Climatology, 3rd ed., Higher Education Press, 1997��id�b5bc42e04bca�body���土壤有机质是动植物残体经微生物分解形成的腐殖质等混合物，占表土比例虽小却决定肥力、结构和保水性。它还能固碳、缓冲酸碱，是土壤健康的核心。��Soil organic matter is the mix of humus and residues from decomposed plants and animals; small in topsoil yet it decides fertility, structure and water retention. It also stores carbon and buffers pH, central to soil health.�ans��src��:Tarbuck & Lutgens,《Earth Science》第14版,Pearson,2015�GE. J. Tarbuck and F. K. Lutgens, Earth Science, 14th ed., Pearson, 2015��id�ba02f7bfe3f8�body��"AMOC把表层暖水向北输送，在北大西洋冷却下沉后把热量释放到大气，为欧洲带来温和冬季。它一旦减弱，欧洲与北美东岸会变冷，并扰乱热带降雨带。拉姆斯托夫与IPCC第六次评估报告都警告全球变暖可能削弱这一环流。�HThe AMOC carries warm surface water northward, releasing heat to the atmosphere as it cools and sinks in the North Atlantic, giving Europe mild winters. If it weakens, Europe and the North American east coast cool and tropical rain belts shift. Rahmstorf and the IPCC AR6 warn that global warming may undermine this circulation.�ans��src��gCaesar等,《观测到的大西洋经向翻转环流减弱指纹》,Nature,2018年,第556卷,197-201页قJ. Caesar et al. (2018), Observed fingerprint of a weakening Atlantic Ocean overturning circulation, Nature, vol. 556, pp. 197-201��id�bad7363ef31a�body���南极绕极流是地球上唯一环绕整个大陆、没有陆地阻挡的洋流。它沿南极洲外围自西向东流动，连接了大西洋、太平洋和印度洋。它把三大洋深层水混合，并对全球热量和碳的分配起关键作用。�QThe Antarctic Circumpolar Current is the only current on Earth that flows all the way around a continent without being blocked by land. It circulates eastward around Antarctica and connects the Atlantic, Pacific, and Indian Oceans. By mixing the deep waters of the three oceans it plays a key role in global heat and carbon distribution.�ans��src��cRachel Carson,《The Sea Around Us》Oxford University Press,1951;中译《环绕我们的海洋》�HR. Carson, The Sea Around Us, Oxford University Press, 1951; Chinese ed.��id�bb8c518832a5�body���塞尔维亚数学家米兰科维奇计算出地球轨道三要素的周期变化：偏心率约10万年、地轴倾斜约4万年、岁差约2.1万年。它们改变到达高纬的太阳辐射量，特别是夏季辐射；若夏季太阳辐射弱，冰雪难以融化而逐年累积，冰期就启动。深海氧同位素记录显示的冰期-间冰期周期与这些轨道周期高度吻合，说明轨道强迫驱动了第四纪冰期旋回，温室气体变化又放大了响应。�[Serbian mathematician Milutin Milankovitch calculated the cyclic changes in three orbital parameters: eccentricity at about 100,000 years, axial tilt at about 41,000 years, and precession at about 21,000 years. They alter the insolation reaching high latitudes, especially in summer; when summer insolation weakens, snow fails to melt and accumulates year after year, launching an ice age. The glacial-interglacial cycles recorded in deep-sea oxygen isotopes closely match these orbital periods, showing orbital forcing drives Quaternary glacial cycles while greenhouse gas changes amplify the response.�ans��src��>IPCC AR6 第一工作组报告,Cambridge University Press,2021�HIPCC AR6 WG1, Climate Change 2021: The Physical Science Basis, CUP, 2021